window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1201,"title":"Chapter 1201 Who Slaps Whose Face?","paragraphs":["1201 Who Slaps Whose Face?","“Wang Zhao, take care of the shop. I have something to do and will be heading out.”","Chu Yunfan left the shop after he finished speaking.","Today was Situ Miaoyi’s birthday. Chu Yunfan had received an invitation and was rushing over to attend the birthday party.","The Situ clan was one of the top merchant families in Conglong City. They had great influence even in the Great Wei Kingdom. And Situ Miaoyi was the eldest daughter of the Situ clan so he naturally had to attend her birthday party.","On this day, the largest first-class restaurant in the city, First Pavilion, had been booked by the Situ clan. People who were attending the party came from all over the city and gathered at First Pavilion.","“Young Master, I’m sorry. First Pavilion has been booked by our eldest miss today. It’s not open to the public.”","In front of the restaurant, Chu Yunfan was stopped by an attendant.","“I’m here to attend the party,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","When the messenger heard this, his expression immediately became much friendlier. He hurriedly said, “Please show me your invitation.”","Chu Yunfan was stunned. Earlier, An Xiuxiu had only given him a verbal invitation on behalf of Situ Miaoyi but had not given him an invitation letter.","“I’m sorry, I don’t have an invitation,” he said directly, “But I’m a guest personally invited by your miss. You can report it to the higher-ups and confirm it. My name is Chu Yunfan.”","When the waiter found out that Chu Yunfan didn’t have an invitation card, he looked a little embarrassed. However, seeing Chu Yunfan’s confident expression, he couldn’t make up his mind. Chu Yunfan didn’t look like a liar.","“In that case, please wait a moment, Young Master Chu. I’ll go in and report immediately,” the waiter said.","“Okay, go,” Chu Yunfan said.","This scene was also seen by many guests, but they were not sure about Chu Yunfan’s background. They had never seen Chu Yunfan in their circle.","“Who is that person? Why didn’t he receive an invitation?”","“He doesn’t look like someone from our circle.”","Suddenly, a group of people walked over from afar. The person in the lead was none other than Chu Xiujie.","Behind Chu Xiujie were Chu Yanghui, Chu Yongyan, and the others. When they saw Chu Yunfan, they all glared at him angrily.","Chu Xiujie looked at Chu Yunfan strangely, not knowing why he was standing there. But soon, he heard from the other attendants.","“So that’s how it is. Some people clearly didn’t receive an invitation but they still insisted on joining in the fun. Tsk, tsk. They really don’t care about their dignity in order to climb up the social ladder,” Chu Xiujie said loudly.","Suddenly, the guests’ faces revealed a look of realization. So that was what was happening. So it was someone who came uninvited.","They had seen a lot of people like this because this circle was not open to the public. Many people who had not received an invitation wanted to sneak in so that they could build some connections.","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan had clearly become such a person. When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, the look in their eyes was a little strange.","“I didn’t expect him to be such a person.”","“Tsk tsk, some people are just too thick-skinned.”","At this time, Chu Xiujie proudly walked over and said, “Chu Yunfan, why do you have to do this? Since you didn’t receive an invitation, why do you have to squeeze in?”","In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was just trying to get close to him.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even bother to look at him.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan still dared to be so arrogant at this time, Chu Xiujie gritted his teeth and said, “Chu Yunfan, is it your business to come groveling here? You’re humiliating the marquis!”","“It’s none of your business.” Chu Yunfan sneered at Chu Xiujie.","“Why you...” Chu Xiujie was furious and was about to explode. Behind him, Chu Yanghui, Chu Yongyan, and the others also glared at Chu Yunfan.","Suddenly, hurried footsteps were heard. A fiery red figure walked out of First Pavilion. It was none other than An Xiuxiu.","Seeing An Xiuxiu striding over, Chu Xiujie was about to smile and strike up a conversation with her. He knew that An Xiuxiu was the pearl in Marquis Anguo’s palm. She was also one of the top few people in the circle of Conglong City’s noble children. She was much better than him, who was a candidate for the heir of Marquis Zhongxin.","Unless he became the heir of the marquis, he would not be able to stand on equal footing with her. If he could befriend her, it would be undoubtedly beneficial to him.","He had a thought in his mind. If he could marry An Xiuxiu, with the power of Marquis Anguo, it would be a sure thing for him to become the heir of Marquis Zhongxin.","“An...” Chu Xiujie was just about to speak when he saw her walking past him as if she had not seen him at all. She did not even look at him, causing Chu Xiujie’s face to freeze.","Even Chu Yanghui, Chu Yongyan, and the others behind Chu Xiujie were stunned. This was completely different from what they had expected.","They thought An Xiuxiu was coming for them, but she didn’t even glance at them. Then, she walked up to Chu Yunfan and said apologetically, “I’m sorry. It was a slip of the tongue. I didn’t expect you to be stalled at the entrance because of a matter as small as an invitation card.”","An Xiuxiu looked a little embarrassed. She was very embarrassed to make such a basic mistake.","“It’s nothing. It’s just a small matter.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. He did not take this matter to heart.","“Let’s go. I’ll bring you inside,” An Xiuxiu said as she led Chu Yunfan inside. From the beginning to the end, she didn’t even look at Chu Xiujie.","At this time, Chu Xiujie’s face was completely ashen. He had previously mocked Chu Yunfan for not having an invitation card and coming to climb up the social ladder.","In the end, they were slapped in the face by An Xiuxiu. This precious daughter of Marquis Anguo was not even aware of Chu Xiujie’s presence. Instead, she welcomed Chu Yunfan, whom they did not think highly of.","After a long time, Chu Xiujie snorted and said, “Let’s go!”","Chu Yanghui and Chu Yongyan were silent, not daring to anger Chu Xiujie. At the same time, they were also very surprised. They did not know how An Xiuxiu knew Chu Yunfan, and it seemed that they had a good relationship.","After all, they had only noticed Chu Yunfan in the past few days. Before this, Chu Yunfan was considered a special one among the candidates, but in fact, he did not have a very heavy presence.","The other guests also revealed curious expressions, wondering who this person was."]},{"number":1202,"title":"Chapter 1202 A Blind Dog","paragraphs":["1202 A Blind Dog","Under An Xiuxiu’s lead, Chu Yunfan was quickly brought to the banquet hall of First Pavilion.","At this time, the banquet hall was already crowded. Although it was only Situ Miaoyi’s birthday party, because of her identity, it was naturally not as simple as a gathering of three or five good friends.","Many children of the city’s nobility came to participate, and many of the city’s prominent figures were also in attendance. Of course, these were all introduced to him by An Xiuxiu, and Chu Yunfan himself didn’t know a single person.","After leading Chu Yunfan into the banquet hall, An Xiuxiu quickly bid farewell and went to do other things.","Chu Yunfan didn’t mind. He found a seat in the corner and sat down. His ears were filled with the sound of glasses being clinked together. In the eyes of many people, this was also a social occasion. But to him, it didn’t matter.","Soon, after Chu Yunfan, Chu Xiujie, and the others also walked in. After a glance, they quickly found Chu Yunfan who was resting in the corner with his eyes closed.","Chu Xiujie’s face revealed a somewhat cold expression. Soon, a middle-aged butler was summoned and came to Chu Xiujie.","“Young Master Jie, what can I do for you?” the middle-aged man asked as he looked at Chu Xiujie.","Chu Xiujie glanced at Chu Yunfan and said something. Soon, the man left with a solemn expression on his face.","Chu Yunfan was resting in a corner and recovering from his injuries. Suddenly, he felt someone approaching. He opened his eyes and saw a middle-aged butler striding over and standing in front of him with a hint of aggressiveness about him.","“Young Master, please show me your invitation,” the butler said as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“I don’t have an invitation, but you can ask your young miss about it. My name is Chu Yunfan.”","At this time, Chu Yunfan’s face was showing some impatience. No matter how good his temper was, at this time, he was a little angry. Moreover, he could see that this person was clearly targeting him.","When the butler heard Chu Yunfan honestly admit that he did not have an invitation, his face immediately revealed a hint of joy, and then he said, “I don’t care what your connections are. If you can’t produce an invitation, I’ll have to ask you to leave.”","Chu Yunfan coldly glanced at the butler and said, “I don’t know who instructed you, but there are some things I hope you will consider carefully. There are some things you can’t do.”","It was not hard for Chu Yunfan to imagine that the butler must have been instructed by someone else. Otherwise, he would not be pestering him like this.","Chu Yunfan had been in the Great Wei Kingdom for a year and lived in seclusion. He had not offended many people. It was not difficult to guess that this was related to Chu Xiujie.","The butler was immediately angered by Chu Yunfan’s words and shouted, “You don’t have to care about how I do things! Since you can’t produce an invitation, then get lost! I’m doing things according to the rules!”","At this time, the shouts here attracted the attention of the crowd. Many people showed a bit of horror. Those who could come here, whether they had an invitation or not, clearly had a certain status. This middle-aged butler actually insisted on pestering Chu Yunfan to show his invitation.","These people weren’t fools. They naturally understood that there was something wrong.","Many people turned their gazes over. They didn’t know what Chu Yunfan would do. Would he make a scene or just leave dejectedly?","“What a good way to do things according to the rules. Is this how the Situ clan disciplines their servants? You sure are acting impressively by chasing guests out.”","Suddenly, a mocking laugh was heard. Then, a tall figure walked over.","When the middle-aged butler saw this, he was shocked. It was the deputy leader of the Battle Wolves, Liao Deyi. That was an existence that was on equal footing with his master.","“Master...” Liao Deyi was about to say “Master Chu,” but he quickly realized something and changed his words. “Young Master Chu, what a coincidence. I didn’t expect to see you here.”","“Situ Miaoyi and I know each other. She invited me to her birthday party today. I didn’t expect that there would be so many waves. Interesting. It seems that some people don’t want me to have it easy,” Chu Yunfan said without looking at the butler. “Why are you here, Deputy Liao?”","“I’m here to discuss a deal with Situ Ye on behalf of our leader. I didn’t expect to meet a blind dog here.”","Situ Ye was Situ Miaoyi’s father and the head of the Situ clan.","Liao Deyi coldly glanced at the butler. He had a bad temper. If it was someone from his gang, he would have kicked this kind of guy to death.","He had seen Chu Yunfan’s methods with his eyes. Whether it was his strength or his level of alchemy, Chu Yunfan was second to none.","Chu Yunfan had killed a deputy leader of the Battle Wolves with a single slap. Now, the Battle Wolves did not say a word of nonsense against him and no one dared to take revenge.","Even the few old guys who were close to Chen Ke in the gang didn’t dare to say anything. Even if they didn’t wish to save the leader’s life, they couldn’t afford to offend the terrifying existence who killed Chen Ke with a single slap.","Even their leader who was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage had said that he would not have been able to kill Chen Ke with a single slap.","After that, the leader gave an order that no one in the gang was allowed to find trouble with Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, they would be hunted down by the entire gang.","The butler suppressed the fear in his heart. At this point, there was no way out. He could only say firmly, “Deputy Liao, you’re meddling. This is the Situ clan’s business.”","“I’m meddling? If Situ Ye knew about this, he would probably want me to kill you,” Liao Deyi said.","He was sure that if Situ Ye knew how powerful Chu Yunfan was, he would have this butler’s head chopped off for being a traitor who received benefits from someone and beg Chu Yunfan for forgiveness.","At this time, many people looked at Chu Yunfan with different eyes. They didn’t know what relationship Chu Yunfan had with Liao Deyi. Before Chu Yunfan could say anything, Liao Deyi had rushed out. They felt that this situation was very strange.","They could vaguely feel that Liao Deyi had an extraordinary respect for Chu Yunfan. He probably had the same attitude toward their leader.","“Deputy Liao, it’s against the rules for you to interfere like this,” the butler said firmly.","“Then I’ll take care of this.”"]},{"number":1203,"title":"Chapter 1203 This Chu Yunfan Is Not Simple","paragraphs":["1203 This Chu Yunfan Is Not Simple","As this voice rang out, a man and a woman walked over. One of them was a young woman in a fiery red dress. She was the pearl of Marquis Anguo, the famous An Xiuxiu.","Beside her stood a handsome young man. He was dressed in a luxurious robe and had a powerful aura.","When the butler saw the two of them, his legs immediately went weak. He could ignore Liao Deyi because Liao Deyi could not control the Situ clan. However, the two people in front of him were different. An Xiuxiu was the eldest miss’ best friend, and they had a good relationship.","The other person was even more impressive. It was actually the heir of Marquis Anguo, An Zhenguo.","No matter who it was, he couldn’t afford to offend them. At this moment, he realized that it was a wrong choice to accept Chu Xiujie’s benefits to find trouble with Chu Yunfan.","Who would have thought that this guy, whom he did not even know, could actually make these big shots stand up for him one after another?","An Xiuxiu glanced at the butler and whipped him with a long whip.","“How dare you ruin Miaoyi’s reputation!” An Xiuxiu said fiercely.","She hated this kind of person the most. He used his master’s name to be lawless. Most importantly, the person he offended was Chu Yunfan.","During this period of time, she had gone to Chu Yunfan’s place a lot. Although she was teaching Chu Hongcai, she would also receive Chu Yunfan’s guidance.","Chu Yunfan didn’t give her much advice, but he hit the nail on the head every time. It made her feel enlightened. In her heart, Chu Yunfan was definitely synonymous with unfathomable.","She didn’t want to provoke such a person. She also knew that Situ Miaoyi’s attitude toward Chu Yunfan had taken a 180-degree turn.","Originally, Situ Miaoyi didn’t want to have anything to do with Chu Yunfan even if she was beaten to death. However, after the battle with the Snake Brothers, there was obviously a huge change. That was why she asked An Xiuxiu to invite Chu Yunfan.","Now, this butler actually dared to find trouble with Chu Yunfan. No matter who ordered him to do so, it was unforgivable.","“Ah!”","The housekeeper screamed and was sent flying. Everyone in the room gasped. They all knew that An Xiuxiu was a hot-blooded woman, but they didn’t expect her to attack.","The servants and guards of the Situ clan could only watch and didn’t dare to step forward. If it was someone else who dared to act presumptuously here, of course, they wouldn’t stand by and watch. However, it was this lady. Everyone knew that An Xiuxiu and Situ Miaoyi had a good relationship.","Who would dare to stop this lady?","In a short while, the butler had been whipped more than ten times. His entire body was covered in wounds and he screamed continuously.","“Young Master Jie, save me!”","Seeing that An Xiuxiu was about to kill him, the butler hurriedly shouted.","At this time, it was impossible for Chu Xiujie to not make a sound. He could only bite the bullet and walk up to say, “An Xiuxiu, isn’t it inappropriate for you to attack like this? No matter what, he’s from the Situ clan. Don’t tell me you don’t respect the Situ clan?”","“Chu Xiujie, are you really going to stoop so low? Are you trying to drive a wedge between Miaoyi and me with your mediocre skills?” An Xiuxiu sneered.","When the housekeeper called out to Chu Xiujie, she knew that this matter must have something to do with him. She couldn’t stand people like Chu Xiujie who didn’t achieve anything.","Chu Xiujie was so angry that his face turned ashen, but he didn’t dare to fight back because An Zhenguo was beside An Xiuxiu. He knew how powerful An Zhenguo was. He had already been a Divine for a long time, and his current cultivation was simply unfathomable. In the future, he would definitely have a place among the top experts in Conglong City.","Even if he became the heir of Marquis Zhongxin in the future, he would not be An Zhenguo’s match.","“No matter what, you can’t represent the Situ clan!” Chu Xiujie said.","“What’s there that I can’t represent? What Xiuxiu says is also what I, Situ Miaoyi, also say!”","Suddenly, at this moment, a melodious but powerful voice was heard. Chu Yunfan looked up and saw Situ Miaoyi, who he had not seen for more than ten days, striding over.","Today, Situ Miaoyi was dressed in a grand dress and looked even more beautiful than the day he met her. However, at this moment, her face was filled with anger. She frowned slightly and said, “Xiuxiu is already giving me face by not killing this traitor!”","Situ Miaoyi had already heard about the situation from an attendant. She was instantly furious. She had gone through a lot of trouble to invite Chu Yunfan, but this traitor actually colluded with others to deal with Chu Yunfan. Wasn’t this a slap to her face?","In the past few days, she had been constantly learning about Chu Yunfan from An Xiuxiu, her best friend. Her evaluation of Chu Yunfan had become higher and higher, and the resistance from before had long disappeared.","When the butler heard this, his expression immediately changed. He hurriedly struggled to get up and said, “Eldest Miss, please spare my life!”","“Spare you? How can there be such a good thing in this world? Men, drag him away and kick him out of the Situ clan with eighty lashes!” Situ Miaoyi commanded.","Chu Yunfan had a whole new level of respect for Situ Miaoyi. Originally, he had thought that she was a delicate flower that had grown up in a greenhouse. Now, it seemed that she was also not inferior to a man.","Soon, the butler was dragged away, and Chu Xiujie’s face turned green and white. He could only retreat.","Situ Miaoyi ignored him and walked straight to Chu Yunfan. “Young Master Chu, I’m really sorry. It’s my fault for not being strict with my subordinates. That’s why such a thing happened.”","“It’s fine. They’re just a couple of scum.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Situ Miaoyi was about to speak when An Zhenguo suddenly walked up to Chu Yunfan and said, “Chu Yunfan? My sister mentioned you a lot. I heard that you gave her a lot of guidance recently. On behalf of the An clan, I thank you.”","“It’s nothing. It’s just a small matter. Xiuxiu is very talented. She just needs someone to give her some pointers,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","An Zhenguo looked at Chu Yunfan. He had not taken Chu Yunfan seriously before, but after listening to An Xiuxiu’s words of guidance, he suddenly realized that everyone had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan did not say much, but each word hit the nail on the head. This kind of insight wasn’t something that ordinary people could have. In fact, even An Zhenguo couldn’t do it.","This Chu Yunfan was not simple."]},{"number":1204,"title":"Chapter 1204 Defeating An Zhenguo With One Punch","paragraphs":["1204 Defeating An Zhenguo With One Punch","No matter what, it definitely had nothing to do with Chu Yunfan being lucky as the rumors had claimed.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan was also sizing up An Zhenguo. As the legitimate son of Marquis Anguo, An Zhenguo had a huge reputation in Conglong City. Now, it seemed that he was indeed very impressive.","An Zhenguo was at most in his thirties and looked no different from an ordinary person in his twenties. However, in terms of cultivation, he was already close to the peak of the sixth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. He was only one step away from the seventh tier.","It was not impossible for him to enter the half-Core Stage in the future.","Compared to them, Chu Xiujie and Chu Haoyu, who had only just stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage, were far inferior. They were not on the same level.","They were all children of noble families, but there was also a huge difference in talent between them.","“I heard from Xiuxiu that you’re very strong. I would like to spar with you.” An Zhenguo looked at Chu Yunfan seriously, his eyes flashing with fanaticism.","He was able to cultivate to such a level at such a young age. Naturally, he was a person who was extremely crazy about martial arts. Chu Yunfan looked much younger than him, but in terms of cultivation, Chu Yunfan was very powerful according to An Xiuxiu.","However, he didn’t have a direct understanding of how powerful Chu Yunfan was. In his opinion, no matter how powerful Chu Yunfan was, he should only be on the same level as him. For Chu Yunfan’s age, this was already very shocking.","“There’s no need for that.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “You’re no match for me.”","An Xiuxiu and Situ Miaoyi looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. Chu Yunfan’s words sounded too arrogant. With An Zhenguo’s strength, even many veteran experts were not his match. However, Chu Yunfan actually said bluntly that An Zhenguo was not his match.","Chu Yunfan was a little too confident in himself.","However, when they looked at Chu Yunfan, he looked calm.","On the other hand, Liao Deyi believed Chu Yunfan’s words. He had personally seen Chu Yunfan kill Chen Ke, who was of similar strength to him, with a single slap.","“I don’t believe it!” An Zhenguo shook his head.","He could feel the strong confidence in Chu Yunfan’s words, but he still did not believe that he was not Chu Yunfan’s match. It was simply impossible for him to admit defeat before they even fought.","“In that case, let’s find a place to spar,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Great!” An Zhenguo said.","Soon, Situ Miaoyi had someone bring Chu Yunfan to First Pavilion’s practice room. Although she badly wanted to watch the battle, she was the hostess today and could not leave.","In the training room, Chu Yunfan and An Zhenguo faced each other from afar. In the entire training room, there was only An Xiuxiu as an audience.","“If you want to attack, then attack with all your strength. Otherwise, you get another chance,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“You’re really confident,” An Zhenguo said as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan smiled and didn’t say anything. However, at that moment, An Zhenguo made his move. He turned into a gust of wind and was so fast that he instantly kicked Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, the barrier in the training room instantly recovered, preventing it from being destroyed.","An Zhenguo kicked Chu Yunfan. Even though he didn’t expect that this kick would severely injure Chu Yunfan, the actual result still shocked him.","Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He did not move an inch. An Zhenguo’s attack had failed to do anything to him.","Swoosh!","In the next moment, An Zhenguo’s movements became even faster. In an instant, the entire training room was filled with a storm.","His cultivation had already reached the peak of the sixth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. Due to the restrictions of the laws of the Spirit Realm, he was unable to compete with the Divines of the Federation in terms of strength.","However, it was still very shocking.","An Xiuxiu’s eyes widened. She saw Chu Yunfan being swallowed by the storm. Then, she heard a huge explosion as if an extremely intense battle had taken place. However, after she condensed her divine power into her eyes, she could see that there was no intense battle at all. It was An Zhenguo who had been attacking, and his attacks were easily blocked by Chu Yunfan.","No matter how fast An Zhenguo was, or how amazing the angle of his attack was, Chu Yunfan could always keep up with his pace.","An Zhenguo’s attacks was casually turned into nothing.","An Xiuxiu was extremely shocked. She knew her brother very well. He was known as the son of the storm. His attacks were extremely fast and powerful. Even those with higher cultivation than her brother found it difficult to do anything to him.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would completely reverse this fact? Chu Yunfan was completely relaxed.","An Zhenguo’s expression had become completely solemn, completely different from his earlier relaxed expression.","“It’s my turn next. Take my punch,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","An Zhenguo’s soul immediately froze. Then, he saw Chu Yunfan clench his fist and punch over.","The speed of this punch was not very fast, but Chu Yunfan’s punch gave him a feeling that he could not dodge it no matter what.","That wasn’t because of the speed!","An Zhenguo was a martial arts expert. He immediately understood that he was actually completely suppressed by Chu Yunfan mentally, which was why he felt that he could not avoid it.","Chu Yunfan’s simple punch stirred up the spirit energy of nature, forming an inescapable net that covered the sky and earth.","Boom!","An Zhenguo couldn’t dodge. Chu Yunfan’s punch directly hit his chest, and he flew backwards. Like a kite with a broken string, he crashed into the wall and slid to the floor.","But then, An Zhenguo realized that he was not injured at all. After being sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s punch, the terrifying fist force instantly dispersed into the air.","At this moment, how could he not understand that Chu Yunfan was showing mercy?","Even if he didn’t know what was good for him, he knew that if Chu Yunfan hadn’t shown mercy, that punch would have been enough to seriously injure him.","After dusting himself off, he smiled bitterly and cupped his hands. “Thank you for showing mercy!”","Previously, when Chu Yunfan said that he was no match for him, he thought that Chu Yunfan was being arrogant. But now, it seemed that Chu Yunfan was not arrogant and was telling the truth.","In just a short exchange, he had a feeling that Chu Yunfan was unfathomable and invincible."]},{"number":1205,"title":"Chapter 1205 A Backhand Slap","paragraphs":["1205 A Backhand Slap","Chu Yunfan was much more powerful than An Xiuxiu had described.","An Xiuxiu’s strength was still far behind. She could see many things through the fog but she could not see Chu Yunfan’s strength clearly. She could only tell that Chu Yunfan was very strong, but she did not know how strong he was.","That was why An Zhenguo felt that he could compete with Chu Yunfan. Now that they had exchanged blows, he was sent flying with a punch.","“It’s nothing. You’re young, Prince An, yet you have such profound cultivation. You’re amazing,” Chu Yunfan said.","An Xiuxiu watched from the side and felt that Chu Yunfan was quite funny. He was much younger than her brother, but he talked as if he was really old.","However, this felt natural. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, he was indeed qualified to make such an evaluation.","Unlike An Xiuxiu, who felt a little out of place, An Zhenguo felt that it was normal. In this world, the strong were respected. Chu Yunfan’s strength was unfathomable, and An Zhenguo could not compare to him. Naturally, Chu Yunfan had the right to comment on him.","“No, no, no. I was arrogant before and thought that all the heroes in the world were just so-so. Now that I think about it, I’m just a frog at the bottom of a well.” An Zhenguo said straightforwardly.","Chu Yunfan had convinced him through and through. Chu Yunfan was so much younger than him, but his strength was not something he could compare to. He did not even have the intention to compare.","“You’re too modest, Prince An.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","The sparring session ended quickly. The three of them walked out of the practice room and returned to the venue. At this time, the venue was lively again and Situ Miaoyi was at the center.","Chu Yunfan and the other two came to Situ Miaoyi’s side and quickly became the focus of everyone’s attention, the incident with the Situ clan’s butler still fresh in their minds.","“You guys are done already?” Situ Miaoyi looked at Chu Yunfan and the other two in astonishment.","“Yes, we sparred a little. It wasn’t a death match!” Chu Yunfan smiled.","An Zhenguo looked at Chu Yunfan gratefully. Chu Yunfan saved him some face and didn’t mention his defeat.","“We all gave out our birthday presents earlier. Chu Yunfan, did you prepare any presents? Did you not bring any?” Chu Xiujie suddenly asked.","Everyone’s eyes focused on Chu Yunfan. Situ Miaoyi’s expression changed and she said, “Chu Xiujie, are you trying to cause trouble? I’ve already let you off for the sake of Marquis Zhongxin, but you still dare to continue causing trouble?”","Situ Miaoyi’s brows furrowed slightly.","“Am I causing trouble?” Chu Xiujie’s face was gloomy. “Everyone brought gifts. I just want to see what Chu Yunfan has brought.”","Chu Xiujie’s face was full of confidence because he knew that Chu Yunfan had lived in seclusion for more than a year. He hadn’t formed any cliques and had no other source of income. The little subsidy given by the Chu clan was not enough for Chu Yunfan to give Situ Miayi any high-class gifts.","He wanted to embarrass Chu Yunfan and make him feel ashamed.","Chu Yunfan didn’t really care and said, “What gift did you give? How about you show me?”","“Chu Yunfan, feast your eyes on this pair of Wind Spirit Bracelets! When one wears it, it will naturally absorb spirit energy for the person’s use!” Chu Yanghui said straightforwardly from behind Chu Xiujie.","“Stop stalling. Chu Yunfan, what are you giving? Let us see it!” Chu Yongyan joined in the fun and shouted.","“Since you want to see it, I’ll let you see it.” Chu Yunfan flipped his palm, and a medicine bottle appeared in his hand.","“Miss Situ, I came in a hurry and didn’t bring any good gifts. Please consider this Divinity Nourishment Pill as your birthday gift. I hope you don’t mind,” Chu Yunfan said as he handed the bottle to Situ Miaoyi.","“Divinity Nourishment Pilll? I’ve never even heard of such a thing before. I don’t even know where it came from,” Chu Yongyan said disdainfully.","Chu Yunfan grinned. “There’s nothing magical about this pill. It only has one function. It allows a peak Innate to enter the Divine Abilities Stage.”","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, it immediately caused an uproar. There were far more Divines in the Spirit Realm than in the Federation. However, because there were no high-tech weapons, Divines had a higher status.","However, not everyone could step into the Divine Abilities Stage. Even though they were all descendants of noble families, most of them could not cross this line in their lifetime.","Among them, there were many at the peak of the Innate Stage. It was not that they did not want to enter the Divine Abilities Stage but they did not have the resources or ability to do so.","Giving such a medicinal pill was equivalent to giving away one’s future!","Even the people who had been the most indifferent to Chu Yunfan now looked at him with fiery eyes.","Even Situ Miaoyi could no longer maintain her composure. Her family was a wealthy merchant family. She had seen all kinds of good things since she was young. It was nothing, but this pill still shocked her.","Just as she had said when she was chatting with An Xiuxiu, the Divine Abilities Stage was a completely different world. Especially for women, it was a step that determined whether they could decide their own fate.","“This is too expensive of a gift!” Situ Miaoyi said as she inhaled a deep breath.","Chu Yunfan looked at Situ Miaoyi in surprise. Situ Miaoyi was able to resist the temptation under such circumstances.","“It’s fine. It’s just a medicinal pill. It’s most suitable to give it to the person who needs it the most.”","The value of the Divinity Nourishment Pill was incomparable, but to Chu Yunfan, it wasn’t that precious. Others felt that it was incomparably precious because they couldn’t make it. The most expensive thing was the alchemist’s fee.","“In that case, I’ll gratefully accept it.” Situ Miaoyi took a deep breath and nodded.","“Chu Xiujie, what else do you have to say? You only have the ability to stir up trouble!” At this time, An Xiuxiu, who was beside him, spoke and pointed at Chu Xiujie.","At this time, everyone looked at Chu Xiujie with disdain. Chu Xiujie was so arrogant just because he gave a pair of bracelets. In the end, he was slapped in the face. At this time, everyone was waiting to see him make a fool of himself.","Chu Xiujie’s face was gloomy. He felt his entire face burn. He dusted off his sleeves and left the venue with Chu Yanghui and the others."]},{"number":1206,"title":"Chapter 1206 One Month Later, Time to Slap Someone in the Face","paragraphs":["1206 One Month Later, Time to Slap Someone in the Face","Chu Xiujie left with a livid look on his face. Everyone seemed to be able to hear a loud slap ring through the air.","At the same time, they also began to be curious about Chu Yunfan. They were no strangers to Chu Xiujie, but Chu Yunfan seemed to have appeared out of nowhere. When some of them heard Chu Xiujie call out Chu Yunfan’s name, they immediately seemed to remember something.","“So he’s that Chu Yunfan!”","“I think I’ve heard of him before. He seems to be one of the candidates to takeover Marquis Zhongxin’s household.”","!!","“Tsk tsk, this slap in the face is really ruthless!”","Many people now understood why Chu Xiujie was looking for trouble with Chu Yunfan everywhere. It turned out that there was such a relationship behind it.","Chu Xiujie and Chu Yunfan were both candidates for Marquis Zhongxin. It was normal for the two sides to be at loggerheads. Some people had even seen Chu Xiujie and Chu Haoyu fighting openly and secretly. It was just that Chu Yunfan was an unfamiliar face.","After Chu Xiujie left, the atmosphere became merry once again. The topic of conversation was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Even An Zhenguo looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. Even with the power of Marquis Anguo, this level of pill was extremely rare. Not only were the medicinal ingredients required very precious, but they also needed a pill recipe that had been passed down from ancient times. They also needed to hire a powerful alchemist to make the pill. None of these components could be missing.","This was the fundamental reason why the Divinity Nourishment Pill was so precious. Now, Chu Yunfan had actually given it to Situ Miaoyi without even blinking.","Situ Miaoyi took the Divinity Nourishment Pill and put it in her personal space. When she looked at Chu Yunfan again, there was a hint of special meaning in her beautiful eyes.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stay for long. Not long after Chu Xiujie left, he said goodbye.","“He’s so nice. He actually gave you such a precious medicinal pill just like that.” An Xiuxiu looked at Situ Miaoyi with a mocking expression.","Situ Miaoyi’s face flushed red. Her red lips parted slightly as she said, “Don’t talk nonsense!”","“I’m not talking nonsense. This medicinal pill can’t be bought no matter how much money you spend, okay?”","“If I had such a pill,” An Xiuxiu said, “I wouldn’t have to go out and cultivate for a year to break through!”","An Xiuxiu’s eyes were filled with envy. She had paid a huge price to enter the Divine Abilities Stage. She had risked her life to break through. Now, Situ Miaoyi was about to break through as well.","It was impossible for her not to be envious.","Situ Miaoyi bit her lower lip, her eyes shifty. No one knew what she was thinking.","The incident at Situ Miaoyi’s birthday party quickly spread, and it also made Chu Yunfan’s name appear for the first time in the circle of the rich and powerful of Conglong City.","However, after that, Chu Yunfan went into seclusion to heal his injuries. He did not appear in person, and soon, there were no more topics to talk about.","It didn’t cause much trouble in Marquis Zhongxin’s household because Chu Yunfan was too lazy to say anything, and Chu Xiujie and the others wouldn’t humiliate themselves.","As for the people in the marquis’s household, what they paid attention to was the matter of Chu Hongcai challenging Chu Xiujie.","This matter had been continuously fermenting with the passage of time. Chu Xiujie and the others were also adding fuel to the fire behind the scenes.","Chu Xiujie was very confident in his strength. If it was Chu Yunfan, he might be a little afraid, but the person who challenged him was Chu Hongcai. In his opinion, it was simply courting death.","Therefore, Chu Xiujie and the others were constantly adding fuel to the fire behind the scenes, making the impact of this matter bigger and bigger. They wanted to severely injure Chu Hongcai a month from now to establish their prestige.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about this. Although he had heard about it from Chu Hongcai, he didn’t care. He only wanted Chu Hongcai to win.","In the blink of an eye, another 20 days passed.","At this moment, in the backyard of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion, a youth was sitting cross-legged on the ground. He was in a meditative position, and there was powerful energy boiling around his body.","The terrifying aura that belonged to the peak of the Innate Stage was spreading out in all directions. However, before it could spread out to the backyard, it was blocked by the barrier above the backyard.","This barrier was set up by Chu Yunfan. Together with the spirit-gathering array that Chu Yunfan had set up, it turned the backyard into a small paradise.","In a corner of the backyard, a black-robed young man and a girl in a red dress stared at the young man.","They were Chu Yunfan and An Xiuxiu. The person who was breaking through in the middle was Chu Hongcai.","The one-month deadline was close at hand. In this one month, after enduring Chu Yunfan’s special training, Chu Hongcai’s strength had undergone an earth-shattering change.","He had broken through from the peak of the sixth Innate stage to the peak of the Innate Stage!","Moreover, his foundation was extremely solid, and there were no signs of instability.","For ordinary people, this might cause their foundation to be unstable. However, for Chu Yunfan, who had a strategic position, this was nothing. In the cultivation system, the Innate Stage was a stage to build the foundation. A small leap was nothing at all.","After a month of hard work, coupled with the Innate Pill that Chu Yunfan had specially made, Chu Hongcai’s strength had undergone earth-shattering changes.","Today was the day Chu Yunfan had chosen for him to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Hongcai mobilized his divine power to the limit and immediately swallowed a Divinity Nourishment Pilll. One of the two Divinity Nourishment Pillls that Chu Yunfan had made a month ago was given to Situ Miaoyi and the other was left for Chu Hongcai.","Situ Miaoyi had already successfully entered the Divine Abilities Stage a few days ago, and she had even come to the shop to thank Chu Yunfan.","Now, Chu Hongcai had just swallowed the other one. Not long after, the medicinal power of the Divinity Nourishment Pill was completely released into his body, forming a powerful cyclone storm around him.","The surrounding spirit energy began to be devoured at an astonishing speed. An Xiuxiu, who was at the side, stared at everything in front of her without blinking, feeling extremely shocked.","During this month, she watched Chu Hongcai cultivate step by step to reach this level. If she hadn’t seen it with her own eyes, she would have found it hard to believe that someone could jump several levels in a short month.","After a long time, the violent energy in Chu Hongcai’s body calmed down. Above the backyard, a phenomenon of heaven and earth actually appeared. It was a sign that he had stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage.","Seeing this, Chu Yunfan smiled and said, “The one-month deadline is up. It’s time to slap some people in the face!”"]},{"number":1207,"title":"Chapter 1207 Who Told You I’m Only an Innate?","paragraphs":["1207 Who Told You I’m Only an Innate?","The one-month deadline had finally arrived.","Chu Hongcai’s challenge to Chu Xiujie had undoubtedly become the most anticipated event in the entire residence.","In the eyes of many smart people, Chu Hongcai was definitely unable to pose a threat to Chu Xiujie, and the key behind this was the Young Master Fan who was shrouded in fog.","Chu Yunfan had only attacked once in front of them. He had crippled Chu Yanghui with one kick. Then, he had taught Chu Hongcai only one move that allowed him to severely injured Chu Yongyan with one strike.","!!","This made Chu Yunfan even more mysterious within Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","The sun was getting darker and darker, and everyone in the residence who could find time to come had already arrived at the arena area. The dozen or so candidates of Marquis Zhongxin had already gathered together long ago, but they were clearly divided into two sides.","On one side were Chu Xiujie, Chu Huihui, Chu Yongyan, and the others. On the other side was a square-faced young man leading a group. He was facing Chu Xiujie from afar and was not at a disadvantage.","This person was none other than the other prominent figure among the candidates of the Chu clan heirs, Chu Haoyu.","Chu Hongcai challenging Chu Xiujie was a huge matter that shook the entire residence. Regardless of whether he won or lost, it would change the current situation.","If Chu Hongcai lost, it would greatly increase Chu Xiujie’s prestige. If Chu Hongcai won, the pattern of the two strong contending for the throne would also be changed, and it would become a three-legged stand.","Chu Haoyu had no choice but to witness the fight.","“Why aren’t Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai here yet?”","“Don’t tell me they don’t dare to come.”","“That’s entirely plausible. After all, with Chu Hongcai’s strength, he wants to challenge Chu Xiujie. I think he’s just talking out of his *ss!”","“Don’t tell me they’re running away without fighting!”","As time passed, many people started making assumptions. Many even guessed that Chu Yunfan did not dare to come.","Just as Chu Xiujie was starting to get impatient, he saw two figures striding in. They walked into the arena one after the other. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai?","“Everyone’s already here. Come on! It looks like we’re the ones who’re late,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","Of course, he was not late. He had come just in time.","Chu Yunfan’s calm attitude and Chu Xiujie’s solemn attitude formed a sharp contrast.","“It doesn’t matter if you come earlier or later. It’s just the difference between being defeated by me sooner or later,” Chu Xiujie said lightly.","Chu Xiujie’s gaze was firmly locked onto Chu Yunfan. He didn’t take Chu Hongcai to heart at all, but Chu Yunfan had embarrassed him time and time again, making him gnash his teeth in hatred.","However, Chu Yunfan was as slippery as a loach, making it impossible for him to find a suitable opportunity to deal with him.","“Chu Xiujie, are you sure you can defeat me?” Chu Hongcai stepped forward and sneered.","“You?” Chu Xiujie didn’t even look at him. Instead, he looked directly at Chu Yunfan, “Chu Yunfan, what’s so great about always scheming behind my back? Do you dare to fight me later?”","Chu Yunfan looked at him and sneered, “What tricks do I need to use to deal with you? You can challenge me later if you can still stand up.”","“What are you babbling on about? Let’s begin!” Chu Hongcai took a step forward.","“If you want to die, then I’ll fulfill your wish!”","Chu Xiujie sneered and took a step forward. A light appeared under his feet. In an instant, he had already arrived in the ring.","Chu Hongcai also leaped and dove into the ring.","Many people couldn’t help but shake their heads when they saw this scene. Although Chu Hongcai’s lightness skill looked good, it was still an Innate Stage technique after all. It couldn’t be compared to a Divine.","Just the fact that they couldn’t fly was a huge disadvantage/","“As expected, there are no miracles.” Chu Haoyu shook his head.","In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was only forcing Chu Hongcai to go up because of his previous boasting. He was just sending Chu Hongcai to his death.","Seeing Chu Hongcai happily go up, the last bit of worry in Chu Xiujie’s heart vanished into nothingness. He and Chu Haoyu had the same judgment.","“I’ll finish you off in one move!” Chu Xiujie roared.","The aura of a Divine was instantly released, causing the enchantments on the stage to awaken and spring into action.","As soon as he finished speaking, Chu Xiehie made his move. In an instant, a long spear appeared in his hand. The spear’s light was like a poisonous dragon, directly stabbing toward Chu Hongcai.","The terrifying aura brought by the spear light soared into the sky and instantly drowned Chu Hongcai.","“It’s over!”","Everyone’s face revealed such an expression. After Chu Xiujie attacked with all his strength, Chu Hongcai, who was in the Innate Stage, surely would not be able to withstand it.","Boom!","However, when everyone heard a loud explosion, they did not see Chu Hongcai fly out of the ring.","“How could this be?!”","Chu Haoyu was the first to reveal a look of disbelief.","He didn’t know when, but a spear had appeared in Chu Hongcai’s hand, firmly blocking Chu Xiujie’s attack.","Chu Xiujie also felt that his attack had been blocked. He immediately looked at Chu Hongcai in shock, simply in disbelief. He had attacked with the intention of severely injuring Chu Hongcai or even killing him, but in the end, he was unable to do anything to Chu Hongcai.","“Chu Xiujie, weren’t you very arrogant? I didn’t expect your strength to just be this,” Chu Hongcai chuckled.","“Impossible! How could you have blocked my spear?!” Chu Xiujie said in disbelief, “You’re just an Innate!”","“Who told you that I’m only an Innate?” Chu Hongcai burst into laughter. The bitter training he had been putting in during this period of time had finally been completely unleashed.","Boom!","A terrifying Divine Abilities Stage aura was completely released, and there was an extremely happy expression on Chu Hongcai’s face. In this month, he had improved at a rapid speed, but only he knew how much pain he had suffered. He cultivated day and night. Other than the necessary time to sleep, he had no time to rest.","Coupled with the Innate Pill and the Divinity Nourishment Pilll made by Chu Yunfan, he finally stepped into the ranks.","It was definitely not just because of Chu Yunfan’s advice. Chu Hongcai had also put in more effort than ordinary people could imagine. He had even been on the verge of death many times to obtain such results.","...","“Chu Xiujie, it’s my turn next!”"]},{"number":1208,"title":"Chapter 1208 Face Slapping Chu Xiujie","paragraphs":["1208 Face Slapping Chu Xiujie","Everyone was shocked by this sudden turn of events, especially Chu Yanghui, Chu Yongyan, and the others.","Back then, they knew Chu Hongcai’s strength level very well. At most, he was only at the seventh Innate stage. How could he have stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage in just one month?","Thinking back to Chu Yunfan’s solemn promise a month ago, they wondered if he really knew magic. Otherwise, how could Chu Hongcai have broken through to the Divine Abilities Stage in a month?","In fact, with the difficulty of reaching the Divine Abilities Stage from the peak of the Innate Stage, it was already very impressive to be able to break through in a few years.","To be able to break through in a month’s time, if that wasn’t a miracle, then what was?","It was just that the height they stood at was too low. There was no way for them to see through the essence of the matter like Chu Yunfan and directly help Chu Hongcai break through from the root.","Chu Haoyu also looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. He had never been optimistic about Chu Hongcai, but Chu Yunfan had used the truth to slap them in the face. He didn’t think highly of Chu Hongcai before, but now, he felt his face hurt.","His eyes were no longer on Chu Hongcai and Chu Xiujie but on Chu Yunfan.","‘How did he do it?!’","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, had a calm expression on his face. Everything was under his control. Chu Hongcai had been training for a month, and now he could finally unleash the results.","Suddenly, at this moment, Chu Hongcai moved. The spear in his hand was like a long black dragon, piercing through the sky. The spear pierced through everything and directly rushed toward Chu Xiujie.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Loud explosions sounded like missiles exploding in the air. The loud explosions were accompanied by countless energy waves that were controlled in this small arena.","Many people could no longer see what was happening clearly. The figures of both sides were almost at their limits.","At this moment, they had a true understanding of how terrifying it was for two Divines to fight.","The small arena was not enough for the two of them to move around. Under such circumstances, the two sides could only fight head-on at close range.","“You’re courting death, you’re courting death, you’re courting death!”","Chu Xiujie was furious. However, to his horror, he discovered that he couldn’t do anything to Chu Hongcai. His attacks were easily blocked.","As time passed, he realized that Chu Hongcai’s strength had increased, and the speed of his spear had increased. Even the spear consciousness contained in each of his spears was boiling, and each attack was much more terrifying than the last.","Chu Hongcai felt all the blood in his body boil. In fact, it was not his first time fighting with a Divine, but An Xiuxiu would always hold back when fighting him so this was his first time fighting with a Divine of the same level.","He was still a bit shaky in some parts at first, but as time passed, they slowly became smoother and stronger.","This was also the fundamental reason why Chu Xiujie felt that Chu Hongcai was becoming more and more difficult to deal with. It was because Chu Hongcai was becoming stronger while he didn’t change. Under this situation, his attacks were repeatedly repelled by Chu Hongcai.","Chu Hongcai didn’t even defend himself against Chu Xiuejie’s attacks. Instead, he used offense to defend, using speed to fight speed, and using the tip of a needle against the tip of a wheat.","Chu Hongcai wasn’t at a disadvantage at all.","“How is that possible? Even if you’ve also reached the Divine Abilities Stage, you’ve only reached it a few days ago while I’ve already reached this stage a few years ago. How could I lose to you?!” Chu Xiujie roared in anger.","All the power in his body burst out and condensed together. Then, he turned into a terrifying hurricane and swept directly in Chu Hongcai’s direction.","“I’m done warming up. I’ll finish you off in one move!”","Chu Hongcai was excited to see Chu Xiujie go all out. He wasn’t afraid at all. On the contrary, he was very excited. A month ago, he would never have thought that he could actually suppress Chu Xiujie.","If someone had told him this a month ago, he would have thought that the other party had gone crazy. But now, he had done it.","“Cloud Split!”","As Chu Hong shouted, the spear in his hand suddenly stabbed out. The spear was extremely terrifying, like a ray of light that could split the world.","In an instant, everyone present seemed to see that after this spear strike, the entire sky was cloudless. Just one spear strike was actually able to disperse the clouds within 10,000 miles.","Of course, this was just an illusion formed by the spear’s consciousness and was not real. Even so, the power of this attack was shocking enough.","Compared to a month ago when Chu Hongcai had first used this move, the power of this attack was completely different.","Boom!","The Cloud Split instantly tore apart all of Chu Xiujie’s attacks. The momentum of the spear light did not decrease and hit directly into Chu Xiujie’s chest.","Chu Xiujie’s eyes were still filled with disbelief. How could this be? His attack was actually completely broken through. His performance compared to Chu Hongcai’s was simply inferior.","Bam!","Chu Xiujie was hit by the spear, and the magic armor he was wearing was instantly destroyed. He hit the barrier around the stage and spat out a mouthful of blood.","With just one shot, Chu Xiujie was defeated by Chu Hongcai!","A month ago, Chu Hongcai shot Chu Yongyan and became famous in one battle. A month later, Chu Hongcai severely injured Chu Xiujie.","If it wasn’t for the fact that everyone had seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed that Chu Hongcai wasn’t even twenty years old.","The scene was dead silent. Everyone was shocked.","“Chu Xiujie actually lost. How is that possible? Isn’t he very strong? How could he be so weak?” someone exclaimed.","“It’s not that Chu Xiujie is weak, but that Chu Hongcai is strong! Or rather, that attack was powerful.”","Chu Haoyu’s expression was extremely solemn as he spoke. His gaze swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Whether it was Chu Hongcai’s sudden increase in strength in a month or the final spear strike that determined the outcome, it all came from Chu Yunfan.","Looking at Chu Yunfan again, his expression was extremely calm, as if everything was under his control.","‘Did he expect all of this?’ this thought flashed through Chu Haoyu’s mind, but he immediately threw it aside. He felt that this was simply inconceivable.","“Hahaha, Brother Fan, I won!” Chu Xiujie said excitedly as he jumped down and looked at Chu Yunfan.","“Let’s go. What’s there to be happy about winning against Chu Xiujie?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Chu Xiujie, who was lying on the ground, spat out another mouthful of blood when he heard Chu Yunfan’s words.","..."]},{"number":1209,"title":"Chapter 1209 Recovering to the Half-Step Core Stage, Called Upon by Marquis Zhongxin","paragraphs":["1209 Recovering to the Half-Step Core Stage, Called Upon by Marquis Zhongxin","Everyone was dumbfounded. To them, Chu Hongcai’s counterattack and defeat of Chu Xiujie was enough to cause a sensation in the entire residence.","However, Chu Yunfan’s expression was so disdainful that Chu Yanghui, Chu Yongyan, and the others opened their mouths, wanting to say something, but in the end, they had nothing to say.","The loser had no right to say anything!","They couldn’t even defeat Chu Hongcai, let alone deal with Chu Yunfan, who seemed to be far stronger than Chu Hongcai.","!!","With Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai’s departure, the battle finally came to an end. However, the impact of this matter was gradually brewing.","There were many people who came to watch the battle. Chu Xiujie had lost his dignity. He originally wanted to use Chu Hongcai to establish his prestige, but who knew that he would be slapped in the face by Chu Hongcai?","Most people didn’t see it with their own eyes. When they heard about it, their first reaction was that it was impossible. However, the news became more and more detailed. Even Chu Hongcai’s last shot was described.","Defeating Chu Xiujie with a single spear strike, he had once again made Chu Xiujie lose his dignity!","Chu Hongcai had caused a sensation in the entire residence overnight. Many people hadn’t even opened their eyes to look at Chu Hongcai before and he wasn’t among those who were competing for the position of heir.","But now, everyone understood that whether they were willing or not, after this battle, Chu Hongcai would definitely enter everyone’s field of vision and become a strong competitor.","Under such circumstances, the competition for the heir turned from a two-sided struggle to a three-sided struggle.","However, some people noticed the mysterious Chu Yunfan standing behind Chu Hongcai.","In the past, Chu Yunfan was famous throughout the residence for his mysteriousness. However, the reason why he was famous at that time was because he lived in seclusion and rarely went out, but he was very liked by the old lady.","However, it was completely different now. It was also mysterious and unpredictable, but now it was just a guess of Chu Yunfan’s powerful strength.","Chu Yunfan had only attacked once, and he had severely injured Chu Yanghui. No one knew how strong he truly was.","However, judging from how he was able to train Chu Hongcai, many people would not believe that he had not stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage. But no one knew exactly how powerful he was. This was what many people wanted to know.","As this matter continued to ferment, an even bigger piece of news instantly suppressed the impact of this matter—the old lady was coming back.","The old lady who had returned to her hometown to visit her relatives was finally coming back, and Marquis Zhongxin, who had accompanied her, was also on the way back.","According to the journey back, they would return to Conglong City in three days at most.","Instantly, everyone in the entire residence started to move. Whether it was Chu Xiujie, Chu Hongcai, or Chu Haoyu, they were all likely to become the future masters of the residence.","However, the current master of the residence was still the marquis himself and the old lady.","The entire residence was like a machine that was operating to welcome the return of the old madam and the marquis.","This trend even affected Chu Hongcai. Even he went to prepare. Chu Yunfan’s words had ignited his ambition. Originally, he had absolutely no hope of becoming the heir, but it was different now. Under everyone’s watchful eyes, he defeated Chu Xiujie with a single strike, proving that he had the strength of a Divine.","And he was only in his teens. In terms of age, what was originally a disadvantage had now become an advantage.","Since he had such a huge advantage, he was naturally unwilling to give up just like that!","However, he had been an invisible person in the residence before, and he was not even as famous as Chu Yunfan. If he wanted to compete for the position of heir, he had to leave a deep impression on the marquis.","Therefore, Chu Hongcai went back to prepare early in the morning. Chu Yunfan did not force him to stay and train. In fact, this wave did not affect Chu Yunfan at all.","While he cultivated and healed his injuries, he used the Battle Wolves’ channels to gather the medicinal herbs he needed to make pills.","The Great Wei Kingdom was not the Federation. In the Federation, as long as one had money, they could buy the herbs they wanted online. Here, one had to go through local tyrants like the Battle Wolf Gang.","The Battle Wolf Gang was indeed the largest gang in Conglong City. The list of medicinal herbs that Chu Yunfan had given them was being collected at an astonishing speed. It would not take long for them to collect enough medicinal herbs.","At that time, Chu Yunfan’s recovery would be just around the corner. Once he recovered, he would be the true return of the dragon!","Although he was strong now, the difference between him and when he was at his peak was too great. They could not be mentioned in the same breath. However, according to Chu Yunfan’s recovery speed, he would be able to recover his half-step Dan Stage combat strength in a few days.","After this period of secluded cultivation, Chu Yunfan had not received any benefits. On the contrary, this process was a process of re-cultivation for him, and he had re-established his foundation.","Chu Yunfan was confident that once he recovered, he would be able to break through to the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, and his combat strength would rise to another level.","Although he had been crippled for more than a year, from the speed of his cultivation, he had become even faster. It could be considered a blessing in disguise.","It was precisely because it was a crucial moment that the matter of Marquis Zhongxin returning to his residence did not affect him at all. In any case, he did not want to fight for the position of heir so he did not even think about hanging around in front of Marquis Zhongxin.","In the backyard of First Pavillion, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged on the ground, his body floating in the air. He was surrounded by a surge of divine power that was boiling.","Suddenly, he opened his eyes and released all his divine power like a monstrous wave. The barrier in the backyard shook violently as if it would be broken in the next moment.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan managed to reign in the huge wave of mana so it didn’t affect the outside world at all. He let out a long breath and the breath turned into a long dragon, disappearing into the air.","“I’ve finally recovered to this stage!” Chu Yunfan said.","His strength had finally recovered to the half-step Core Stage. However, compared to the first time he stepped into this realm, it was completely different. In his eyes, ordinary half-step Cores were simply unable to withstand a single blow from him. He could even protect himself from Cores.","He was only one step away from a complete recovery, but this one step was like the difference between heaven and earth.","However, before he could recover, he heard a piece of news from Chu Hongcai, who had rushed over in a hurry."]},{"number":1210,"title":"Chapter 1210 You Want to Persuade Me? You’re Not Qualified!","paragraphs":["1210 You Want to Persuade Me? You’re Not Qualified!","It was already the third day—the day of Marquis Zhongxin’s return.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had recovered to the half-step Core Stage.","In the core courtyard of the residence, a man in a luxurious robe who looked to be around 50 to 60 years old sat in the study, handling various documents.","This person was none other than Marquis Zhongzin of the Great Wei Kingdom, Chu Yaowei.","Behind him was a square-faced man who looked to be in his forties. This man stood behind Chu Yaowei without moving as if he was a wooden stake.","Suddenly, footsteps came from outside, followed by a voice announcing, “Chu Yunfan requests an audience!”","“Come in.” Chu Yaowei raised his head.","A tall and slender figure dressed in black slowly walked in. It was Chu Yunfan.","“Greetings, Marquis Zhongxin!” Chu Yunfan bowed with a straight face.","“Sit,” Chu Yaowei said.","Chu Yunfan didn’t refuse and sat down. He looked into Chu Yaowei’s eyes, neither servile nor overbearing.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve done a lot during this period of time,” Chu Yaowei said with a faint smile as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","However, he still underestimated Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan did not have the slightest fear when facing him. The reason why Chu Yunfan was polite was that he was grateful that the residence had taken him in.","“May I know what you are referring to, Marquis?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I heard that Chu Xiujie was defeated by Chu Hongcai?” Chu Yaowei said calmly.","He wasn’t completely ignorant about the cliques formed among the candidates. In fact, he was happy to see this happen and even single-handedly promoted it. This was like raising a parasite, choosing the strongest one among these people to inherit the family business of the residence.","Although it was a sly move, there was no other way.","“Yes,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","“I also heard that you were the one who trained Chu Hongcai?” Chu Yaowei continued to ask.","“That’s his own hard work,” Chu Yunfan said in neither a servile nor overbearing manner. “I just gave him a little guidance.”","Chu Yaowei’s facial muscles twitched. He almost wanted to flip the table.","To be able to make a seventh-level Innate martial artist break through to the Divine Abilities Stage in a month’s time, if it was just a casual guide, what was the meaning of giving everything he had?","However, Chu Yaowei quickly controlled his expression. He was already used to Chu Yunfan’s attitude. In fact, this was not the first time Chu Yunfan had acted this way.","He was like this almost every time. He was neither humble nor overbearing as if he could be on equal footing with the Chu Yaowei himself. Although he had a sharp edge, he did not reveal it. He was not the kind of person who was arrogant and domineering.","Chu Yaowei didn’t want to argue with Chu Yunfan because he felt that it was meaningless to argue with a boy. Moreover, if his mother found out, he would be reprimanded.","Also, he was somewhat tolerant of this person who looked very similar to his deceased brother.","However, it was different because he realized that he had never understood Chu Yunfan. Chu Hongcai had advanced by leaps and bounds with just a few pointers. He never believed that Chu Yunfan had such an advantage, but in fact, he did. He had just been hiding it all this time.","Was Chu Yunfan really not interested in being the heir?","“It was you who guided Chu Hongcai to come out and fight for the position of heir, right? Why? Aren’t you interested at all?” Chu Yaowei asked.","He didn’t think there was anything wrong with Chu Hongcai coming out to fight for the position. It wasn’t scary for a man to have ambition. What was scary was that if their ability and ambition didn’t match.","If Chu Hongcai was only at the seventh Innate Stage, Chu Yaowei would have shouted at him to retreat. However, since he had already stepped into Divine Abilities Stage, it was different.","“I’m untalented and inexperienced. I’m afraid I don’t have the qualifications to compete for the title of Marquis Zhongxin,” Chu Yunfan said.","“This is simply not true,” Chu Yaowei said with certainty.","He could tell that Chu Yunfan wasn’t coming out to compete because he thought he lacked talent and knowledge. This kind of calm confidence was something that only people who were extremely confident in themselves could have.","Being confident but not flamboyant was something that many people could not do.","This was especially true for young men like Chu Yunfan. They were either not confident, or if they were confident, they would be arrogant. And to some extent, being arrogant was not a bad thing because young passion could often do many things that middle-aged and old people could not do.","However, this made it even more obvious how rare it was for someone like Chu Yunfan to be confident but not ostentatious.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know what Chu Yaowei was thinking. Even if he knew, he wouldn’t take it seriously. He had seen many storms and stood at the top of the world. The position of heir wasn’t worth him making a big fuss about.","However, since Chu Yaowei had said so, Chu Yunfan didn’t hide it anymore and said directly, “Becoming the heir is a kind of restriction for me. My ambition is to be at the peak of martial arts. ”","“How dare you!” Chu Yaowei shouted, his eyes flashing with inexplicable light.","It should be known that many people wanted to compete but were not qualified. Those who were qualified to compete had also fought until their heads were bleeding. On the other hand, Chu Yunfan regarded it as a kind of restriction.","No one had ever dared to say it so directly in front of him!","“I’m just telling the truth. You guys think that power is everything, but I think that strength is everything. With my strength, it’s not difficult for me to earn the title of marquis,” Chu Yunfan said directly.","“Sir, he’s very confident. Why don’t you let me persuade him?”","At this moment, the middle-aged man behind Chu Yaowei stood up and spoke up.","“It’s not that easy to become a marquis of the Great Wei Kingdom.”","“All right, Wang Zhenxi, go ahead,” Chu Yaowei said.","Originally, Chu Yunfan wasn’t in his plan and wasn’t on his list of candidates. But now that Chu Yunfan had shown his elegance, Chu Yaowei was a little reluctant to let go just like that.","In his opinion, Chu Yunfan’s way of thinking was too childish. When they were young, everyone thought that they could change the world, but they couldn’t even change themselves.","The middle-aged man, Wang Zhenxi, took a step forward. A pressure unique to Divines erupted, but Wang Zhenxi controlled it very well and crushed it all toward Chu Yunfan.","Wang Zhenxi was actually an eighth-tier Divine. He was only one step away from reaching the ninth tier. Such a person was a rare expert in the Great Wei Kingdom.","Chu Yunfan grinned and said, “You want to persuade me? You’re not qualified.”"]},{"number":1211,"title":"Chapter 1211 The Unfathomable Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["1211 The Unfathomable Chu Yunfan","Wang Zhenxi’s face revealed a hint of anger. With his cultivation, he was considered one of the best in the entire Great Wei Kingdom, but Chu Yunfan was looking down on him.","Although he was Chu Yaowei’s personal bodyguard, Chu Yaowei did not look down on him and treated him as a trusted subordinate.","On the contrary, Chu Yunfan dared to look down on him!","“How arrogant of a junior!”","Wang Zhenxi sneered. In the blink of an eye, he had already arrived before Chu Yunfan. He casually slapped out with his palm.","This simple strike struck Chu Yunfan’s shoulder. In an instant, it was like a spear stabbing out, fast and ruthless.","Wang Zhenxi’s simple attack was extremely vicious. If Chu Yunfan was hit by this strike, Chu Yunfan’s entire arm would be temporarily crippled.","However, Wang Zhenxi only wanted to teach Chu Yunfan a lesson so he didn’t use much divine power. It was purely a physical attack, but this casual attack had great power.","Chu Yunfan calmly raised his hand and blocked Wang Zhenxi’s attack.","“What great strength!”","Wang Zhenxi immediately felt a huge force rebound back on him, causing his arm to go numb. He hurriedly used his divine power to eliminate this sore and numb feeling, turning it into nothingness.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. His movement was as fast as lightning. He pointed out a finger.","It was just a simple finger, but when he pointed it out, the finger was like a fast sword.","The sword light tore through everything and went for Wang Zhenxi’s shoulder.","Wang Zhenxi was shocked. Chu Yunfan’s speed was so fast. His palm changed rapidly and he slapped at Chu Yunfan’s finger.","Bam!","With a loud grunt, the two of them controlled the scale of the battle and did not use any divine power. However, even so, it was still very shocking.","Thud, thud, thud!","Wang Zhenxi took a few steps back before he could finally get rid of the force. But before he could catch his breath, Chu Yunfan had already arrived beside him and pointed at him again and again.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The palm and finger collided, directly blasting out waves of air explosions through the air.","In just a moment, Wang Zhenxi was already complaining incessantly. Chu Yunfan’s strength was simply terrifying.","Just a finger was enough to numb his arm, and the numbness was spreading throughout his body at an alarming speed.","After exchanging a few more moves, Wang Zhenxi would be completely numb. Even if he used his divine power to resolve it, he would not be able to keep up with the speed at which the numbness spread.","Thinking of this, he didn’t hold back anymore. He immediately shouted and turned his palm into a fist. His fist was like a white rainbow that pierced through the sun as it flew toward Chu Yunfan.","The terrifying air wave brought about by this punch was like a long river. In an instant, it boiled.","Chu Yunfan didn’t back down. From the beginning of the fight, Wang Zhenxi had been the one retreating. In just a moment, he was forced into a corner by Chu Yunfan, who had never retreated.","It was a simple finger attack.","Boom!","The tip of Chu Yunfan’s finger pierced through the fist force and shattered the white rainbow that soared into the sky. Then, he pointed at Wang Zhenxi’s fist.","Chu Yaowei’s eyes were wide open. He didn’t know who would win this battle.","However, this doubt was quickly resolved because Wang Zhenxi had already been forced into a corner. Now, he was forced to retreat and had hit the wall, one of his arms hanging limply by his side.","However, Chu Yunfan just stood there with his hands behind his back, not moving at all.","It was already obvious who would win and who would lose.","Chu Yaowei’s face was filled with disbelief. Chu Yunfan actually won. It was simply unbelievable!","Although Wang Zhenxi did not use his divine power from the beginning to the end, Chu Yunfan was the same. In the head-on battle, no one had an advantage, but in the end, Chu Yunfan won.","All of this was enough to explain the problem!","Chu Yunfan actually won!","“Thank you for letting me win,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Wang Zhenxi immediately used his divine power and quickly expelled the sore and numb feeling. He took a deep breath and the boiling blood in his body finally calmed down. He said, “It seems that I’ve underestimated the people of the world. It’s incredible that your martial arts have reached such a level. I feel like I can see my master’s shadow in you.”","Wang Zhenxi was a pure martial artist. At this time, he did not care about it and directly compared Chu Yunfan to an expert on the same level as his master.","From the beginning to the end, he had been ruthlessly suppressed by Chu Yunfan. It could be said that he had used all means other than divine power, but he still could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. In contrast, Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength at all.","He only advanced and did not retreat, casually forcing him into a corner. These words always made people feel despair. He had not felt this way for a long time.","Chu Yaowei, who was standing at the side, had a look of disbelief on his face. He knew that Wang Zhenxi’s master was a figure known as the Fist Master on Mount Tai Yang. His cultivation was unfathomable. He had already been ranked at the top of the world more than a hundred years ago and had a great reputation throughout the Great Wei Kingdom.","And Wang Zhenxi actually compared Chu Yunfan, a young boy, to his master. This in itself was an incredible miracle.","“I want to fight you with all my strength!” At this moment, Wang Zhenxi seemed to have encountered a rare opponent.","“No need. You’re no match for me. Why bother?” Chu Yunfan shook his head and said, “However, to be able to train a disciple like you, your master must be a powerful figure. If he comes, I’ll be interested.”","Wang Zhenxi nodded. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t take him seriously, he was no longer angry over it. Chu Yunfan’s strength was indeed completely above his.","Wang Zhenxi was a martial arts fanatic and his thoughts were far simpler than ordinary people’s. Chu Yunfan was stronger than him so he had the right to say such words.","“If my master knows about your existence, he will definitely be interested. I believe that you will meet one day,” Wang Zhenxi said.","“Yes.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Chu Yaowei’s eyes flashed with inexplicable light. He suddenly said, “Since that’s the case, I won’t force you. There’s a luncheon in the residence tomorrow. You have to attend.”","...","“All right, I will be there.","“I shall take my leave first,” Chu Yunfan said."]},{"number":1212,"title":"Chapter 1212 Never Seen Such a Genius!","paragraphs":["1212 Never Seen Such a Genius!","After Chu Yunfan left, Chu Yaowei asked, “Is he really that strong?”","Wang Zhenxi nodded. “He is very strong. So strong that it’s unbelievable. It’s as if he was born for martial arts. In my life, I’ve seen many geniuses from the outer realms and the Great Wei Kingdom. However, to be honest, none of them can compare to him. In fact, none of them can even reach the same level. He’s only in his twenties. It’s a miracle for him to have such cultivation at this age!”","“Yeah, looks like we were all wrong!”","Chu Yaowei revealed a bitter smile. Before this, he was full of confidence and wanted to expose Chu Yunfan’s trump card. He wanted to see the background of this person who was known as the most mysterious candidate in the residence.","In the end, it exploded, and it gave him a shock!","He almost scared himself to death!","What a result!","Wang Zhenxi actually compared Chu Yunfan to his master!","Chu Yaowei knew Wang Zhenxi’s master. If his father didn’t have a good relationship with Wang Zhenxi’s master and helped him when he was in the most difficult time, Wang Zhenxi wouldn’t have been sent here to be his guard.","An expert of Wang Zhenxi’s level could be considered very powerful in the Great Wei Kingdom.","“But can he really compare to your master?” Chu Yaowei asked in disbelief.","He could already accept that Chu Yunfan was very strong.","Wang Zhenxi was an expert at the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, but even he was no match for Chu Yunfan. Hence, Chu Yunfan should already be at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Thinking about how he himself had only reached the seventh tier of the Divine Abilities Stage even after cultivating his entire life, the difference was really too great.","His cultivation was pretty good among the nobles, but it was not the top either. Even if resources kept piling up on him, talent was still the deciding factor.","With his talent, this was almost his limit. He was not even sure if he could reach the ninth tier. As for the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, it was basically impossible.","No wonder Chu Yunfan didn’t take the position of the marquis seriously at all. At this level, even if he didn’t have a noble title, no one in the Great Wei Kingdom would look down on him.","“I don’t know. I can’t figure out his cultivation level unless I have a real battle with him. However, I reckon that if his level is really that high, I won’t be able to figure out his background even if I fight with him with all my strength. I don’t know my master’s level either. I had some thoughts when I came out, but I’m not sure anymore!” Wang Zhenxi shook his head.","“I don’t know if he’s as strong as my master right now, but his future achievements will at least be on the same level as my master’s. So, if you want to rope him in, it’s best to do so now, sir.”","“I don’t know why he has been hiding his strength and living in the residence, but this is undoubtedly the best opportunity!” Chu Yaowei shook his head with a bitter smile.","If Chu Yunfan had just shown his brilliance, he could still rope him in. But now that Chu Yunfan’s strength had reached such a great height, there were not many cards he could play. After all, there were very few trump cards that could make a powerhouse like Chu Yunfan move.","“But do you think there’s a chance to pull him into that plan?” Chu Yaowei looked at Wang Zhenxi.","“That plan is too difficult. He won’t be qualified to join unless he reaches the level of my master’s. It’s best to observe him first. That plan must not be revealed. Otherwise, the consequences will be unimaginable.” Wang Zhenxi shook his head.","“I understand.”","When Chu Yaowei thought of that plan, his entire body shook. His eyes burst out with waves of fierce light. He clenched his fists and gritted his teeth.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know that after he left, Chu Yaowei and Wang Zhenxi had such a conversation, but he didn’t care. For him now, nothing was more important than his own recovery.","However, as the saying goes, the tree wants to be calm, but the wind won’t stop.","Chu Yunfan had just returned to First Pavilion when he realized that Chu Hongcai had already arrived before him. Moreover, he looked ragged and in a sorry state.","He looked really miserable!","Chu Yunfan took a closer look and saw that Chu Hongcai’s chest had caved in from being hit by someone. It had been caved in by someone’s hand. If it wasn’t for the inner armor he was wearing, he would have been pierced through.","At this time, Wang Zhao was hurriedly sending all kinds of healing pills to Chu Hongcai. This month, Wang Zhao understood that Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai had a good relationship, so he didn’t dare to neglect Chu Hongcai.","However, he couldn’t help Chu Hongcai with his injuries so he could only send over a lot of healing pills.","“What happened to you? How did you get beaten up like this?!”","Chu Yunfan quickly went forward and injected his divine power into Chu Hongcai’s body. Immediately, Chu Hongcai’s originally pale face became rosy again. The wounds on his body where he had been hit were also recovering at an astonishing speed.","In just a moment, Chu Hongcai’s injuries had mostly recovered.","“I’m actually healed... This is amazing!” Chu Hongcai exclaimed in surprise, “Brother Fan, you’re really amazing!”","“This is nothing. I’ll teach you a healing chant later. If you memorize it, it’ll be of great use to you in the future,” Chu Yunfan said.","He had found countless healing techniques in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. He could choose any one of them for Chu Hongcai. It was a rare healing technique in this world.","Chu Yunfan immediately passed one of the healing chants to Chu Hongcai. Chu Hongcai was surprised and delighted. Although his cultivation was not as high as Chu Yunfan’s, he could hear how amazing this chant was. If he used this chant, it would not take long for his injuries to be completely healed.","This time, he had chosen to come to First Pavilion instead of recuperating in the residence after being severely injured. It was the right choice.","“I’m fine now. Thank you, Brother Fan,” Chu Hongcai hurriedly said.","“What happened to you? How could you be beaten up like this? With your cultivation and status, who would dare to be so ruthless?” Chu Yunfan frowned. “Could it be Chu Xiujie? That’s not right. With his cultivation level, Chu Xiujie shouldn’t be a match for you.”","“It’s not someone from our residence. It’s the old madam’s family,” Chu Hong said with a bitter smile. “This time, when the old madam returned from her hometown after visiting her relatives, she brought back a family member with her.”"]},{"number":1213,"title":"Chapter 1213 Kicking You to the Ground in One Kick","paragraphs":["1213 Kicking You to the Ground in One Kick","“Family? What family?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Brother Fan, you really don’t know what’s going on outside,” Chu Hongcai looked at Chu Yunfan and said with a bitter smile.","Chu Yunfan was focused on his own healing and did not care much about the outside world. This was also a kind of free and easy because he had absolute confidence in himself. No matter what happened, it would not affect him.","He also wanted to be free and easy, but he knew that it was impossible.","“The old madam is the daughter of the Chang family of Duke Ning of the imperial capital. When she returned from visiting her family, Duke Ning’s young master, Chang Shenghong, also came along!” Chu Hongcai said through gritted teeth.","Chu Yunfan frowned slightly. Among the dignitaries of the Great Wei Kingdom, there were the ten great and many marquises. Among them, the dukes were the most prestigious, and the marquises were slightly below them.","The reason why the old madam had such great prestige in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence was not only because she was the mother of the marquis, but also because her maternal family was a lineage of Duke Ning.","“In that case, was your injury caused by the junior duke?” Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows.","“It’s all because of him but he didn’t even make a move!” Chu Hong said with a bitter smile. “But it was all his fault. Do you know what I heard? They only have a few people, yet they said that they want to sweep through Conglong City. They’re simply going too far. Do they really think that there’s no one in Conglong City who can stand up to them?”","In the Great Wei Kingdom, Conglong City was the place where the founding ancestor had started. Naturally, it had a pivotal position. However, in comparison, there were more experts gathered in the imperial capital. That was the most elite place in the entire empire.","The competition between Conglong City and the imperial capital was not something that happened in a day or two. However, the imperial capital had gathered most of the country’s resources and firmly suppressed Conglong City.","The nobles in Conglong City were also unconvinced.","“If he’s sweeping through the city, then so be it. What’s the point of you rushing up?!” Chu Yunfan frowned.","“Brother Fan, do you think I’m deliberately looking for trouble? Isn’t it all because of that Chu Xiujie? Tsk tsk, Chu Xiujie has long been colluding with Chang Shenghong. D*mn it, this is the matter of our residence. What right do they have to interfere? They actually dared to warn me not to have delusional thoughts!” Chu Hongcai said through gritted teeth.","“From what you said, he and Chu Xiujie are cousins, and we are outsiders.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “But he’s meddling too much. Does he really think he’s invincible?”","“Exactly. D*mn it, I’ve never suffered such a big loss before!”","Chu Hongcai was burning with anger and cursed repeatedly.","“It’s not just me. I think Chu Haoyu was injured too”","“Then it should be my turn soon. I don’t believe that they will let me off.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly, but a hint of hostility flashed in his eyes.","“Who is Chu Yunfan? Get out here!”","Just as they were talking, a loud roar came from outside the shop.","At that moment, outside First Pavilion, a tall and well-dressed young man roared, shaking the entire street. He looked proud and arrogant, but soon, he felt that something was wrong. He realized that the mercenaries passing by were looking at him as if he was an idiot.","“Where did this idiot come from? He must be from somewhere else.”","“It must be. How could a local be so stupid?”","“I think so too. He probably doesn’t know how terrifying the owner of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion is.”","These mercenaries all looked at this young man as if he was an idiot. Although not everyone had seen the owner of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion fight, they had more or less heard of him.","The deputy leader of the Battle Wolves, a seventh-level Divine, had been slapped to death by the owner of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion. Up until now, the Battle Wolves did not dare to come out and say anything. On the contrary, the Battle Wolves even said that the owner of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion was their friend. Whoever went against him would be going against the Battle Wolves.","Even the biggest gang in Conglong City was terrified. One could imagine how famous Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion was during this period of time. Very few people saw the owner of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion in public, but it did not prevent this place from becoming a legend on Pill Street.","Apart from that, the medicinal effects of the pills sold in Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion were at least twice as good as those sold in other shops. Every morning, when there were new products on the shelves, they would be swept clean. Many of them were made by Wang Zhao. Chu Yunfan didn’t hide from Wang Zhao and instructed him on how to improve the basic pill recipes.","Anyway, Chu Yunfan would take a cut of the pills Wang Zhao made. In the end, Wang Zhao was working for him.","The mercenaries’ gazes became stranger and stranger. This made the young man in the luxurious robe feel that something was wrong. He was even a little embarrassed and angry. Just as he was about to flare up, he saw two figures slowly walk out from Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion, one in front and one behind.","He knew that the person walking at the back was Chu Hongcai, and the person in front was none other than Chu Yunfan.","“Is this the guy who injured you?” Chu Yunfan pointed at the tall young man.","“That’s right. He’s the eldest son of the Zhenyuan family, Xu Feng!” Chu Hongcai looked at the person in front of him and gritted his teeth in hatred.","The arrogance he had felt after defeating Chu Xiujie was gone. It was only now that he realized what Chu Yunfan meant when he said that his horizons were too small.","He was indeed one of the best among the candidates, but he started too late. Compared to those noble children who were nurtured as heirs since birth, he was still far behind.","He was actually beaten up by a descendant of a duke without any strength to fight back. It was simply a great humiliation.","“Are your injuries healed already?” Xu Feng grinned and looked at Chu Hongcai as if he was watching a joke.","“You’re Chu Yunfan? I heard that you’re very arrogant and dare to covet something that doesn’t belong to you. Today, I’ll teach you a lesson. Don’t daydream about something that doesn’t belong to you!”","Xu Feng turned to Chu Yunfan, a sharp light flashing in his eyes.","As he spoke, Xu Feng instantly made his move. He pounced over like a fierce tiger, and his fist swept over like a spiked club.","“Watch out!” Chu Hongcai hurriedly shouted.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at Xu Feng. He raised his leg and kicked him.","Bam!","Before Xu Feng’s fist could even touch Chu Yunfan, he was kicked by Chu Yunfan. After a muffled groan, he flew like a kite with a broken string.","Xu Feng collapsed onto the ground."]},{"number":1214,"title":"Chapter 1214 Chu Yunfan, I’ll Teach You a Good Lesson!","paragraphs":["1214 Chu Yunfan, I’ll Teach You a Good Lesson!","His actions were clean and neat. There was no extra movement. With just one kick, Xu Feng fell to the ground.","With just one kick, Xu Feng’s entire chest caved in. If Chu Yunfan had not held back, he would have made Xu Feng explode in just one kick.","“You? You want to teach me a lesson too? Piece of trash.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Xu Feng immediately spat out another mouthful of blood. He was full of confidence to find trouble with Chu Yunfan. He even wanted to teach Chu Yunfan a lesson and let him know what it meant to not covet something.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan would kick him to the ground? He couldn’t even use his full strength. It was as if he had kicked a super big hornet’s nest.","Above all, Chu Yunfan’s disdainful expression was the biggest blow.","When the surrounding mercenaries saw this scene, they looked like they had expected this. It was not much different from what they had imagined. The strength of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion’s owner was at an unbelievable level.","He could even defeat ordinary Divines in one move!","Chu Hongcai, who was watching from the side, felt extremely relieved. Although he wasn’t the one who did it, this helped him vent his anger. Previously, he was defeated by Xu Feng and was even ridiculed by him.","“The junior duke won’t let you off for this!” Xu Feng spat out another mouthful of blood and gritted his teeth.","“If he doesn’t come to me, I’ll go to him. There are some things that he can’t meddle in just because he wants to. Who does he think he is? Idiot!”","Chu Yunfan sneered. Xu Feng wanted to use Chang Shenghong to suppress Chu Yunfan, but who knew that Chu Yunfan was not afraid of Chang Shenghong? In fact, he even ignored him.","After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he and Chu Hongcai returned to Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion.","“So, what do you think? Do you know what it means to be a frog at the bottom of a well now?” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“Brother Fan, I was wrong. I shouldn’t have been so arrogant. I’ll definitely work hard on my cultivation,” Chu Hongcai said in a dejected tone.","In a small courtyard that had been turned into a guest room in Marquis Zhongxi’s residence, a group of young men sat together. The leader of the group was a young man with a medium build. He wore a gorgeous long robe and his eyes were incomparably sharp, giving him an extremely terrifying appearance.","Under his gaze, everyone lowered their heads to show their obedience, and Chu Xiujie was among them.","“Shenghong, you’re amazing. I heard that you even defeated An Zhenguo,” Chu Xiujie said with a look of awe on his face. “An Zhenguo is one of the top experts among the younger generation in Conglong City. Even he is no match for you. It seems that it will not be difficult for you to sweep through Conglong City!”","The middle-sized youth was none other than Junior Duke Ning, Chang Shenghong.","When Chang Shenghong heard this, he smiled proudly and said, “This is nothing. Conglong City is just a small city. Xiujie, when you get the title of Marquis Zhongxin, you have to look further. Compared to the imperial capital, Conglong City is too small.”","“That’s right, that’s right. After I become the marquis, I will definitely follow your lead!” Chu Xiujie quickly said.","Even though Chu Xiujie sounded like he was trying to suck up to Chang Shenghong, all the young men present were descendants of noble families. They were all under Chang Shenghong’s command.","In the imperial capital, Chang Shenghong was the leader of one of the many factions of the noble children.","Chang Shenghong nodded his head in satisfaction. Although he didn’t like this cousin of his, what he cared about was the future. When he became Duke Ning and Chu Xiujie became the Marquis Zhongxin, both sides would be able to form an alliance in the Imperial Court. That future would be of great use to him.","Otherwise, why would he risk making the marquis unhappy by interfering in this matter? The temptation of gaining a future marquis-level underling was simply too great.","“What Chu Hongcai? Chu Haoyu? I got Xu Feng to settle it easily. It’s nothing. CHu Xiujie, allow me to share some wisdom. Strength is the foundation of everything. You’re just too weak. If you had enough strength, would these outsiders jump out?” Chang Shenghong said indifferently.","“You’re right, Shenghong. I’ll definitely work hard on my cultivation.”","Chu Xiujie was a bit crestfallen. Cultivation depended on talent and resources. His talent was pretty good, but the problem was that his resources couldn’t compare to these people. Because he wasn’t the marqui’s direct successor, he wasn’t trained according to the usual standards.","It was a little too late now.","“I have to say say a few words with Uncle. What kind of selection for the heir candidate is this? Isn’t this not distinguishing between close and distant familial relations?” Chang Shenghong continued.","“Yeah!”","At the mention of this, Chu Xiujie suddenly became extremely depressed, because if it was divided according to kinship, he would have already become the heir.","The other young men also echoed this sentiment.","“But why hasn’t Xu Feng returned yet?” Chang Shenghong couldn’t help but ask curiously.","“Shenghong, don’t underestimate Chu Yunfan. He’s the most cunning one. I don’t care about Chu Hongcai or Chu Haoyu,” Chu Xiujie quickly said.","“It doesn’t matter. Cunningness and conspiracies are nothing in the face of absolute strength.” Chang Shenghong waved his hand.","Suddenly, at this moment, a series of hurried footsteps came from outside. Then, a few servants carried in a stretcher. The person lying on the stretcher was groaning in agony. Who else could it be but Xu Feng?","“How could this be?!”","“Who did this?!”","“How dare someone hit our brother!”","At this moment, the descendants of the noble families were all talking at the same time. They felt that their prestige had been greatly challenged. They had come to Conglong City with lofty thoughts. Now that Xu Feng had been crippled, wasn’t it a slap to their faces?","Soon, everyone figured out what had happened. It turned out that Xu Feng had gone to find trouble with Chu Yunfan and ended up being crippled by Chu Yunfan’s kick.","Upon hearing this, these noble children from the imperial capital were furious. In their impression, there should not be any experts in Conglong City. Of course, those older experts were a different matter. However, the older generation of experts generally wouldn’t interfere, because behind them, which one of them didn’t stand a powerful noble family?","It was precisely because of this that they had not expected such a situation to happen.","“D*mn it!” Chang Shenghong gritted his teeth. He felt his face burning. He had been bragging so confidently before but now he was being slapped in the face.","“Chu Yunfan, I’m going to teach you a lesson!”"]},{"number":1215,"title":"Chapter 1215 I’ll Make Him Humble","paragraphs":["1215 I’ll Make Him Humble","Chang Shenghong had never thought that Xu Feng would fail. He had even swore that he did not put Chu Yunfan in his eyes. However, reality had given him a hard slap. It made him understand that things were not that simple.","Unlike everyone’s righteous indignation, although Chu Xiujie’s face also revealed an ugly expression, he felt a lingering fear in his heart. This was because he knew very well that Xu Feng was much stronger than him.","Xu Feng had stepped into the third tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, and was still heavily injured by a single kick. It could be inferred how shocking Chu Yunfan’s strength was.","With his eyesight, it was not difficult to see that Xu Feng only had only one injury, and that was the injury from that kick. In other words, Chu Yunfan had only used one move from the beginning to the end, which was the most terrifying part.","Previously, Chu Xiujie had tried to deal with Chu Yunfan time and time again, causing trouble for him. At first, he was very annoyed. Why was Chu Yunfan as slippery as a loach? He couldn’t seize the opportunity to teach him a lesson. But now, he suddenly felt very lucky.","If he had really angered Chu Yunfan before, he would have been crippled by a kick. His subordinate, Chu Yanghui, had been crippled by Chu Yunfan’s kick just like that.","Just thinking about it made him shudder.","At the same time, he began to hate Chu Yunfan. He clearly had such strength, but why didn’t he say anything? He even felt that everything he did was a joke in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","It was as if Chu Yunfan saw him as a clown or a wild monkey. When Chu Xiujie thought of this, he was so angry that he went crazy. However, he had already realized that he was definitely not Chu Yunfan’s match. The only person he could rely on was his distant cousin, Chang Shenghong.","“Chu Yunfan, I will make you pay the price for this!” Chang Shenghong was furious.","“Changsheng, don’t be anxious. Isn’t there a banquet tomorrow? Wouldn’t it be better to defeat him at the banquet and embarrass him in public?” Chu Xiujie suggested.","“Tomorrow? That’s a good idea!” Chang Shenghong gritted his teeth.","Compared to defeating Chu Yunfan now, Chang Shenghong was more inclined to defeat Chu Yunfan at the banquet tomorrow.","“We’ll let him go for now. I’ll teach him a lesson tomorrow!” Chang Shenghong sneered.","As for whether this would make the marquis unhappy, he failed to consider it. Or rather, it didn’t matter because behind him stood Duke Ning. Even if he was only a junior duke, his status wouldn’t lose to the marquis. Therefore, he had nothing to be afraid of.","On the second day, the entire residence bustled. After the return of the marquis and the old madam, this was the first time a banquet was held. Everyone in the household, everyone who could be called by name, and hundreds of relatives related to them were all gathered here.","This was especially so since Junior Duke Ning and the other children of the nobility were joining the banquet.","However, before the start of the banquet, everyone had heard that this Chang Shenghong was not easy to deal with. He had just arrived at the residence and had already publicly interfered with the heir selection. Chu Hongcai and Chu Haoyu, the two originally popular candidates, had been severely injured by Xu Feng.","It was not a good feeling, especially when Chang Shenghong was so domineering. Except for Chu Xiujie and the others, everyone felt a little aggrieved.","It felt like an enemy was knocking on their door.","When the banquet started, Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai arrived together. However, when they were at the entrance, they were stopped by someone.","This person was none other than Chu Haoyu.","“Nice to meet you,” Chu Yunfan said that it was a pleasure to meet Chu Haoyu because he didn’t have much contact with Chu Haoyu so they weren’t well acquainted.","However, he had some doubts in his heart. Why was Chu Haoyu looking for him at this time?","Chu Haoyu didn’t look well at the moment. His face was pale. His injuries from the battle with Xu Feng hadn’t fully healed yet. After all, he wasn’t Chu Hongcai. With Chu Yunfan’s help, Chu Hongcai had fully recovered overnight.","However, Chu Haoyu was in the Divine Abilities Stage. Although he couldn’t be said to be fully recovered, he was more than half recovered. At least he didn’t have to lie in bed and could get up.","“What’s the matter?” Chu Yunfan went straight to the point.","Chu Haoyu looked at Chu Yunfan with a solemn expression. After a long time, he said, “Chu Yunfan, I plan to withdraw from the competition for the position of heir and help you get it.”","Even with Chu Yunfan’s willpower, he couldn’t help but be a little dazed. He felt that Chu Haoyu wasn’t the kind of person who would give up so easily.","“Why would you give up?”","Chu Yunfan wasn’t the one who said this. Chu Hongcai was.","Chu Haoyu smiled bitterly as he thought, ‘I originally thought that I was the most suitable person to become the heir. Whether it was Chu Hongcai or Chu Xiujie, I believed that I was not inferior. However, what happened yesterday made me completely understand that I’m far from qualified. Moreover, I was humiliated by Chang Shenghong. If I don’t take revenge, I swear that I’m not a human. And I believe the only one who can do this is Chu Yunfan! No matter what, even if it’s Chu Yunfan or Chu Hongcai, it can’t be Chu Xiujie!’","Chu Haoyu had thought it through very clearly. By now, he was probably already out of the competition. Chu Hongcai had Chu Yunfan backing him up, while Chu Xiujie had Chang Shenghong backing him up. No matter who won or lost, it would definitely not be his turn.","Chang Shenghong’s strength was far beyond his imagination. Coupled with the pressure of Duke Ning’s household, it was enough to make him collapse.","Not to mention that Chang Shenghong did not even need to make a move. Any one of his subordinates could easily defeat him.","Chu Haoyu and Chu Hongcai were the same. In Chu Yunfan’s words, they were both too short-sighted. Their vision was only limited to the small Marquis Zhongxin’s household. Now, with Chang Shenghong’s forceful intervention, he truly understood that he was too weak.","It had been very difficult for him to make this decision. He had worked hard for so many years. He was naturally unwilling to give up so easily, but he had to give in to reality. If Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai had the final victory, he could escape unscathed.","He didn’t have any deep conflicts with Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai, but if Chu Xiujie won in the end, he would probably lose his last foothold in Conglong City.","Under the pressure of reality, he didn’t have a choice.","Chu Hongcai was still immersed in shock, but Chu Yunfan had already figured it out. He immediately smiled and said, “I’m not interested in the position of marquis. You can assist Chu Hongcai. As for that Chang Shenghong, I’ll teach him a lesson.”"]},{"number":1216,"title":"Chapter 1216 Chu Xiujie Is Eliminated","paragraphs":["1216 Chu Xiujie Is Eliminated","“It should have been like this a long time ago!” Chu Hongcai clenched his fist and said excitedly.","“Motherf*cker, who does he think he is? Isn’t he just the junior duke? But even so, what qualifications does he have to participate in our family’s matters?!”","Although Chu Haoyu didn’t say anything, he had the same expression. At this moment, their interests were aligned. No matter how they fought, if an outsider appeared, it would be another matter.","However, none of them were able to resist, and the marquis himself didn’t seem to be interested in any of this, which made them extremely depressed.","“That dog Chu Xiujie is a traitor, colluding with outsiders to deal with us. I really don’t understand why the marquis listed him as a candidate,” Chu Hongcai said gloomily.","“Don’t worry. After today, no matter what, Chu Xiujie will lose the qualification to compete.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“Brother Fan, why do you say that?” Chu Hongcai said with some doubt.","“After today,” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “Chu Xiujie will forever lose the possibility of fighting for the position, regardless of whether I take care of him or not. This is because he doesn’t understand the problem.”","Seeing that both of them were a little confused, Chu Yunfan continued, “If I remember correctly, Duke Ning and Marquis Zhongxin do not belong to the same faction.”","The two suddenly realized that they weren’t stupid. It was just that they hadn’t thought of it before. Now that Chu Yunfan reminded them, they suddenly remembered. In fact, although the old madam was the young lady of Duke Ning’s household, the relationship between the two families had actually become more and more distant due to political differences in recent years.","Unless Marquis Zhongxin intended to change his family, he would not let this matter rest so easily. Chang Shenghong had the support of Duke Ning behind him, yet he dared to interfere in such a big matter like the heir selection.","As long as the marquis was not a pushover, he would definitely react to this. And based on their understanding of the marquis, he was definitely not someone who would be willing to be manipulated.","Chu Xiujie colluded with Chang Shenghong to compete for the position. However, this was the thing that eliminated him.","“He’s dead!” Chu Hongcai immediately realized that at this point.","Chu Xiujie definitely won’t have the chance to become the heir. Otherwise, Marquis Zhongxin and Duke Ning are not on the same path, but the heir of the marquis is following the orders of the junior duke? What would others think of Marquis Zhongxin? Would they think that he was two-faced?","Chu Haoyu looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. These things were worthless, but if they weren’t exposed, no one could see through them.","Obviously, Chu Xiujie did not realize this and thought that he had a helper. Chang Shenghong was also arrogant so perhaps he did not feel that there was anything wrong. His method was too simple and crude.","After this incident, Chu Haoyu was even more certain that Chu Yunfan was indeed extraordinary. He was not as simple as ordinary people thought.","After hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Chu Haoyu and Chu Hongcai were relieved. No matter what, Chu Xiujie was already out of the game. There was only one mission left today, and that was to retaliate against Chang Shenghong.","The grand banquet soon started. Everyone who was related to Marquis Zhongxin sat down. Chu Yunfan sat with Chu Hongcai and Chu Haoyu. Opposite them were Chang Shenghong, Chu Xiujie, and the others.","This was also the first time Chu Yunfan had seen Chang Shenghong and the others. Although Chang Shenghong tried to hide it, Chu Yunfan could tell that his cultivation was actually at the peak sixth-tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","For someone who was not even 50 years old, it was indeed very shocking. For a Divine, who had a lifespan of more than 200 years, 50 years old was still considered young.","The lifespan of the people in the Spirit Realm was extremely long, even more shocking than the lifespan of the humans in the Federation that had been improved by science.","Divines only had a lifespan of two hundred years in the Federation, but in the Spirit Realm, they had a lifespan of at least three hundred years.","The cataclysm of the Federation had only happened a few hundred years ago. The time for the transformation was still too short. In terms of science and technology, the Federation was able to create weapons like nuclear bombs that could even threaten Cores. In addition, they had put super weapons like the Star Destroyer into use. In terms of lethality, they were not necessarily inferior to the Spirit Realm.","However, the level of development in martial arts truly reflected the gap. It was simply an existence on two different planes. They could not be mentioned in the same breath.","However, even in Conglong City, this kind of cultivation was unmatched. The imperial capital was indeed the core of the entire Great Wei Kingdom. Anyone who came out of there would have such a cultivation.","This was what attracted Chu Yunfan’s attention. After he recovered his strength, he might have to make a trip to the imperial capital.","“Chu Yunfan, be careful. I just received news that Chang Shenghong defeated An Zhenguo!” Chu Haoyu warned Chu Yunfan.","At this time, Chu Haoyu had already given up. He knew that there was no hope for him so he did not hold anything back and placed all his bets on Chu Yunfan. After seeing Chu Yunfan’s ability, he knew that if he were to be half-hearted, the consequences could be very serious.","“Don’t worry, it’s useless.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He didn’t take Chu Haoyu’s words to heart. No matter what kind of strength Chang Shenghong had, he was still far inferior to Chu Yunfan.","On the other side, Chang Shenghong was staring at Chu Yunfan. This was the person who had embarrassed him in front of everyone. A cruel smile appeared on his face. He wanted to make this person lose face in front of everyone.","Not long after, the lmarquis finally arrived with his family. There were two people in the center of the crowd. One was the marquis himself, and the other was an old lady who looked to be in her seventies or eighties. This old lady had white hair, but she walked with great strength.","In reality, the backyard of the residence was now under the control of the old madam. The wife of the marquis had suffered the same fate as the marquis’ few sons. They had all died in the attack.","“Yunfan, come here, come here!” As soon as the old madam sat down, she waved at Chu Yunfan.","Many people were shocked. Although they knew that Chu Yunfan was favored, it seemed that he was far more favored than ordinary people imagined.","The old madam had actually left a seat beside her for Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1217,"title":"Chapter 1217 All of You Should Attack Together, I’m in a Hurry","paragraphs":["1217 All of You Should Attack Together, I’m in a Hurry","Chu Yunfan went up to a thousand and bowed. “Greetings, Marquis Zhongxin, Greetings, Matriarch!”","“You’re too polite, my child,” the old madam said with a smile. She looked at Chu Yunfan with a very kind gaze as if she was seeing the reincarnation of her young son.","After everyone was shocked, they didn’t say anything because they were already used to this scene. It wasn’t just a day or two that the old madam favored Chu Yunfan.","Only Chu Xiujie gritted his teeth. Even he, the actual grandson, didn’t receive such an honor so what right did an outsider like Chu Yunfan have?","Chu Yunfan didn’t decline and sat down beside the old madam, talking to her from time to time. Although he knew why the old madam was so good to him, treating him well still meant treating him well. In the past year, while Chu Yunfan was at his weakest, she had sheltered him from the wind and rain. He was very grateful.","“Ladies and gentlemen, the first reason for this banquet is that we want to get together with everyone. We haven’t seen each other for a while. Secondly, it’s a late welcome banquet. This time, we’ve come back with a group of guests from Imperial Capital!”","The marquis stood up and looked at everyone.","“Today is a family banquet. Everyone, don’t be shy. Eat and drink well!”","Following his words, the kitchen began to serve the dishes. They had already been prepared long ago. Everyone began to push their glasses and exchange them. For a moment, the entire atmosphere was abuzz.","After three rounds of wine, everyone was full. Suddenly, one of the scions stood up and looked at the crowd. “Everyone, we have long heard that Conglong City has many talented people and experts. However, it seems that this is not the case. We’ve already seen two of the so-called candidates for the position of the heir in the marquis’ household. Both Chu Haoyu and Chu Hongcai have disappointed us. However, we have heard that there is also Chu Yunfan who has outstanding strength. I wonder if he dares come up and give us a few pointers?”","Perhaps it was because he was drunk, but this scion’s face was red and his words were aggressive, making everyone involuntarily put down their chopsticks, their faces revealing a hit of anger. This was directly slapping the marquis in the face.","Not to mention Chu Haoyu and Chu Hongcai, who were glaring at him angrily. To them, being so easily defeated was a great humiliation.","“Don’t boast so much. Didn’t Xu Feng also get crippled by a single kick yesterday? If the people from Imperial Capital are so powerful, they wouldn’t be like this,” Chu Hongcai said directly.","This time, it was the scions from Imperial Capital who were embarrassed. This was clearly a slap to their faces!","The face of this scion turned even redder. He then looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “Chu Yunfan, do you dare to come out and accept the challenge?”","Chu Yunfan put down his chopsticks and slowly stood up. He said, “Bunch of clowns.”","“What did you say?” At this moment, the scions of Imperial Capital were all enraged. Chu Yunfan actually dared to be so arrogant.","“Yunfan, don’t go!” the old madam said. She was worried about Chu Yunfan. Although she was old, she was not senile. She could naturally see that these people were here to cause trouble.","“You people have nothing better to do. You dine on the food of our household and dare to jump out after that. Men, throw all of them out.”","The old madam commanded. She had been the master of the backyard for so many years and had long possessed a kind of power that was not angry.","Hearing the old madam’s words, the guards around them all stepped forward. Seeing this, the marquis didn’t stop her or say anything. He just looked at Chu Yunfan with a faint smile and waited for him to deal with it.","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly and said, “Matriarch, please take a seat. These clowns don’t need you to do anything.”","He had little regard for these people. The old madam was worried about him and had thus interfered. However, the old madam was underestimating him.","“Since you want to compete, please wait for a moment,” Chu Yunfan said as he walked straight to a tree beside him.","Just as everyone was wondering what he was going to do, they saw him cut off a branch from a nearby tree. Then, he used his finger as a sword and easily cut off the surrounding twigs and leaves from the main branch. In just a moment, even the skin was shaved off, turning the branch into a stick.","Then, Chu Yunfan walked back to the arena, holding the stick that was as tall as a person, and said, “All right, we can start now.”","“Chu Yunfan, it’s too late for you to do that now. Besides, it’s just a wooden stick. Are you kidding me?” When the scion saw Chu Yunfan’s behavior, he was instantly furious.","Chu Yunfan was looking down on him from the bottom of his heart. It was just a wooden stick.","They were not ordinary people. Even if it was a huge tree, he could use a finger to break it, let alone this kind of slender ordinary wooden stick.","“To deal with trash like you, even a wooden stick is enough,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan strangely. What the heck was he saying?","Chu Yunfan continued calmly, “How about this? If any of you are unhappy with me, stand up together and attack me together.","“Come on now, quickly. I’m in a hurry.”","I’m in a hurry!","Everyone was dumbfounded. They had seen people look down on others, but they had never seen someone look down on others like this.","Chu Yunfan actually said he was in a f*cking hurry!","Chu Hongcai, who was watching from the side, gave him a thumbs up. Brother Fan was extraordinary. Even if he was acting tough, he still came off as fresh and refined. He had to remember this sentence so that he could use it in the future.","Without a doubt, Chu Yunfan’s words had thoroughly enraged the other scions. Other than Chang Shenghong, who had not made a move due to his status, the rest of them flew into the arena one after another.","At this moment, they couldn’t care less about bullying him with numbers. When they were drunk and Chu Yunfan said that, they all wanted to teach him a lesson.","At this moment, with a signal from the marquis, a few experts hurriedly walked over and set up a barrier.","When these experts clashed, if one wasn’t careful, they could tear down the entire residence.","These scions surrounded Chu Yunfan. He held the wooden stick in his hand and looked at these people with a cold smile on his face.","“Go! Teach him how powerful we are!”","One of the scions shouted, and everyone seemed to have received an order as they rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, it was as if a fierce tiger had fallen into a pack of wolves."]},{"number":1218,"title":"Chapter 1218 The Scions’ Instant Defeat","paragraphs":["1218 The Scions’ Instant Defeat","The dozen or so scions attacked Chu Yunfan collectively. These people were not ordinary people either. Every one of them was an expert above the Divine Abilities Stage. There was even no lack of second, third, and even fourth-tier Divines.","It could be said that they could not fully display their strength in this small space, but their speed had completely erupted.","Not many people present could see their actions clearly, but everyone who could keep up with them clearly was shocked.","Facing so many masters simultaneously, such a small venue was a restriction for these scions, but it was the same for Chu Yunfan because his space to move had become smaller.","!!","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan moved. The wooden stick he had just sharpened in his hand smashed forward.","Bang!","A scion had just pounced over when he was smashed by the wooden stick. From afar, it looked as if he had forcefully rammed into it.","All of this was too strange. This scion immediately let out a muffled groan and he flew backward. He crashed heavily onto the ground, and his entire face was covered in blood from the wooden stick.","What was even more terrifying was that he felt as if his entire body had been swept by a huge force. All the bones in his body were about to fall apart, and he could not get up for a while.","After Chu Yunfan sent one of the scions flying, he didn’t stop. He swept out with momentum and instantly swept away another two scions who were flying through the air.","Screams could be heard as the two figures were sent flying and slammed into the barrier.","The magic shields on their bodies were shattered by Chu Yunfan’s ordinary wooden stick. The magic weapons and inner armor on their bodies were also shattered by this stick.","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed it.","The other scions took advantage of this time and pounced on Chu Yunfan. However, they missed. Chu Yunfan’s strange figure only swayed slightly before they passed through his body and missed.","Bam!","A long staff came crashing down from the sky, sweeping aside the few scions who had pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","Spurt!","These scions spat out blood one after another. They felt as if their ribs were about to be completely broken.","All of this happened in a blur. Within seconds, half of these scions had already been defeated.","They could not use their Divine Abilities Stage cultivation at all!","“This is terrifying!”","Only now did many people finally have a chance to catch their breath. They felt that they would have missed the battle if they had blinked.","The people of Marquis Zhongxin’s household had long been dissatisfied with the arrogance of these people from the capital. Now that they saw Chu Yunfan teach them a lesson with a wooden stick, they immediately cheered.","Only Chang Shenghong and Chu Xiujie’s expressions turned extremely ugly.","At this time, there were still seven or eight scions present. They were a step too slow and could not attack Chu Yunfan at first moment. However, in that instant, half of them had already fallen.","Chu Yunfan was still holding onto the wooden stick. He didn’t even move his feet.","At this moment, they finally realized that they had encountered a ruthless person. They finally realized that when Xu Feng was kicked by Chu Yunfan, they should have been alert.","“Are all the people from the capital so weak? What a pity,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","These scions were all furious, but they did not dare to act rashly like before. Those who were lying on the ground and wailing were the ones who had attacked blindly earlier.","“Give him a good beating!”","At that moment, a scion roared and released his Divine Abilities Stage aura. He had been wary of many things before, and in reality, he had not been able to make a full move. However, it was different now. They no longer had a choice.","In an instant, the auras of seven or eight scions were released, forming various phenomena behind them. These scions all had a strong family background. Naturally, they knew high-tier martial arts. Now, they were completely unleashed.","Only then did everyone see the foundation of their noble background.","Although they were separated by a barrier, many people could feel the terrifying aura of these Divines. They all started to worry for Chu Yunfan. This was different from before. These scions had all become serious. They no longer dared to casually attack like before.","Boom!","The scions joined forces. All their attacks turned into a torrent that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was still calm as if he did not take this attack to heart. However, the long stick in his hand moved.","“It’s impolite not to reciprocate. You guys take this too!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","His entire body rose from the ground and flew into the air. The wooden stick in his hand smashed fiercely in the direction of those scions.","Boom!","The martial arts torrents unleashed by those scions could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. They were directly smashed into pieces by this ordinary wooden stick.","“Impossible!”","These scions were still in disbelief. It was just an ordinary wooden stick. Logically speaking, it should have been shattered at the first moment. However, they did not expect it to be able to shatter their attacks.","This was simply a miracle!","After smashing the torrent of martial arts into pieces, the wooden stick did not lose its momentum. On the contrary, it continued to smash down at an astonishing speed toward these scions.","As the wooden stick smashed down, the terrifying tide caused the entire barrier to tremble violently, like ripples on the surface of the water.","Bam!","Finally, the wooden stick smashed down. These scions were directly swept by it. They screamed and were sent flying. They crashed into the barrier and collapsed to the ground. They spat out blood and were heavily injured.","Instant kill!","Chu Yunfan had only used one move to kill these people!","Many people still couldn’t believe what they were seeing. After all, everything seemed so unbelievable.","One moment, Chu Yunfan was surrounded, and the next moment, these people were lying on the ground.","This reversal of the situation was too fast!","..."]},{"number":1219,"title":"Chapter 1219 I’ll Defeat You!","paragraphs":["1219 I’ll Defeat You!","The situation had reversed too quickly. Before anyone could react, everything had already happened.","“That was so scary!”","This was the first time many people had truly realized Chu Yunfan’s strength. Although he had the record of crippling Chu Yanghui with a single kick, Chu Yanghui was only at the Innate Stage. Compared to this terrifying scene of Divines lying on the ground, there was a world of difference. They were not on the same level at all.","“Is this Chu Yunfan’s true hidden strength?”","!!","“Just what level of strength has he reached? To think that a random wooden stick he cut up contains so much power!”","Many people began to discuss, not even caring that the marquis was present. This was because the shock that this scene had given them was overwhleming.","It could even be said that it subverted their worldview, especially their inherent impression of Chu Yunfan. He was just a person who relied on the old madam’s favor to get to the top.","It seemed that this was not the case at all. The strength hidden behind Chu Yunfan was truly shocking.","Chu Hongcai was the one who was not surprised. He had been used to seeing big scenes with Chu Yunfan during this period of time so he had calmed down after a little excitement. Compared to the shocking scene where Chu Yunfan slapped the deputy leader of the Battle Wolf Gang to death, this was nothing.","However, Chu Haoyu was different. This was the first time he had seen Chu Yunfan’s true might. Previously, it was Chu Hongcai who had attacked. How could it be compared to the current situation?","“Has Chu Yunfan always been this powerful?”","After a long while, Chu Haoyu suddenly opened his mouth and asked.","“Yeah. Brother Fan has always been amazing. It’s just that you guys never believed him,” Chu Hongcai said matter-of-factly.","Chu Haoyu was silent. No wonder Chu Yunfan was so confident in himself. If Chu Yunfan had wanted to compete for the heir position, they would have had no hope. However, Chu Yunfan had given the opportunity to Chu Hongcai.","Suddenly, Chu Haoyu felt extremely jealous. Why didn’t he get to know Chu Yunfan earlier?","Because he had realized that Chu Yunfan had no ambition for the position. It could even be said that he had no objections to whoever wanted it.","If he had discovered Chu Yunfan’s extraordinary abilities earlier, he would have been able to gain Chu Yunfan’s support. If that were the case, the one in the limelight now would not be Chu Hongcai, but him.","Thinking of this, he could not help but feel extremely depressed. He could only say that this was fate.","However, the more he saw Chu Yunfan’s strength, the more he did not dare to have any other thoughts. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, it would be a matter of minutes to deal with him.","In addition to everyone’s shock, the old madam was also extremely shocked. She had always treated Chu Yunfan as a sickly person since first meeting him. She had expected him to have reached this stage.","However, unlike the others, after the shock, her eyes were filled with gratification and even a hint of pride.","Chu Yaowei stared at Chu Yunfan, his eyes shining brightly, but no one knew what he was thinking.","In fact, just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, he had allowed the situation today. He wanted to use this opportunity to see if he could force Chu Yunfan to show a part of his strength.","After all, Chu Yunfan was too mysterious. So mysterious that even he, the marquis, could not see through him. However, Chu Yunfan’s outburst still gave him a huge surprise.","Moreover, he could also see that Chu Yunfan was probably not at his peak state right now. After all, it was obvious from his ease that he could use such power with just an ordinary wooden stick. If it was true divine power, he was afraid that Chu Yunfan would immediately explode.","Chu Yunfan put away his wooden stick and stood there. He looked at Chang Shenghong outside the arena and said, “I just finished warming up. Would you be interested in giving me some pointers? But if you’re afraid, then forget it.”","“What? You trying to say I’m a coward?” Chang Shenghong was indeed shocked by Chu Yunfan’s attack, but it was impossible for him to be afraid. After being provoked by Chu Yunfan, he immediately stood up.","“Then get on the stage. I have something to tell you,” Chu Yunfan said calmly, “There are some things that you can’t meddle in. Who do you think you are?”","Chang Shenghong immediately walked into the arena with an extremely ugly expression. He grabbed at the air, and a pitch-black saber appeared in his hand. His aura instantly erupted, approaching the peak sixth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. He was even stronger than An Zhenguo, who Chu Yunfan had defeated previously.","“Even An Zhenguo isn’t a match for you, let alone you.”","As Chang Shenghong spoke, many people who did not know about this matter were instantly shocked. Even An Zhenguo had been defeated by Chang Shenghong. Many people could not help but have more guesses about Chang Shenghong’s strength. There was no doubt that this was definitely not something that the scions could compare to.","“Come on. I’ll teach you a lesson today.” Chu Yunfan pointed his stick at Chang Shenghong.","“You’re courting death!”","Chang Shenghong suddenly exploded. The saber in his hand moved, slashing out a shocking saber light. The saber light soared into the sky, directly splitting the world apart.","Boom!","Everyone could see that the terrifying shockwave brought by the saber light had torn everything apart. If not for the barrier, the entire venue would have been destroyed. Although Chang Shenghong was arrogant and conceited, he was powerful.","However, Chu Yunfan did not want to be outdone. He stabbed out with the wooden stick in his hand like a spear.","Boom!","The saber light and the wooden stick collided. Chang Shenghong’s attack was blocked in mid-air. He could not move forward. He could even feel an even more terrifying force rushing toward him. In an instant, it was about to send him flying.","Chang Shenghong did a few somersaults in the air before he finally dissipated the terrifying force. When he came back to his senses, he saw that Chu Yunfan was already standing before him.","It was too fast. Before anyone could react, Chu Yunfan had already rushed up.","Bam!","The wooden stick struck Chang Shenghong’s body. He grunted and flew backward, crashing into the floor of the venue. The floor was smashed into powder and a huge hole was created."]},{"number":1220,"title":"Chapter 1220 Beating up Chang Shenghong","paragraphs":["1220 Beating up Chang Shenghong","Chang Shenghong fell to the ground. His entire body was twitching, and his bones were almost shattered.","His eyes widened, and he almost choked on his breath.","At this moment, he finally understood why his subordinates were so vulnerable.","Although he had the intention of roping in the noble families behind these scions, he did not accept just anyone. They had to be at least at the Divine Abilities Stage or above before he would even look at them.","!!","Usually, he was also an expert. Just like Xu Feng, he could sweep away the entire younger generation of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","However, when these people faced Chu Yunfan, they actually couldn’t block Chu Yunfan’s stick. As Chang Shenghong watched from the side, he felt that it was completely unbelievable. But now that he was really hit by Chu Yunfan, he realized how terrifying it was.","It was just a simple strike, but it was as if he had been hit by a huge object at high speed. Even the inner armor on his body had shattered. If he did not have the inner armor, he did not doubt that he would have been blown up in midair.","Chang Shenghong struggled to get up, only to see Chu Yunfan standing high in the sky, looking down at him like a cold god. The aloof and mighty look on Chu Yunfan’s face showed that he had no regard for him.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze had completely angered him.","Chang Shenghong looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “Chu Yunfan, don’t think that you’ve won for sure. I’ll fight you to the death!”","Chang Shenghong roared and blood-red energy began to surge out of his body. It was as if he had used some secret technique to stimulate the divine power in his body to boil.","His cultivation also began to rise crazily at a speed visible to the naked eye. In an instant, he had already broken through the sixth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage and rushed to the seventh tier.","Seeing Chang Shenghong’s strength rise to another level, the people of the marquis’ residence who were spectating revealed shocked expressions. Chang Shenghong had actually been forced to this extent. That was the strength of a peak sixth-tier Divine, yet he was actually forced to the point where he had no choice but to use a secret technique.","Such a secret technique would undoubtedly have a huge impact on him.","But even so, Chang Shenghong still used it without hesitation. One could imagine how furious he was.","When Marquis Zhongxin saw this scene, his expression finally changed. He became somewhat worried. He had never expected things to reach this stage.","If everyone was only worried, then Chu Xiujie was terrified. He would never have thought that Chu Yunfan could be so powerful. His cousin, Chang Shenghong, who was invincible in his eyes, had been forced to such a state when facing Chu Yunfan. If it was him, he would be dead for sure.","At this moment, he was starting to regret provoking Chu Yunfan, but he only had one thought, and that was to let Chang Shenghong kill Chu Yunfan in the battle. Only then would Chang Shenghong calm down.","If he could not kill Chu Yunfan, even if it was a draw, it would be a disaster for Chu Xiujie.","At this moment, there was only one sentence left in his mouth.","“Kill him! Kill him the d*mn b*stard!”","“Die, you piece of trash!” Suddenly, Chang Shenghong made his move.","The saber in his hand slashed out an astonishing saber light that was more than a hundred feet long. The saber light swept across the sky and slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","His terrifying and crazy divine will locked onto Chu Yunfan. He did not give Chu Yunfan the slightest chance to escape.","However, Chu Yunfan did not have any intention of escaping. He just sneered at Chang Shenghong and swept out with the wooden stick in his hand again.","Bam!","The wooden staff swept across the saber light. Under everyone’s watchful eyes, a magical scene happened. Chu Yunfan’s stick actually shattered the terrifying saber light inch by inch. In the void, it turned into a rain of light that filled the sky and dissipated.","To Chu Yunfan, whether Chang Shenghong used the secret technique or not was actually the same concept. It could not affect him at all.","“Impossible!”","Chang Shenghong’s eyes were red from the killing. He could not believe what he was seeing. Chu Yunfan easily shattered his full-powered attack. He could not accept it. If Chu Yunfan had to use all his strength to block it, then it would be fine. However, looking at Chu Yunfan’s expression, it was clear that he was still completely at ease!","Chang Shenghong erupted, and all the divine power in his body condensed. Just as he was about to slash at Chu Yunfan again, he saw Chu Yunfan’s stick sweep through the sky and instantly reach him.","Bam!","Chang Shenghong was hit head-on. The magic shield that he had painstakingly reorganized instantly collapsed. He could not withstand the blow.","The divine power that had gathered in his body was scattered by Chu Yunfan’s stick, and the intense pain stimulated his nerves and almost made him scream.","However, Chu Yunfan had no intention of stopping. He swung down his stick again.","Bam!","The stick hit Chang Shenghong’s body hard. The divine power that had gathered on his body was once again dispersed. He fell to the ground with a scream.","However, Chu Yunfan wasn’t satisfied. He didn’t seem to have the intention of letting it go. He hit Chang Shenghong again and again.","Thwack!","Thwack!","Thwack!","Every time Chu Yunfan hit Chang Shenghong with the stick, a loud whipping sound would be heard.","Chang Shenghong was whipped to the ground. He tried to stand up, but Chu Yunfan whipped him to his knees and forced him to kneel.","In just moments, Chang Shenghong’s body was covered in blood.","Many people finally realized that Chang Shenghong had lost, and he had lost so horribly that he had no power to resist. Everyone could tell that Chu Yunfan was teaching Chang Shenghong a lesson. He had used just the right amount of strength so he wouldn’t kill Chang Shenghong, but he could make him suffer all kinds of pain.","All the bones in Chang Shenghong’s body were broken, but he wouldn’t die.","When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, they felt a chill run down their spines. After all, Chu Yunfan looked terrifyingly cold at this moment.","Finally, Chu Yunfan stopped the stick in his hand and said, “Today, I’m teaching you a lesson. Not everyone in the world is your mother and has the responsibility to give in to you. Do you think that your strength can dominate the world? You’re just a frog at the bottom of a well.","“I’m warning you today. If you dare to meddle in the Chu clan’s affairs again, I’ll slap you every time I see you. And you’re d*mn right I’ll keep my word.”"]},{"number":1221,"title":"Chapter 1221 The Banquet Ends, and Chu Yunfan Is the Star","paragraphs":["1221 The Banquet Ends, and Chu Yunfan Is the Star","Chang Shenghong, who had been whipped countless times, could only groan in pain. He couldn’t even resist. He completely lost his temper after being whipped by Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, he was in a daze. He had no way to fight back against Chu Yunfan.","The scene was dead silent. Other than the screams of the scions from Imperial Capital, there was no other sound. Everyone was stunned by Chu Yunfan. They didn’t even let out a rough gasp.","It was simply terrifying!","!!","“Isn’t he too strong? If my senses aren’t wrong, Chang Shenghong is already at the seventh-tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, but he was still beaten up. What level is Chu Yunfan at?”","After a short period of suppression, everyone exploded. Everyone was immersed in Chu Yunfan’s shocking performance.","An ordinary wooden stick, even one that had been cut right under their noses, actually had such power. It was simply appalling.","“I can’t believe that there’s such a person in our household!”","“He’s way too strong!”","Everyone was in an uproar.","Chu Haoyu was shocked. He was certain that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was probably above the seventh tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. It was simply unbelievable that such a person would appear in their household.","At this moment, he did not have any intention of competing. The two sides were not on the same level at all. How could they compete?","Moreover, he really believed that Chu Yunfan had no intention of fighting for the position. With such talent and strength, there was no need for him to rely on the marquis to get to the top.","Chu Haoyu looked at Chu Hongcai, who was as excited as a child, and endless envy flashed in his heart. If it were him, how good would that be?","However, that was simply impossible!","On the other side, Chu Xiujie was almost scared to death when he saw this scene. It felt as if the wooden stick that Chu Yunfan had used to hit Chang Shenghong had hit him as well.","His entire body was limp in his seat. There was only one thought in his mind, ‘How can this be? How can this be?!’","Chu Yunfan descended and stood in front of the marquis and the old madam. He cupped his hands and said, “Marquis, Matriarch, I apologize for ruining the banquet.”","“It’s not your fault,” the old madam said, “It’s all because these fellows don’t have eyes. They actually tried to meddle in the matters of our house!”","The old madam also knew about the conflict between these young people. She stood on Chu Yunfan’s side with a clear flag. Even without Chu Yunfan, she would not tolerate these people wantonly meddling in the affairs of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","The selection was a huge matter to the residence, and these people actually dared to interfere. Even their father did not dare to do so. They were really audacious.","“So what if they did? I’ll just take it as they did it on behalf of their parents. I’ll write a letter to those guys later and ask them if they plan to interfere in the matters of our house!”","The old madam had always been an extremely powerful person. She had no intention of letting this matter rest. Even if these people had been taught a lesson by Chu Yunfan, she still wanted to hold them accountable.","“Not bad. Good fight!” Chu Yaowei finally spoke. This was the first time he expressed his opinion on this matter. “Xiujie, on this matter, you really disappoint me!”","Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Xiujie and his face revealed a disappointed expression. In terms of closeness, he was more inclined toward Chu Xiujie, but he was such a useless person. He colluded with outsiders to interfere in the selection. Did he think the marquis was already dead?","When Chu Xiujie heard this, his face turned completely ashen. How could he not understand that he had been completely eliminated?","He had already figured out what his problem was, but it was useless.","From the moment he sought out Chang Shenghong, the selection no longer had anything to do with him. Marquis Zhongxin was a staunch person so how could he allow others to interfere in his family’s affairs?","At this moment, Chu Xiujie didn’t even have the thought of begging for mercy because he knew Chu Yaowei’s character very well. If there was no chance, there was no chance.","At this moment, he looked at Chu Yunfan, his eyes red, and his heart filled with evil. He gathered all his divine power and instantly appeared behind Chu Yunfan. A dagger appeared in his hand and he wanted to stab Chu Yunfan to death.","“This is all your fault. I’m going to kill you!”","At this moment, his eyes were filled with hatred and killing intent toward Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan had not appeared out of nowhere, he would not have been eliminated like this.","‘Everything was caused by Chu Yunfan. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, I wouldn’t be in this state!’","This was the only thought in Chu Xiujie’s mind.","“Brother Fan, watch out!” Chu Hongcai exclaimed.","However, in the next moment, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s stick, which had been turned around, smash down on Chu Xiujie.","Bam!","Chu Xiujie slammed into the ground, his sternum broken. He was instantly seriously injured and lost his fighting strength.","All of this happened so fast that it happened in the blink of an eye. Before anyone could react, everything had already happened and was over.","Everyone heaved a sigh of relief. At that critical moment, Chu Yunfan reacted and did not let Chu Xiujie succeed. Otherwise, who knew how the situation would turn out today? It was even possible that it would be impossible to end it.","“Vile beast!”","Chu Yaowei finally couldn’t help but curse. Originally, he was only disappointed with Chu Xiujie, but now he was completely in despair.","He knew that Chu Yunfan’s strength was simply unfathomable. At this time, Chu Xiujie’s actions only served to anger Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yaowei had thought highly of Chu Xiujie before. After all, he was his nephew. However, he had not expected him to be a piece of filth.","“What are you waiting for? Throw these people out!” Chu Yaowei shouted.","At this moment, everyone finally came to a realization and regained their senses. Those guards hurriedly went forward and carried out the scions on the ground in a flurry.","However, the scions were heavily injured. Their bones were broken by Chu Yunfan’s direct hits. As they moved, their wounds were affected, and they immediately screamed again and again.","For a moment, the entire venue was enveloped in waves of screams.","The banquet came to an end, and without a doubt, Chu Yunfan was the star of the banquet."]},{"number":1222,"title":"Chapter 1222 The Battle Wolves Are in Trouble Again","paragraphs":["1222 The Battle Wolves Are in Trouble Again","Chu Yunfan’s god-like performance was deeply imprinted in everyone’s minds. He was an invincible existence, like a reincarnated god of war.","After the banquet, he was summoned to the backyard by Chu Yaowei and the old madam.","In the living room of the backyard, Chu Yaowei and the old madam sat on the main seat, while Chu Yunfan, as a junior, sat below.","“Yunfan, I heard from Yaowei that you don’t plan to become the heir,” the old madam said directly.","!!","The old madam was very shrewd. Although she doted on Chu Yunfan before, she had never said that she wanted Chu Yunfan to become the heir. She doted on him only because she felt guilty for her youngest son who had passed away, but it did not mean that she did not know the big picture.","However, the situation was completely different now. From Chu Yunfan’s performance, it could be said that he was unexpectedly outstanding.","Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties. There was no doubt that his future was limitless.","Without mentioning anything else, just this strength alone was enough for him to become the heir of the marquis. If Chu Yunfan was the heir, she could even smile in the afterlife because the Chu clan would definitely flourish.","However, when she mentioned this idea to her son, Chu Yaowei, she heard him say that Chu Yaowei had already mentioned it to Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Chu Yunfan was not interested at all?","The power that others fought for was like a worn-out shoe to Chu Yunfan.","That was why she asked Chu Yunfan directly.","“Yes, Matriarch. My ambition isn’t here. It’s useless even if I force myself to stay.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “But I think Chu Hongcai is a good candidate. He’s young and has potential. He’ll definitely become a qualified heir in the future.”","Chu Yaowei and the old madam both revealed disappointed looks. Of course, they couldn’t say that Chu Hongcai wasn’t outstanding enough. He was in the Divine Abilities Stage before the age of 20. Such talent was the best even among the heirs of the top noble families in the capital.","However, it wasn’t a matter of not knowing what was good, it was just a matter of comparing the goods. If there was no comparison, Chu Hongcai was of course an extremely outstanding candidate. But compared to Chu Yunfan, he was far inferior.","It was because of this that they favored Chu Yunfan. However, they couldn’t force him to accept the matter of inheriting the family business.","“So, as long as the candidate is Chu Hongcai, you will support him?” Chu Yaowei thought of Chu Yunfan’s words and quickly asked.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He understood Chu Yaowei’s words. He wanted Chu Yunfan to support the household. Even if he wasn’t the heir, with the talent and strength that Chu Yunfan had shown, his future achievements were limitless.","With such a super big shot supporting them, the household could at least be safe for hundreds of years.","“As long as Hongcai becomes the heir in the future, I will support the household. After all, I’m also a member of the Chu clan. There’s no reason for me not to help my own people,” Chu Yunfan said.","“All right then!” Chu Yaowei said.","Although this wasn’t the best outcome, it wasn’t the worst either. As long as Chu Yunfan still supported the household, it would be of great benefit to them.","“I will immediately report this to the Imperial Court and elect Hongcai as the heir of the household.”","Seeing that Chu Yunfan was so understanding, Chu Yaowei immediately returned the favor.","Although this matter still needed the approval of the Great Wei Kingdom’s Imperial Court, generally speaking, as long as it was reported, it would be approved.","“I think Hongcai is a good kid. He’s talented and strong. Most importantly, he has a good heart. He’s lucky to have met you,” Chu Yaowei said with a smile.","He had been observing these candidates. Other than the mysterious Chu Yunfan, he was naturally familiar with the information of the others.","Moreover, he had no other choice now. Chu Xiujie had been eliminated, Chu Haoyu had given up, and Chu Yunfan was unwilling to participate. So, besides Chu Hongcai, he had no other choice.","Moreover, what he valued the most was the good relationship between Chu Hongcai and Chu Yunfan.","“Yes,” Chu Yunfan nodded and agreed with Chu Yaowei’s opinion. “But I’ve touched Chang Shenghong today. I hope I didn’t make things difficult for you, Matriarch.”","The old madam shook her head and said, “What’s so difficult about it? Duke Ning is my nephew. If he dares to grin at me, I’ll chop him down. Besides, Chang Shenghong is too bold. He dares to meddle in other people’s affairs. You beating him up is for his own good. Otherwise, something will happen sooner or later.”","The old madam felt sorry for Chang Shenghong, but she knew that if he had not been beaten up today, there would be more trouble in the future.","Chu Yunfan had only given him a small punishment for his sake. If it were any other ruthless person, he would have killed him long ago.","As an elder of the Chang clan, she naturally had the obligation to teach these juniors, even if it was in this way.","“That’s right. I’ll write a letter to Duke Ning. It’s nothing. It’s just some minor wounds. They’re all Divines so they’ll be back to life in a few days.”","Chu Yaowei didn’t take this matter to heart. It wasn’t the first time that the scions had fought each other. When they were young, they weren’t any better. It was ridiculous to fight one after another. As long as they didn’t kill anyone, it wasn’t a big deal.","“Moreover, even if Duke Ning and the others are unwilling to let the matter rest, will you be afraid?” Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan with a faint smile as if he had seen through Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan smiled and didn’t reply. Of course, he wasn’t afraid. When he recovered his strength, the entire Great Wei Kingdom would be at his mercy. There was nothing to be afraid of.","“All right, both of you can leave. I’m tired,” the old madam said, ordering them to leave.","Chu Yunfan left the residence and returned to Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion, where he found a member of the Battle Wolves in uniform who had been waiting for him for a long time.","“Master Chu, I’ve been waiting for you!” the Battle Wolf member said as he quickly stepped forward.","“What’s wrong?” Chu Yunfan looked at the member with a curious expression.","“Our gang leader has sent you an invitation,” the member quickly said.","“What is it about?” Chu Yunfan asked.","The member revealed a troubled expression and said, “I don’t know. How would small fries like us know about such things? Our leader has invited you to come to the base immediately after you return. He has something important to discuss with you.”"]},{"number":1223,"title":"Chapter 1223 The Experts’ Doubts","paragraphs":["1223 The Experts’ Doubts","What could have happened to the Battle Wolves?","Chu Yunfan felt it a little strange as he had not expected this. He immediately decided to follow the Battle Wolf member.","This time, they weren’t going to the Battle Wolves’ Conglong headquarters. Instead, they were going to the base outside the city. Although it was just a base, it was actually the Battle Wolves’ real headquarters. It was heavily guarded, just like a small city.","Since the Battle Wolves were able to become the number one gang in the entire Conglong City, their strength was naturally not to be underestimated.","It didn’t take long for the two of them to arrive at the Battle Wolves’ base outside the city. When Chu Yunfan arrived, he saw Liao Deyi waiting anxiously.","When he saw Chu Yunfan, he immediately went forward and said, “Master Chu, you’re finally here!”","“What’s wrong? Did the leader’s illness relapse again?” Chu Yunfan said.","“It’s not like that. There’s a problem within our sect,” Liao Deyi said.","“What is it?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Liao Deyi looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “Master Chu, you’re aware that our gang leader was injured by someone, right? In the end, it was you who personally saved our leader.”","“That’s right. Could it be that what you want to say has something to do with the person who injured your leader?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Liao Deyi nodded. “That’s right. Your guess is correct, Master Chu. Recently, we finally found out that the person is not just anyone. He’s one of our first enemies. The Battle Wolves was originally a small gang in Conglong City. We fought all the way to the top until we finally reached our current status. Of course, this process was by no means smooth sailing.","“During the process, we offended many people. One of them escaped. Later, he became a disciple of another master. It has been more than a hundred years since we last saw him, but his cultivation has improved by leaps and bounds. When our leader went out to patrol a while ago, the man ambushed him and the leader almost lost his life.”","Chu Yunfan continued to listen but wasn’t surprised. The rise of the Battle Wolves couldn’t have been smooth sailing. Some people benefited, while others suffered.","“And he’s here now?”","Liao Deyi looked at Chu Yunfan with a bitter smile and said, “That’s right. We can’t hide anything from you, Master Chu. Yes, he’s here. Not only that but he’s also gathered many gangs from Conglong City and the nearby areas. They’re not far from us now.","“If it were just a single sect, we wouldn’t be apprehensive. However, he has gathered many sects that we had conflicts with while in the process of our development. Usually, they don’t dare to attack us. Now, all of them have stuck out their necks,” Liao Deyi said.","“And you want me to help?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“Yes, Master Chu.” Liao Deyi nodded.","Chu Yunfan didn’t comment on it. He didn’t feel much about the Battle Wolves or other gangs. However, his relationship with the Battle Wolves was quite good.","“Let me take a look first.”","“Thank you, Master Chu!”","Liao Deyi was overjoyed when he saw that Chu Yunfan did not directly refuse. He was not very confident that Chu Yunfan would agree. After all, these were muddy waters.","As for Chu Yunfan’s strength, he wasn’t sure either. However, Chu Yunfan killed Chen Ke with a single slap so his combat strength was no doubt terrifying. No matter what, it would be a huge help at this critical moment.","Under Liao Deyi’s guidance, Chu Yunfan entered the Battle Wolves’ base. At this time, the entire base was crowded with people as if a storm was about to come.","Soon, Liao Deyi brought Chu Yunfan to a reception hall used for receiving guests. At this time, there were already five people waiting in this hall.","One of them was an old man dressed in black. He sat alone and had a cold aura about him. His expression was arrogant.","On the other side were two skinny men in black. They looked exactly the same. They were twins.","Other than that, there was also a young man in his thirties who wore green clothes. He had an arrogant expression as he stood to the side.","There was also a young girl half the height of an ordinary person. She was dressed in orange clothes and was filled with an ancient aura.","When the five of them saw Chu Yunfan arrive, they all turned their gazes over. They noticed his age. He looked like he was only in his twenties and they were very surprised.","They could tell that Chu Yunfan was not the kind of person who looked young but was actually an old monster. He was indeed very young, and that vigorous life aura could not be faked.","“Everyone, let me introduce you. This is Chu Yunfan, Master Chu,” Liao Deyi explained, and then he started to introduce the others. “This is the Eccentric Elder of Mount Chang. These two are the Twin Stars of the Zhang clan from the Zhao prefecture. This is the genius young master of the Inherited Sword Manor, Wan Feihong, and last but not least, the Child Elder of Mount Ying.”","Then, Liao Deyi sent a telepathic message to Chu Yunfan, “Master Chu, these are the experts that the Battle Wolves had invited at a high price.”","Chu Yunfan nodded slightly. It seemed that the Battle Wolves were not ignorant of this crisis. They had actually invited so many experts.","He swept his gaze around. These people were not ordinary people. The strongest among them was the black-robed old man, the Eccentric Elder of Mount Cang. His cultivation had already reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","As for Zhao prefecture’s Zhang clan’s Twin Stars and the Child Elder of Mount Ying, they were all in the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. The weakest among them was the genius young master of the Inherited Sword Manor, Wan Feihong, who was only at the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, in the entire Great Wei Kingdom, such a lineup could be considered extremely powerful. Even so, Liao Deyi still rushed to find Chu Yunfan. It could be seen that the enemy’s strength was extraordinary.","“Liao Deyi, what do you mean by finding such a young boy?”","At this moment, the first to speak was Child Elder. She looked like a young girl, but her voice was extremely ancient.","“Child Elder, although Master Chu is young, he’s a genuine senior alchemist of the Alchemist Association,” Liao Deyi explained.","Suddenly, everyone looked at Chu Yunfan differently. However, Liao Deyi’s words angered another expert, Wan Feihong. He glanced at Chu Yunfan. Suddenly, his gaze turned into two sword lights that pierced straight at Chu Yunfan.","“No, Brother Wan!” Liao Deyi quickly said."]},{"number":1224,"title":"Chapter 1224 Injured Heavily and Forced to Kneel","paragraphs":["1224 Injured Heavily and Forced to Kneel","Only Divines could do something like this. The Divine Abilities Stage was a level that could turn the impossible into the possible.","Of course, different levels were naturally different. At Wan Feihong’s level, a casual glance at an Innate could kill that person, and a glance at an ordinary Divine could severely injure them.","It was precisely because of this that Liao Deyi had not expected this sudden attack.","However, the two sharp swords that were formed by Wang Feihong’s gaze were stopped three inches away from Chu Yunfan, and they shattered inch by inch. They could not get close to Chu Yunfan.","!!","At this moment, after everyone reacted, the way they looked at Chu Yunfan had changed entirely.","Wan Feihong had not expected Chu Yunfan to be able to block his attack so easily. Chu Yunfan had simply ignored his attack.","“Not bad!” Wan Feihong smiled faintly as if he was not the one who had launched such an attack just now. He did not take what had just happened to heart.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes glinted with a fierce light. He looked at Wan Feihong and said, “How dare you. Didn’t your parents teach you any manners?”","Hearing this, Wan Feihong’s indifferent expression suddenly disappeared. He sneered at Chu Yunfan and said, “You’re courting death. Do you think you can mention my parents?”","When the others saw the conflict between the two of them erupt, they looked at the two of them with interest, especially at Wan Feihong. He was too proud to the point of being arrogant.","Wan Feihong even dared to look down on famous experts like them. However, because of the Inherited Sword Manor behind him, they could only endure it. But now, he finally met someone who could not bear it.","“Master Chu, calm down, calm down. The Inherited Sword Manor is not an ordinary place. The manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor has already stepped into the half-step Core Stage several decades ago. His strength is unfathomable,” Liao Deyi hurriedly sent a telepathic message to Chu Yunfan.","Wan Feihong sneered at Chu Yunfan. No matter how he looked at Chu Yunfan, this boy was not pleasing to the eye. Before Chu Yunfan arrived, he was the youngest and the proudest genius around.","However, Chu Yunfan’s arrival made him unhappy because he knew very well how difficult it was to become a senior alchemist. This brat was even more arrogant than him.","Since he was unhappy, he directly attacked. He did not think too much about it. In any case, everyone respected his father, so what if he attacked?","“A mere senior alchemist dares to blaspheme our Inherited Sword Manor? You’re courting death! Kneel and kowtow three times to me and I’ll spare your life,” Wan Feihong said arrogantly as if everything was taken for granted.","At this moment, everyone could see that Wan Feihong did not like Chu Yunfan and wanted to humiliate him. Although they did not know why, it was obvious that Wan Feihong had to achieve this goal.","“Inherited Sword Manor? What the hell is that? Even if your father comes, he’s not worthy of being compared to me, let alone trash like you.”","A mere half-step Core might be a terrifying existence to others, but in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, it was nothing. He had even killed a Core before and now, was not worried about an ordinary half-step Core—an existence who could be easily killed with a single slap if they acted arrogantly in front of him.","For others, backup like the one Wan Feihong had might be enough, but for Chu Yunfan, it was simply childish.","“What did you say?” Wan Feihong’s eyes widened in anger. At this moment, he no longer had the mocking expression from before. When he looked at Chu Yunfan now, his eyes were filled with sharp killing intent.","When Liao Deyi saw this scene, he felt a headache coming on. Both sides were existences that he could not afford to offend.","“I said you’re trash, and you asked me to kneel to you?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“That’s right. But kneeling won’t be enough now. You must die to apologize!”","Wan Feihong was furious. Then, he instantly exploded and pounced toward Chu Yunfan. The terrifying aura belonging to an eighth-tier Divine was instantly released and swept toward Chu Yunfan in an overwhelming manner.","Immediately after, a shocking sword light exploded in the reception hall. The sky was torn apart, and the sword light gathered into a long river that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","“Oh no! Master Chu, be careful!” Liao Deyi hurriedly shouted, but he did not dare to step forward.","He was only a seventh-tier Divine and Wan Feihong, who had erupted in rage, was stronger than him. He did not even dare to get close.","The others also set up barriers to avoid being injured.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the attack. He simply raised his hand and caught the sword light that was coming down. As Chu Yunfan exerted force, the sword light shattered inch by inch.","Everything looked so terrifying!","Chu Yunfan crushed the sword light that seemed to have turned into a tangible sword inch by inch. It could not hurt him in the slightest.","“Impossible!”","Wan Feihong’s eyes widened. His full-powered attack was actually blocked by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the sword light fragments and threw them back at Wan Feihong. Immediately, these sword lights turned into shards that swept toward Wan Feihong.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Countless sword lights exploded on Wan Feihong’s body, sending him flying and crashing into the pillar of the reception hall. The entire reception hall shook for a moment, and the barriers were restored one after another. One could imagine how shocking this attack was.","However, what truly shocked these top-notch experts was that Wan Feihong had been injured by his own attack.","Chu Yunfan’s casual throw held such shocking power.","Wan Feihong coughed up a mouthful of blood. The inner armor that he used to protect himself had completely shattered, scattering in all directions. But he did not look at Chu Yunfan with contempt. On the contrary, he was shocked.","But before he could continue, Chu Yunfan shouted, “Kneel!”","Immediately after, Wan Feihong felt a terrifying force pressing down on him. It was as heavy as Mount Tai, and he could not withstand it and instantly knelt.","His knees smashed into the floor, creating two big holes. He wanted to scream but he couldn’t make a sound.","The others could see that a sealing talisman had appeared on his body. It was like a huge mountain that pressed down on him, preventing him from getting up."]},{"number":1225,"title":"Chapter 1225 It’s Just a Half-Step Core, and Look at How Scared You Are!","paragraphs":["1225 It’s Just a Half-Step Core, and Look at How Scared You Are!","All of this happened in a flash. Before anyone could react, everything had already ended.","By the time everyone came to their senses, Wan Feihong was forced to kneel and a seal was placed on his body to suppress him.","Many people were shocked. Just what kind of seal was this? It actually had such power.","They could see that Wan Feihong was struggling to hold on, and his hands were trembling!","When Chu Yunfan exploded, everything was so casual. He didn’t even have to make a move to subdue Wan Feihong.","When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, they were no longer shocked because Liao Deyi had said that Chu Yunfan was a senior alchemist, but because of his strength.","Besides the fact that his father was the manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor, Wan Feihong’s own strength was not to be underestimated. Even the strongest among them, the Eccentric Elder, could not possibly subdue Wan Feihong in such a short time.","Chu Yunfan had subdued Wan Feihong in one move. It was a completely crushing performance. This was what shocked them the most.","Wan Feihong cultivated the Way of the Sword. People of the Way of the Sword emphasized attacking instead of defending. In terms of attack power, it was very shocking. Even experts who were stronger than them were unwilling to encounter such a Way of the Sword expert.","However, this sword expert’s tried and tested moves did not have any effect on Chu Yunfan at all and he was directly suppressed.","At this moment, they no longer dared to underestimate Chu Yunfan. Although he looked the youngest, his methods were a little unfathomable.","At this moment, they all began to search through their memories. Logically speaking, it was impossible for an expert of this level to not have any reputation. How could they not know about him at all?","This was very strange in itself.","On the other hand, Liao Deyi, who was standing at the side, smiled bitterly. He had not expected that the situation would turn out like this. Before they could deal with the external enemies, both sides had already started to fight among themselves.","“Master Chu, I’m afraid that you’ve gotten yourself into big trouble this time. The manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor is famous for being protective of his people. I’m afraid that he won’t let this matter rest. I’m afraid that even the Battle Wolves won’t be able to escape blame.” Liao Deyi smiled bitterly.","He was all too clear about the strong personality of the person at the head of Inherited Sword Manor. If it wasn’t for that, he wouldn’t have specially invited Wan Feihong. Rather than saying that he hoped for Wan Feihong to come and take charge, it would be more appropriate to say that he wanted to use this opportunity to build a relationship with Inherited Sword Manor.","They wanted to use their relationship with Inherited Sword Manor to scare off the enemy. But now, it was impossible. Now that Wan Feihong was forced to kneel and kowtow, how could Inherited Sword Manor let this matter go?","“Don’t worry. I won’t implicate you guys. If Inherited Sword Manor comes looking for me, you can ask them to come to me. The guy’s just a half-step Core, and look at how scared you guys are.” Chu Yunfan sat down and didn’t even look at Wan Feihong.","“For your sake, I’ll only give him a small punishment.”","This time, even the expression of the Eccentric Elder changed. Forcing someone to kneel was already a small punishment. If Chu Yunfan were to really attack, wouldn’t he kill someone?","However, they could tell that Chu Yunfan was not joking.","They felt as if they could see mountains of corpses and seas of blood on Chu Yunfan’s body. They all shivered. This was definitely not an illusion. Chu Yunfan must have killed people like flies to make them feel this way.","This was because Divines were sensitive. Their perception of killing intent was too sharp so they could sense his aura.","Even Eccentric Elder, who had lived the longest among them, had to admit defeat. This young man held a rare record of having killed so many people though he was only in his twenties.","What surprised them further was that even though Chu Yunfan had killed so many people, yet he did not seem to be affected. Generally speaking, many people would lose themselves after killing so many times. No matter how well they hid, it would affect them. However, Chu Yunfan was different. In fact, they could feel that if Wan Feihong had not provoked him first, Chu Yunfan would never have attacked.","They were all curious as to where Chu Yunfan had done such a shocking massacre. If someone had done it, it was impossible for them to be unaware of it.","However, they didn’t know that in the Kunlun Realm, the Federation led by Chu Yunfan had suffered hundreds of millions of casualties. The scale of the tragedy was beyond the imagination of the masters of the Great Wei Kingdom.","Even if a Core tried his best to kill a hundred million people, he wouldn’t be able to kill all of them. However, a nuclear bomb could easily wipe out so many humans. Compared to the killing efficiency of the Federation, the killing efficiency of the Spirit Realm was child’s play.","From Chu Yunfan’s tone, he was unbothered by half-step Cores. Could it be that he had a powerful master behind him?","But thinking about it, it made sense. If he didn’t have a powerful teacher, how could he cultivate to such a shocking level at the age of twenty? No matter how talented he was, it was impossible. Resources, talent, and inheritance were indispensable.","These people compared the powerful inheritances in their minds one by one, wanting to find out which inheritance had such a shocking genius.","After all this, the gang leader of the Battle Wolves finally arrived. Although he could walk, everyone could see that his blood and energy were declining. He was far from recovering to his peak.","“What’s going on?” The leader saw Wan Feihong kneeling on the ground and immediately turned pale with fright.","Liao Deyi smiled bitterly and told the leader about the matter.","At this time, the leader also smiled bitterly and then looked at Chu Yunfan with a bit of disbelief in his eyes. He knew that Chu Yunfan was a senior alchemist. At his age, it was already very shocking for him to have such achievements in the field of alchemy.","However, at this moment, the leader realized that the seemingly most brilliant alchemy results were just the most inconspicuous part of Chu Yunfan. The most terrifying thing about him was his hidden strength. Even now, Liao Deyi still couldn’t determine how strong Chu Yunfan was.","However, he knew that in his current state, he couldn’t handle this matter. Anyway, Chu Yunfan had already said that he would deal with Inherited Sword Manor and had no intention of implicating them.","The gang leader heaved a sigh of relief and said slowly, “Everyone, I’m very grateful that you are willing to help me today. However, we’re facing an unprecedentedly strong enemy today. We have set up a trap for them. I hope that everyone will join forces with me to kill him.”"]},{"number":1226,"title":"Chapter 1226 Going to the Meeting Alone, a Sudden Change!","paragraphs":["1226 Going to the Meeting Alone, a Sudden Change!","At this moment, the Battle Wolves leader’s words attracted everyone’s attention. No one looked at Wan Feihong anymore. The seal suppressed him, and he could not even speak.","Chu Yunfan’s attainments in sealing had shocked them. With this unique sealing technique, he occupied a place among the many experts of the Great Wei Kingdom.","“I want to know who your enemy is. I don’t want to fall into a trap for no reason,” Child Elder said.","Liao Deyi stepped forward and said, “I’ll tell you about him. His name is Bu Shan. In his early years, he led one of the gangs in Conglong City. Later, the Battle Wolves destroyed this gang. I didn’t expect this guy to escape.","“I don’t know what fortuitous encounter he had, but he became a famous master’s disciple, and his cultivation increased by leaps and bounds. He became even more daring and ambushed our leader some time ago.","“Now, he has gathered a group of small gangs and successively destroyed the Battle Wolves’ branches in various places. They’re heading toward the headquarters now.”","Everyone looked solemn. There was no doubt this Bu Shan was troublesome. If not for this, the Battle Wolves’ leader would not have gotten injured.","The Battle Wolves could stand in Conglong City for many years because of their leader’s incredible strength. Among the many experts in Conglong City, the leader was one of the top existences. Now that he had been severely injured and lost his confidence in fighting one-on-one, he could not use his strength to surround Bu Shan. One could deduce that Bu Shan was not an easy opponent.","The leader seemed to notice everyone wavering. He said, “Our gang will offer 10,000,000 low-grade spirit stones as a reward if you can help me kill this b*stard.”","At this point, these experts’ breathing began to quicken. With their strength, it was not an exaggeration to say they were rich. However, tens of millions of low-grade spirit stones were still considerable for them.","Even if they could only get a portion of it, it was still a significant windfall. Ten million low-grade spirit stones were more than enough to buy a peak Divine’s life. Even Chu Yunfan was tempted.","“All right, in that case, I will accept this order,” Eccentric Elder said.","The others agreed, while only Chu Yunfan remained noncommittal. Still, no one dared to underestimate him.","Suddenly, there was a loud battle cry outside the base, and everyone reacted to it. They spread their divine will and immediately grasped the situation outside.","It turned out that the members of the minor sects who had rushed over from all over the world had gathered and started attacking the Battle Wolves’ headquarters.","This was also the first time Chu Yunfan had seen the means of war in the Spirit Realm. Although it was just a battle between gangs, these gangs had a certain degree of advancement and retreat, just like a real army.","They were not just gangsters. Instead, these gangs had some selected elites who were specially trained, just like the army. They knew how to advance or retreat and were excellent at battle formations. Their strength was quite extraordinary.","The various methods of attacking the city made Chu Yunfan think it was an eye-opener. This classical method of attacking the city completely differed from the simple and crude method of attacking the Federation.","The Federation’s methods of attacking cities were usually straightforward. They used various high-tech weapons and nuclear bombs to bombard the ground. No powerful enemy could withstand such an attack.","After using various firepower to dominate the battlefield, their battleships would bombard the area. Finally, mechas would clean up the battlefield. This simple method was jokingly called “The Three Axes,” but one had to admit it was very effective.","However, the Great Wei Kingdom siege was utterly different as these were martial arts experts. They did not even need a ladder. They pushed the siege chariots one by one, braving various attacks to rush to the bottom of the city wall.","Huge cracks appeared on the city walls under the substantial siege chariots’ impact. Some experts even rose from the ground and rushed up the city walls. This unique method of attacking the city broadened Chu Yunfan’s horizons, but the others were not as relaxed as him because they felt the situation’s urgency.","“Don’t panic, everyone. Let’s confirm Bu Shan’s location first and then lure him over. Then, we’ll surround and kill him,” the leader said, “As for those motley crew, don’t worry. This is the Battle Wolves’ headquarters. It won’t be so easy for them to attack us.”","Everyone nodded. They had not been invited to deal with these ordinary people. Even the Battle Wolves had Divines to deal with the Divines from the various sects. They did not have to worry about them.","Suddenly, a figure slowly appeared from the void, accompanied by a mocking voice, “Are you looking for me?”","Everyone’s heart tightened. They turned and saw a thin middle-aged man with a long scar on his face, making him look incredibly ferocious when he smiled.","The leader’s expression turned cold as he shouted the person’s name, “Bu Shan!”","Everyone reacted. This was the target they had been tasked to deal with—Bu Shan.","“I didn’t expect an old fellow like you to still be alive. It’s such a pity,” Bu Shan said arrogantly as he looked at the leader. “It’s fine. This time, I’ll break your neck myself. None from the Battle Wolves can leave. I want every single one of you dead!”","At this point, Bu Shan’s eyes turned red with madness. After so many years, he could finally get his revenge. It was a result of many years of bitter cultivation.","“What are you waiting for? Attack!” the leader thundered, and the Eccentric Elder and the others immediately mobilized.","However, something unexpected happened. The Zhang clan’s Twin Stars, who had been silent all this while, suddenly attacked. The elder brother attacked the Child Elder. He had planned this and injured her, sending her flying to the side."]},{"number":1227,"title":"Chapter 1227 Kill One First","paragraphs":["1227 Kill One First","At the same time, the younger brother burst out and pounced toward Liao Deyi. How could Liao Deyi’s cultivation be able to withstand this attack? He was sent flying on the spot and spat out a mouthful of blood. He was almost killed.","Only Eccentric Elder flew directly to Bu Shan. However, who would have thought that the few experts who were supposed to be supporting him, Child Elder and Liao Deyi, would be severely injured by the Twin Stars?","All of this happened too quickly. No one could react in time, nor had they expected such a thing to happen.","Eccentric Elder was the first to react. He immediately knew that things were not good and quickly prepared to retreat. However, Bu Shan would not give him such an opportunity.","A shocking saber light appeared out of thin air and instantly slashed down horizontally.","Slice!","The saber light tore through everything. The magic armor on Eccentric Elder’s body was cut open like paper. However, it still bought him some time. He managed to step to the side, avoiding the fatal blow.","Even so, when the dust settled, a terrifying crack appeared on his chest. It was so deep that his bones could be seen. Blood kept spurting out, and he could not stop it.","The wound was actually black in color. This saber had been dipped in poison.","Spurt!","Eccentric Elder spat out a mouthful of blood as he retreated. Ignoring his injuries, he retreated to the corner of the wall and assumed a defensive posture. However, his arms were trembling. The poison was too powerful. Even if he tried his best to suppress it, he could not hold it off for long. The poison on his wound was continuously seeping into his body, eroding his life.","At this moment, his eyes flickered with a horrified light. He did not know why it had become like this.","“Twin Stars, you two... ” the leader finally realized what had happened.","The Twin Stars had betrayed him. Only Chu Yunfan was the only expert left, who was standing far away. The others were all instantly heavily injured and lost their ability to fight.","The leader was currently far from being at his peak. If he was at his peak state, dealing with the Twin Stars at the same time wouldn’t be a problem. But now, he didn’t have the confidence to win against even one of them.","The Twin Stars slowly moved to stand behind Bu Shan.","Bu Shan revealed a proud smile and said, “Old man, did you think that I would come alone without any precautions? You underestimate me too much!”","After being hunted by the Battle Wolves for so many years, he was no longer the same as before. He had prepared for revenge for so many years. How could he fail in the gutter?","“The Twin Stars are also your people?”","The leader finally understood everything. The Twin Stars were spies, but he hadn’t found any connection between them and Bu Shan previously. That was why he dared to invite them.","If the Twin Stars were spies, then everything was clear. The allied forces outside, which they thought were the main force of the attack, were actually a feint attack, and this was the real place for the decisive battle.","The leader had schemed against Bu Shan. He had wanted to set a trap to lure Bu Shan in. Who knew that it was Bu Shan’s trap from the beginning? If it wasn’t for the sudden betrayal of the Twin Stars, even if he couldn’t find so many people, he wouldn’t have lost so badly.","After understanding everything, the leader turned pale. He immediately understood the situation he was facing.","“That’s right. The Twin Stars have always been my people. You just didn’t know about it.","“You think you can set a trap for me?” Bu Shan said proudly, “Old man, your time is over!”","“Master Chu, let’s break out of this encirclement together!”","At this moment, the leader suddenly thought of Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had not been defeated yet. Although the two of them might not be a match for Bu Shan and the Twin Stars, it was better than being completely no match for them. As long as they could hold out for a while, the Battle Wolf members would sense that something was wrong and rush over.","At that time, there would still be a chance to turn defeat into victory.","At this moment, there weren’t many helpers he could find on the battlefield. Liao Deyi was barely holding on. The Child Elder couldn’t unleash her full strength. She had been schemed against and lost her combat ability. As for the Eccentric Elder, who was the strongest, he could only stand and couldn’t fight back.","Looking around, the leader realized he could only rely on Chu Yunfan.","But what he could think of, Bu Shan could also think of. He said to the Twin Stars, “Get rid of that annoying fellow first. I’ll deal with this old fellow myself.”","Bu Shan did not place much importance on Chu Yunfan. Compared to the other people, Chu Yunfan looked too mediocre. Moreover, he had already thought highly of Chu Yunfan by letting the Twin Stars attack at the same time.","However, the Twin Stars did not underestimate Chu Yunfan, because they had seen how he had suppressed Wan Feihong with lightning speed. Naturally, they understood that even if Chu Yunfan could not compare to the Eccentric Elder, he was still a ruthless person.","The two of them quickly surrounded Chu Yunfan from both sides.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan slowly said, “Leader, if I help you deal with these people, I’ll be taking the 10 million low-grade spirit stones. Do you have any problem with that?”","At this moment, the leader heard Chu Yunfan’s words and didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. Why was he still fussing about this at a time like this?","“Master Chu, if kill these three, I’ll reward you with 10 million low-grade spirit stones,” the leader said directly. At this point, he had no other choice.","“In that case, I won’t stand on ceremony.”","Chu Yunfan smiled and narrowed his eyes. The Twin Stars, who were surrounding him, only saw a blur. In an instant, Chu Yunfan disappeared from where he was.","“Where is he?” The Twin Stars hurriedly spread out their divine wills to search for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. Among Divines, their divine will was much more reliable than their eyes.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already appeared behind the younger brother. He used his finger as a sword, and a sword light shot out from his finger. In an instant, it slashed toward the younger brother.","The younger brother only had time to turn around and set up a barrier in an attempt to resist. However, the barrier he set up was like paper. Chu Yunfan instantly broke the barrier and split his body into two.","Slash!","Fresh blood spurted out.","The younger brother of the Zhang clan’s Twin Stars had fallen."]},{"number":1228,"title":"Chapter 1228 The Fall of the Twin Stars","paragraphs":["1228 The Fall of the Twin Stars","“Brother!” the elder brother roared in rage, his anger mixed with grief and indignation.","In the blink of an eye, his younger brother had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. The two brothers had been together since they were born. Their relationship was deep as if they were one person.","But now, he could only watch as his brother died here. Immediately, he completely exploded. His aura was released, almost filling the entire reception hall.","“I’ll kill you!” the elder brother roared.","The hammer instantly fell on top of Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","A terrifying tide erupted, but soon, the elder brother realized that something was wrong. He realized that his hammer could not move any further.","Then, he realized his hammer could only hit an inch above Chu Yunfan’s head. A light screen had formed above Chu Yunfan’s head, blocking his explosive hammer.","“Impossible! How are you able to block my hammer without using any magic weapons?!”","The elder brother was in complete disbelief. His attack was not invincible, but it should not be at a level that could be blocked without any magic weapons. Even Bu Shan, who he followed, could not do this.","Chu Yunfan had completely broken his understanding.","“This is nothing.”","Chu Yunfan sneered and reached out to grab the hammer. In an instant, he grabbed it. It was a simple move of snatching the hammer head with his bare hands. Although the action was simple, Chu Yunfan could still do it when facing a ninth-tier Divine like the Twin Stars. It only highlighted how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","“Sh*t!”","At this moment, alarm bells started ringing in the elder brother’s head. He felt an imminent sense of danger surging up. Then, he saw Chu Yunfan easily swing the huge hammer that he needed two hands to swing with one hand. Chu Yunfan easily swung the hammer and smashed it down on the elder brother.","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. In an instant, the huge hammer had already fallen on the elder brother’s head. The elder brother quickly formed a hand seal and formed a huge shield above his head.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, Chu Yunfan instantly shattered the huge shield.","Spurt!","The Zhang Clan’s Twin Stars Brother screamed and spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire body seemed to have been hit by a heavy blow and he instantly flew backward, landing heavily on the ground.","His eyes were filled with fear, and there was no longer a trace of anger. At this moment, the most important thing was not revenge, but to survive Chu Yunfan’s attack.","The elder brother struggled to get up, but he didn’t have time. Chu Yunfan leaped up and was instantly on top of him. The huge hammer suddenly smashed down.","Boom!"]},{"number":1229,"title":"Chapter 1229 Killing Bu Shan","paragraphs":["Chapter 1229 Killing Bu Shan","Chu Yunfan could not help but sigh after hearing this. If one wanted to know what a formidable and ambitious person looked like, it would look like this.","Bu Shan could only say such words after his two essential generals had been. It was undoubtedly the temperament of an ambitious man. Even Chu Yunfan did not expect him to say such words.","When the others heard Bu Shan’s words, their hearts suddenly tightened. If Chu Yunfan agreed, it would be over for them. After all, half of the Battle Wolves’ assets were much more than the ten million low-grade spirit stones the leader had promised.","If it were them, they would probably be tempted too. After all, it was much more cost-effective, no matter how one looked at it.","!!","“I’m sorry, but I’m taking someone else’s money to eliminate a disaster. I still have this bit of professional ethics.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “We’ve already reached this point, and you still want to turn the tables when you’re about to die?”","Bu Shan was startled, and then his face revealed a ferocious expression. “Since you refuse a toast only to drink a forfeit, don’t blame me for being impolite!”","He laughed coldly, and golden light flashed on his body, turning into armor. At this moment, he looked like a golden god of war. His aura soared compared to the beginning. The aura on his entire body rose rapidly.","Bu Shan had already vaguely touched the edge of the half-step Core Stage!","“I gave you a chance, but you didn’t know how to cherish it. Since that’s the case, you can die!” Bu Shan sneered.","At this time, the Battle Wolf leader quickly advised Chu Yunfan, “Master Chu, be careful. His armor is powerful and tough to break through.”","When the leader was at his peak, he had been severely injured by Bu Shan. He would have died long ago if not for his loyal confidant, who risked his life to protect the old leader.","“No wonder he’s so confident to come alone.”","Chu Yunfan was not concerned, even if Bu Shan was in this state. His expression did not even change.","Boom!","Bu Shan moved. His entire body resembled a small mountain that instantly crushed over. In the blink of an eye, he was already launching an attack on Chu Yunfan.","A saber slashed down, forming a terrifying light, almost splitting the entire space into two. Everyone present could feel the terror of this saber, and their expressions changed drastically.","They would have probably gotten heavily injured with one saber strike if it were them. There was no way they could escape.","However, Chu Yunfan did not dodge. The terrifying light fell from the sky, directly cutting his body. The raging waves caused by the light blew his clothes and hair, but he did not move.","The terrifying light that could split the space in half could not hurt Chu Yunfan.","Bu Shan realized what had happened and felt something was amiss. Chu Yunfan was too calm. Even when facing an existence like Bu Shan, he did not show the slightest fear.","A golden light burst from Chu Yunfan’s body, shaking away the saber’s light as he spoke, “Is this your only trump card? Is that the extent of your power? I’m so disappointed.”","The others were also dumbfounded. They looked at the unharmed Chu Yunfan as if they had seen a ghost. This was much more shocking than his unexpected and astonishing cultivation.","They finally realized their previous estimation of Chu Yunfan was utterly wrong. Whether he was a master of alchemy or an unfathomable expert, they were many sides to him.","If Chu Yunfan were an older adult in his seventies or eighties, they would not feel anything was wrong with this. However, he was still young. Whether it was an unfathomable expert or an alchemy master, it was evident it would take countless years to accumulate such strength.","Chu Yunfan’s existence completely violated this rule.","“Take this!” Chu Yunfan sneered. He swung his hammer and smashed it down on Bu Shan.","Bu Shan hastily retreated, but Chu Yunfan’s hammer was too fast. In just a moment, it had already fallen on him. He had to slash down at the hammer with his saber.","Clang!","A loud explosion rang out, and everyone heard the deafening sound of metal clashing. Chu Yunfan firmly held the big hammer in one hand while opposite him, Bu Shan’s raised arms were trembling violently.","Just that one slash had already drained all the strength from Bu Shan’s body, causing him to tremble.","His eyes were about to pop out as he wondered how Chu Yunfan could be so terrifying. He even felt that if it were not for the magic armor he wore, Chu Yunfan’s hammer would have bashed him to pieces, and blood would have flowed out.","His entire body felt so sore and numb that he almost collapsed.","However, Chu Yunfan cared not for it. He continued to swing the hammer down.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","The sound of metal clashing rang out as Chu Yunfan knocked Bu Shan back. Ultimately, Bu Shan could only maintain his posture of holding the saber with both hands and could not move.","At this moment, he realized he was in big trouble. The strength Chu Yunfan displayed was too terrifying.","“Again! I’ll hammer you to your knees!” Chu Yunfan thundered. He rose from the ground like a phoenix and rushed into the air. His hammer smashed down.","Bang!","There was another explosion, and the entire reception hall shook violently. Bu Shan let out a muffled groan, and his saber was instantly sent flying, completely embedding into the wall.","Only the saber’s hilt was visible, and the armor that firmly protected him shattered inch by inch.","Bu Shan let out a blood-curdling scream, unable to withstand this tremendous force. His knees smashed into the ground, creating two huge holes. His skin tore as blood sprayed out, instantly","turning him into a bloodied man.","“Again!” Chu Yunfan roared. Then his hammer smashed down once again.","Bu Shan could not resist. His entire body was sent flying, tearing him apart mid-air.","This took a long time to describe, but it had only been a short period. Everything had been settled. The mighty man who had once made everyone despair could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1230,"title":"Chapter 1230 The Battle Wolves’ Surrender","paragraphs":["1230 The Battle Wolves’ Surrender","The entire reception hall was dead silent. Everyone looked like they could not recover from how quickly Chu Yunfan had killed Bu Shan.","They looked at Chu Yunfan, who had a calm expression. Killing Bu Shan was just a piece of cake for him. He would have killed Bu Shan much quicker if Bu Shan did not have his high-quality magic armor that blocked most of Chu Yunfan’s power.","Bu Shan had only touched the edge of the half-step Core Stage and had yet to truly step into that level. Moreover, even if he had stepped into the half-step Core Stage, he would still be no match for Chu Yunfan, so Chu Yunfan was not worried.","There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was the youngest on the list. It might even be unprecedented.","After killing Bu Shan, Chu Yunfan put away the saber and the hammer. Then he began to treat everyone’s injuries. With his help, everyone’s injuries quickly stabilized, especially the Eccentric Elder.","The poison in his body had been alleviated and suppressed. He could think of a way to force the remaining poison out himself.","The leader quickly said, “Thank you for saving us, Master Chu. Otherwise, our hundred years of foundation would’ve been destroyed!”","At this time, he no longer dared to treat himself as Chu Yunfan’s equal. Although Chu Yunfan saved him last time, he could still be on equal footing with Chu Yunfan with his cultivation.","However, he had come to realize that Chu Yunfan’s future was limitless. He dared not take advantage of his seniority, and thus, spoke in a heartfelt manner.","“That’s right. We would’ve died without your help today, Master Chu. If you need any help in the future, I will do anything for you!” the Eccentric Elder said.","“I thank you for saving me, Master Chu. If you need anything in the future, just let me know!”","Although the Child Elder had a strange demeanor, she understood the principle of repaying kindness. Moreover, Chu Yunfan’s strength was far above hers, so she dared not forget his help.","Liao Deyi quickly said, “Master Chu, I can’t thank you enough. I won’t even frown if you tell me to climb a mountain of knives or go through a sea of fire!”","“Everyone, you’re too polite. It’s just a small matter,” Chu Yunfan said.","Meanwhile, Wan Feihong was still kneeling in the corner. Although he was kneeling, he had seen the entire situation. At first, he was petrified that Bu Shan would kill him and that he could not fight back. Not to mention Chu Yunfan had forced him to kneel.","He could not block Bu Shan’s blade even at his peak. Moreover, he could not even speak or say his father’s name.","He never expected Bu Shan, who made him despair, to be no match for Chu Yunfan. Bu Shan was killed in just a few moves.","At that moment, he finally understood why he was no match for Chu Yunfan. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, even someone at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage was no match for him, let alone someone at the eight tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Wan Feihong could not even block a single slash from Bu Shan, let alone Chu Yunfan.","After watching Chu Yunfan kill the Twin Stars and Bu Shan as if he was cutting melons and vegetables, Wan Feihong became even more afraid. He was no longer as arrogant and despotic as before.","Wan Feihong completely understood that it was not that Chu Yunfan dared not kill him. He could even kill a great figure like Bu Shan, let alone him.","If Chu Yunfan killed him, he would have nowhere to cry. Kneeling was nothing compared to death. However, his eyes were still full of hatred. Chu Yunfan made him lose face for the rest of his life today, and he was afraid he could never wash away his shame.","“However, from how Bu Shan attacked, he doesn’t look like a rogue cultivator. He should have an inheritance,” Chu Yunfan said.","There was a considerable difference between rogue cultivators and those with inheritances. The internal energy and martial arts techniques they cultivated were often compatible with their divine arts, and their power would increase exponentially.","This was a fact.","Rogue cultivators were generally gathered from all over the place, and it was common for them not to be in the same system. Compared to experts with inheritance, experts of the same level were often no match for them.","Whether they had inheritance and foundation could be extremely important for cultivators.","The Eccentric Elder’s and the Child Elder’s brows went up. Bu Shan was already so terrifying. They wondered how terrifying his backer would be.","At the thought of this, the pair felt like things were getting increasingly troublesome.","‘Now that Bu Shan is dead, how could the existence behind him possibly let this go?’","At this moment, the leader realized he could no longer hide the matter, so he could only say, “That’s true. As far as I know, Bu Shan has received his master’s inheritance.”","Liao Deyi and the leader revealed a bitter smile. If possible, they were willing to reconcile with Bu Shan, even if they had to pay a considerable price. However, Bu Shan hated them and was unwilling to reconcile. He only wanted to slaughter the Battle Wolves. Thus, they had no choice but to resist.","The leader quickly said, “Therefore, we would like to ask you to lend us a hand, Master Chu. The Battle Wolves would be extremely grateful.”","After some thought, Chu Yunfan said, “This matter is acceptable. I killed Bu Shan. If his sect wants to pursue this matter, I won’t be able to escape. However, I also want to see what kind of person stands behind him.”","Chu Yunfan had nothing to worry about when he restored or improved his cultivation to a higher level, even if Bu Shan’s sect attacked him.","Since Chu Yunfan had agreed, the leader and Liao Deyi heaved a sigh of relief. The leader quickly said, “We’ll get someone to send you the 10 million low-grade spirit stones later. We’ll also do our best to collect the herbs you asked us to find as well, Master Chu.”","“Excellent,” Chu Yunfan said. Of course, he did not want to be a good person for no reason. He wanted to use the Battle Wolves’ channels to collect medicinal herbs and speed up his recovery."]},{"number":1231,"title":"Chapter 1231 A Talent Appears in Every Generation, Everyone’s Sentiment","paragraphs":["1231 A Talent Appears in Every Generation, Everyone’s Sentiment","After this incident, the Battle Wolves followed Chu Yunfan’s lead. Although he was unwilling to manage the Battle Wolves’ trifles, they dared not disobey him. After all, they had already offended the sect behind Bu Shan.","Although Chu Yunfan was the one who killed Bu Shan, his sect would not let Chu Yunfan off so quickly.","The Battle Wolves were the so-called number-one gang in Conglong City and seemed mighty, but they were outside the country’s system. They could not get past the Great Wei Kingdom’s protection. Once something happened, they would instantly be destroyed.","Such a situation had happened more than once or twice in the Great Wei Kingdom’s history. They had no other choice but to rely on Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan said, “Since Bu Shan is dead, I’ll leave if there’s nothing else. You guys should be able to deal with the motley crew outside.”","The leader said respectfully, “Okay, I won’t trouble you to do it, Master Chu.”","The Battle Wolves was the largest gang in Conglong City, and they had seen many situations. Without the threat of Bu Shan, the remaining motley crew formed by the various gangs was no match for the Battle Wolves.","If Chu Yunfan continued to stay here, it would be useless. He left swiftly. Although other sects were attacking the base outside, they could not stop him as he easily killed his way out.","Everyone could not help but sigh with relief when they saw him leave. His existence was undoubtedly a tremendous pressure on them. Even if he did not have ill intentions, the fact that he easily killed the Twin Stars and Bu Shan was enough to put massive pressure on them.","At this moment, Child Elder said, despite herself, “I didn’t expect to see such a powerful person in Conglong City.”","The Eccentric Elder sighed. “It’s the new generation replacing the old. There’s a new talent in every generation.”","He had to admit he was old and that the younger generation was terrifying.","“Master Chu has a bright future ahead of him. I believe this is just the beginning,” Liao Deyi said. He felt he was fortunate to have Chu Yunfan’s help. Otherwise, the Battle Wolves would crumble following their leader’s death.","One could say Chu Yunfan had saved the Battle Wolves twice.","Then the leader looked at Wan Feihong, who was still kneeling, and a helpless expression appeared on his face. He could not break Chu Yunfan’s seal and dared not do so.","What a joke.","The Battle Wolves depended on Chu Yunfan to survive, so they would not dare break the seal Chu Yunfan had left behind.","“What a powerful seal. I’ve studied the field of sealing arrays my whole life but never encountered something like this.” The Eccentric Elder looked at the seal on Wan Feihong and clicked his tongue in wonder.","Wan Feihong was highly embarrassed.","The leader said, “Deyi, go and inform the Inherited Sword Manor. Wan Feihong has offended Master Chu. We can’t handle this matter. Let the Manor Lord handle it personally.”","Liao Deyi had a helpless expression on his face. He had invited Wan Feihong to build a relationship with the Inherited Sword Manor and even wanted to rely on them. However, he discovered that Wan Feihong was of no help and even successfully dragged him down.","Wan Feihong’s eyes flashed with hope as he roared in his heart, ‘Just you wait. When my father arrives, I’ll make sure to kill all of you!’","At this moment, the duo exchanged glances. Previously, Chu Yunfan did not care about the Inherited Sword Manor. They thought Chu Yunfan was being too arrogant. However, it seemed Chu Yunfan had absolute confidence in himself.","Chu Yunfan soon returned to Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion. He continued cultivating in seclusion to recover and heal his injuries, ignoring the outside world.","On Pill Street, everyone talked about other gangs attacking the Battle Wolves. Many wondered whether or not the Battle Wolves could hold on this time.","When afternoon arrived, the latest news came from the base. The various sects had joined forces, but the Battle Wolves quickly defeated them.","The hidden experts of the Battle Wolves had killed the leader of the attacj. The Battle Wolves’ once again proved themselves with their incredible strength. It was worthy of being the number one gang in Conglong City.","Even if the other sects in Conglong City were to join forces, they would not be a match for the Battle Wolves. As the forces retreated, the battle that had shaken the entire city finally ended. In many people’s eyes, the Battle Wolves had reestablished their supreme power as the number one gang.","This was a day before anyone knew a guest would arrive at the Battle Wolves’ base.","The Battle Wolves were on guard against a great enemy because this person was none other than Wan Huang, the lord of Inherited Sword Manor, well-known all throughout the Great Wei Kingdom.","The Battle Wolves’ higher-ups, the leader, Liao Deyi, and the others gathered outside the reception hall. Wan Huang stood high and looked down at these people, full of anger.","He sneered at them and said, “How dare you! You were the ones who invited my son to help you, and this is how you repay him?! You’re courting death by making my son kneel in your sect!”","His words shook the Battle Wolves. This was a genuinely terrifying half-step Core. People of this level were rare, even in the Great Wei Kingdom. Each was a mighty lord.","Although there was only a difference of half a step between the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage and the half-step to Core Stage, the difference resembled heaven and earth.","The old leader thundered, “Lord Wan, Wan Feihong’s matter is beyond our control. If you’re here today to denounce us, we’ll fight until both sides suffer. Although the Battle Wolves aren’t as powerful as the Inherited Sword Manor, we can’t allow anyone to bully us!”","The barriers and arrays throughout the Battle Wolves’ base were activated. Various trump cards were also activated and aimed at Wan Huang. Although half-step Cores were terrifying, the Battle Wolves still had a way of making half-step Cores perish alongside them."]},{"number":1232,"title":"Chapter 1232 Chu Yunfan Is Already an Overlord","paragraphs":["1232 Chu Yunfan Is Already an Overlord","Although there were no half-step Cores in the Battle Wolves, they had developed for over a hundred years. Others would surely have overturned them if they did not have a few trump cards.","It was impossible to defeat a half-step Core. However, there were ways to die alongside them. This would cause many to be sorrowful as the people in their sect had to die with the other party. How helpless was that?","Still, they could do nothing about it. Unlike the Federation, where technology and martial arts were equally important and half-step Cores could be killed, those of the Spirit Realm had to pay a considerable price to do so.","The best way to deal with a half-step Core was to deal with the Core themselves. This was the Battle Wolves’ limit. If it were a Core, they would have no choice but to surrender.","Even if they launched a suicide attack, it would make no difference to a Core. One palm strike would kill half their numbers. Another palm strike would wipe out the entire Battle Wolves.","The Battle Wolves glared at Wan Huang. Although they could not compare to the Inherited Sword Manor, they were not the ones who sealed him or forced him to kneel. Yet, Wan Huang wanted to hold them accountable.","Wasn’t this a little too overbearing?","Wan Huang coldly glanced at the Battle Wolves’ leader and said, “You dare threaten me?”","The Battle Wolves’ leader said, “Lord Wan, I’m not threatening you. You know this is our last resort. But if things come to it, we won’t have any other choice besides attacking with all our might.","“We don’t want to go that far, but if it does, so be it. The Battle Wolf Gang is the foundation I’ve built. I’m not afraid!”","Wan Huang’s eyes flickered with a bright light as if he was evaluating the outcome of the attack and whether or not it was worth it. After a long time, he finally said, “I want to see my son first.”","After hearing Wan Huang’s words, the Battle Wolves heaved a sigh of relief. Wan Huang did not intend to perish with them. After all, his son was only sealed, not dead. If Wan Huang were to fight to the death over such trivial matters, the Inherited Sword Manor would have been destroyed long ago.","The leader quickly said, “Lord Wan, please follow me.”","Under the leader’s guidance, Wan Huang entered the reception hall. He was outraged when he saw his son trapped in the seal and forced to kneel. The divine power in his body surged, and his aura resembled that of an unsheathed sword.","“How bold!” Wan Huang roared in rage.","His aura suppressed the Battle Wolves’ upper echelons. They felt it was difficult for them to move. Even the leader could barely protect himself. This aura threatened to overwhelm him at any time.","“You’re all courting death!” Wan Huang roared.","Meanwhile, the kneeling Wan Feihong burst into tears when he saw his father. He finally saw hope.","The leader said stiffly, “Lord Wan, we didn’t do this. We won’t be afraid if you intend to die with us.”","After a long time, Wan Huang finally reigned in his aura. He did not want to die here, after all. Then a sword light unsheathed from his back and instantly blasted through the reception hall’s roof. The sword light descended with lightning speed and landed on the seal on Wan Feihong’s body.","Bam!","The sword was sent flying, followed by an explosion. Wan Huang’s expression finally changed. He initially thought the seal was nothing impressive and thought he would be able to break it.","However, it seemed that was not the case. This seal was highly mysterious. His sword would have broken an ordinary seal long ago. This was a technique that could break everything. No matter what technique one had, it would be broken under the suppression of absolute strength.","However, this seal seemed to have fused with nature, absorbing spirit energy from all directions to strengthen itself continuously. And his attack activated the seal, making it even stronger.","Wan Feihong’s pain increased and he screamed.","The leader said, “If you want to undo this seal, I’m afraid the one who erected it must undo it.”","He recalled Chu Yunfan’s words. If Wan Huang came, he should tell Wan Huang to find Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, he had already calmed down a little. He knew if he continued trying to destroy the seal, it would probably crush his son.","Liao Deyi almost rolled his eyes when he heard this. ‘Who’s the truly vicious one here? The first time Master Chu met your son, he wanted to kill Master Chu. That was truly lawless.’","Soon, the leader recounted the incident. He did not exaggerate anything and simply told the whole story.","Wan Huang was furious when he heard everything. He ignored the part about Wan Feihong wanting to kill Chu Yunfan. He only took into account that Chu Yunfan had suppressed Wan Feihong.","“Enough! Tell me, where is this Chu Yunfan? I want to rip him to shreds!” Wan Huang thundered.","After Liao Deyi told Wan Huang the location of Chu Yunfan’s Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion, everyone saw him disappear into the sky on a beam of light, heading straight for Chu Yunfan.","“Wan Huang is even more powerful than the legends say. I wonder if Master Chu can handle him,” Liao Deyi said worriedly.","The leader said, “Don’t worry. Master Chu is young, but he knows what he’s doing. Since he dared to suppress Wan Feihong, he must have had a well-thought-out plan.”","At this moment, he thought of how Chu Yunfan had quickly suppressed Bu Shan, who was almost at the half-step Core Stage. He had a terrifying guess in his heart.","‘Has Master Chu entered the half-step Core Stage?’","He dared not even consider that possibility before because it was simply too shocking. If his speculations were true, all their previous estimates would be overturned.","Chu Yunfan was not someone who would become an overlord in the future but already was one.","‘If that’s the case, that’s great. Let Master Chu teach Wan Huang a lesson,’ Liao Deyi thought."]},{"number":1233,"title":"Chapter 1233 Confrontation With Wan Huang","paragraphs":["1233 Confrontation With Wan Huang","Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion was as crowded as usual today. It did not sell many pills daily, but everything put on the shelves was always snatched up.","However, no one dared to act presumptuously here. Everyone knew the owner of this shop was not to be trifled with. Those who dared to cause trouble previously had died, regardless of their status or strength. None survived. Even those high and mighty figures, like the Battle Wolves’ deputy leader, had fallen.","So what if they were low-level mercenaries? Even those famous mercenary groups would not dare be impudent here.","Suddenly, a sword light swept across the sky. This light almost tore the entire world in half. Immediately after, a figure stepped from the light and appeared above Pill Street.","“Who is that? Why is he acting so arrogantly?”","The person had already drawn his sword at lightning speed before the mercenaries could figure out his identity. The light tore through the sky and slashed toward Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion.","Boom!","The light expanded to more than 1,000 feet and descended like a dragon. The entire sky shattered as it fell along this long rainbow. The barriers throughout Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion were instantly activated.","However, the level of these barriers was too low. They were barriers Wang Zhao had set up back then. They all instantly shattered, like a hot knife through butter. It was cut open without any difficulty.","Boom!","When the light hit the barrier, a massive explosion went off. The light hit the barrier, but the light was slowly cracking. This attack was earth-shattering, and its wave affected the entire Pill Street.","Many mercenaries joined forces to set up a barrier to prevent everyone from getting injured by the attack’s aftershock.","“Who is that?!” Many people looked at the sky in shock.","“What a powerful sword intent. A sword cultivator of this level is rare, even in the Great Wei Kingdom!”","Many people were shocked by the strength of the sword intent. They could feel the terror of this from afar. Not to mention taking on this sword personally, even the aftershock was enough to destroy them.","“Who is it then?”","Many people were guessing.","“I think I’ve seen him before. He’s the manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor!”","Finally, someone recognized this middle-aged man. He was the overlord of the entire Great Wei Kingdom, the manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor.","In the Great Wei Kingdom, only experts who were half-step Cores and above could be the overlord of a region. Even the Great Wei Kingdom’s officials were unwilling to provoke such people.","Take the Battle Wolves, for example. Although it was the number one gang in Conglong City and seemed awe-inspiring, the Great Wei Kingdom’s officials could easily destroy them.","However, if there was a half-step Core guarding the place, then even the Great Wei Kingdom would have to be wary of them. Only a figure of this level could be an overlord.","After confirming the person’s identity, everyone stopped making a fuss. With his reputation as the manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor, it was not surprising this man had such shocking sword cultivation.","He was a figure who stood at the peak of the entire Great Wei Kingdom.","However, many were even more curious why such a person wanted to find trouble with Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion’s owner. Who exactly was this owner?","Many also wanted to see how strong Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion’s owner was and whether or not he could stop Inherited Sword Manor’s lord.","When Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion appeared out of thin air, countless people made guesses about Chu Yunfan’s background. Still, no one could figure it out. He did not even need to use any fancy moves and simply slapped the people on the street. They could not tell his background from such simple moves.","This was an excellent opportunity.","“B*stard, get out here! Break!” Wan Huang shouted as he failed to cut Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion in half.","The entire Pill Street and the martial arts experts nearby were alarmed. However, they quickly recognized Wan Huang. Even the officials of Conglong City were unwilling to provoke him and did not care.","According to the agreement between the Great Wei Kingdom and these experts, they would not interfere in the grudges between these experts as long as it did not affect the people.","It was just that there were more experts from all walks of life in the surrounding area. They set up barriers one by one to protect Pill Street so it would not get destroyed in the battle.","A figure dressed in black slowly walked out of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion and approached the sky step by step. In a clear voice, he said, “You made me wait for an entire day. You’re too slow.”","His body shone with a jade-like light.","“Were you the one who sealed my son, you b*stard?” Wan Huang gritted his teeth and looked at the young man before him. However, he found it difficult to hide the shock in his eyes.","Chu Yunfan looked too young. He was only in his twenties but had such achievements. Even Wan Huang, gnashing his teeth in hatred, could not help but feel shocked.","“That’s right. He wanted to kill me. So, I’m giving him a minor punishment,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“My son can’t kill you even if he tried, but you humiliated him. You’re simply going too far!” Wan Huang snorted coldly.","Chu Yunfan sneered and looked at Wan Huang. “If my strength was inferior to your son’s, would I deserve to die then?”","Wan Huang did not answer, but it was evident from his expression that if Chu Yunfan’s strength had been inferior to Wan Feihong’s, he was of the opinion that Chu Yunfan deserved to die.","“I won’t waste my breath on you. Will you undo the seal or not?!” Wan Huang shouted.","“That depends on whether or not you have the ability to make me.”"]},{"number":1234,"title":"Chapter 1234 The Manor Lord of Inherited Sword Manor Flees in Fear","paragraphs":["1234 The Manor Lord of Inherited Sword Manor Flees in Fear","Wan Huang gritted his teeth and said, “Excellent!”","The divine power in his body turned into a wave that surged up. Instantly, it turned into a vast sword domain that swept outward. This was the power of a half-step Core.","At this moment, many mercenaries retreated from Pill Street. Although there were barriers protecting the place, they were only effective against Divines.","Wan Huang was a half-step Core. If he were to be careless, the entire barrier would be broken through.","The sword domain spread, making everyone feel like a sharp sword was dangling above their heads. It was terrifying. Wan Huang was the true god in this sword domain.","Countless sword light transformed into sharp swords that surrounded him, resembling countless guards. Even true ancient gods could not compare to this.","“Come forth!” Wan Huang shouted.","With a flip of his palm, an ancient greenish-bronze sword appeared in his hand. The sword emitted a faint light but soon erupted with a shocking light, giving off a shocking pressure.","“What a great sword cultivation. It’s terrifying!”","Everyone felt their scalps go numb. They could not help but exclaim in shock as they felt like a sword could fall on their heads from above at any moment.","Many Divines could not help but change looks with each other. This was the power of a half-step Core. No wonder he could become an expert that could shake an entire region in the Great Wei Kingdom.","There was a fundamental difference between him and a Divine.","“Cutter of Evil!”","Wan Huang’s sword slashed down. He instantly resembled the sun between heaven and earth. Rainbow light shot up into the sky, like a god of the sword path.","However, Chu Yunfan had no intention of escaping. Instead, he sneered and withdrew his fist to his abdomen, facing the light that swept over like a tide. Countless multicolored lights boiled behind him. The golden light was brilliant and turned into a huge asura.","It was the Asura Punch!","It had been a long time since Chu Yunfan had used this move. Other opponents were unworthy to witness this move, but Wan Huang, an expert of this level, was enough for Chu Yunfan to use his full strength.","Boom!","The asura behind Chu Yunfan punched into the endless sword wave. The fist’s force engulfed the light that filled the sky. The wave brought about by this punch was even faster than when it came, rolling back toward Wan Huang.","Wan Huang’s pupils contracted slightly, and countless sword lights surged around his body. Like a tidal wave, he slashed at Chu Yunfan again.","However, Chu Yunfan’s punch resembled the fist of creation, sweeping through everything. Any obstacles in front of this punch shattered, and Wan Huang’s sword lights were utterly vulnerable.","Sword talismans burst from Wan Huang’s body, shining with extreme light. Compared to the previous attack, Wan Huang’s incoming one was terrifying. It was more than one level higher.","He could split the entire sky into two at a scale visible to the naked eye. It looked horrifying.","When everyone saw this sword, they hurriedly fled. Once this sword landed, it would be enough to destroy the area. Compared to ordinary Divines, half-step Cores had already learned to concentrate their power on one point and then release it completely.","Still, Chu Yunfan had no intention of escaping. He even stepped forward as countless golden lights spread from his hands. He tore apart the terrifying sword light. This time, people finally saw what it looked like when a sword light was torn apart mid-air.","“The owner of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion is amazing!”","“Did he tear apart the sword light with his bare hands? What kind of technique is that?”","“Is Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion’s owner a body cultivator?”","“It’s my turn!” Chu Yunfan’s body flashed as he stepped on a ball of lightning and charged toward Wan Huang.","Unknown when, he threw a punch that turned into a golden roc and flew across the sky. It was so fast that everyone only saw a golden light. Chu Yunfan’s punch tore through everything and arrived before Wan Huang.","Wan Huang only felt his vision blur, and Chu Yunfan had already appeared before him. He only had time to rely on his instincts to slash downward.","However, this sudden sword attack was no match for Chu Yunfan. Wan Huang could not withstand it and got hit.","Boom!","After a loud explosion, he was sent flying like a kite with a broken string. He finally managed to stabilize himself, but his face was pale, and a large hole had appeared in his armor.","Although he had the armor’s protection, a bloody hole still appeared on his body. His expression was solemn. Chu Yunfan’s punch might have pierced him if he did not have the armor.","Wan Huang was furious. Even with his strength, he was no match for Chu Yunfan. He could not kill Chu Yunfan or save his son. For the first time, he felt powerless. Wan Huang had never felt this way since stepping into the half-step Core Stage.","Simultaneously, he looked at Chu Yunfan with shock. Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties. Even if he had started cultivating since he was in his mother’s womb, he should not possess such terrifying strength.","There were countless geniuses in the Great Wei Kingdom, but no one had ever heard of someone who had reached Chu Yunfan’s level, let alone seen one of such caliber.","‘Has anyone ever seen an overlord in his twenties?! It’s unheard of! No wonder he didn’t care when he saw me descending!’","However, Chu Yunfan gave Wan Huang no time to catch his breath. He took a step forward and instantly rained down punch after punch. Each punch seemed to surpass the speed of light and fell on Wan Huang like a meteor shower.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Soon after, everyone saw Wan Huang was covered in blood as he flew away miserably. The armor on his body had shattered into pieces. Chu Yunfan had almost beaten him to death.","Wan Huang noticed the situation was not in his favor and took advantage of the time Chu Yunfan sent him flying to flee. Then, he spat out a mouthful of blood and activated a secret technique before fleeing the city, leaving a bloody trail in the sky.","Everyone was in a daze as they watched the scene before them. The renowned manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor had fled amid a battle."]},{"number":1235,"title":"Chapter 1235 Another Wave Rising, an Enemy Appears","paragraphs":["1235 Another Wave Rising, an Enemy Appears","Everyone watching the battle was dumbfounded.","Wan Huang, one of the top experts in the Great Wei Kingdom, had fled mid-battle. They would not have believed it if they had not seen it.","Even Chu Yunfan was a little dumbfounded. He did not expect Wan Huang to run away so quickly, leaving no chance for him to give chase.","However, he did not chase after Wan Huang because he had no reason to kill him. Since Wan Huang had run away, Chu Yunfan decided to let him be. The battle ended with Wan Huang’s escape, but the waves it caused had just begun fermenting.","If Chu Yunfan dared not provoke this matter, and only the people in Pill Street knew about it, perhaps everyone in Conglong also knew.","Half-step Cores were a high and mighty group in Great Wei. Besides a few Cores, no half-step Core could be rivaled.","These people were listed in the Great Wei Kingdom’s government. Any one of them was a dangerous person. Now, another person had made it onto the list, Chu Yunfan, Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion’s owner.","However, Chu Yunfan was usually low-key and lived in seclusion. It was not that he had not appeared before, but only a few people had ever seen him. Few people knew his identity, but most did not. Or rather, they could not discover him in such a short period.","Now, he had finally shown up. One could only say he shocked the entire Pill Street but had not attracted the attention of significant forces. Now, he had defeated Wan Huang. This battle shook Conglong, and even the whole of Great Wei.","Chu Yunfan could no longer keep a low profile as his identity would be known sooner or later. He just needed time.","This matter shocked the Battle Wolves. The others were unclear about the situation, but Wan Huang suddenly initiated a fight with Chu Yunfan. Only the Battle Wolves knew what was happening.","Even Liao Deyi hoped Chu Yunfan would teach Wan Huang a lesson, but when the former beat the latter into fleeing, the Battle Wolves’ upper echelons were dumbfounded.","After hearing the news, the Battle Wolves’ leader said, “We’ve underestimated Master Chu. His strength is probably second to none in Conglong.”","Liao Deyi said, “That’s right. With Master Chu’s protection, even Bu Shan’s sect can’t be so arrogant.”","Many spies appeared outside Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion after the battle. However, no one dared to approach it casually. Everyone knew a top half-step Core was guarding it.","Chu Yunfan did not bother with these spies. Although these spies came for him, he did not care about them. He was about to continue his secluded cultivation when Chu Hongcai brought him some news.","The old madam would be celebrating her 150th birthday in three days, so Chu Yunfan was to prepare for it.","Chu Yunfan recalled that the old madam had turned 150 in the blink of an eye. Of course, she was also a Divine. Although she did not reveal her cultivation level and was not too brilliant, she had lived longer than most after entering this level.","After some thought, Chu Yunfan had a plan. The best gift for the old madam was the Longevity Pilll, which could extend a person’s lifespan. After all, he had once made one of these pills for the Heavenly Dragon Elder.","Later, he made some more and left them for his parents. Now, he had to make another. Although he only had three days, the Battle Wolves dared not underestimate what he had ordered.","In just a day, Chu Yunfan had already prepared the needed ingredients for the Longevity Pill. Although these medicinal ingredients were uncommon, they were not that rare either.","While Chu Yunfan refined the Longevity Pill in seclusion, a mountain of corpses was scattered all over one of the branches of the Battle Wolves. These were corpses of hundreds of Battle Wolves.","An older man in black with white hair and a youthful face raised his arm and grabbed the neck of an altar master of the Battle Wolves, suddenly snapping it.","“Chu Yunfan? Marquis Zhongxin’s Chu Clan? How dare you kill my disciple. I’ll make you pay!” the black-robed man said with a sinister smile. He had already killed the entire branch by himself.","Meanwhile, a square-faced old man in white walked over slowly and said, “The sect leader is unhappy about the operation’s failure. He told us to destroy the marquis’s family to warn the monkeys.”","“Hmph, I’ve already made arrangements. I want to spare Marquis Zhongxin!” The black-robed man coldly snorted.","“I heard it’ll be Marquis Zhongxin’s great madam’s 150th birthday. I want to turn their birthday banquet into a funeral banquet!”","The square-faced man in white frowned and said, “I’m afraid this Chu Yunfan isn’t easy to deal with. He even defeated Wan Huang of Inherited Sword Manor.”","The black-robed man’s expression changed as he said coldly, “Wan Huang is nothing. Any one of us can kill him since he’s just an empty husk of a man. If we join forces, Chu Yunfan will still die even if he has extraordinary abilities.”","“If that’s the case, I’ll go prepare. But how do you plan to deal with the Battle Wolves?” the square-faced man in white said coldly.","“Let’s not bother with them first. What if Chu Yunfan finds out about us and escapes? I must ensure he dies without a burial place. Let’s not alert the enemy.” The black-robed man quickly decided.","He paused and continued, “After dealing with Chu Yunfan, we’ll uproot the Battle Wolves. They’re puny, so it will not be too late to crush them.”","The pair looked at each other. In the blink of an eye, a barrier covered the branch. No one knew the inside had become Hell, and no one was alive."]},{"number":1236,"title":"Chapter 1236 Chang Shenghong Wants to Slap His Face?","paragraphs":["1236 Chang Shenghong Wants to Slap His Face?","The entire Marquis Zhongxin household was lively on this day as the old matriarch celebrated her 150th birthday. This was a significant event for the entire residence.","Under such circumstances, no one dared to forget the matriarch’s birthday. Various gifts had been delivered a few days ago, filling the entire warehouse. It was close to noon, and when the birthday banquet officially began, countless guests of high status arrived.","As a junior, Chu Yunfan had rushed over early in the morning. He was not interested in other people but was still concerned about the old madam’s birthday. Unlike before, he had little presence in the residence.","Many knew he was related to the old madam. However, things had changed.","His popularity in the Chu clan continued rising since defeating Chang Shenghong and making the Chu clan proud. He would have become the most popular candidate had he not publicly announced that he was not interested in the heir position. Even though he had given up on the fight for the position, it did not make everyone look down on him.","After Chu Yunfan displayed his strength, many thought he had potential. He could still make his own even if he did not rely on Marquis Zhongxin. This was what countless people cared about most.","He stood among the juniors while the old madam sat on the main seat and accepted everyone’s congratulations. Chu Yaowei sat beside the old madam and would only stand up to welcome guests with status.","Opposite Chu Yunfan was Chang Shenghong, Chu Xiujie, and the others, looking at him with gritted teeth. Chang Shenghong felt he had been slapped in the face in front of everyone. It was the greatest humiliation of his life.","Chu Xiujie even thought he had lost the heir position because of Chu Yunfan. He always thought the position should have been his, but it was impossible because of Chu Yunfan. He wished he could kill Chu Yunfan with just his gaze.","Chu Yunfan did not care about these hateful gazes because he knew they could not hurt him.","At this moment, Chang Shenghong glared at Chu Yunfan before speaking to the matriarch, “Grandaunt, Duke Ning from the Imperial Court has prepared a birthday gift for you. This is the list of gifts. Please take a look.”","Then, he handed over a list of gifts.","Beside the matriarch, Chu Yaowei took the list and looked at it. He could not help but reveal a surprised expression. He had to admit that the gifts on this list were precious. He casually glanced at it. With his cultivation, he knew the gifts on this list alone were worth more than three million low-grade spirit stones.","Duke Ning was rich compared to others who only had tens of thousands of low-grade spirit stones.","When the servant boy read the list aloud, many people at the birthday banquet gasped. They had long heard that the ten dukes were extremely wealthy, which now seemed accurate.","This gift from Duke Ning was like comparing gold to rocks. No one could compare to it.","“He’s so rich. Duke Ning is indeed powerful.”","“This is to be expected. The matriarch was from Duke Ning’s household. Ultimately, she’s one of them.”","“This can’t be described with just our people. Duke Ning is so generous.”","Chang Shenghong did not leave after Chu Yunfan defeated him because of this moment. A smug smile appeared on his face as he listened to the crowd. He finally felt proud.","‘Even if you are more powerful, Chu Yunfan, so what? Do you see this? This is the wealth of Duke Ning. It’s not something a poor person like you can compare to.’","Beside Chu Yunfan, Chu Hongcai gritted his teeth. In his opinion, Chang Shenghong intentionally did this to anger them. However, even he could not help but marvel at Duke Ning’s outstanding generosity.","Millions of low-grade spirit stones were an unimaginable astronomical figure for ordinary people. If it were him, he did not know how many years it would take to save up this amount.","On the contrary, Chu Yunfan, beside him, looked calm. He was not shocked by this list of luxurious gifts at all.","“Thank you. How are your grandfather and father?” the matriarch naked with a satisfied smile.","To her, perhaps she did not need so many things, but it was a prestigious thing for her family to send such lavish birthday gifts all the same.","She had gained a lot of favors. She had no ambition in martial arts cultivation and was already very old. She was in the winter of her life, so she valued her reputation much more instead.","At this moment, Chang Shenghong said in high spirits, “My father says he’s sorry he can’t attend your birthday banquet. He could only present some small gifts. He hopes you won’t feel too disappointed.”","Although they were just small gifts, it was evident no one would treat them as such.","“Oh, don’t worry. Your father works hard for the country and shares the Emperor’s burden, so he doesn’t have to worry about an old woman like me. It’s a sin if he does,” the matriarch said smilingly.","“Duke Ning’s household has already presented our birthday gift. I heard you love Chu Yunfan very much, so I wonder what gift he will present you.”","Although Chang Shenghong was talking to the matriarch, his eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan. Many who knew about the grudges between the duo instantly felt enlightened.","‘So, Chang Shenghong is waiting here for Chu Yunfan.’","Chang Shenghong represented Duke Ning when presenting this birthday gift. It was the most important one as no one else could compare. Not even the other dignitaries.","Even the wealthy were like this, let alone a mere Chu Yunfan.","He was not even the heir of Marquis Zhongxin. He was just a candidate for the position. How much money could he have? It was already good enough if he could have tens of thousands of low-grade spirit stones.","This was Chang Shenghong’s killer move."]},{"number":1237,"title":"Chapter 1237 One Shock After Another (1)","paragraphs":["1237 One Shock After Another (1)","Chang Shenghong had been suppressing his anger, waiting for this day to slap Chu Yunfan’s face. He had been waiting for this day since Chu Yunfan taught him a lesson.","Chu Yunfan had easily defeated him before, showing the incomparable difference in strength between the two. Chang Shenghong knew it was impossible to defeat Chu Yunfan for revenge. This was his only chance to slap Chu Yunfan in the face.","There was no mistake in this. After all, Chu Yunfan was just a poor boy. Before he became a candidate for the heir position, he was just an ordinary member of the Chu clan.","‘How could Chu Yunfan have any savings? It was probably measly compared to ordinary people’s birthday gifts, let alone a superb one like mine.’","After thinking this, Chang Shenghong looked at Chu Yunfan smugly as if he could see Chu Yunfan making a fool of himself the next second.","At this moment, Chu Hongcai said despite himself, “Chang Shenghong, why are you so smug? This birthday gift is from Duke Ning, not something you prepared yourself. Why are you behaving as if you were the one who gave it?”","Chu Yaowei’s expression darkened. He thought Chang Shenghong had learned his lesson after the last blow. He had not expected this not to be the case at all and that Chang Shenghong still wanted to cause trouble.","If it were any other day, he would have turned a blind eye to it. However, today was his mother’s 150th birthday banquet. If Chang Shenghong wanted to cause trouble at this time, it was equivalent to slapping his face in public.","Was this not publicly embarrassing the Chu clan?","The kind smile on the matriarch’s face disappeared. She was not stupid and could understand Chang Shenghong’s intentions.","‘He wants to use this birthday gift to embarrass Chu Yunfan.’","She thought Chang Shenghong have a change of heart after learning his lesson, but now she realized she had overestimated him. All her life, the most important thing to her was her reputation, but Chang Shenghong wanted to tarnish it. How could she let this slide?","As her anger rose up, a voice sounded from outside, “Conglong City’s Alchemist Association branch president, Kong Buyi, has arrived!”","The announcement shocked everyone, especially Chu Yaowei, who shot up from his seat. The Chu clan’s matriarch’s birthday was today, so only the Chu clan’s relatives or vassals with interests related to the Chu clan would attend. The other prominent families would only send over representatives and give gifts. After all, the matriarch’s birthday was not Chu Yaowei’s, so it was not that big of an occasion.","As for the branch president of Conglong’s Alchemist Association, it was even more so. He was in charge of the entire Alchemist Association. Regarding status in the entire city, he was a unique existence. Compared to Chu Yaowei, he was only higher, not lower.","It was good enough if the Alchemist Association had only sent an elder to congratulate them, and the etiquette was also thorough. But now, Kong Buyi himself had personally come, instantly stunning everyone. This was too much of a show of respect.","Chu Yaowei quickly stood up. He dared not be arrogant before Kong Buyi, so he hurriedly said, “Please, come in!”","Soon, Kong Buyi appeared before everyone.","“President Kong, you’re in person. The entire Chu clan is honored,” Chu Yaowei said.","The two sides were naturally incomparable.","Kong Buyi quickly said, “It’s nothing. I just returned from the capital today. I heard the old madam was celebrating her birthday, but I didn’t prepare much. I only have this. Please don’t take offense to my simple offering.”","Then he revealed a jade box and opened it. There was a bottle of pills in the box.","“These are some Hundred Herbs Soul Restoring Pills I personally made. It’s quite effective in treating psychological injuries,” Kong Buyi said, “I was in a hurry so this is the only thing I could prepare.”","As soon as Kong Buyi finished, everyone gasped. They were knowledgeable people. Of course, they had heard of the Hundred Herbs Soul Restoring Pills that Kong Buyi had made. They knew it was tough to find something like this anywhere.","Physical injuries were nothing to Divines. They could even reattach severed limbs and recover in no time. Even if they were only slightly injured, psychological injuries were difficult to treat. This was what everyone felt was the most troublesome.","However, this Hundred Herbs Soul Restoring Pill was made for psychological injuries. Usually, Divines might not even be able to obtain even one pill even if they spent thousands of gold.","However, Kong Buyi had brought an entire bottle of them as a gift. How could this be a small gift like what Kong Buyi had said? After all, these Hundred Herbs Soul Restoring Pills were worth over a million low-grade spirit stones.","To an extent, it was even more valuable than the birthday gift Duke Ning had presented. After all, Duke Ning’s gift was only expensive, but these pills were things many could not buy with money. It was a life-saving pill at a critical moment.","Moreover, the matriarch was from Duke Ning’s household, so it was customary for Duke Ning to be generous. Kong Buyi had no relationship with Marquis Zhongxin’s household, yet he was willing to spend so much money.","This was what made everyone feel incredulous. They wondered what he was after.","“I hope you won’t take offense to my small gift, Martriach,” Kong Buyi said.","“President Kong, this is too valuable!” Chu Yaowei quickly said.","He could accept the gifts from Duke Ning because they were relatives. This situation utterly different. They were not related to Kong Buyi in any way. If he accepted this gift, he would owe Kong Buyi a huge favor.","The matriarch was very clear about the situation. She said, “That’s right. Today is just my birthday. Isn’t this too grand, President Kong?”","“You are too polite. This is just a little gift. I’m delighted the two of you don’t mind,” Kong Buyi quickly said.","Suddenly, he turned to look at Chu Yunfan and added, “Little Friend Chu, don’t just look at me. Come out and say something.”","Kong Buyi’s words confused everyone as they wondered what this had to do with Chu Yunfan.","Did they know each other?"]},{"number":1238,"title":"Chapter 1238 One Shock After Another (2)","paragraphs":["1238 One Shock After Another (2)","Everyone was confused by Kong Buyi’s words. Why did it seem like Kong Buyi knew Chu Yunfan?","And Kong Buyi addressed Chu Yunfan as “Little Friend.” This was clearly a sign of lowering his status to be on the same level as Chu Yunfan.","‘Chu Yunfan’s possible refusal is making Kong Buyi nervous? What kind of logic is this?!’ Chu Yaowei was completely dumbfounded. He could not understand what was going on.","‘What is wrong with the world? Why is it becoming more and more incomprehensible?","‘I must be mistaken somehow!’","Chu Yaowei soon came to a conclusion. He must have made a mistake. Kong Buyi was the president of the Alchemist Association. Even when Kong Buyi was talking to him, he was neither servile nor overbearing. How could he show any signs of fawning over Chu Yunfan?","This was completely illogical!","At this moment, everyone’s eyes were on Chu Yunfan and Kong Buyi, especially Chang Shenghong and Chu Xiujie, who looked as if they had seen a ghost.","What sort of figure was Kong Buyi? He was a great figure who could stand on equal footing with many marquises. Even if these younger generations wanted to meet Kong Buyi, he would not be bothered.","Even though Chang Shenghong was related to Duke Ning, it was nothing in front of Kong Buyi. He was the president of the Alchemist Association of a large city.","But now, he was lowering himself to Chu Yunfan’s level. No matter how one looked at it, it was very strange.","Beside Chu Yunfan, Chu Hongcai’s face was flushed with excitement. Kong Buyi was a big shot that he didn’t dare to meet. Now, Kong Buyi was friendly with Chu Yunfan, who was of the same generation as him. Brother Fan was simply awesome.","Chu Yunfan hesitated for a moment. He immediately understood why Kong Buyi would be so humble in front of everyone, and it wasn’t just because he was a senior alchemist.","Even as a senior alchemist, he would at most be on the same level as Kong Buyi. Even if Kong Buyi wanted to build a relationship with him, he would not have to do so.","Kong Buyi probably knew about his battle with Wan Huang.","Just the identity of a senior alchemist wasn’t enough to make Kong Buyi like this, but if Chu Yunfan was also a half-step Core, it would be completely different.","If an ordinary person could do any one of these, it could be said that it was something worth bragging about for a lifetime. In the entire Great Wei Kingdom, they would be powerful characters.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan had done it in such a short period of time. Judging from his age, it could be said that he would definitely become an alchemy expert and a Core in the future.","Now, many people thought that Kong Buyi was trying to make friends, but in reality, he was trying to cozy up to someone in advance.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised anymore. He said, “Since President Kong has such kind intentions, you shouldn’t reject it, Matriarch. Although it looks precious, to an alchemist, it’s very cheap.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Kong Buyi’s face revealed a hint of joy. He quickly said, “That’s right, that’s right. Actually, the really expensive thing is the labor cost. To me, it’s just some time spent. It’s not worth mentioning as long as you like it, Matriarch.”","Seeing that Chu Yunfan did not refute, Kong Buyi finally heaved a sigh of relief. Just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, Kong Buyi had gone to the Imperial Capital to specifical report Chu Yunfan’s matter to the headquarters.","However, he hadn’t taken Chu Yunfan seriously. After all, he was also a senior alchemist, so he still had some reservations. But when he returned, he heard a series of things about Chu Yunfan. Others didn’t know who the owner of Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion was, but the Alchemist Association did. They even knew that it was Chu Yunfan from the beginning.","However, at that time, he only wanted to provide some convenience for Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would become more and more terrifying?","In particular, he had defeated Inherited Sword Manor’s Manor Lord, Wan Huang, in battle. No, to be precise, Wan Huang had been beaten by Chu Yunfan and was forced to flee in a sorry state. He had almost been killed by Chu Yunfan.","When this matter came out, the entire Alchemist Association of Conglong City was shocked. Although alchemists were often martial arts experts, they were only ordinary ones.","At Chu Yunfan’s age, he was actually a master of alchemy and a martial arts expert at the same time and had extremely shocking achievements in both fields.","If this continued, Chu Yunfan would very likely become an alchemy expert and a Core in the future. No matter which of these identities he achieved, he would become a famous figure in the entire Great Wei Kingdom. With just a stomp of his foot, the Great Wei Kingdom would tremble.","If he could do both, he would probably become an unprecedented existence.","This time, even Kong Buyi could not be bothered to continue being reserved, and hurriedly took advantage of this excuse to express his goodwill. Fortunately, although Chu Yunfan had seen through his intentions, he did not reject his goodwill. Chu Yunfan seemed to be agreeable.","This made Kong Buyi heave a sigh of relief.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had actually agreed, Chu Yaowei and the matriarch felt that something was not right. Why did they feel that something was wrong? From the looks of it, why did it feel like Kong Buyi was going to come up with something and was afraid that Chu Yunfan would be unhappy?","As for Chu Yunfan, he was the one being flattered, but he still hesitated and thought it over.","No matter how they looked at it, it was strange. However, the two of them were not idiots. How could they not see that Kong Buyi was probably here for Chu Yunfan, and the matriarch’s birthday celebration was just an excuse?","Thinking of this, the matriarch didn’t refuse because she believed that Chu Yunfan would do things with restraint.","“In that case, I won’t stand on ceremony. Men, take President Kong’s gift,” the matriarch said, “President Kong, please take a seat.”","Kong Buyi finally sat down.","Chang Shenghong was still a little confused. He had been threatening Chu Yunfan just a moment ago. How did the situation change so suddenly? No matter how he looked at it, the limelight had inexplicably fallen on Chu Yunfan.","Although he didn’t understand what was going on, seeing Chu Yunfan’s nonchalant attitude made him gnash his teeth in hatred.","“Chu” Just as Chang Shenghong was about to continue making things difficult for Chu Yunfan, there was another announcement.","“The president of the Situ Merchant Guild has arrived with his beloved daughter, Situ Miaoyi!”","Another commotion went through the crowd. Another big shot had personally arrived.","Everyone was a little dumbfounded. What was going on today? Normally, these big shots would not appear easily. But today, they appeared one after another!"]},{"number":1239,"title":"Chapter 1239 One Shock After Another (3)","paragraphs":["1239 One Shock After Another (3)","Situ Ye, the president of the Situ Merchant Guild!","He was the most influential figure in Conglong and had a great influence throughout the entire city.","Some people even said that he was a strong contender for the next president of the Conglong Merchant Guild. It could even be said that he was almost certain to land the position.","Such a person was a person of great importance in Conglong. Even compared to Marquis Zhongxin, he was a big shot who could be on equal footing.","If Situ Ye came personally to celebrate the birthday of Marquis Zhongxin himself, it would be a great honor. After all, there were so many influential people in the city. If he had to come personally to celebrate everyone’s birthday, he wouldn’t have to do anything else for a year. Just attending birthday banquets and giving gifts would be tiring enough.","Therefore, although Marquis Zhongxin had sent out invitations as usual, he never thought that these important figures would actually come. It was already very good if they sent a representative. However, Situ Ye had come personally and even brought his beloved daughter.","Everyone looked at Kong Buyi again and felt that something was strange today. These big shots had actually arrived one after another.","Kong Buyi was stunned for a moment. He did not expect Situ Ye to come today. However, he immediately thought of something. He looked at Chu Yunfan and immediately understood.","Situ Ye was the same as him. He had come for Chu Yunfan. If it was just the marquis himself, he would not have such a big reputation to make them come personally despite their busy schedule. However, he did not know how Situ Ye had found out about Chu Yunfan.","Kong Buyi was no longer surprised after he understood all of this. He sat down on his seat and leisurely looked up at the sky as if all of this had nothing to do with him.","Soon, a middle-aged man with bright eyes appeared in front of everyone with a young girl in a gorgeous long dress.","“Hello, President Situ!”","“President Situ, long time no see!”","“Hello, President Situ. Nice to meet you!”","Along the way, many people spoke up to curry favor with Situ Ye.","From a certain point of view, Situ Ye was even more popular than Marquis Zhongxin. Although Marquis Zhongxin had a high position and authority, he was not as direct as Situ Ye.","Situ Ye was known to be a golden goose. As long as he gave them a little guidance, they would immediately become rich.","However, Situ Ye only smiled politely and nodded before walking over.","“Greetings, Matriarch. Greetings, Marquis Zhongxin,” Situ Ye said.","Situ Miaoyi also called out sweetly, “Good day, Marquis Zhongxin. May you be blessed, Matriarch.”","“Good! Very good!”","When the Matriarch saw Situ Miaoyi, she smiled happily. She liked Situ Miaoyi very much. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have insisted on letting Situ Miaoyi and Chu Yunfan go on a blind date.","She looked at Situ Miaoyi and then at Chu Yunfan. She felt that the two of them were a perfect couple.","Situ Miaoyi’s smile was as beautiful as a flower, and it never stopped. On the other hand, Chu Yunfan felt uncomfortable because of the matriarch’s inexplicable smile. He was not stupid and quickly understood the matriarch’s thoughts.","Although there was a huge age difference between him and the matriarch, everyone in the residence knew that she was raising Chu Yunfan as her son because he looked exactly like her late youngest son.","All the mothers in the world had the same thought. They couldn’t wait for their children to get married and have children as soon as possible.","Chu Yunfan, who had already experienced this on Earth, could not understand, but he did not intend to expose it. Today was the matriarch’s birthday. So long as she was happy, he went along with it.","“Brother Situ, today is my mother’s birthday. I’m sorry to have troubled you to attend.”","Although Situ Ye didn’t have a noble title, Chu Yaowei didn’t dare to act arrogantly in front of Situ Ye. Marquis Zhongxin’s residence and Situ Merchant Guild had some business dealings, and they were people he wanted to rope in.","“Brother Chu, what are you saying? With our friendship, is there such need to say such things?” Situ Ye quickly said.","On the contrary, Chu Yaowei was a little confused. The relationship between them was just so-so. But with what Situ Ye, others would think they’re very close.","“I came in a hurry today, so I didn’t bring any generous gifts. I only brought a painting. I hope you won’t mind, Brother Chu.”","Situ Ye stretched out his hand, and the air shimmered. A painting appeared in his hand. It was an ancient painting that had yellowed. In this ancient painting, there was only a figure practicing punches.","Everyone’s eyes blurred. They felt that this figure had actually come alive. In front of everyone’s eyes, it had transformed into a human figure and was currently punching.","This set of fist techniques was earth-shattering, and streams of fist intent rolled toward them.","They were so shocked that they took a step back. Only then did they realize that the illusion in front of them had suddenly disappeared. The painting was just that painting. It was nothing more.","However, their eyes were burning.","There was no doubt that there were thousands of paintings in the world, but those that could reach the Dao Entering level could be said to be as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. Anyone who could draw such paintings could be considered a grandmaster in the Spirit Realm, and the number was even rarer than Alchemy Grandmasters.","This kind of person had entered the path through painting and had already reached a miraculous level. When ordinary people drew, their highest goal was to draw the shape of the painting. This was the first level of the painter’s path.","What was even more powerful than this was that besides the shape, it was a step further to the spirit. At this step, it could already be considered extremely impressive. This was the second level of the painter’s path.","Above this similarity in spirit was the combination of form and spirit. This was because, in a sense, form and spirit were two parallel lines. It was not necessarily stronger than the other. For example, on Earth, the Western style of painting in the Common Era was mainly based on form, while ancient China paintings were mainly based on spirit.","However, when one reached the third level, having both body and spirit was extremely impressive. At this level, one could basically be called a grandmaster.","Even though a grandmaster’s painting was precious, it wasn’t enough to drive all the important figures here crazy.","The truly precious ones were those above these three levels. At the Dao Entering level, not only did their paintings contain both form and spirit, but they were also integrated with one’s knowledge.","This kind of Dao Entering-level painting was extremely rare because it could help people comprehend the Dao. Even if it was just mountains, rivers, flowers, and birds, its value was immeasurable. It could manifest the Great Dao of Heaven and Earth in front of people."]},{"number":1240,"title":"Chapter 1240 One Shock After Another (4)","paragraphs":["1240 One Shock After Another (4)","The Great Dao of Heaven and Earth was the most obscure and difficult to understand. This was something that everyone knew.","In the endless sea of bitter cultivation, only when the body was strong enough could it transform into a small boat that carried the cultivator to the other side of cultivation.","However, when one reached the Divine Abilities Stage, one had to begin strengthening their spiritual cultivation base to comprehend the Heavenly Dao. However, the Heavenly Dao was so obscure and difficult to understand.","A Dao Entering-level painting could display a portion of the Heavenly Dao in front of everyone in the form of illusions. This was the most precious.","Therefore, every time a Dao Entering-level painting entered the world, it would undoubtedly attract countless people’s attention. It would often be bought at a high price in a very short period of time. There was basically no possibility of it circulating outside.","Among the Dao Entering-level paintings, there was one that was the most precious. It was the kind of painting that Situ Ye had taken out. It contained a martial arts ultimate art.","This kind of painting looked like it was just drawing an action, but in fact, there was a set of powerful martial arts hidden in it. As long as one studied it every day, one could even learn a set of powerful techniques.","Not to mention the preciousness of the Dao Entering-level painting, even such a powerful martial art was worth a lot. When the two factors were combined, the price was really terrifying.","Compared to Kong Buyi’s handiwork, this painting was no small gift.","After understanding this, countless people gasped. What was Situ Ye thinking? If this painting was spread outside, it would cause countless people to kill each other.","“I saw the signature just now. It’s Scholar Shenkong’s painting!”","When many people heard this, their eyes widened. They had heard of Scholar Shenkong. To be precise, Scholar Shenkong was not a person of the present day. He was a painting grandmaster from hundreds of years ago. At that time, his name still shocked the world. Even if it was just his early doodles, they could be sold for a sky-high price now.","Not to mention this was a Dao Entering-level painting. Even a great grandmaster of the painter’s path could not draw a painting at the Dao Entering level every time. To draw even one, it often took a long time to brew. The spirit was in harmony with heaven and earth, and it was only possible to draw it in a state of divine Dao integration.","Scholar Shenkong had been famous for a long time, so the price of his paintings had always been high. It was very rare to find a Dao Entering-level painting. In addition, it was a painting by Scholar Shenkong, so it was even more precious.","“This... This is too valuable!”","Chu Yaowei was stunned for a moment before he quickly said. He felt more and more puzzled.","Why did everyone like to come here with such scary things?","A Dao Entering-level painting was very precious. In addition, it was a painting that contained an ultimate art. Its value naturally went without saying. It had far exceeded the point of returning the favor.","If he accepted it, he did not know when he would be able to repay this favor.","Everyone was making things difficult for him.","Although Chu Yaowei was extremely touched, he knew that if Situ Ye was trying to curry favor for no reason, he would either be a traitor or a thief.","“What’s there to be afraid of?” Situ Ye said, “This is to congratulate the Matriarch on her birthday anyway.”","Since he had already said this, Chu Yaowei could only say, “All right then. Brother Situ, please take a seat.”","Chu Yaowei quickly asked someone to keep the painting.","Not far away, Chang Shenghong, Chu Xiujie, and the others were staring at the painting with their eyes wide open. That was a Dao Entering-level painting. Even they could only look at it.","If a Divine didn’t have the support of a large faction, it would be very difficult for them to afford such a painting even if they died of exhaustion. If they added in the fact that it was the incarnation of a famous master like Scholar Shenkong, the price was even more ridiculous.","After all, they couldn’t risk all their wealth to buy a painting. That would be too wasteful.","Now that one of them had actually appeared before their eyes, how could they not be envious?","However, what happened next made Chang Shenghong gnash his teeth in jealousy. Situ Ye had no intention of sitting down at all. Instead, he went straight to Chu Yunfan.","“You are Chu...” Situ Ye was stumped for a moment as if he couldn’t think of how to address Chu Yunfan.","“President Situ, just call me Yunfan!” Chu Yunfan said. He knew what Situ Ye was trying to do, but he didn’t care.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Situ Ye heaved a sigh of relief. A bright smile appeared on his face as he said, “My daughter has mentioned you numerous times. I’m indebted to you for taking care of her, but I haven’t had the time to come and thank you. I hope you don’t take offense.”","Situ Ye was talking about how Chu Yunfan had saved Situ Miaoyi. After hearing about it, he felt a chill down his spine. If Situ Miaoyi had been hurt, he would never forgive himself.","Chu Yunfan looked at Situ Ye with a faint smile. It had been more than a month since this incident, and Situ Ye had only come to visit him now. He was afraid that thanking him was only a small part of the reason. The real reason was probably that he knew about the battle between him and Wan Huang.","Whether it was Kong Buyi or Situ Ye, they were probably here because of this. However, Chu Yunfan had no intention of exposing him.","He knew what was going on, but the others didn’t. When they saw this scene, their eyes almost popped out. From what Situ Ye said, it seemed that Chu Yunfan had helped Situ Miaoyi with something before, which was why Situ Ye had personally come to thank him.","But what was with that attitude? It was simply too much!","They could all see that Situ Ye even had a fawning expression on his face. He was completely different from the usual high and mighty President Situ!","One had to know that Situ Ye was neither flustered nor servile even when he was facing Marquis Zhongxin and the matriarch. However, in front of Chu Yunfan, he actually showed a fawning expression as if he was afraid that Chu Yunfan would find fault with him.","This must be a fake Situ Ye!","Only Situ Ye himself knew that when he found out that Chu Yunfan was the one who had fought Wan Huang, he was completely dumbfounded. Back then, when the matriarch forcefully introduced Chu Yunfan to Situ Miaoyi, he was not very happy.","If it was the heir of the marquis, then they could be considered a match of equal status. However, Chu Yunfan was just a candidate with no hope of becoming the heir. Wasn’t this making things difficult for people?","Who knew that the situation would suddenly change?"]},{"number":1241,"title":"Chapter 1241 One Shock After Another (5)","paragraphs":["1241 One Shock After Another (5)","The situation took a turn for the worse.","Situ Ye had previously looked down on Chu Yunfan and thought he was unworthy of his daughter. He never expected Chu Yunfan to have such a trick up his sleeve.","The most inconspicuous candidate was the most attention-grabbing one. Whether it was a senior alchemist or a half-step Core, any of them was enough to shake the Great Wei Kingdom. Chu Yunfan was even worthy of the princess, let alone his daughter.","With both, his future was limitless, and he would become an overlord. One would say he was already an overlord.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength and talent, it would not be difficult for him to become influential in the Great Wei Kingdom. Otherwise, the president of the Situ Merchant Guild would not have to curry favor with him.","Of course, the most important thing was to make up for neglecting Chu Yunfan.","More importantly, Chu Yunfan could not have jumped out of a rock. How amazing must the sect behind him be to have produced such a genius?","Today, Situ Ye was offering up Scholar Shenkong’s Dao Entering-level painting. One-third was to congratulate the martriach on her birthday, one-third was to apologize to Chu Yunfan, and the last one-third was to curry favor with the powerful sect he suspected was behind Chu Yunfan/","Even if their relationship didn’t get closer, he could not let their relationship worsen. Of course, he did not know the powerful sect he suspected did not exist. In a sense, it was not wrong to say Chu Yunfan had jumped out of a rock.","Besides apologizing, he also had another thought he had never told anyone. That was to matchmake Chu Yunfan and his youngest daughter, Situ Miaoyi, if possible.","He initially thought Chu Yunfan was unworthy of her, but things had changed. It was not a matter of whether or not he liked Chu Yunfan but whether Chu Yunfan liked his family.","However, he felt there was nothing wrong with it. His daughter was as beautiful as a flower and had long been famous throughout Conglong. Otherwise, the matriarch could not have proposed this marriage to Chu Yunfan.","As the saying went, man and woman were a match made in Heaven. He could say anything when Chu Yunfan became his son-in-law.","“President Situ, you’re too polite. It was just a piece of cake for me,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Chu Yunfan, thank you for your Divinity Nourishment Pill and for what happened last time.” Situ Miaoyi looked at Chu Yunfan with glistening eyes as if she wanted to see through him.","From their first meeting, she felt Chu Yunfan was different from the rumors. Later, she heard many incredible things about him from An Xiuxiu and seemed to have gotten used to it. Even Chu Yunfan’s battle against Wan Huang did not seem too far-fetched. She thought he could do anything.","“It’s nothing. It was just a birthday present,” Chu Yunfan replied.","Situ Miaoyi had just come out of seclusion because she was still digesting the Divinity Nourishment Pill he had given her as a birthday gift. Now, she was almost in the Divine Abilities Stage.","Situ Ye’s generosity was primarily due to Chu Yunfan giving Situ Miaoyi a bright future. Although it was only a matter of time before she reached the Divine Abilities Stage with her talent and the Situ clan’s assets, the earlier she reached the Divine Abilities Stage, the greater the advantage she would have.","Furthermore, she had attained the Divine Abilities Stage so early. There was an excellent chance for her to break through to the seventh or eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage in the future. She might even have a chance to reach the peak.","Chu Yunfan was the one who had brought her all this, so Situ Miaoyi was very grateful. A different feeling emerged in her heart. None of those young masters who usually fawned over her could compare to him.","‘Chu Yunfan Chu Yunfan again! What’s wrong with everyone today?! Why is everyone looking at him?!’","Chang Shenghong wanted to slap Chu Yunfan in the face. A gift of three million low-grade spirit stones was not something a poor man like Chu Yunfan could afford. However, no one expected these high and mighty big shots to appear one after another before Chang Shenghong had time to show off.","It would be okay if they were here, but they were all here for Chu Yunfan. Chang Shenghong was even angrier when he saw a beauty like Situ Miaoyi looking at Chu Yunfan affectionately.","‘What’s so great about him? Regarding family background, I’m the junior duke of the state, while he’s just an heir candidate who isn’t favored. I believe I far surpass him in terms of appearance and demeanor!","‘These people are blind. They only have eyes for Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan!’","This made Chang Shenghong even more jealous. His entire body seemed to burn with the flames of jealousy.","“Miss Situ Miaoyi, right? I’m Chang Shenghong, the heir of Duke Ning. I’ve always been in the Imperial Capital. I never expected to meet a woman as beautiful as you in Conglong.” Chang Shenghong quickly restrained his anger and put on a self-righteous expression.","Situ Miaoyi’s beautiful eyes flashed with disgust. She had seen too many wealthy playboys. Since a long time ago, these self-righteous playboys had been like flies.","The more Chang Shenghong tried to show off, the more she thought Chu Yunfan was extraordinary. At least Chu Yunfan did not show such an expression when he looked at her. On the contrary, she could feel a faint sense of alienation from Chu Yunfan.","Albeit, it was a polite sense of alienation. This made her feel defeated, but now she felt this alienation was what made Chu Yunfan so different.","At this moment, she only felt a faint curiosity in her heart. However, he did not know that when a woman became interested in a man, it meant the most dangerous time had already arrived.","“Thank you.”","Situ Miaoyi did not want to talk to Chang Shenghong and just nodded lightly in response. Her aloof expression contrasted with her enthusiasm when speaking to Chu Yunfan. It made Chang Shenghong feel like he had gotten slapped in the face. It made him mad with anger and gnashed his teeth in hatred.","As the heir of Duke Ning, no one had ever ignored him like this. It was a great humiliation. He was about to flare up when an announcement sounded outside, “Marquis Anguo has arrived with his children!”"]},{"number":1242,"title":"Chapter 1242 One Shock After Another (6)","paragraphs":["1242 One Shock After Another (6)","‘Another one?!’","Everyone seemed a little numb at this moment. The big shots came one after another as if they had made an appointment. Soon after, two men and a woman strode in. The group leader was a middle-aged man who looked to be in his forties or fifties.","He had a robust figure and walked with a fearsome demeanor. He had the aura of a soldier. He was Marquis Anguo. Unlike Marquis Zhongxin, Marquis Anguo spent most of his time in the army, so his attitude somewhat resembled the army’s style.","Behind him were An Zhenguo and An Xiuxiu.","“Old Madam, sorry I’m late.” Marquis Anguo chuckled.","Marquis Zhongxin could barely sit still. Although he and Marquis Anguo were both marquises, they had little connection. But today, Marquis Anguo had come personally, giving Marquis Zhongxin much respect.","Marquis Zhongxin was so honored that he felt slightly flustered.","“Greetings, Uncle Chu. Greetings, Old Madam,” An Zhenguo and An Xiuxiu hurriedly greeted the matriarch.","“Excellent!” At this moment, the matriarch was so happy that she couldn’t stop smiling. These people had come to congratulate her on her birthday. What could be more prestigious than this?","“Marquis Anguo, you’re here in person. You are too polite,” Chu Yaowei quickly said.","“It’s nothing. Our two families are old friends, and it’s the old madam’s birthday. How could I not come personally?” Marquis Anguo chuckled.","Chu Yaowei smiled but still felt something was amiss. All of them were not quite right today. If their relationship were excellent, Marquis Anguo would have arrived long ago. Moreover, he would not have suspected something was off. However, Marquis Anguo and he were not close.","Chang Shenghong, who was initially angry, saw An Xiuxiu, and his eyes lit up. He quickly stepped forward and said, “Xiuxiu, do you remember me? It’s me, Chang Shenghong.”","Although he had only won by one move, he made it sound like he had won an enormous victory and told everyone in the city about it.","An Xiuxiu ignored him and walked to Chu Yunfan’s side. “Long time no see, Chu Yunfan!”","Chu Yunfan said with a smile, “You look great. You’ve been in seclusion for a while, haven’t you? I see you’ve achieved a breakthrough.”","He could already tell that An Xiuxiu had stepped into the second tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. He knew her strength had significantly improved.","An Xiuxiu blushed when she heard his words. She said, “It’s all thanks to your guidance.”","She had just stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage. According to her estimation, she could not break through again so quickly.","However, she had been following Chu Yunfan for a while and he had given her a little guidance. Not only did he correct the flaws in her cultivation technique, but he also guided her in many areas she lacked understanding. Her cultivation base improved exponentially with his guidance.","“I only guided you, but you ultimately had to do it yourself,” Chu Yunfan said smilingly.","Chu Hongcai, standing on the sidelines, interjected, “Why did you break through again? It wasn’t easy for me to reach my level. I wanted to spar with you.”","The trio had become closer in the past month, especially Chu Hongcai. To be precise, An Xiuxiu had beaten him up too many times.","They just ignored Chang Shenghong.","When Chang Shenghong saw An Xiuxiu talking to Chu Yunfan, his face turned red with fury. He was about to explode from anger, but An Zhenguo arrived beside him before he could.","“Chang Shenghong, you beat me with one move last time but went around saying you annihilated me. Do you dare to compete with me again?” An Zhenguo glared daggers at Chang Shenghong.","An Zhenguo had gotten a little unlucky last time, and Chang Shenghong announced it to everyone. Hatred filled An Zhenguo’s heart, and he had long wanted revenge.","Chang Shenghong glared at An Zhenguo and shouted, “Sure. Just don’t cry when you’re defeated again!”","While everyone chatted, Marquis Anguo and Marquis Zhongxin finished their small talk. After giving him a string of expensive prayer beads in a low-key manner, he walked toward Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan.” Marquis Anguo walked over. Everyone saw this scene and understood he was indeed here for Chu Yunfan.","This was not the first time. If everyone could not understand it now, they would be foolish.","Whether it was Kong Buyi, Situ Ye, or Marquis Anguo, they seemed to have come under the guise of celebrating the old madam’s birthday, but their real target was Chu Yunfan.","Otherwise, why would all these big shots not look for anyone besides Chu Yunfan, an unknown junior in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence?","Chu Yunfan cupped his hands and said, “Greetings, Marquis Anguo.”","Marquis Anguo said, “You’re too polite. Speaking of which, our two families are old friends. Thank you for caring for my daughter previously.”","Even he found it unbelievable that An Xiuxiu’s cultivation had skyrocketed in such a short time. After his son confirmed it, Marquis Anguo truly looked at Chu Yunfan for the first time. However, Chu Yunfan’s battle against Wan Huang a few days ago shocked him. When his daughter told him that Chu Yunfan owned the Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion, he realized he had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","A half-step Core was simply terrifying. Everyone knew even Marquis Anguo did not have such cultivation. Just thinking about it was terrifying.","This was what people meant that every generation had its talents.","However, Marquis Anguo realized Kong Buyi and Situ Ye had already arrived. He understood he was not the only one who had received the news.","“It’s nothing. Xiuxiu also helped me quite a bit, so it’s mutually beneficial,” Chu Yunfan said smilingly, “You’re too polite, Marquis Anguo.”","Chu Yaowei looked at the two and could sense something was amiss, no matter how slow he was. Without exception, all the guests who came today were here for Chu Yunfan.","Also, this clan member whom he thought he had seen through, seemed to be hiding many secrets. Otherwise, these crucial figures would not be so excited.","“Investigate this and report back to me. What’s going on?”"]},{"number":1243,"title":"Chapter 1243 Slap in the Face","paragraphs":["1243 Slap in the Face","No matter how slow Chu Yaowei was, he knew something was wrong.","Not only Chu Yaowei but the others in the Chu clan also noticed something was wrong. There must be something everyone else knew that only he did not. Plus, Chu Yunfan came from his household, so he felt like he was left in the dark.","However, his guess was not entirely correct. Not everyone knew about it. After the battle between Chu Yunfan and Wan Huang shocked the city, and significant forces sent forth their spies.","Although Chu Yunfan lived in seclusion, he was not isolated from the world. In addition, he had never hidden his identity. It was only a matter of time before his identity was exposed. It would only take a few days.","Kong Buyi, Situ Ye, and Marquis Anguo had only taken the initiative. For some reason, they first knew of Chu Yunfan’s existence and then learned of his battle with Wan Huang.","They were just one step ahead of the others.","However, this feeling of everyone else knowing everything and not him felt terrible. Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan chatting happily with everyone, and his eyes flashed with disbelief.","‘What else does he have that I don’t know about?’","Compared to the Chu clan’s complicated thoughts, the old madam’s thoughts were much more straightforward. She knew everyone was here for Chu Yunfan, and her birthday was just an excuse.","However, it did not matter. At this time, she only had one goalto make herself look good. Chu Yunfan had achieved that, which was something even Marquis Zhongxin, her eldest son, had failed to do.","“D*mn you, Chu Yunfan.” Chang Shenghong gritted his teeth hatefully.","Suddenly, he stood up and glared at Chu Yunfan. “Don’t think you can hide and use other people as cover. I’ve been very patient with you. So, what gift did you bring?”","The pair once again attracted everyone’s attention. A few big shots had come earlier, distracting everyone. Only now did they remember the conflict between the two.","“Chang Shenghong is so persistent.” Someone sighed.","However, most knew Chang Shenghong could hardly compare to Chu Yunfan. Many knew these big shots had come for Chu Yunfan, but some were unsure why the big shots had come in such a grand manner.","Still, Chu Yunfan was far more awe-inspiring than Chang Shenghong. Kong Buyi, Situ Ye, Marquis Anguo, and the others had given their attention to Chu Yunfan. Since they knew his power before others, they wanted to know what kind of congratulatory gift Chu Yunfan could afford.","“Why are you so persistent? Just give up already!” Chu Hongcai said fiercely.","Meanwhile, Chu Haoyu did not say much. These big shots came, making him feel his horizons broadening. After all, it was rare to see any of these influential people.","Seeing them would be difficult even if he became Marquis Zhongxin’s heir. He would only be on equal footing with these people if he became the next Marquis Zhongxin. However, these big shots wanted to please Chu Yunfan, making him feel like Chu Yunfan was the real deal.","It made Chu Haoyu think he had been too narrow-minded when he fought so hard to become Marquis Zhongxin’s heir. Although Chu Yunfan was not the heir, he was more impressive than the latter. His prestige came from himself, not from the title of Marquis Zhongxin’s heir.","Chu Yunfan smiled and did not take Chang Shenghong’s words to heart. He said indifferently, “Since he wants to see it, I’ll oblige. How dare he jump ahead with a gift worth a measly three million low-grade spirit stones? He’s overestimating himself.”","Everyone was astounded when they heard this. They did not know where Chu Yunfan’s confidence came from. Three million low-grade spirit stones were not as simple as Chu Yunfan said.","This was a big deal, and they were curious about what he had prepared to dare disregard this gift worth three million low-grade spirit stones.","“Foolish!” Chang Shenghong had also heard Chu Yunfan’s words but felt Chu Yunfan was simply stubborn.","‘Even now, he’s still pretending.’","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly and said, “I’m not that extravagant. My only gift to the matriarch to congratulate her on her birthday is a bottle of pills.”","He flipped his palm, and a bottle of pills appeared in his hand. Then he handed it to the matriarch.","“This is perfect! You’re so thoughtful!” The matriarch was thrilled. She seemed to have thought of something and quickly said, “Hurry up and put this aside!”","Chang Shenhong immediately became anxious when he saw the old madam putting the gift aside without looking at it closely. He thought the old madam was trying to save Chu Yunfan’s reputation.","‘Even she doesn’t think highly of him. No matter how expensive a bottle of pills is, it can’t compare to my gifts.’","“Wait a minute. Chu Yunfan, since you said the pill is much better than the three million low-grade spirit stones that Duke Ning gave, I’d like to see what kind of pills they are!” Chang Shenghong thundered, stopping the matriarch from putting the item away.","The matriarch looked displeased. She thought Chang Shenghong was here to ruin her reputation.","‘My grandnephew doesn’t know what’s good for him. He wants to ruin my birthday banquet. Why is he doing this?!’","Chu Yaowei was also displeased. He looked at Chang Shenghong and said, “There’s no difference in worth as long as it’s a birthday gift.”","‘This is all because of Chu Yunfan! This d*mn Chu Yunfan!’","“Since it’s a birthday gift, there’s no need to hide it from everyone. It’s okay to ask, right? Or are you afraid to answer, Chu Yunfan?” Chang Shenghong’s voice became increasingly stern as his voice got louder.","“Since you want to be embarrassed so badly, I’ll fulfill your wish,” Chu Yunfan stepped forward and continued, “There’s nothing to hide. This bottle contains five Longevity Pills. Each Longevity Pill can extend one’s life by twenty years. I made them for the matriarch to wish her good fortune and longevity.”","An uproar immediately followed."]},{"number":1244,"title":"Chapter 1244 The Shock Brought by the Longevity Pills","paragraphs":["1244 The Shock Brought by the Longevity Pills","Everyone was in an uproar. Each of these Longevity Pills could extend one’s life by twenty years.","Every word caused a sensation!","Martial arts lived long lives, but they were not immortal. Even the strongest of the generation could not escape the erosion of time and would turn to dust eventually. There was no exception to this.","Everyone had different levels of power, status, and life span, but death was fair to everyone.","For martial arts experts, time was incomparably precious. The stronger the martial artist, the longer they could survive. And one of these pills could extend one’s lifespan by twenty years.","These twenty years could very likely bring about a huge breakthrough and extend one’s lifespan even more. Even if they didn’t, who would want twenty extra years for nothing?","Any one of these pills was worth far more than the three million low-grade spirit stones that Chang Shenghong had given the matriarch.","Whether it was Situ Ye or Marquis Anguo, no one would be indifferent to an extra twenty years of life. Let alone three million low-grade spirit stones, they were willing to pay even if it was twice as much. Twenty years was enough for them to do too many things.","“Longevity Pills? How could there be such a thing?!” Chang Shenghong roared, “I don’t believe it. Other than some heavenly materials and earthly treasures, how could there exist any medicine that can prolong one’s life? I’ve never heard of such things.”","“You haven’t heard of it, doesn’t mean it doesn’t exist!” Kong Buyi unexpectedly stood up and said at this moment. “I’ve heard that there was indeed something called Longevity Pills during ancient times. However, the pill recipe was lost to the ages.”","Unlike the others, Kong Buyi was the president of the Alchemist Association, so he knew more about these secrets than the others. He knew that Longevity Pills had existed in ancient times, but the pill recipe was lost later on.","Of course, that did not mean there was no Longevity Pill recipe. In fact, the later generations were no fools. As far as he knew, there were several recipes in the Alchemist Association. However, without exception, all these recipes required extremely precious herbs.","These precious herbs often had the function of prolonging life. And after being made into pills, the medicinal effect would increase. However, these natural treasure was extremely difficult to find. Its value was simply immeasurable. There was no possibility of it being popularized on a large scale.","In ancient times, there were many Longevity Pills. Although the price was not cheap, it was not unacceptable.","During that era, martial arts flourished and shook the many worlds. One of the most important factors was the birth of the Longevity Pill. The lifespan of various experts continued to extend, and they had enough time to cultivate to the peak.","Kong Buyi’s words were undoubtedly to support Chu Yunfan and confirm the existence of the Longevity Pill.","The people present were all prominent figures of the Great Wei Kingdom and were well-informed. Naturally, they had heard of the existence of Longevity Pills. However, they were made from extremely precious natural treasures and were basically national treasures. Only alchemy experts had the opportunity to make them. And once they were made, they would most likely be purchased by the Great Wei Kingdom’s imperial court.","They had only heard of the pill’s name and had never seen it before.","Moreover, the Great Wei Kingdom attracted many experts to work for them. These Longevity Pills were a huge bargaining chip, especially for those experts who were nearing the end of their lives. They had to rely on the Great Wei Kingdom to obtain Longevity Pills.","The real problem was not in the Longevity Pill itself, but in the ancient pill recipe that could not be popularized. That was the recipe that seized the fortune of heaven and earth. The Longevity Pill now was just a slight use of the natural treasures that had the function of prolonging life.","“I thought it was just a legend. I didn’t expect to actually see it in my life” Kong Buyi looked at Chu Yunfan in shock as he muttered to himself.","No matter what it was, the value of the Longevity Pill was immeasurable. It could even be passed down as a family heirloom.","Even Marquis Anguo and Situ Ye, who knew Chu Yunfan’s identity, looked at the scene in front of them with envy. Five Longevity Pills meant a hundred years, which was equivalent to nearly half of their lives.","“Yunfan, this is too expensive!” the matriarch hesitated for a moment before saying.","Although she was old, she was not senile. Of course, she understood how shocking this was.","“It’s nothing. I accidentally discovered these pills. They’re of no use to me. Giving them to you would be the best choice, Martriach,” Chu Yunfan said.","He didn’t say that he was the one who made them because if he did, he would become the target of public criticism. No one could resist the temptation of prolonging life. At that time, all the experts in the Great Wei Kingdom would come to seek him out.","That would be the beginning of countless troubles. However, he knew that there were still some people who wanted to know if he had the recipe or if he had other Longevity Pills. However, as long as he did not make an enemy of the world, Chu Yunfan was not afraid.","Whoever dared to show themselves would be crushed to death.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s firm attitude, the old madam could only say, “In that case, I’ll accept them.”","Today, the surprises were getting bigger and bigger.","“I don’t believe it. I don’t know where he found these pills to fake all this!”","Chang Shenghong saw that everyone was shocked by the Longevity Pill that Chu Yunfan had brought, so he immediately shouted in contempt.","“Chang Shenghong, haven’t you had enough?” Chu Yaowei said angrily.","Did Chang Shenghong really want his mother’s birthday banquet to become a joke in everyone’s eyes?","“Get out!”","Chu Yaowei was completely enraged by Chang Shenghong. However, Chang Shenghong was still unwilling to give up. There was a crazed look on his face.","“Chu Yunfan, do you dare put these pills to the test right here and right now?!”","Everyone shook their heads. Chang Shenghong had lost his mind. He was like a drowning man clutching at straws.","Chang Shenghong firmly believed that this poor Chu Yunfan would not be able to get his hands on Longevity Pill. That was why he wanted to test them even if he had to die. He was not afraid even if he had offended everyone in Marquis Zhongxin’s household.","In other words, he had already offended everyone in the household. If he could not expose Chu Yunfan’s scam, he would not be willing to drop the matter.","His eyes were bloodshot like a gambler’s eyes. He stared at Chu Yunfan, wishing he could tear him into pieces.","“Since you’re still unwilling, I’ll make you give up.” Chu Yunfan sneered."]},{"number":1245,"title":"Chapter 1245 To Everyone’s Shock, the Longevity Pills Were the Real Deal","paragraphs":["1245 To Everyone’s Shock, the Longevity Pills Were the Real Deal","“Matriarch!”","After Chu Yunfan shouted, he glanced at everyone and saw that their eyes were burning. The existence of the Longevity Pill made everyone unable to remain calm/ Even Marquis Anguo and the others, who had been the calmest, were now flushed with excitement.","After all, this might be their only chance to see the Longevity Pill in action.","“Since everyone wants to see it, let them see it!” Chu Yunfan said, “It will be a good opportunity to verify the effects of the Longevity Pill!”","Of course, Chu Yunfan couldn’t say that he was the one who made the pills. He could only say that they were something he obtained by accident. With that, he could reduce some of the attention on him.","“All right, I’ll give it a try.”","The matriarch also understood that if she did not give it a try now, they would not let it go, especially Chang Shenghong. For the first time, she felt that this grandnephew of hers was so annoying and did not understand him at all.","As she spoke, the matriarch opened the medicine bottle. Immediately, a medicinal fragrance assailed her nose. She immediately felt her spirit jolt. The medicinal fragrance quickly spread in all directions. Everyone felt every pore on their body open up. They even felt as if their meridians and marrow were being cleansed.","Under everyone’s gaze, the matriarch poured out a Longevity Pill and put it in her mouth. The instant she swallowed it, the medicinal power was released. It melted in her mouth and fused into her limbs and bones.","The matriarch was a Divine, so she could naturally feel the medicinal power turning into a powerful life force that began to assault every cell in her body. And this change could be seen with the naked eye.","In fact, at her age, a Divine could be said to have entered old age. At this stage, it was already difficult to improve her body functions, let alone reverse the situation. It was simply impossible.","Once the body began to age, it was an irreversible process.","In everyone’s eyes, the matriarch’s change was visible to the naked eye. Originally, most of her hair had begun to turn white. Now, it was the clock was going backward. Her hair turned black and shiny again. She looked as if she had become ten years younger. The wrinkles on her face began to gradually decrease, and her skin became lustrous again.","And compared to these changes in appearance, everyone could sense that the vitality in the matriarch’s body had begun to recover crazily. They could easily feel the powerful vitality radiating from her.","After a long time, the change in the matriarch’s body finally came to an end. Everything was as Chu Yunfan had saidshe was now twenty years younger. Even the matriarch herself found it unbelievable. This transformation was so obvious. The feeling of her entire body becoming younger made her feel great.","“It’s actually real! The Longevity Pills are real!”","Among these people, Chang Shenghong was the one who couldn’t accept it the most. He didn’t hesitate to offend Marquis Zhongxin and everyone else to expose Chu Yunfan. Who knew that the result of this revelation would not be Chu Yunfan losing face, but him losing face?","Chu Yunfan was telling the truth. There were really such things as Longevity Pills. He was not lying.","Chang Shenghong was so proud of himself before, thinking that he could slap Chu Yunfan in the face. He thought that Chu Yunfan was a poor b*stard and shouldn’t be able to produce any decent birthday gifts.","In the end, he realized that the person who was really slapped in the face wasn’t Chu Yunfan, but himself.","This feeling made his entire face burn as if he had been slapped by Chu Yunfan. He couldn’t understand how this could be true. Chu Yunfan should just be a poor man. How could he have obtained such a good item?!","Unlike Chang Shenghong, who was completely dumbfounded, everyone was shocked after verifying the authenticity of these pills. Many people even became excited, not knowing if Chu Yunfan had any more.","“I didn’t expect them to really be Longevity Pills!”","“Where did this Chu Yunfan get these pills from? He actually has five of them!”","“If these Longevity Pills were to be sold, the price would probably break through the sky. In twenty years, many people would be willing to go bankrupt in exchange for them. Just the one that the matriarch swallowed was already much more precious than three million low-grade spirit stones.”","“That’s right. It’s funny that Chang Shenghong thought he could slap Chu Yunfan in the face. Now, he’s been slapped by Chu Yunfan!”","Many of the guests started to criticize Chang Shenghong. He was the center of attention previously, the legendary junior duke. But now, he had become the target of everyone’s criticism. It was nothing more than praising the high and trampling on the low.","Chang Shenghong’s face turned green and white as he was criticized by the crowd. Finally, he couldn’t take it anymore. After looking at the crowd with a venomous gaze, he snorted coldly and left.","The other scions who had followed Chang Shenghong here, as well as Chu Xiujie, did not dare to stay. It was too humiliating. He never thought that he would be so humiliated today.","Chu Xiujie thought that he was here to hold his head high and teach Chu Yunfan a lesson. Who knew that the result would be the opposite? Chu Yunfan had taught them how to behave.","Chang Shenghong’s departure did not cause any commotion. In fact, many people in the Chu clan felt that he should have left long ago. He had been looking for trouble several times.","It seemed that he was looking for trouble with Chu Yunfan, but today was the matriarch’s birthday celebration, and Chu Yunfan was a member of the Chu clan. If Chu Yunfan lost face, wouldn’t that mean the Chu clan would lose face too?","Chang Shenghong did not understand why he was boycotted by the entire Chu clan. He did not understand that he had offended the public.","After he left, everyone’s eyes once again focused on Chu Yunfan. It was as if they wanted to know where he had gotten the Longevity Pills and if he had more on him. If there were more, it would probably cause a huge uproar.","Many extremely powerful experts would even spy on the Longevity Pill. The more top-notch a powerhouse was, the more they needed Longevity Pills to help them save time to break through.","One could imagine that Chu Yunfan’s troubles were not small.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care. His strength was not something that ordinary people could covet. The so-called experts at the half-step Core Stage were nothing more than food to him.","Although he wasn’t a match for a true Core just yet, a Core couldn’t do anything to him. At most, he would just run away. And when he recovered his full strength, his strength would be so great that he had nothing to fear!"]},{"number":1246,"title":"Chapter 1246 What Kind of Favor Does the Battle Wolves Owe?","paragraphs":["1246 What Kind of Favor Does the Battle Wolves Owe?","Chu Yunfan was not the slightest bit worried, but the matriarch began to worry.","After all, with her intelligence, it wasn’t difficult for her to guess the series of threats that might come later. Even the residence might not be able to protect Chu Yunfan.","For the sake of Longevity Pills, some experts would do anything. Without sufficient strength, they would covet such wealth. It was no different from a child holding a gold ingot on the street.","She sighed internally. Although Chu Yunfan was filial, he was too impulsive. If he only took out one pill, then she would just eat it and everything would be done. Even if others suspected that Chu Yunfan had more, they wouldn’t be so sure.","However, Chu Yunfan took out five pills in one go, so the situation was completely different. He most likely had more on him. Even she thought this, let alone others.","Under such circumstances, some people were capable of doing anything. However, there were too many people at the scene. Even if they wanted to block the news, it was already too late.","Situ Miaoyi looked at Chu Yunfan from the side. Her beautiful eyes flashed with disbelief. She understood how precious Longevity Pills were. It was because of this that she felt that it was unbelievable that Chu Yunfan could take out such a thing.","An Xiuxiu was much calmer. Unlike Situ Miaoyi, she had been in contact with Chu Yunfan for the past month and had seen too many amazing things. Chu Yunfan was like a treasure that could never be completely revealed and often gave her surprise after surprise.","Every time she thought that Chu Yunfan had reached the top, Chu Yunfan would give her a new surprise.","Marquis Anguo’s eyes flashed with a bright light. Chu Yunfan was indeed as his daughter had said. He was simply unfathomable. It was only possible to be on good terms with such a person. If they became enemies, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Among these people, the one who was the most shocked was Chu Yaowei. Previously, he thought that he had completely grasped Chu Yunfan’s thoughts and that he had found out the truth about him, but Chu Yunfan used reality to tell him that he was still far from it.","Before he could figure out why these big shots had come for Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan had used these Longevity Pills to give him a huge shock.","He felt that this was troublesome.","This was different from ordinary goods. No matter how many ordinary goods there were, even if it was tens of millions of low-grade spirit stones, with his power, he could still protect it. After all, the entire Great Wei Kingdom stood behind him.","Although the Great Wei Kingdom was not as powerful as the Federation, it was still a big country. To dare to lay a hand on a marquis was undoubtedly going against the entire Great Wei Kingdom. Not many people had such guts.","However, Longevity Pills were different. The fact that it could extend one’s lifespan was enough to make countless people boil. As long as they could survive, so what if they offended the entire Great Wei Kingdom? At most, they could escape thousands of miles away and hide in the outer realm.","Chu Yaowei had a headache just thinking about it. Today, Chu Yunfan really surprised him. What made him even more depressed was seeing Chu Yunfan’s indifferent expression. He felt that Chu Yunfan didn’t understand how troublesome this matter was.","However, the person he hated most was not Chu Yunfan, but Chang Shenghong. If not for Chang Shenghong, all this could have been carried out in secret. Chu Yunfan had not intended to make a big fuss, but Chang Shenghong forced him to come out and everyone now knew about it.","No matter how Chu Yaowei looked at Chang Shenghong, he found him an eyesore. He gnashed his teeth in hatred. He was keenly aware that some people around him were looking at Chu Yunfan with strange eyes. Not all of them were friendly.","After all, the benefits of the Longevity Pills were too great. If the news spread, they would probably be able to sell them for a high price.","Chu Yaowei couldn’t wait to end this birthday banquet and prepare for the upcoming storm. He especially wanted to find out what Chu Yunfan was hiding from him. None of these elders were fools. For them to come together, there must be something that he did not know.","Suddenly, just as everyone’s eyes were getting more and more eager, another announcement came from outside.","“The gang leader of the Battle Wolves has arrived with Deputy Leader Liao!”","Everyone was dumbfounded again. Another big shot had come. This time, everyone looked at Chu Yunfan. They had confirmed that there was no mistake. They must have come for Chu Yunfan again.","Although the Battle Wolves were only a gang, they were spread all over Conglong. The leader of the Battle Wolves was definitely one of the top big shots in the city. Even many influential figures had to rely on the Battle Wolves’ connections and abilities.","“Let them in!”","At this moment, Chu Yaowei had completely lost his temper and said this in hurry.","The leader of the Battle Wolves swept his gaze across the crowd and realized that there were a few familiar faces. He could not help but be a little stunned. He did not expect these big shots to also be here. Each of them was more shocking than the last.","“Everyone, it’s been a long time. I didn’t expect to see all of you here!” the leader greeted everyone.","Kong Buyi and the others returned the greeting, but they were a little stunned. They didn’t know what kind of relationship Chu Yunfan had with the Battle Wolves for the leader to come personally.","The leader first went forward and said to Chu Yaowei and the matriarch, “Marquis, Matriarch, we came in a hurry and didn’t prepare anything nice. We only prepared the title deed for the shops on Tianhe Street. Consider it as added joy to the matriarch’s birthday banquet.”","The leader spoke as if it was an ordinary birthday gift, but everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. This was because this was not an ordinary thing. Tianhe Street was one of the golden commercial streets in Tianhe City. Its value was immeasurable, but no one had ever dared covet it.","Because that was the Battle Wolves territory. Or rather, the entire street was developed by the Battle Wolves. Others could not snatch it even if they wanted to.","Countless people wanted to buy it, even if it was just a shop. But the Battle Wolves was never willing to sell. After all, who would sell a hen that could lay golden eggs? Wouldn’t that be stupid?","Any random shop could earn a lot of money every day, and now the Battle Wolves was actually going to give up this hen that laid golden eggs to the marquis?","However, everyone turned to look at Chu Yunfan in unison. What kind of favor did the Battle Wolves owe that they had to repay him like this?"]},{"number":1247,"title":"Chapter 1247 Wan Huang Lowers His Head and Begs for Mercy","paragraphs":["1247 Wan Huang Lowers His Head and Begs for Mercy","Everyone understood that it definitely wasn’t something related to Marquis Zhongxin’s household.","Marquis Zhongxin’s household and the Battle Wolves didn’t have such a relationship. Even if there was an exchange of benefits, it would be under the table. It was impossible to carry out such an exchange in the open.","Therefore, it was obvious that it was Chu Yunfan. Only Chu Yunfan was worthy of the Battle Wolves’ offer.","However, they just couldn’t understand what Chu Yunfan had done to make the Battle Wolves so generous. Any random shop was already worth a lot and enough to repay whatever kindness he had shown them. A whole street was worth far more than millions of low-grade spirit stones.","There weren’t many golden eggs like this in the whole of Conglong.","“This is a little inappropriate. It’s too expensive!” Chu Yaowei burst out before the matriarch said a word.","“What’s there to be concerned about? Compared to what Master Chu did for our gang, this is just a drop in the ocean,” the gang leader said.","Although he was heartbroken to hand over the land title to this street, it was nothing compared to Chu Yunfan saving the entire Battle Wolves. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, this street wouldn’t have been saved.","More importantly, Chu Yunfan was the only one who could protect the Battle Wolves from being destroyed by Bu Shan’s sect. There was the price to pay for that protection.","There was no such thing as a free lunch in this world. If everyone knew the reason, they wouldn’t be so shocked by the Battle Wolves’ generosity. Compared to the entire Battle Wolves, this was nothing.","Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan again. He didn’t know what Chu Yunfan had done to make these big shots come one after another.","“Master Chu, say something. We came in a hurry today and am sorry we didn’t prepare anything great. I hope you don’t mind!” Seeing that Chu Yaowei didn’t want to accept the gift, the gang leader started to get anxious.","The others almost fainted when they saw this. They had never seen such a scene before. One party wanted the other party to accept their generous gift, and if they did not accept it, it would be as if they were letting him down.","Many people were roaring in their hearts. ‘If Marquis Zhongxin doesn’t want it, then I’ll take it! Let go of that land title and give it to me!’","Chu Yunfan saw that the gang leader had brought the topic to him and knew that he could not avoid it. He immediately said, “In that case, accept it, Martriach. It’s a token of the Battle Wolves’s sincerity.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, the gang leader heaved a sigh of relief. The others saw his expression and gritted their teeth. The gang leader actually looked relieved after his gift was accepted, as if everything was the other way around.","“Yunfan, since the Battle Wolves is giving it to you, then you should keep this land title.”","The matriarch thought for a moment and gave the land title to Chu Yunfan. She could see that the Battle Wolves was targeting Chu Yunfan, not the Chu clan. Therefore, it was most appropriate to give this land title to him.","“That’s no necessary. What use do I have for this land title?” Chu Yunfan shook his head. He was destined not to stay in Conglong for long. What was the use of keeping the land title?","“Matriarch, just accept it. Take it as my filial piety to you!”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was sincere. Back when he was in danger, it was the matriarch who had stood up for him and treated him very well. Although it was because of his appearance, he had always remembered this and was grateful.","Compared to his life, this land title was nothing.","The matriarch saw Chu Yunfan’s determined expression and said, “Since that’s the case, you can accept it Yaowei.”","She could clearly see that Chu Yunfan was repaying her kindness, but at the same time, after cutting off all ties with her, there would be fewer ties in the future. After all, he was an eagle in the sky and would not stay on the ground for long.","“Master Chu, I came in a hurry today, but the reward that I promised earlier has been prepared.”","The gang leader had prepared a reward in addition to the land title of this street. Based on the value of the land title of Tianhe Street, the other reward would not be much less.","Many people felt like their saliva was about to flow out when they heard this. If this sky-high wealth was given to one person, that person would instantly become rich overnight.","However, when they looked at Chu Yunfan again, he didn’t seem to care at all. His expression was indifferent as if those things weren’t wealth at all.","They didn’t know that Chu Yunfan was already rich enough to rival a country back in the Federation. His net worth was not something that these people could estimate.","“Mm, all right.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Suddenly, the gang leader looked at Chu Yunfan carefully and said in a low voice, “Master Chu, the manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor wishes to see you too.”","Chu Yunfan was a little stunned. He never thought that the gang leader would be helping Wan Huang deliver a message. One had to know that his battle with Wan Huang had shocked all of Conglong. Wan Huang had almost died at his hands and had fled in panic.","This battle had established Chu Yunfan’s reputation. He had thought that Wan Huang would count his lucky stars and not grit his teeth to think of a way to take revenge. Why would he want to see him?","This was not impossible. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, it was not difficult for him to do this.","“Master Chu, have you forgotten that Wan Feihong is still kneeling in our sect?”","At this moment, the leader of the Battle Wolves smiled bitterly at Chu Yunfan. Wan Huang had been scared out of his wits during the battle with Chu Yunfan, so he had no way to deal with Chu Yunfan.","However, Wan Huang was so furious that he almost tore apart the Battle Wolves. Besides threatening Wan Huang to die together with them, they had no other means.","Wan Huang soon realized that he had no way to break Chu Yunfan’s seal. The seal was simply poisonous. It could absorb the spirit energy of heaven and earth to strengthen itself when it was attacked. Unless it could be broken in one go, the more he tried to break it, the tighter the seal became and the more his son suffered.","He had no choice but to lower his head to Chu Yunfan. After all, he couldn’t beat Chu Yunfan in a fight. If he didn’t lower his head, his son might die in the Battle Wolves’ headquarters.","“I see.” Chu Yunfan instantly understood and said, “In that case, where is he?”","When the gang leader saw Chu Yunfan relent, he was overjoyed. Wan Huang might not be able to defeat Chu Yunfan, but he could definitely torture the Battle Wolves.","The Battle Wolves truly had been unlucky for the last few days.","“He’ll be here soon. He went to prepare an apology gift for you, Master Chu.”"]},{"number":1248,"title":"Chapter 1248 Everyone’s Realization and Shock","paragraphs":["1248 Everyone’s Realization and Shock","The gang leader said in a low voice.","“Hmph! ” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly. “At least he knows the rules.”","He didn’t have to kill Wan Huang. Of course, if Wan Huang wanted to die, he didn’t mind sending him to his death. However, if Wan Huang knew the rules, Chu Yunfan would let him go.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan was willing to relent, the gang leader heaved a sigh of relief. To him, whether it was Chu Yunfan or Wan Huang, they were both people he could not afford to provoke.","The battle between Chu Yunfan and Wan Huang was undoubtedly an undeserved disaster for him. When the immortals fought, the mortals on the ground suffered.","Wan Huang couldn’t deal with Chu Yunfan, but he could vent his anger on them. Now that the two sides finally had the intention to reconcile, the Battle Wolves heaved a sigh of relief.","While Chu Yunfan was talking to the gang leader, the entire place fell silent. Everyone seemed to be completely dumbfounded. Although the gang leader lowered his voice, it wasn’t telepathy. Everyone present was an expert. Although not everyone was a Divine, just hearing his voice was not a problem.","The words of the gang leader fell into their ears. It was as if a nuclear bomb had exploded, causing everyone to be confused. If they weren’t mistaken, the gang leader was talking about the manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor, Wan Huang.","Wan Huang was a famous supreme figure in the path of the sword in the Great Wei Kingdom. In the entire kingdom, there might be people who had never seen Wan Huang, but there was not a single person who had not heard of him. These families in the Great Wei Kingdom had been taught that there were some forces that they absolutely could not afford to offend.","Among them, although Inherited Sword Manor wasn’t ranked at the top, it was still a well-known existence on the list. In fact, those who could squeeze into the list were definitely existences that they couldn’t afford to offend.","Among them, Wan Huang was definitely a ferocious existence.","If this kind of person came to Conglong, the entire city would be shocked. He was a half-step Core. In the Great Wei Kingdom, according to the unspoken rules, this kind of half-step Core was an existence that could be on equal footing with a duke or even the monarch.","In the eyes of ordinary people, even Marquis Zhongxin, Marquis Anguo, Kong Buyi, Situ Ye, the gang leader of the Battle Wolves, and the others who were important figures were nothing in front of Wan Huang. They were at least one level lower.","Just the mention of Wan Huang’s name was enough to make many people tremble in fear.","And such a big shot actually wanted to apologize to Chu Yunfan?","If they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan and the leader of the Battle Wolves wouldn’t joke around with them, they would have thought that they were playing some sort of joke.","Many people only had one feeling. What was wrong with the world? How could it become so unbelievable? It was as if a big joke was being played on them!","Everyone was dumbfounded. They looked at the calm and gentlemanly figure standing there. At this moment, in their eyes, there was a powerful aura.","It was as if the world was under Chu Yunfan’s control.","“Wan Huang? Apologize?”","After Chu Yaowei felt that it was unbelievable, he immediately thought of something. A thought flashed through his mind like lightning. A few days ago, Wan Huang came from Conglong to denounce him. In the end, after a battle with a mysterious expert in the city, he fled in a sorry state.","When he first received this news, he was extremely shocked. There was actually such a powerful expert hidden in Conglong?","He immediately sent someone to investigate. However, like the others, the spies from the residence did not dare to approach. They were watching from afar and did not know that Chu Yunfan was that expert.","But now, Chu Yaowei immediately understood. ‘Could that terrifying and mysterious expert be Chu Yunfan?’","Thinking about it, this was the only possible explanation. If Chu Yunfan was that mysterious expert, then there would be a reasonable explanation for all the strange things that happened today.","Chu Yunfan had beaten Wan Huang into a sorry state, and Wan Huang had no choice but to lower his head to Chu Yunfan for the sake of his son.","Evidently, whether it was Kong Buyi, Situ Ye, Marquis Anguo, or the gang leader of the Battle Wolves, they must have known about Chu Yunfan through various channels.","Thinking of this, everything that had happened before was clear.","No wonder these people were more attentive than the last. Chu Yaowei could not understand it no matter how he thought about it before, but now, he understood everything.","Chu Yunfan was actually a half-step Core. No wonder his guards were unable to withstand even a single blow from Chu Yunfan. They were not his match at all.","He was very clear about the difference between the half-step Core Stage and the Divine Abilities Stage.","If it was to curry favor with a half-step Core, it would all make sense. Moreover, with Chu Yunfan’s age, the probability of entering the Core Stage in the future was extremely high. If he became a Core, even the monarch of the Great Wei Kingdom would not be able to do anything to him.","That kind of top-notch expert was equivalent to a living god.","Thinking of this, Chu Yaowei’s eyes burned with passion. He thought of the previous plan. Originally, Chu Yunfan was just a dispensable existence in his plan, but now that Chu Yunfan had shown his amazing strength, everything was different.","His plan might just work!","While Chu Yaowei’s heart was in turmoil, everyone was dumbfounded. They weren’t stupid. Besides Kong Buyi, Marquis Anguo, and the others who knew about it, the others finally understood that Chu Yunfan was the mysterious half-step Core that was widely rumored a few days ago.","Looking at his age, everyone suddenly felt like they had lived a dog’s life. Compared to Chu Yunfan, they were trash.","Chu Hongcai naturally already knew Chu Yunfan’s identity since he had been present at the battle, but this was the first time Chu Haoyu was finding out about it.","Chu Haoyu finally understood why Chu Yunfan did not care about the Marquis Zhongxin position. With such strength, as long as he joined the Great Wei Kingdom, the Great Wei Kingdom would definitely not be stingy with the position of marquis.","He used to think that the difference between him and Chu Yunfan was just a little bit. Now that he thought about it, it was more than just a little bit. It was like heaven and earth. There was no comparison.","How could a divine dragon in the sky be compared to an ant on the ground?"]},{"number":1249,"title":"Chapter 1249 Wan Huang’s Shocking Apology Gift","paragraphs":["1249 Wan Huang’s Shocking Apology Gift","To think that he had compared himself to Chu Yunfan before Chu Yunfan must have found it ridiculous!","Chu Haoyu no longer had any intention of comparing himself with Chu Yunfan. They were not on the same level.","Eagles and ants on the ground were not on the same level.","At this moment, he was still a little glad that he had joined Chu Yunfan before it was too late. Otherwise, he would probably have been like Chang Shenghong and Chu Xiujie, suffering a huge blow.","Like everyone else, the matriarch’s jaw dropped in shock. She had also guessed Chu Yunfan’s identity, but she had never expected him to be so powerful.","Her image of Chu Yunfan was still stuck in stuck, to more than little over a year ago. At that time, Chu Yunfan was in a very sorry state. He basically did not have any divine power or strength. Without her protection, he would not even be able to survive in the Chu clan.","She never expected him to become so powerful in just a year.","Now that she thought about it, there were indeed too many unreasonable things about Chu Yunfan. For example, even when facing her and Chu Yaowei, he was neither servile nor overbearing as if he didn’t want anything from her.","As the saying goes, the less desire Chu Yunfan had, the more invulnerable he was.","She had thought that Chu Yunfan did not have the strength to fight for it, so he was without desire. Now it seemed that Chu Yunfan was not powerless to fight, but disdained to fight.","This was the truth.","However, after her shock, she immediately felt extremely proud. No matter what, this good child had come from their Chu clan.","The scene was deathly silent. So silent that one could hear a pin drop. Everyone held their breath and looked at Chu Yunfan. After a long time, it was as if a pot had exploded and was boiling over.","“Did I hear wrongly? Chu Yunfan actually forced the manor lord of Inherited Sword Manor to lower his head!”","“Wan Huang is bowing his head and apologizing? This is simply too terrifying!”","“Is this Chu Yunfan’s true strength? No wonder he was able to produce five Longevity Pills.”","“Where did this Chu Yunfan come from? Which sect taught him to be so terrifying?”","It was as if everyone had exploded, and their heartbeats increased by a hundred-fold.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was far beyond their imagination. He was a half-step Core, and he could really walk unhindered through all of Conglong.","“No wonder he wasn’t afraid of the Longevity Pill being exposed. So he has such a trump card. If anyone dares to have attack him, I’m afraid that they’re just courting death.”","“That’s right. He’s a half-step Core. Especially since he’s so young, he’ll definitely be able to enter the Core Stage in the future. Who would dare to provoke such a big shot with unlimited potential?”","“I finally understand why all these big shots are lowering themselves. I thought they were just being humble, but now it seems that it’s not the case at all. They’re simply here to ride someone’s coattails!”","At this moment, they realized that they had thought about it all wrong. These people were not lowering themselves to give Chu Yunfan face. They were clearly here to ride his coattails.","Now that they knew, they understood everything.","After the heated discussion, everyone suddenly became cold. Everyone was waiting for Wan Huang to personally apologize. Such a scene was rare.","Normally, they would not even be able to meet a half-step Core, let alone a half-step Core apologizing to someone in person. What kind of scene would that be?","Wan Huang did not keep them waiting. Soon, a servant reported from outside, “Manor Lord Wan of Inherited Sword Manor has arrived!”","Immediately, the crowd was in an uproar. Although they were prepared for this, many people were still extremely emotional when they saw this scene. Wan Huang had actually come in person to apologize.","Everyone looked over and saw a luxuriously dressed middle-aged man walking in with large strides. He had restrained the sharpness of his entire body. From the looks of it, he did not seem to be any different from an ordinary middle-aged man.","Everyone understood that this was a show of goodwill and a sign of weakness.","They didn’t dare to imagine that Wan Huang, who was rumored to have a bad temper, would actually come to apologize in such a low-key manner.","Everyone’s eyes fell on Wan Huang, making him feel uncomfortable. Those people’s eyes were filled with doubt, confusion, and even gloating. If it was under normal circumstances, those people wouldn’t dare to look at him like this. They were simply courting death.","But now, he had no choice but to swallow his anger. He walked up to Chu Yunfan and bowed first. “Greetings, Master Chu.”","“Mm.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s nonchalant expression, Wan Huang was so angry that he gritted his teeth. The other party was just a little brat, yet he dared to be so arrogant. However, he was truly no match for Chu Yunfan, so he could only admit defeat.","What he didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan had even killed a Core before, let alone a half-step Core. If a mere half-step Core dared to be arrogant in front of Chu Yunfan, wasn’t that courting death?","Everyone thought that they had seen through all of Chu Yunfan’s trump cards, but little did they know that it was just the tip of the iceberg.","“Thank you for letting me live last time, Master Chu.” Wan Huang bowed.","Everyone was in an uproar. Wan Huang had really apologized humbly.","Chu Yunfan looked at Wan Huang in surprise. How did Wan Huang guess that Chu Yunfan had spared his life?","“It’s good that you know,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Everyone was already completely numb to Chu Yunfan’s attitude. It was as if facing a half-step Core was no different from facing an ordinary Divine.","“As an apology for disturbing you last time, Master Chu, I’ve brought a stalk of Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Grass. I heard that you’ve been in the market for this herb. I happened to know the whereabouts of one stalk of this herb, so I bought it at a high price as an apology. Master Chu, are you satisfied?”","Wan Huang flipped his palm, and a strange plant with nine fiery red leaves rested within it.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up. This was the main ingredient of the Nine Yang Soul Restoring Pill that he was planning to make.","Ordinary methods were no longer effective on his injuries. He had to use heavy medicine. The Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill was said to be able to save a person as long as they were still breathing. It was especially effective on the injuries on his meridians."]},{"number":1250,"title":"Chapter 1250 Marquis Zhongxin’s Regret, Danger Drops From the Sky!","paragraphs":["1250 Marquis Zhongxin’s Regret, Danger Drops From the Sky!","This was what Chu Yunfan had been looking for, but Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Grass was hard to come by. He had been looking high and low but had failed to find it.","And now, Wan Huang had brought him a complete herb. This herb could have been transplanted into Chu Yunfan’s personal herb mountain. After that, Chu Yunfan would be able to continuously cultivate the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Grass.","Of course, the main reason was that Chu Yunfan was still unable to open the Mountain River Diagram. Otherwise, he could cultivate many medicinal herbs himself and did not need to buy them from others.","Right now, he was still using his own pocket dimension. However, this pocket dimension could not be compared to the Mountain River Diagram. It was much smaller and did not have the various magical uses of the Mountain River Diagram.","In any case, with such a complete Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Grass, Chu Yunfan could keep the seeds of the herb and use the rest to make the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill. This would be the best of both worlds.","He had previously learned that the price of this Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Grass was not cheap. It cost more than two million low-grade spirit stones. Most importantly, this herb was not easy to find.","The environment in which the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Grass lived was extremely harsh. It had to be at the intersection of Yin and Yang where Yang energy flourished but had Yin energy intersecting it. Such harsh places were not easy to find, so the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Grass had always been difficult to find.","To find it, one needed copious amounts of time. Now that Wan Huang had sent one over, Chu Yunfan would be able to save at least a few months of time.","Chu Yunfan took the herb and scanned it with his spiritual will. After confirming that there were no problems, he put them into the pocket dimension he had opened up and said, “I’ve felt your sincerity. It’s rare for you to be so sincere. In that case, I won’t treat you badly.”","After saying that, Chu Yunfan flicked his finger and a talisman flew out from his palm and stopped before Wan Huang.","“This is a sealing talisman that I condensed myself. The seal on Wan Feihong’s body cannot be opened without this sealing talisman. Inject some divine power into it and the seal will naturally be opened,” Chu Yunfan said.","The seal he used to seal Wan Feihong was a secret technique recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. It was a supreme secret technique from the Ancient Zenith Civilization. One could imagine how precious it was.","At the same time, its power was beyond doubt. It was not something that ordinary people could open. Without the user’s permission, unless one could invite a Core to forcefully break it, it was basically impossible to open.","This was because Chu Yunfan’s power was slightly weaker at that time. If he had recovered to his peak, even a Core would not be able to break the seal he had set up.","“Thank you, Master Chu! Thank you, Master Chu!”","Wan Huang thanked him profusely. He did not care about the strange looks of the people around him. To him, there was nothing more important than his son.","During this period of time, he had been thoroughly tormented. Fortunately, he had decisively lowered his head in the end. Otherwise, who knew how much more horrible things would have got?","Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm, but he was secretly extremely excited. This was related to the recovery of his injuries. After more than a year, he finally saw the possibility of recovery.","Once he recovered, he would be able to roam the world as he wished.","When everyone saw this scene, they were extremely emotional. If they were not sure that they had not misjudged the person, they would have thought that they had seen a fake Wan Huang.","The legendary Wan Huang was extremely irritable. How could he speak in such a low voice?","It was as if he had taken the wrong medicine!","However, everyone understood that even if he had taken the wrong medicine, it was Chu Yunfan who had beaten Wan Huang into submission first. He had made Wan Huang feel that he could not obtain it through force, so he lowered his head in front of Chu Yunfan.","Kong Buyi, Marquis Anguo, Situ Ye, Chu Yaowei, and the leader of the Battle Wolves all realized that from today onwards, Conglong would undergo a huge change.","Even if Chu Yunfan didn’t want to have too much to do with the Chu clan, as long as he came from the Chu clan, it would be of great benefit to the clan.","Even if it was just to raise the tiger skin as a flag, there were still benefits that ordinary people could not imagine.","Chu Yunfan didn’t mind giving such benefits to Marquis Zhongxin’s household. As long as it didn’t affect him, everything was understandable.","Chu Yaowei grew even more solemn. He could see that Chu Yunfan didn’t want to have too much to do with the Chu clan, but it wasn’t the case more than a year ago. If he had paid more attention to Chu Yunfan when he was down and out, or even made Chu Yunfan the heir, then the situation now would be completely different.","The entire Marquis Zhongxin household would welcome its most glorious moment since the first generation. Even more glorious than the first generation, in fact.","After all, the first Marquis Zhongxin was only at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. He was still far from the current Chu Yunfan, not to mention that Chu Yunfan’s future was limitless.","If Chu Yunfan really became a Core, then the Chu clan could be said to be an uncrowned royal family.","However, Chu Yaowei could only wish for it. He knew that it was impossible. At that time, Chu Yunfan did not show any signs of divine power. Unless he was crazy, he would not make Chu Yunfan the heir.","Although he knew that this was the case, he still felt extremely regretful when he thought about it. Glory had been within his reach. It was right in front of him, but he did not cherish it. It was only when he lost it that he regretted it.","“All right, since everyone is here, let the birthday banquet begin!”","When everyone was so shocked that they did not know what to say, the matriarch, who was the first to recover, said.","Although there were many important figures present, including a top figure like Wan Huang, today was her birthday banquet, so it was naturally her home ground.","Everyone came back to their senses and sat down to prepare for the banquet. Only then did they realize that the banquet had not even started yet. However, they only felt that their trip was not in vain. What happened today was more attractive than the birthday banquet itself.","Once the news spread, all of Conglong would be in a complete uproar.","Just as everyone sat down, all the experts present suddenly stood up from their seats and looked at the sky vigilantly.","Chu Yunfan was no exception. He was the first to react."]},{"number":1251,"title":"Chapter 1251 The Villians Finally Appears, the Netherworld Sect!","paragraphs":["1251 The Villians Finally Appears, the Netherworld Sect!","A sudden change occurred!","Everyone jumped up, especially since there were many Divines present. These experts were extremely sensitive to the changes in the spirit energy of nature. They instantly reacted when the change occurred.","However, they had yet to react to what was going on. They were even a little dumbfounded because they had never thought that there would actually be danger in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","This was Conglong, the hidden dragon of the Great Wei Kingdom’s founding ancestor. Although it could not compare to the Imperial City, there were still many experts here. Even those ruthless characters who were lawless in the outer realms did not dare to be presumptuous in Conglong.","Even if there was a problem, it should be the problem of the entire Conglong and not the problem of Marquis Zhongxin.","Therefore, many people were stunned. They didn’t expect that there would be danger here and that someone would actually dare to attack Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","However, they immediately came back to their senses. No matter how unbelievable it was, it still happened.","“Who dares to cause trouble in my house?!” Chu Yaowei shouted and flew into the sky.","However, before he could continue speaking, a big hand appeared out of thin air and slapped him.","Bam!","Chu Yaowei grunted and flew backward. He landed on the ground and created a huge pit.","When everyone saw Chu Yaowei’s condition, they couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. At this moment, Chu Yaowei’s entire body was covered in blood, and there was a huge handprint on his chest. It was the result of being slapped by that big hand.","“Yaowei!” The Matriarch immediately dashed to Chu Yaowei’s side.","At this moment, the people of the Chu clan were also in an uproar. They were completely flustered and did not know what to do.","Kong Buyi, Marquis Anguo, Situ Ye, and the Battle Wolf gang leader all had solemn expressions. They were all top-notch experts, and they had completely released their auras.","Although Chu Yaowei’s strength was not at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, he was definitely not weak. However, he was seriously injured by a palm strike. This kind of strength was simply terrifying.","If it were them, they would not fare any better.","They immediately understood that there was a top-notch expert present today, and that person was at least at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, or even a half-step Core.","If that were the case, then today’s matter would be tricky.","They didn’t bring enough experts because they didn’t expect to encounter any danger here. However, they just happened to encounter danger.","These people all looked at Chu Yunfan. At this time, it seemed that the only person they could rely on was Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan reacted quickly. In a single stride, he had already arrived beside Chu Yaowei. With a flip of his palm, a healing pill had already been fed into Chu Yaowei’s mouth.","Chu Yaowei’s expression immediately turned for the better. The bloodstains on his body started to dry and fall off. The handprint on his chest also gradually disappeared.","“What a powerful healing pill!”","Kong Buyi was a knowledgeable person. When he saw this scene, he couldn’t help but exclaim. Compared to others, he knew the power of this healing pill. Even if he wanted to treat Chu Yaowei’s injuries, it would take a long time. However, he didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to stabilize Chu Yaowei’s injuries with just one healing pill. He even began to recover.","However, this was clearly not the time to think about this.","After stabilizing Chu Yaowei’s injuries, Chu Yunfan looked up at the sky and said, “Where did you come from, friend? Why don’t you show yourself? It’s not a good habit to hide.”","Everyone followed Chu Yunfan’s gaze and saw a figure slowly appear. It was an old man with white hair and a youthful face. He wore a smile on his face, but he didn’t change his expression at all under everyone’s gaze.","He just sneered at everyone and said, “What a lively birthday banquet. However, it seems that this birthday banquet is going to become a funeral banquet!","“It’s just that I didn’t expect to see Longevity Pills. This is simply too good. Hahahaha, it seems that my luck has really changed!”","The black-robed old man laughed. He did not put anyone in his eyes at all. In his eyes, these people were like ants. There was nothing to pay attention to.","He felt that he was extremely lucky. Someone had sent him a pillow when he was sleepy. There was actually a legendary thing like the Longevity Pill. One pill could extend one’s life by 20 years. This was surely a top-notch pill of its kind.","After taking the pills, his lifespan would surely be extended greatly. He might even have the hope of breaking through to the legendary realm.","Then he looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “I didn’t expect you to be able to find my hiding place. You have good eyes.”","“Do you think you can hide from me with your inferior invisibility skills?” Chu Yunfan sneered, then looked in another direction and said, “Since you’re here too, why don’t you show yourself? Do you think I can’t see you?”","Everyone’s heart trembled. They were extremely shocked. One had to know that they did not notice the existence of another person. However, it was obvious that they all believed Chu Yunfan at this moment.","At this moment, the previously silent Wan Huang suddenly thought of something, and his eyes revealed a hint of fear.","“Impossible! Why are those from the outer realms attacking us?!”","“You know where they came from?” Chu Yunfan saw Wan Huang’s expression and guessed that he must have known something, so he asked directly.","“If I’m not wrong, they should be the Black and White Emissaries of the Netherworld Sect from the outer realms.” Wan Huang said after taking a deep breath.","He felt that he was very unlucky today. He was only here to apologize to Chu Yunfan and find a way to save his son. Who knew that he would actually encounter such a thing?","When he thought of the terrifying legends of these two people, he felt uneasy.","“The Netherworld Sect?” Most of the people present were dumbfounded. They had no idea what kind of sect this was, but only the Marquis Anguo suddenly recalled something.","” The Netherworld Sect? How could it?!” Marquis Anguo said in shock, “How could the Netherworld Sect have bypassed the defense line and appeared here?!”"]},{"number":1252,"title":"Chapter 1252 The Horrifying Legend of Netherworld Sect’s The Emissaries","paragraphs":["1252 The Horrifying Legend of Netherworld Sect’s The Emissaries","Marquis Anguo suddenly thought of something and exclaimed.","Everyone’s gaze turned toward him.","Marquis Anguo took a deep breath and said, “The Netherworld Sect is a demonic sect and not a part of the Great Wei Kingdom. It’s normal that you don’t know about them. The Netherworld Sect is a sect based in the Jinzhanghan Kingdom in the north.”","Most of the crowd was dumbfounded. They did not know what the Netherworld Sect was and what the Jinzhanghan Kingdom was.","Only Kong Buyi and the others changed their expressions. They knew a little about the Jinzhanghan Kingdom. Although it was only hearsay, it was enough.","Most people would never leave the Great Wei Kingdom in their entire lives. They would only think that the Great Wei Kingdom was vast and that this was the entire world. However, these high-level elites knew that the Great Wei Kingdom was only one corner of the world.","In the north, there was an extremely powerful country called the Jinzhanghan Kingdom. It was a powerful kingdom established by the nomads in the north.","At the beginning of the establishment of the Great Wei Kingdom, they had fought against the Jinzhanghan Kingdom. At that time, they had only faced a single ten thousand households of the Jinzhanghan Kingdom, but it had almost caused the newly established Great Wei Kingdom to be filled with hatred and almost be destroyed.","Of course, at that time, the Great Wei Kingdom had used the entire nation’s strength to wipe out the disaster. After that, the Jinzhanghan Kingdom never appeared in public again.","Therefore, most people had already completely forgotten what had happened back then. Moreover, so much time had passed. Unless one specialized in history, they would not remember.","However, these people were different. As the elites and higher-ups of the Great Wei Kingdom, they naturally knew many things that ordinary people did not know.","The matter of the Jinzhanghan Kingdom was one of them.","As Marquis Anguo held a portion of military power, he naturally knew that there was such a powerful existence in the north of the Great Wei Kingdom.","The Netherworld Sect was a powerful sect in the Jinzhanghan Kingdom. In the Great Wei Kingdom, ordinary people did not know about it. However, Wan Huang was different. His Inherited Sword Manor was built near the border. He knew much more than ordinary people there.","Because of this, when he saw these two people, his expression changed.","Due to the protection of the Great Wei Kingdom’s imperial court, although the border of the Great Wei Kingdom was often in flames, the country was still relatively stable. However, these sects that were close to the outer realms had heard of the power of the Black and White Emissaries of the Netherworld Sect.","The Emissaries often massacred other sects. Those who obeyed them prospered and those who opposed them died. No one dared to resist them as behind them was the behemoth, the Netherworld Sect.","Wan Huang did not hide anything and told everyone about the rumors of The Emissaries because he was not sure who The Emissaries were after. It seemed that they were after the Chu clan or even Chu Yunfan.","However, with the temper of these two old monsters, they might kill him too. This was very likely and was in line with the style of these two old fellows.","Wan Huang had no other choice. If it was anyone else, he could still watch from the sidelines. However, if it was these two old fellows opposite him, it was a different matter.","He knew that he was famous for his bad temper. However, he was just bad-tempered. In fact, he was still reasonable. However, these two fellows did not operate by logic. If they were in a bad mood, they would kill people. They would easily uproot a sect and slaughter them. Not even chickens or dogs were left alive.","At this moment, everyone felt cold sweat all over their bodies. The person who came was actually such a terrifying existence. They no longer had the thought of watching a good show. According to Wan Huang, with the way these two old fellows acted, none of them would be able to escape today.","“I didn’t expect that there would be someone in the Great Wei Kingdom who knows the two of us so well!” The black-robed old man burst into laughter. “For the sake of this, I’ll let you die a quick death. What do you think, Wan Huang?”","Although it was rumored that The Emissaries were only at the half-step Core Stage, these two old fellows had entered the half-step Core Stage at least a hundred years earlier than him.","Although he didn’t know why they hadn’t been able to step into the Core Stage, this kind of strength accumulated over time was simply terrifying. Ordinary half-step Cores would simply die without a burial ground if they encountered them.","As a matter of fact, he knew that the experts who had died in their hands were half-step Cores. The two of them even had a record of escaping from the hands of Cores.","Even a Core had chased after them with all his might, but he still died in vain. One could imagine how notorious these two people were in the outer realms.","“Emissaries, this has nothing to do with me. Don’t involve me in this. I’ll retreat immediately!” Wan Huang had no moral integrity at all. He turned around and wanted to run.","Everyone was anxious. These two old monsters had such a fierce reputation. They had no chance of winning. They had originally hoped that Wan Huang would be able to resist them until the other experts from Conglong came to support them.","Who knew that Wan Huang did not have such intentions? He planned to flee and sell them out.","“Hahahahaha! Wan Huang, do you think that’s possible? Since you know me, you should know my methods!” The black-robed old man laughed out loud and looked at Wan Huang coldly. “How dare someone of the Great Wei Kingdom kill my disciple! Today, I’m going to avenge him. None of you can leave. I’m going to turn this birthday banquet into a funeral banquet. All of you must die! ”","Everyone understood that The Emissaries had come for revenge, especially when the Black Emissary had said that someone had killed his disciple. No wonder he was willing to take the risk and go deep into the Great Wei Kingdom to kill people.","They were afraid that there was no running today.","“I didn’t kill him. Why are you trying to kill me?” Immediately, someone could not bear the powerful pressure and could not help but shout.","“Indeed, you didn’t kill him, but the killer is among you!” The black emissary laughed sinisterly. “His name is Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, you dared to kill my disciple? You’re dead meat!","“How about we play a game, Chu Yunfan? If you kill yourself, I’ll let one-tenth of the people here go. How about it?”","The black emissary looked at Chu Yunfan playfully. His expression was a little playful. He looked at Chu Yunfan as if he was looking at a dead man."]},{"number":1253,"title":"Chapter 1253 A Thousand People Killed in One Move","paragraphs":["1253 A Thousand People Killed in One Move","When everyone heard the Black Emissary’s words, they all became restless. They could feel an unimaginable terrifying aura from the two elders. It was not something they could resist.","According to Wan Huang, these two people had always been lawless. They would casually and indiscriminately slaughter tribes and sects. They were simply terrifying. Their enemies had no chance of survival.","But now, they said that as long as Chu Yunfan committed suicide, one-tenth of them would be spared. Immediately, many people began to become restless. Although there was only a one-tenth chance, it was better than no chance at all.","Under the pressure of death, many people revealed their ugly colors.","!!","“Chu Yunfan, this is all your fault. They’re here for you, and you’ve implicated us. What else do you have to say for yourself?”","“That’s right. If it weren’t for you, we wouldn’t be faced with such an undeserved disaster!”","“Chu Yunfan, if we sacrifice you, we may live. I beg you. I have a family, I don’t want to die here!”","Suddenly, all kinds of accusations were directed at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a cold smile. He had seen many ugly people, but these people still made him feel disgusted.","The Emissaries did not even say that they would let them go. Even if the Emissaries’ words were trustworthy and let one-tenth of them go, it was only one-tenth.","In order to survive, these people would do anything. There was no doubt that compared to the terrifying Emissaries, Chu Yunfan looked much easier to bully.","No matter how one looked at it, he was not as fierce as the Emissaries.","These people were still too naive. Chu Yunfan looked harmless, but the Emissaries’ kill count was probably lower than Chu Yunfan’s. The Emissaries could only bully some clans and sects at most. How could they compare to Chu Yunfan, who had participated in the real species war?","On the battlefield of species war, Chu Yunfan did not show any mercy when he was killing his enemies. His illustrious reputation in the Federation was built up by countless killings.","“Hahahahaha!”","When the black-robed old man saw that these people immediately had an internal conflict, he immediately laughed out loud. His eyes were filled with ridicule as if he was looking at a group of jumping clowns.","Chu Yunfan was indifferent to everyone’s criticism, but Chu Hongcai, who was beside him, could not help but say, “Are you people crazy? Do you really think they will let us go? Even if we die today, we must have some backbone!”","Those who criticized Chu Yunfan had ugly expressions on their faces. It was not that they did not understand this, but the problem was that they were more afraid of death. Even if there was a slight chance, they did not want to give up.","“That’s right. Even if I die today, I can’t let such a person see me as a joke!” At this moment, the matriarch walked over step by step. The tyranny of the Emissaries had stimulated the stubbornness in her bones.","Once upon a time, she had accompanied the previous Marquis Zhongxin on the battlefield and fought for the country. She was by no means a sheltered woman.","Hearing the matriarch’s words, everyone became more clear-headed. They were afraid that the Emissaries would not let them off, so their expressions became more determined.","Seeing this scene, the Black Emissary said coldly, “Old woman, I think you’re courting death!”","Suddenly, the black emissary made a move. A large hand appeared out of thin air and grabbed at the matriarch like a ghost claw. The matriarch’s idea of letting him watch the monkey show completely vanished. She closed her eyes, knowing that she could not escape this calamity.","Although the Emissaries had come for Chu Yunfan, she had never criticized him.","Slash!","Just as the ghost claw was about to grab the matriarch, a sword ray fell from the sky and cut off the ghost claw.","Bam!","The ghost claw fell to the ground and turned into spirit energy that filled the sky, disappearing without a trace.","Everyone’s spirits were lifted. When they looked over, it was none other than Chu Yunfan. He had casually pointed his finger and used it as a sword to chop off the ghost claw.","“Didn’t you come to kill me? I want to see what tricks you two old fellows have.” Chu Yunfan walked up to the sky step by step. “What bullsh*t Netherworld Sect’s Black and White Emissaries? You two have been praised too much. Do they really think you’re invincible? You actually dared to barge into the Great Wei Kingdom alone? I think you guys are courting death.”","Chu Yunfan was fearless in the face of the pressure from the two masters. He just looked at them coldly.","“Who said we came alone?”","The square-faced White Emissary sneered and waved his hand. Suddenly, a violent spatial fluctuation appeared in the sky. Immediately after, groups of Netherworld Sect disciples in yellow uniforms appeared in the air like a military formation.","There were actually over a thousand people. In just a moment, they had already appeared above the residence.","Everyone wailed. The Emissaries alone had already given them no hope of escaping, let alone the thousands of Netherworld Sect disciples. It was clear that the Emissaries of the Netherworld Sect had come prepared. They wanted to slaughter the entire residence.","“Just in time!” Chu Yunfan sneered and shouted.","He raised his right hand up high. In an instant, countless bolts of lightning shot out from under his feet. Behind him, a dense sea of weapons formed. There were knives, spears, swords, halberds, and all manners of weapons.","All the Netherworld Sect disciples were powerful existences at the peak of the Innate Stage, and more than one-third of them were Divines. The Netherworld Sect’s deep foundation could be seen from this.","However, these people were no match for Chu Yunfan’s sea of weapons. Whether they were in the Innate Stage or the Divine Abilities Stage, there was no difference at all. They couldn’t even take one move from Chu Yunfan.","The thousands of Netherworld Sect disciples were all blown up in mid-air.","Before the thousands of Netherworld Sect disciples could start killing, they were all killed by Chu Yunfan, turning into a rain of blood that fell from the sky."]},{"number":1254,"title":"Chapter 1254 Punches and Kicks, Spitting Blood","paragraphs":["1254 Punches and Kicks, Spitting Blood","Thousands of Netherworld Sect disciples had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands in an instant!","No one had expected him to start using his ultimate move without a word. It was a move that could destroy the world!","Everyone was stunned. Even the Emissaries of the Netherworld Sect and Wan Huang, who was also a half-step Core, were stunned.","In fact, not everyone was good at group battles. If the Emissaries could use powerful moves like Chu Yunfan’s, there would be no need to find thousands of Netherworld Sect disciples.","eaglesnov1,o","It was impossible for a city as big as Conglong to not have a single expert. Unlike Wan Huang who came to find trouble with Chu Yunfan, these people were real outsiders to the Great Wei Kingdom. It could even be said that they were like mortal enemies.","They had to fight for time.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He casually blasted out an attack that was like a sky full of broken stars. Many experts who really knew how to do it could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. Just this move alone, let alone other things, Chu Yunfan’s profound cultivation was indeed rare.","After releasing such a big move, Chu Yunfan’s breathing did not seem labored in the slightest. This move clearly did not consume much of his energy.","“The famous Netherworld Sect is nothing more than this. It can’t even withstand a single blow!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The Emissaries were so angry that their faces turned red. Originally, they had treated the people of the Chu clan as prey. Before the slaughter, they had only teased their prey a little. Who knew that this prey would actually bite them back?","There were thousands of elites from the Netherworld Sect, and among them, there was no lack of powerful Divines. Those who had been called upon by the Emissaries were naturally their trusted subordinates. However, all of them died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. The loss was so great that it was enough to make their hearts bleed.","“You’re courting death!” the Emissaries shouted in unison. Their eyes were filled with killing intent as they stared at Chu Yunfan.","“Previously, you killed my disciple, and today you killed thousands of my Netherworld Sect disciples. You’re dead meat!” the Black Emissary shouted and took the lead to attack Chu Yunfan.","“Tri-Sun Tyrant Hand!”","The Black Emissary stretched out his hand. In an instant, his entire person was like a huge sun as he instantly blasted out.","In the blink of an eye, it was as if three suns had appeared. These three suns instantly smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","“Die!”","These three suns were formed from the martial arts intent realm, but their power was equally terrifying. It was as if they could scorch the entire ground.","“You dare to show off your insignificant skills in front of me?!” Chu Yunfan shouted and punched out. The three suns formed by the martial intent realm were instantly shattered.","It exposed the hand of the Black Emissary. What kind of hand was that? It was as if it had dominated the world and released a terrifying pressure.","Below, Wan Huang was about to run away. He could feel the pressure that this huge hand had on him. He felt that it was simply terrifying. Although they were both half-step Cores, he could feel that there was a clear gap between his cultivation and these two old fellows.","These two old fellows were probably among the small group of people who were qualified to step into the Core Stage. Although he was also a half-step Core, he was still far from touching that threshold.","They were simply incomparable.","Although the Black Emissary’s martial intent realm had been broken, his attack did not slow down. In almost an instant, it had reached Chu Yunfan.","Clank!","When the Black Emissary’s hand landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, a sound like the sound of metal clashing could be heard.","Chu Yunfan didn’t budge, and the mocking smile on the Black Emissary’s face finally began to fade. His attack had indeed hit Chu Yunfan, but it didn’t have the proper corresponding effect.","“What are you doing? Scratching my itch?” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud.","The Black Emissary immediately knew that things were difficult and was about to retreat. However, he saw Chu Yunfan, who had not moved much just now, suddenly move.","Chu Yunfan slapped out with his palm. It was a simple strike, but it made the Black Emissary feel that he could not dodge. Seeing that Chu Yunfan’s slap seemed to have pierced through space and was about to hit him, he shouted and quickly swept out another Tri-Sun Tyrant Hand.","Chu Yunfan’s simple slap didn’t have any extra movements. No matter if it was the Tri-Sun Tyrant Hand or any other move, it was all smashed into pieces. In an instant, his palm had already arrived in front of the Black Emissary.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s palm collided with the Tri-Sun Tyrant Hand, and a terrifying wave swept out. Everyone saw that the intent of the Tri-Sun Tyrant Hand was directly shattered by Chu Yunfan and then turned into spirit energy that scattered all over the sky.","Thud, thud, thud.","In the sky, the Black Emissary was thrown far away. It was caused by Chu Yunfan’s slap. He almost retreated out of the range of the residence before he finally stopped. His face was red and white. He finally suppressed the terrifying blood and qi that was surging in his heart.","This slap almost exploded his blood essence.","A hint of fear flashed across the Black Emissary’s eyes. If he had not decided to take the attack head-on and had retreated to avoid the attack, he would have lost all his blood and energy.","“How can someone’s physical cultivation reach such a level?!”","He had seen all kinds of experts in his life, but he had never seen an existence as terrifying as Chu Yunfan. This type of expert was even rarer.","“You’re nothing.” Chu Yunfan grinned.","In the blink of an eye, he had already pounced forward and was standing right in front of the Black Emissary. Then, everyone saw him punch and kick like a beginner. They were all very simple movements.","It did not look like a fight between Divines, but it looked like a fight between physique experts. Their movements were fierce and ruthless.","This move that should have been extinct among Divines and higher-level experts was extremely terrifying when Chu Yunfan executed it.","No one dared to underestimate his technique. They were simple moves, but they forced the Black Emissary into a corner and almost made him vomit blood."]},{"number":1255,"title":"Chapter 1255 Treasure Robe Spirit Weapon","paragraphs":["1255 Treasure Robe Spirit Weapon","Everyone could clearly see that Chu Yunfan’s martial arts, although simple, was extremely powerful.","For the first time, everyone realized why martial arts emphasized the physique as the foundation of everything. It was just that they had never truly realized how terrifying it was to cultivate the body to the extreme.","They only treated their body as a bowl that contained divine power and dharma power. It was rare to see someone like Chu Yunfan who persisted in tempering his body day after day.","However, once trained, their power was unimaginable.","Chu Yunfan’s moves were simple. They were just simple punches and kicks, but they all had great power. A casual kick could shatter a mountain. One could imagine how terrifying these moves were.","!!","The Black Emissary didn’t dare to underestimate Chu Yunfan. He had to use all his strength to block the attacks. Just this alone was enough to make him vomit blood. He couldn’t fight back at all. Even if he could, his attack couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","On the contrary, as long as Chu Yunfan hit him, it would be enough to injure him grievously.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it happened in a short period. The Black Emissary, who had previously threatened everyone with his aura and forced everyone to a dead end, was forced into a corner just like that.","“Chu Yunfan, you should be proud of yourself for forcing me to this extent!”","The Black Emissary was naturally not a kind person. His eyes suddenly opened wide, and countless black energy instantly boiled around his body, forming rings of light around him. He was actually able to resist Chu Yunfan’s punches and kicks and was not easily injured.","With this layer of black light, the Black Emissary was no longer as passive as before. He actually dared to fight fiercely with Chu Yunfan.","The circle of black light shone darkness onto the entire residence, turning day into night, and the Black Emissary was the king of this darkness.","At this moment, he released his powerful cultivation. It could even be said that he was getting stronger and stronger as he fought.","“Chu Yunfan, you are no match for me!”","The black emissary burst into laughter, and his smile was once again filled with dominance.","Chu Yunfan looked at the Black Emissary coldly. He could tell that the robe of light on the Black Emissary was an artifact. It might even be a magic weapon that had surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage and reached the Core Stage.","Treasures used by Divines were called magic tools. Above magic weapons were spirit weapons used by Cores. They were different as spirit weapons were sentient and could even attack of their own will. They had great power.","However, spirit weapons were rare. Even Cores might not be able to have one because it required very precious materials to inject it with spirit energy. It was a very difficult process.","Some of the weaker Cores didn’t even have such a treasure. Chu Yunfan had not expected the Black Emissary to have a treasure robe spirit weapon on him. This was even rarer than ordinary spirit weapons.","No wonder the Emissaries were able to roam the outer realms and even escape from the hands of Cores. With such weapons, they were indeed capable.","“Tri-Sun Tyrant Hand!”","The Black Emissary laughed loudly and slapped at Chu Yunfan again. With the support of the treasure robe on his body, the power of this move increased.","“It’s over! Chu Yunfan is finished!”","At this moment, Wan Huang’s face was ashen. The Emissaries were too terrifying. They were already far stronger than him. Now that they were wearing these treasure robes, it was impossible to defeat them.","It was because of this that the Black Emissary looked down on Wan Huang. It would not be difficult for him to kill Wan Huang. They were both half-step Cores, but their strengths were worlds apart.","“Petty tricks. Do you think you can compete with me just because you have a magic tool?”","At this time, Chu Yunfan finally became serious. The Emissaries were famous half-step Cores, but Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying. Killing half-step Cores was as easy as eating and drinking for him.","The Black Emissary was too naive to think that he could fight against Chu Yunfan with just a treasure robe.","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly, and steam came out of his nose. He stepped forward as if he was stepping on heaven and earth. He then clenched his fist and punched out.","Boom!","This time, the terrifying attacks from both sides once again clash. Previously, Chu Yunfan’s attacks could suppress the Black Emissary. This time, they were fighting on level ground. It was difficult to determine the winner.","It was a shocking scene.","The Black Emissary’s first attack failed, and he attacked again. His movements were extremely fast, like lightning that tore through the night sky. He appeared and disappeared unpredictably. Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, calmly blocked the Black Emissary’s attacks.","At this moment, the two people in the arena were fighting hard, as if it was difficult to tell who was stronger.","Chu Yunfan’s physique cultivation was invincible. No one knew how he had cultivated such a terrifying physical body. Although the Black Emissary was not as good as Chu Yunfan, he could compete with Chu Yunfan after wearing the treasure robe.","For a moment, it seemed that it was difficult to determine the victor. The crowd was shocked. No one had expected Chu Yunfan to unleash such terrifying combat strength at a critical moment.","After Wan Huang and the others’ round of explanation, everyone knew how terrifying the Emissaries were. They were terrifying existences that had been unkilled for so many years.","However, Chu Yunfan was able to fight the Black Emissary on his own. Before the Black Emissary used his spirit weapon, he was unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan.","This was absolutely terrifying!","The Emissaries were both over two hundred years old, while Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties, which was only one-tenth of their age.","Many people were even more shocked. How did Chu Yunfan cultivate to this extent?","But even so, many felt that he had no chance of winning. Chu Yunfan could only block one Emissary at most. On the other side, there was the White Emissary whose strength was unknown, but he was probably not weaker than the Black Emissary.","The entire residence was still doomed.","Everyone looked at Wan Huang, hoping that this half-step Core would step forward. Who knew that Wan Huang would simply curse out loud under everyone’s gaze?","Today was really an undeserved disaster. If he could have won, he would have stood up long ago!","He was no match for the White Emissary. They were both half-step Cores, but their cultivation levels were worlds apart.","At this moment, the Black Emissary was in high spirits, but he still noticed the passage of time. He immediately shouted, “Hey Whitey, what are you looking at? I’ll hold this guy back. You kill the rest, then we’ll work together to get rid of this Chu Yunfan. Don’t forget. We don’t have much time left!”"]},{"number":1256,"title":"Chapter 1256 The Black Emissary Loses Badly","paragraphs":["1256 The Black Emissary Loses Badly","When the Black Emissary reminded the White Emissary, he suddenly remembered that they did not have much time left.","When the experts of Conglong discovered that something was wrong, they might intervene. At that time, things would be troublesome.","An endless stream of experts from the Great Wei Kingdom would come to rescue them and chase after them. Although they were not afraid, they knew how troublesome it would be.","If they attracted a Core, it would be a real big problem.","Although they had a record of escaping from a Core, they knew that it was more or less due to luck. It was still impossible for them to defeat a Core. It was even difficult for them to protect themselves.","“It’s too early for you to be happy if you think that victory is in your grasp now!”","Just when the Black Emissary thought that he could stall Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan had already begun to move. Unlike before, when he only used his fists and feet, this time, his martial arts conception was completely released.","Behind him, an incomparably huge golden asura formed.","“It has appeared!” Wan Huang exclaimed. He remembered how Chu Yunfan had beaten him up and forced him to flee. That feeling had not been good.","He knew that Chu Yunfan was serious.","At this moment, Wan Huang could not help but feel a little hopeful. If Chu Yunfan attacked with all his strength, they might have a chance. After all, Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength before this.","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan had already pressed down on the Black Emissary. With the force of a thunderbolt, he threw a simple punch, but the sky apart.","The terrifying fist pressure pressed down and smashed down on the Black Emissary.","The Black Emissary’s expression changed. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation erupted. He realized that there was a fundamental mistake in his previous assumption. He thought that Chu Yunfan had already done his best.","However, now was the time for Chu Yunfan to use his full strength.","“Impossible!”","The Black Emissary couldn’t believe it. Chu Yunfan hadn’t even used his full strength, but he was already on par with him. The overwhelming pressure made him breathless as if he was facing a Core.","In fact, his feeling was not wrong. Unlike him, who was at the half-step Core Stage, Chu Yunfan had truly stepped into that level. It was just that he was not at the peak now, but the pressure was still there. It was just that no one had been able to force him to this extent before this.","The Black Emissary roared, and the divine power in his entire body boiled, turning into endless black light that swept out. The Tri-Sun Tyrant Hand that were blasted out once again turned into a destructive force that swept directly toward Chu Yunfan. He wanted to devour Chu Yunfan completely!","However, all of his counterattacks were nothing in front of Chu Yunfan’s Asura Fist. It directly shattered his attack.","Unlike the Black Emissary who was gritting his teeth, Chu Yunfan easily suppressed all of the Black Emissary’s counterattacks.","“What terrifying power!”","“Am I seeing things? Is this Chu Yunfan’s true strength?”","“He can’t be a Core, right?”","“A monster! He’s a monster!”","At this moment, many experts in the residence were dumbstruck. However, they didn’t dare to get close and hid far away. They all set up barriers and cooperated with the barriers in the residence to prevent themselves from being affected.","If they were fighting in the wild, the battle between the two of them would be enough to turn an entire area into nothingness.","Many Divines had only heard of how terrifying a half-step Core was, but they had never seen one before. Now that they had seen it for real, they would never forget it.","Ever since he was defeated by Chu Yunfan, he had always wanted to spar with Chu Yunfan again. Now, he realized that Chu Yunfan had defeated them without even using 1% of his strength.","The two sides could not be mentioned in the same breath.","Just as everyone was sighing, they saw Chu Yunfan crush all of the Black Emissary’s defenses with one punch. Then, he pressed down on the Black Emissary, and a big hand appeared out of thin air. This big hand was different from the ordinary Qi-condensed attack. It was not condensed from spirit energy.","It was all kinds of talismans. Then, they saw Chu Yunfan’s big hand grab the Black Emissary. Chu Yunfan pulled away the treasure robe on his body inch by inch, and blood immediately spurted out.","This was because the spirit artifact had already fused with the Black Emissary’s body. Now, Chu Yunfan was completely pulling it apart inch by inch.","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. Chu Yunfan was going to completely pull away the spirit weapon from the Black Emissary’s body and separate them.","Wan Huang was dumbfounded. As a half-step Core, he understood how terrifying this was. If it were him, it would be impossible for him to do this.","Only those who were terrifyingly strong could suppress the Black Emissary so that he could not move. Only then could they have the strength to forcefully strip away the spirit weapon.","He didn’t even dare to think about facing experts of the same realm as him.","At this moment, there was only one thought left in Wan Huang’s mind. ‘Is Chu Yunfan really a monster? How is he so terrifying?!’","Not only Wan Huang, but even the people in the residence almost fainted from suffocation. They all knew that Chu Yunfan was very strong. After all, he was able to fight Wan Huang and beat him up like a stray dog, forcing Wan Huang to personally apologize.","However, this was too strongso strong that it exceeded everyone’s expectations.","“Impossible! My treasure robe! How is that possible?!” the Black Emissary shouted.","He had relied on this spirit weapon to escape from Cores. If not for this, how could he have escaped? But now, when facing Chu Yunfan, it was even more terrifying than facing a Core!","He felt that he had completely lost control. It was as if his connection with the spirit weapon had been cut off, and it was being pulled out of his body bit by bit.","This feeling was extremely terrifying!","It was as if his life force was draining away from his body.","“Whitey, save me!” the Black Emissary roared.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only been a moment. The treasure robe on his body had been stripped off by Chu Yunfan, and blood sprayed everywhere. He had already become like a bloody man and no longer had the majestic appearance from before."]},{"number":1257,"title":"Chapter 1257 Refining the Black Dragon Night Robe, Greatly Strengthened","paragraphs":["1257 Refining the Black Dragon Night Robe, Greatly Strengthened","Chu Yunfan pulled out the Black Emissary’s spirit weapon inch by inch. It was as if he was pulling it out of the Black Emissary’s flesh and blood.","Chu Yunfan grabbed at the treasure robe with his hand. When everyone saw this, they almost fainted. His fighting method was too brutal. The Black Emissary, who had killed countless people in the outer realms, could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had actually managed to pull away the treasure robe. It was already very obvious who would win.","Without his spirit weapon, the Black Emissary’s ferocity was greatly reduced. He could no longer be like before, where his every move made the residence tremble in fear.","After taking away the spirit weapon, Chu Yunfan sent his divine will into it. In just a moment, he had already refined the spirit weapon.","At the same time, he had already understood all the information about this treasure robe. This spirit weapon was originally called the Black Dragon Night Robe. It was a spirit weapon grade treasure robe. Not only was its defense invincible, but it could also resonate with one’s divine power, increasing the power of one’s attacks.","It could even increase the original foundation of its user by 30%.","Don’t underestimate the power of only 30%. One should know that the power of a half-step Core or even a Core was unimaginable. Even an increase of 10% was terrifying, not to mention an increase of 30%.","The Black Emissary’s strength had increased greatly because of this Black Dragon Night Robe. The key was that his defense was very shocking. No matter how Chu Yunfan attacked, he could not break this Black Dragon Night Robe.","Of course, the most important factor was that Chu Yunfan was not at his peak.","However, the value of this robe was unquestionable. In the hands of the Black Emissary, it was like casting pearls before swine. In Chu Yunfan’s hands, it was truly terrifying.","Chu Yunfan was already very terrifying, but now that he had increased the power of his attack by 30%, it was truly terrifying!","“Impossible!”","The Black Emissary immediately felt that Chu Yunfan had cut off his connection with the Black Dragon Night Robe. He spat out a mouthful of blood. In order to refine the robe, he had spent more than three years before finally succeeding.","However, Chu Yunfan had wiped out his primordial spirit in just a few moves. Three years of hard work had gone to waste. He clearly had an extremely powerful technique to easily erase the Black Emissary’s rudimentary technique.","This was a technique from the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, which was not something the Black Emissary could compare to.","“This treasure robe is good stuff. In your hands, it’s like casting pearls before swine.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The Black Emissary’s eyes flashed with fear, but Chu Yunfan only looked at the Black Emissary coldly and said, “You’re just relying on this treasure. Without it, what are you?”","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan made his move. He attacked the Black Emissary. He used his finger as a sword, and then a terrifying sword light appeared out of thin air. It cut through everything in the air and suddenly slashed down toward the Black Emissary.","Wherever the sword light swept past, a terrifying spirit energy tide was set off and rushed in the direction of the Black Emissary. Just as Chu Yunfan was about to kill the Black Emissary, a white light suddenly took the Black Emissary away atlightning speed.","The Black Emissary was still in shock.","“If you didn’t make a move, I’d be dead!” the Black Emissary roared, as if he was expressing his anger at the White Emissary who had just stood by and watched.","The White Emissary didn’t say anything. His expression was extremely solemn as he looked at Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan was too terrifying. He knew the Black Emissary’s strength very well. Naturally, he knew that even he couldn’t defeat the Black Emissary like this.","However, the powerful Black Emissary was so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan. In just a moment, he was defeated. If he didn’t show respect to Chu Yunfan, he would be the one to die.","“It seems that we can only join forces. Only by doing so can we defeat him,” the White Emissary looked at the Black Emissary and said.","The Black Emissary nodded with a solemn expression.","Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention of chasing after him. He took advantage of this time to quickly refine the Black Dragon Night Robe. Soon, the robe slowly fused into Chu Yunfan’s body, becoming one with his flesh and blood.","The more he refined the robe, the more Chu Yunfan felt that it was a waste in the hands of the Black Emissary. The Black Emissary could not exert enough power. He was only a half-step Core, which was the biggest limitation.","But Chu Yunfan was different. He had the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, a martial arts book that was the culmination of the Ancient Zenith Civilization. His cultivation and combat strength had already entered the Core Stage. He was on a completely different level from the Black Emissary.","The Emissaries looked at each other. Almost at the same time, they unleashed their powerful auras. In just a moment, they completely exploded.","The Black Emissary’s black divine power surged into the sky, while White Emissary’s white divine power was like a dazzling sun. The black and white divine power fused together in mid-air, forming a black and white giant.","This giant had completely fused the Black Emissary and the White Emissary together, and the aura that erupted from it was far superior to the aura that the Black Emissary had while wearing the Black Dragon Night Robe.","“Is this their true strength?!” When Wan Huang saw this scene, he was scared silly. Just one of them was an existence that he could not fight against at all, let alone now. The two of them working together made him feel a sense of despair.","It wasn’t just Wan Huang, everyone in the residence felt despair. Facing the Emissaries who had erupted with such shocking strength after fusing, could Chu Yunfan still be a match for them?","Chu Yunfan was calm, but he just looked at the black and white giant coldly.","“Is this your trump card?” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “Watch me break it!”","“Arrogant!”","The angry roars of the Emissaries came from within the giant. Then, the ten-meter-tall giant suddenly moved. Its hands formed a huge seal and smashed it down on Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1258,"title":"Chapter 1258 A Half-Spirit Weapon?","paragraphs":["1258 A Half-Spirit Weapon?","This huge palm smashed down from the sky. Wherever it passed, even the space was sealed. The world became gray and white as if it had turned into a film. In an instant, the hand smashed down onto Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, a dragon’s roar came from Chu Yunfan’s body. Then, a long black dragon rose from his body and protected him.","The giant palm smashed down and collided with the long black dragon. However, the terrifying power of the giant palm that was enough to smash a mountain was actually unable to do anything to the long black dragon, not to mention Chu Yunfan, who was protected by the black dragon.","“Impossible!”","From within the giant, the Black Emissary widened his eyes in shock. This giant was a joint attack technique unique to him and the White Emissary.","Many years ago, the two of them did not have such cultivation. They accidentally entered a cave and obtained an inheritance. Among them was this joint attack technique. Over the years, the two of them had relied on this technique to defeat countless powerful enemies and escape death countless times. No matter what kind of strong enemy it was, as long as they relied on this technique, they could easily defeat a strong enemy that one person alone could not defeat.","However, this law was ineffective on Chu Yunfan. Before they could make a move, the Black Dragon Night Robe on Chu Yunfa’s body had already blocked their attack.","What was even more unbelievable was that it was not Chu Yunfan himself who blocked their attacks, but the robe. Of course, the Black Emissary knew the ultimate form of the robe. However, he had cultivated the robe for so many years but had never been able to truly activate its true form.","This was because he had not cultivated it at all, and his strength was far from enough. However, Chu Yunfan had only justtaken away his robe for a short while and had already refined it to perfection. Chu Yunfan had refined it to a higher level than him.","The giant did not hesitate. It slapped down again and again. The terrifying attacks fell like a meteor shower.","Chu Yunfan was surrounded by the black dragon, and behind him, a pair of lightning wings spread out. He jumped up and instantly rushed toward the giant.","Chu Yunfan punched out, and the raging tide formed shattered the huge palm print that the giant smashed down. None of the attacks could pose a threat to Chu Yunfan.","He threw a punch, and an extremely dangerous aura erupted from his entire body, making people feel suffocated. In an instant, it ruthlessly smashed into the giant.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s fist force tore a huge hole in the giant’s body, and the the Emissaries inside could even be seen.","The two of them were shocked. Chu Yunfan’s aura was too violent and broke all their attacks. When they saw Chu Yunfan directly charge into the giant’s body to capture them, their faces revealed a hint of fierceness.","“Die!”","At this moment, the White Emissary roared and leaped up. A silver-white saber appeared in his hand. This saber was suffused with a silver-white light. If one looked carefully, one could see that these silver-white lights were actually talismans.","These talismans were extremely sharp. When they were condensed, they gave the saber an incomparably sharp feeling.","With just a single slash, the air was sliced apart. It was extremely terrifying, as if a single slash could cut the world in half.","“Is this a spirit weapon? No, it’s a half-spirit weapon!”","Chu Yunfan frowned. He immediately realized that this was not a spirit weapon. Although a part of it had the unique pressure of a spirit weapon, it had yet to completely become a spirit weapon.","This was the so-called half-spirit weapon. Usually, the source of a half-spirit weapon was either a failure when it was refined into a spirit weapon or it had not been refined completely. Only then would it appear in a half-finished state.","However, although it was only a semi-finished spirit weapon, its quality had already surpassed that of a magic weapon. If it was used well, it could even pose a threat to a Core.","Athough this kind of half-spirit weapon was not as valuable as a true spirit weapon, it was still rare. Even among half-step Cores, only a portion of them possessed such an item.","The Emissaries were experienced half-step Cores. Their foundation was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people. Even Wan Huang could not compare to them. Besides a treasure robe, they also had a half-spirit sword.","Any one of them was priceless.","The blade swept across and even the black dragon protecting Chu Yunfan was cut in half. Although the black dragon was powerful, it was formed using energy. Facing this kind of half-spirit weapon, it was like a hot knife cutting through butter.","Just as it was about to hit Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan raised his hand and grabbed the blade.","“You’re courting death. Hahaha, you want to grab the saber with your bare hands?”","The Emissaries burst into laughter. They frantically urged their divine power to cut Chu Yunfan in half.","Clank!","Accompanied by the sound of metal clashing, Chu Yunfan reached out and grabbed the half-spirit weapon.His palm emitted a layer of jade-colored luster. The half-spirit weapon’s blade could cut through the black dragon, but it could not cut through Chu Yunfan’s defense.","In other words, Chu Yunfan’s defense was even more amazing than the Black Dragon Night Robe.","Then, Chu Yunfan grabbed it with all his might. The half-spirit weapon that could destroy the world actually shattered inch by inch before everyone’s eyes.","It turned into light that filled the sky and scattered in all directions.","“How could this be?!”","At this moment, the expression on the White Emissary’s face finally changed. He was no longer as ferocious as before. He truly understood the reason for the despair on the Black Emissary’s face.","Chu Yunfan was too strong—so strong that they couldn’t see any hope!","They were always the ones who brought this kind of despair to others. No one had ever been able to give them such a feeling.","They truly felt death approaching!","Boom!","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He punched out and the black and white giant was blown up. The Emissaries were sent flying and mouthfuls of blood was sprayed into the air."]},{"number":1259,"title":"Chapter 1259 Killing the Black and White Emissaries","paragraphs":["1259 Killing the Black and White Emissaries","The Emissaries were knocked back by Chu Yunfan’s punch and flew backward while vomiting blood. It was only one punch, but the black and white giant released by the two of them could not withstand it.","Extreme fear flashed through their eyes. They thought that the giant they released together was the true limit of a Core. But now, Chu Yunfan’s attack had truly broken their worldview. That was the true limit. If there was anyone, it could only be Chu Yunfan.","The Emissaries looked at Chu Yunfan and were furious. They had been arrogant all their lives. Ever since they entered the half-step Core Stage, they had never suffered such a big loss. Now, they were forced to this point by Chu Yunfan, like stray dogs.","The two of them immediately decided to escape and fled in different directions. At this moment, if they fled separately, there was still a 50% chance of escaping. If they ran together, it might seem like they could stay together for warmth, but in fact, they were really courting death.","Chu Yunfan looked in the direction the two of them had fled in. He sneered and instantly chased after the Black Emissary.","Seeing Chu Yunfan chasing after the Black Emissary, the White Emissary suddenly smiled. Although he had worked with the Black Emissary for many years, when it was time to betray him, he really did not show any mercy and betrayed the Black Emissary in an instant.","When the Black Emissary saw Chu Yunfan chasing after him, he immediately felt his soul leave his body. He turned around and struck out a huge palm print in an attempt to slow Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan was so powerful that he could not slow him down. The giant palm print was blocked by the black dragon on Chu Yunfan’s body and could not pose any threat to him.","In a moment, Chu Yunfan had caught up with the Black Emissary and stomped on him.","The Black Emissary was unable to resist and was stepped on. Chu Yunfan, who had really attacked, was extremely terrifying. In almost an instant, the Black Emissary was crushed into pieces and killed in an instant.","“I can’t accept this!”","The Black Emissary’s scream echoed in the sky. However, it was useless even if he was unwilling. His entire body shattered into pieces and was crushed by Chu Yunfan in mid-air.","He died instantly.","On the other side, the White Emissary heard the Black Emissary’s scream. He felt like his soul was about to leave his body. However, he was already at the edge of the boundary of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. Previously, this boundary was used to prevent anyone from escaping from the residence. Who knew that it would actually become his death at this time?","He realized that he couldn’t penetrate through it immediately. Just as he was about to make a hand seal and pass through it, he saw Chu Yunfan catching up to him.","A pair of lightning wings spread out behind Chu Yunfan’s back. His speed was extremely fast. After killing the Black Emissary, he was still able to catch up with the White Emissary.","The White Emissary thought that the Black Emissary’s death would delay Chu Yunfan’s progress. He was truly naive.","“I’ll fight it out with you!”","The White Emissary saw that Chu Yunfan had caught up with him first. His life force was completely cut off. His eyes widened and he roared as he formed a long saber with his divine power and slashed at Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","When the blade touched Chu Yunfan’s body, it exploded and turned into spirit energy that filled the sky.","A fragment of the saber appeared in Chu Yunfan’s hand. It was a fragment of the half-spirit weapon that the White Emissary had just slashed out.","The fragment suddenly transformed into a shocking saber light that cut through the sky. The White Emissary’s face filled with disbelief. His head had been cut off and sent flying. Even a half-step Core would die if his head was cut off.","In the next moment, the White Emissary’s head exploded. Chu Yunfan pointed out a sword energy and instantly shattered his head.","Chu Yunfan chased the White Emissary all the way to the edge of the residence before finally killing him.","At this point, both the Emissaries had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Everyone was dumbfounded. This series of pursuits sounded long, but in fact, it had ended in just a moment.","The terrifying existence that was so powerful that even Wan Huang, who was a half-step Core Stage, felt suffocated was dealt with by Chu Yunfan in a few moves.","During this process, the Emissaries used many trump cards in succession, dazzling everyone. But even so, before Chu Yunfan, they were vulnerable—completely vulnerable.","From the beginning to the end, they did not pose any real threat to Chu Yunfan.","To the many guests in the residence, today was an eye-opener. In the past, they had only heard of half-step Cores, but in fact, they had never seen them before. Not to mention witnessing the explosive battle between experts of this level.","This was a feeling that it was completely worth it.","In fact, under normal circumstances, they would not have been able to witness such a battle. They now had a clear idea of half-step Cores. No wonder such experts were the overlords of a region.","Half-step Core Stage only possessed some of the power of the Core Stage, but it had already completely surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage.","“This is a half-step Core? If a half-step Core is already so terrifying, then a real Core must be truly invincible!”","“That’s right, it’s too scary. Whether it’s Chu Yunfan or the Emissaries, even if it’s just the aftermath of the battle, if we didn’t have the protection of the barrier, I’m afraid we’d be finished!”","“Forget about the Emissaries, they’re obviously not young. The real scary one is Chu Yunfan. Look at how old he is. He’s at most thirty years old. A half-step Core at thirty years old... My God. If that isn’t a myth, what is it?”","“Even the experts in myths and legends are not so ridiculous!”","Suddenly, many people began to discuss crazily, and many people felt even worse. They had previously criticized Chu Yunfan crazily for their survival. Before this, they thought it was nothing and that Chu Yunfan was dead meat. What else could they have done?","Who knew that the situation had completely turned around. Chu Yunfan killed the Emissaries in a flash.","Back then, they had criticized Chu Yunfan, but now, it felt like they were courting death. Many people instantly felt cold sweat drip down their backs.","They felt as if they were waiting for judgment."]},{"number":1260,"title":"Chapter 1260 The End, the Aftershock","paragraphs":["1260 The End, the Aftershock","Now that they thought about it, it was really ridiculous. In order to survive, they crazily criticized Chu Yunfan and even wanted to use public opinion to force Chu Yunfan to commit suicide.","No one expected him to become someone who could decide life and death. If they had known this earlier, they wouldn’t have criticized him so desperately.","“Is this his true strength?”","At this moment, Chu Yaowei was still stunned. He had only known that Chu Yunfan was hiding his strength, but now he could see it clearly. Chu Yunfan’s hidden strength was not only at the peak Divine Abilities Stage as he had initially thought.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was at the half-step Core Stage. It was even far beyond the ordinary half-step Cores. If Chu Yaowei had not seen it with his own eyes, he would not have believed it.","After all, Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties. He knew that. Compared to Chu Yunfan, he really felt like he had lived a lowly life.","“Well done!” The matriarch nodded profusely.","She was proud of Chu Yunfan. When everyone thought that he was dead meat, he exploded out of nowhere and killed the Emissaries beyond everyone’s expectations. Compared to the other people’s complicated thoughts, her heart was filled with pride.","Compared to the others, Wan Huang felt cold sweat on his back. He suddenly felt that he was really lucky. Fortunately, he had decided to lower his head to Chu Yunfan.","Otherwise, he would have suffered the same fate as the Emissaries. There would be no difference.","Previously, he had only vaguely felt that Chu Yunfan might have let him off, but that was only a guess. Now, he understood that his previous feeling was right. Chu Yunfan had indeed let him off. Otherwise, he would have died at Chu Yunfan’s hands long ago.","It was impossible for there to be any other outcome.","Thinking of this, he felt even more fortunate. He could not even defeat one of the Emissaries. If he really faced Chu Yunfan, the final result would only be death.","He felt like he had just survived a disaster and was overcome by emotion. If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, and someone had told him that there was a person in his twenties who had such a world-shaking cultivation base, he would have slapped that person to death.","Did he really think he was an idiot?","That was simply impossible!","And now, the impossible had happened!","Chu Yunfan slowly descended and said, “I’m sorry to have frightened everyone.”","All of them were crying bitterly, blaming themselves for being blind before, which was why they had acted like that. To express their regret, they all proposed gifts that would satisfy the residence in an increase of tenfold.","Only then did Chu Yunfan nod to show that he would let them go. It could be considered a minor punishment for these fence-sitters.","Chu Yaowei quickly ordered people to clean up the battlefield. Chu Yunfan had blown up more than a thousand people, causing the smell of blood to soar into the sky. It was like a battlefield.","These were all places that needed to be cleaned.","Since such a big incident had already happened, it was naturally impossible for today’s birthday banquet to continue. Everyone dispersed one after another.","The guests left in twos and threes, and the topic of discussion naturally was Chu Yunfan. He was the only topic of focus for them.","Today, apart from the feeling of surviving a disaster, they even felt that their horizons had been broadened. A true expert was so powerful.","There was no doubt that with the departure of these guests, today’s battle would spread throughout the whole of Conglong in the shortest time possible, and Chu Yunfan’s name would no longer be hidden.","No matter how low-key he was, he was destined to become extremely dazzling in the eyes of the various forces of Conglong.","No one could ignore such a powerful expert, and no one would treat Chu Yunfan as a member of the younger generation.","In this world, strength was the most important thing. Strength was the standard that determined everything. After displaying such strength, he naturally would not be underestimated.","After Chu Yunfan accompanied the matriarch for a while, he was about to leave when a servant suddenly walked up to him and said, “Young Master Fan, the Marquis has asked for you.”","Chu Yunfan’s brows furrowed slightly. He did not know why Marquis Zhongxin was looking for him at this time. He immediately followed the servant to a secret room in the depths of the residence. No one could enter this secret room, so Chu Yunfan walked in alone.","As expected, Chu Yaowei had been waiting for a long time.","“Marquis, may I know why you’re looking for me?” Chu Yunfan went straight to the point.","Chu Yaowei smiled bitterly and said, “I didn’t expect a flying dragon like you in our Chu clan. If it weren’t for today’s incident, I’m afraid that we would never know that you have such ability our entire lives.”","Chu Yunfan smiled and didn’t comment. Too many things had happened recently. According to his original plan, he would leave after he recovered his strength. He didn’t want to be too eye-catching. It was best if he didn’t have too much to do with the residence and left quietly.","After all, he was not a real member of the Chu clan. He was just an imposter. Although that person looked the same as him, they were not the same person.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention of going deeper into the topic, Chu Yaowei knew that he should stop and didn’t continue to ask. After all, he knew that Chu Yunfan was so outstanding that his master’s inheritance was probably extraordinary. If Chu Yunfan wasn’t going to say anything, he naturally didn’t want to investigate further, lest he offended Chu Yunfan’s master.","“In that case, I’ll get straight to the point. I just want to ask you one thing. How many half-step Cores like you are needed to kill a Core?”","Chu Yaowei’s words shocked Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yaowei had invited him here to kill a Core."]},{"number":1261,"title":"Chapter 1261 You Won’t Find Another Like Me in the Entire Great Wei Kingdom!","paragraphs":["1261 You Won’t Find Another Like Me in the Entire Great Wei Kingdom!","Surround and kill a Core?","Even Chu Yunfan was shocked by this topic.","It wasn’t that he didn’t think that Cores could be killed, but he knew very well how difficult it was to deal with them.","Back then, the entire Federation had gone all out to kill that God who had just entered the Core Stage. Even the president had planned to sacrifice himself to kill that god of death but had failed in the end. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan’s pills, the president would have died.","One could imagine how amazing a Core was.","For a half-step Core, although it was only half a step away, it was like a natural chasm. Of course, if one didn’t consider Chu Yunfan’s abnormal situation, it was impossible to succeed.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Chu Yaowei and said, “Marquis, are you pulling my leg? I can tell you that there’s no chance of winning even if you surround them with half-step Cores!”","Chu Yunfan shook his head and continued, “You don’t understand how terrifying a Core is. It’s a completely different concept from a half-step Core. Secondly, I’m not boasting here, but you won’t find another person like me in the entire Great Wei Kingdom, and even with my strength, I can barely protect myself in front of a Core.","“You can find any number of half-step Cores and they will all die.”","Before Chu Yaowei could say anything, Wang Zhenxi, who was behind him, had a complete change in his expression. Although the marquis also cultivated, he spent most of his energy on government affairs. But Wang Zhenxi was different. He was a martial arts fanatic. Because of this, he understood how terrifying the information that Chu Yunfan inadvertently revealed was.","Half-step Cores were certainly no match for Cores. He and Chu Yunfan had the same opinion on this point. No matter how many of them came, it would not make any difference to Cores.","It was just like how ordinary peak Divines could not withstand a single blow from half-step Cores, Cores could easily defeat eight or ten of them without any difference.","Moreover, half-step Cores were already overlords in the Great Wei Kingdom. These people were high and mighty and could have anything they wanted. It would be a great price to hire even one of them.","If they had to invite so many of them, the price was unimaginable. And even if they did, it would most likely be useless.","However, what surprised Wang Zhenxi the most wasn’t this, but what Chu Yunfan said. Chu Yunfan said he could protect himself in front of a Core.","His pupils contracted slightly. One should know that his master was also a half-step Core. However, if his master were to face a Core, he would definitely not be a match for him. Therefore, he instinctively refused to believe it.","However, he immediately recalled the shocking scene he had seen today. If his master was to face off against any which one of the Emissaries, he could only protect himself. However, those people were like dolls in Chu Yunfan’s hands and were easily defeated. From this, one could imagine how amazing Chu Yunfan’s strength was.","Wang Zhenxi didn’t believe that others could protect themselves if facing a Core, but he believed Chu Yunfan’s words. However, there was no way to verify this.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Chu Yaowei’s face darkened and he began to grit his teeth. “Is it really impossible?”","Chu Yunfan said, “Marquis, please forgive me for being presumptuous. I’d like to ask, why would you have such thoughts? As far as I know, Cores are terrifying. To those at the Divine Abilities Stage, they’re like living gods. Even if they had such thoughts, it would be very dangerous to surround and kill a Core.”","Chu Yunfan truly understood the terror of a Core. Back then, a Core had almost destroyed the Federation all by himself. If it wasn’t for the fact that he had no other choice, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t have agreed to such a reckless move.","What a joke! Even if there were ten half-step Cores, they would be killed in an instant.","Even if it was the entire Great Wei Kingdom and the power of the Imperial Court, if they wanted to kill a Core, they would have to do their best and calculate every possible scenario. If this Core escaped, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“All right, since it’s already come to this, and you’re not an outsider, I won’t hide it from you.” Chu Yaowei said after some thought, “Before this selection, I actually had two sons. You know this, right?”","“I do.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Chu Yaowei was not without children. In fact, his sons were not as simple as one or two. After all, Chu Yaowei had a lot of wives and concubines and they had given him many children.","“But they’re all dead. Dead!” Chu Yaowei gritted his teeth. His eyes were red as if he had thought of something that made him gnash his teeth.","Chu Yunfan vaguely knew what Chu Yaowei was going to say.","“Was it done by a Core?” Chu Yunfan probed.","“That’s right. It was done by a Core!” Chu Yaowei’s face revealed a sorrowful expression.","“This matter started with my grandfather. Back then, he was ordered by the emperor to exterminate a rebellious sect in the Great Wei Kingdom. Who knew the plan would go awry and the sect master would escape? Since then, he has become the nightmare of our entire clan,” Chu Yaowei said, “After that sect master escaped, he fled to the outer realms. No one expected him to be so lucky. In a short period, he had many fortuitous encounters and his cultivation increased greatly. In just a few decades, he stepped into the half-step Core Stage.”","Chu Yunfan immediately understood and said, “So, he came back for revenge?”","“That’s right. My grandfather had already passed away many years ago. After his strength broke through, he was just like the Emissaries today. He attacked the residence. At that time, my father, the old Marquis Zhongxin, fought till the end of his life. With his death, he finally delayed and stopped the sect master. The other experts in the city rushed over and scared the sect master away.","“But that had caused my father to suffer a great loss. After that, he lay on his sickbed and was never able to get up until his death.","“However, this is only the beginning of our clan’s nightmare.”"]},{"number":1262,"title":"Chapter 1262 Even if They Gathered Another Eight or Ten Half-Step Cores, It Wouldn’t Be Enough!","paragraphs":["1262 Even if They Gathered Another Eight or Ten Half-Step Cores, It Wouldn’t Be Enough!","Chu Yaowei gritted his teeth and his eyes turned red from anger, but he still continued, “This is just the beginning of our family’s nightmare. I’m actually not my father’s only son. In fact, both my father and I have had many sons, but in those years, they were all killed one after another, including Chu Xiujie’s father. It’s because of this that I usually indulge him. I didn’t expect that I had pampered him to this extent.”","Speaking of Chu Xiujie, Chu Yaowei’s eyes were filled with hatred for him for not competing, but there was also a little guilt. He had let down his brother and had not taught Chu Xiujie well.","“You know that the old madam is especially good to you, right? I think you know some of the reasons. Its because my little brother who looks like you was also killed in an attack!”","Chu Yunfan nodded with a serious expression. Experts were not scary. What was scary was experts who were shameless. Both sides were already at loggerheads. Such experts were more terrifying than anything else.","This was because they didn’t follow the rules. Moreover, no one could stop such an expert. They appeared and disappeared like ghosts. Today, they would kill you, and tomorrow, he would kill another. Sooner or later, he would kill your entire bloodline.","As Marquis Zhongxin, Chu Yaowei usually lived in seclusion and was stationed in Conglong City. It was not easy to find an opportunity to kill him. However, the other members of the Chu clan did not have such good treatment. Once they were discovered and found, they would die.","Even Wan Huang would have a way to do it if he was determined to do it for decades, let alone Chu Yunfan. This was why the Battle Wolves had to compromise with Wan Huang in the end.","“After that, it was my sons. They were hunted down one by one when they went out. They were even hunted down when they left Conglong.” Chu Yaowei’s eyes were red and his voice trembled. The veins on his hands that were holding the armrests of his chair popped out. If it wasn’t for the fact that this chair was extraordinary, it would have been crushed into pieces.","“I’m not even afraid that you’ll laugh at me for me. I lost my ability to reproduce in the last attack. That’s why there’s an heir selection.”","In the end, Chu Yaowei spoke in a calm tone. This was an indescribable pain for a man. At this moment, this pain was nothing to him, because what really hurt him was that his many children, and even his first wife, were hunted down one after another.","It was the most sorrowful thing in the world for a white-haired person to send off a black-haired person. Moreover, he had experienced it so many times. This feeling usually did not appear. He had to bear the heavy responsibility of the entire Marquis Zhongxin residence, so he would not show it in front of outsiders.","He had even casually mentioned this matter. The atmosphere in the entire residence was not strong, so even though Chu Yunfan had been here for more than a year, he did not notice much. Of course, this was also related to Chu Yunfan living in seclusion and not wanting to get too involved.","“Over the years, I’ve been trying to find the perpetrator. At the same time, I’ve been trying to invite all kinds of experts. However, during the recent attack, I found out that not only did that old man not die, but his cultivation had also improved. He has even broken through to the Core Stage!” Chu Yaowei slapped the armrest, and finally, the armrest, which had already suffered a lot of damage, was smashed into pieces. “The heavens are blind. This person is allowed to live until now and even allowed continuously breakthroughs in his cultivation!”","Chu Yunfan sighed. This was a personal grudge. He and the gods were also irreconcilable, but it was a war between different races. It was a public grudge, and he himself had no personal grudge with the gods.","Compared to public grudges, private grudges were truly unending.","“My grandfather was ordered by the emperor to destroy that sect. Moreover, that sect colluded with the rebel forces outside the borders. My grandfather did nothing wrong!” Chu Yaowei gritted his teeth. He didn’t think that there was anything wrong with this. The Chu clan had the imperial order and enjoyed wealth. This was also the price they had to pay.","However, the sect master clearly understood that he was no match for the entire Great Wei Kingdom. The Great Wei Kingdom was very afraid of Core Stage experts, but it was not impossible to kill them. They definitely had all kinds of methods.","If he offended the Great Wei Kingdom’s imperial family, then he might face an endless pursuit. The revenge then fell on Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. In the end, this sect master had not completely lost his mind.","“However, since this matter started because of the Emperor’s order, then does the Imperial Court not have any reaction?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That’s true. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have asked you about this.”","“Since you’ve asked me, I can tell you that it doesn’t matter how many people you send. Unless you can find a Core, you’ll die no matter how many people you send,” Chu Yunfan said, “Most importantly, if such a Core wants to hide, who knows when he will appear again. I really want to help, but I can’t stay here forever.”","Chu Yunfan was also a little helpless. Out of feelings, he was willing to help the Chu clan, but who knew when the next time would come. It was impossible for the residence to say that they had not made a move in these years, but the result was not nothing. That was already very clear.","“What if I have a way to attract him?” Chu Yaowei gritted his teeth.","“That can’t be helped. Even if he’s attracted here, you can find another eight or ten half-step Cores, but they won’t be enough to kill him.” Chu Yunfan shook his head, but then his eyes lit up. There was a way to solve this problem. After all, as long as he made the pill, his recovery would be in front of him. At that time, not only would his cultivation be restored, but he would also be able to advance further.","At that time, Chu Yunfan would have full confidence, but not now.","“What if I say I can find a Core?” Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan and suddenly said in a deep voice.","“You can find someone in the Core Stage?” Chu Yunfan looked at Chu Yaowei and said.","“That’s right. I’m confident. As for how I know, you don’t have to worry about it. But I need your combat strength. Would you be willing to help me?” Chu Yaowei stared at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan pondered for a moment and said, “Sure. As long as you can find a Core to help you, I’m willing to help you. But no matter what plan you have, you have to do it in a month’s time.”","“All right, not a problem.” Chu Yaowei nodded heavily."]},{"number":1263,"title":"Chapter 1263 The Destruction of Inherited Sword Manor Depended on Mood!","paragraphs":["1263 The Destruction of Inherited Sword Manor Depended on Mood!","After getting Chu Yunfan’s approval, Chu Yaowei was relieved. He had been waiting for this revenge for too long.","Since his grandfather’s generation, he had been attacked continuously until he was the only one left in his generation, and none of his children were left. Only he could understand this pain.","After all, not every half-step Core dared to attack a Core. Just as Chu Yunfan said, if half-step Cores could only be killed by force, then for Cores, such a concept did not exist. Unless it was an expert of the same level, it was impossible to kill the other party.","For half-step Cores, no matter how many of them went, they would die. Because of this, many half-step Cores would only think about dealing with Cores. The success rate was non-existent.","After discussing with Chu Yaowei, Chu Yunfan left without looking back. For him, there was nothing more important than refining the Nine Yangs Spirit Restoring Pill.","In the Battle Wolves’ headquarters, Wan Huang used Chu Yunfan’s talisman to break the seal Chu Yunfan had placed on Wan Feihong. Seeing the seal disappear, Wan Huang finally heaved a sigh of relief.","“Father, if you didn’t come, I would’ve died!” Wan Feihong hurriedly shouted.","“B*stard, I only let you out for a short time, and you’ve already caused such a big trouble for me!” Seeing his son’s miserable appearance and being knelt for a few days, even with his Divine Abilites cultivation level, Wan Huang was very dispirited.","Wan Feihong shouted as a hint of hatred flashed through his eyes, “Father, you must avenge me! That Chu—”","However, before he could finish speaking, Wan Huang slapped him, causing Wan Feihong’s face to be covered in blood and him to see stars.","Wan Feihong was completely dumbfounded. He covered his face and looked at his father in complete shock. He didn’t understand why his father wasn’t going to help him get revenge and had instead slapped him.","According to past experience, if someone dared to offend him, his father would definitely think of a way to help him get revenge. Why was it completely different from the script this time?","“Vile beast. If you want to die, go die yourself. Don’t drag the Inherited Sword Manor down with you!” Wan Huang roared.","Thinking back to how Chu Yunfan had plotted and slaughtered the Emissaries, he still felt his hair stand on end. If he had not seen it with his own eyes, he would never have believed that someone could be so powerful.","Although Chu Yunfan hadn’t reached the Core Stage yet, it was no different from meeting a real Core. In any case, Chu Yunfan could easily crush him as easily as crushing an ant.","Wan Feihong had offended such a person. Wan Huang finally had to lower his head with great difficulty and even spent a huge price to find the Nine Yangs Spirit Restoring Grass to obtain Chu Yunfan’s forgiveness.","And now, Wan Feihong actually dared to mention revenge. Did he think that their family had lived too long?","Even if the news reached Chu Yunfan’s ears, he would be completely shocked, let alone in front of him.","Fortunately, after looking around, there was no one else. The Battle Wolf Gang naturally did not have the interest to disturb the reunion of this father and son.","Only then did Wan Huang heave a sigh of relief. He was not making a mountain out of a molehill. He used to be a high and mighty figure, so he understood the thoughts of such people all too well. Be it the secular world or the law, there were too few things that could control them.","Wan Huang originally thought that his child was still young. No matter what kind of parents, they would feel the same way. Even if their son was a little mischievous, he would tolerate it.","However, looking at Chu Yunfan, who was in his twenties, and his son, who was in his forties or fifties, he seemed to have lived a dog’s life. Not only was his cultivation level, which he was most satisfied with, far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s, but even his temperament was far inferior.","It was really not afraid of not knowing the goods, but it was afraid of comparing goods.","Wan Huang immediately calmed himself down. He couldn’t continue to compare like this. If he continued to compare like this, he would have the urge to slap this beast to death.","Seeing that Wan Feihong was still in a daze, Wan Huang immediately told him what had just happened, afraid that he would dare to provoke Chu Yunfan again.","Wan Feihong was even more dumbfounded. He originally thought that although Chu Yunfan was stronger than him, he was definitely not a match for his father. As long as his father stepped out, it would be easy to deal with Chu Yunfan.","When his father came to save him, he had imagined that his father would beat Chu Yunfan into submission or even kill him to get the way to save him.","Who would have thought that the truth was that his father had paid a huge price to obtain the Nine Yangs Spirit Restoring Grass, and he had lowered his head to apologize to Chu Yunfan in exchange for this opportunity.","This made Wan Feihong feel that it was not that he did not understand, but that the world was changing quickly. Although he was arrogant, he wasn’t an idiot. He understood what it meant to have an expert of this level. If Chu Yunfan was unhappy with the Inherited Sword Manor that he was so proud, Chu Yunfan could uproot them.","It was that awesome!","A chill ran down Wan Feihong’s spine. He didn’t dare to have any thoughts of revenge. If Chu Yunfan’s strength was similar to his, even if he was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, he would do everything he could to take revenge. However, Chu Yunfan was so strong that even his greatest backer, his father, was no match for him. In fact, he might even destroy the Inherited Sword Manor.","He had already given up completely.","“Do you understand now? Although I don’t know how he trained, there’s no doubt that he’s not someone you can afford to provoke. Clean up and go to the Chu clan to apologize later!”","Wan Huang sighed. He couldn’t say for sure. He didn’t want to lower his voice like this, but he had no choice but to lower his head.","At this moment, the Chu clan’s front door was already crowded.","Old Wang was the gatekeeper of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. Since their ancestors, they had been the sons of the Chu clan. In his generation, he had gotten a gatekeeper job. He thought that today would not be any different from the past, but the moment he opened the door, he realized that there was a long line at the entrance of the Chu clan.","This gave everyone a fright. One had to know that although Marquis Zhongxin’s residence was considered to have a high position and power, they were not the top few people in Conglong. Although there were also an endless stream of people who came to visit, there was definitely no situation where there was a long queue early in the morning."]},{"number":1264,"title":"Chapter 1264 The Fear of the Big Forces in Conglong","paragraphs":["1264 The Fear of the Big Forces in Conglong","It was not easy for them to get to the bottom of it, but they found out that these people actually came from the families of various wealthy merchants. These wealthy merchants were of all sizes.","Some were even more famous than the residence, while some were inferior. This wasn’t a big deal, but what really shocked Old Wang was that early in the morning, the representatives of these families had already formed a long queue in front of the door.","Among them, the aristocratic families sent their influential figures to come, while the weaker nobles lined up in person in front of the door. This was a scene that had never happened before. Even if it was a weak noble, if the clan leader personally came to visit, they had to be received in all seriousness.","If Old Wang was not careful, he would not be able to continue being the gatekeeper.","But now, these people were actually very quiet and lined up in a long queue outside the residence in the order of first come, first serve. They did not make any noise, which made Old Wang, who had been a gatekeeper his entire life, click his tongue in wonder.","As a gatekeeper, the most important thing was to observe people’s expressions. He knew who he could not offend. All of these people were people he could not offend. Usually, they had high and mighty appearances and would not even glance at Old Wang.","He was basically ignored. But now, these people were all talking to him amiably as if they were afraid of making him unhappy.","This made Old Wang deeply understand a sentence that he had never understood before. What did it mean to be a seventh-grade official in front of the prime minister? He was a seventh-grade official in front of the prime minister!","Of course, in the past, he would at most try his best to show off to ordinary people. He never thought that one day, these influential figures would be so polite to him.","However, when he thought that these people were here to visit his master, he didn’t expect that these people would just ask, ” Is Master Chu here?”","These people’s words stunned him. He didn’t understand. What Master Chu was in the residence?","However, he soon found out that these people were actually here to look for Young Master Fan. He immediately recalled the shocking battle he saw in the residence yesterday. He dared to say that he would only be able to see this once in his lifetime. It was impossible for there to be a second.","That terrifying battle still made him feel extremely shocked when he thought about it. It was simply unbelievable and beyond the limits of imagination.","After yesterday’s battle, everyone in the residence had come to regard Chu Yunfan as a god. As people of the residence, although their cultivation levels were not very high, their judgment was not bad.","Naturally, they knew what a half-step Core meant. With such an expert in charge, the Chu clan would probably create more glorious achievements than the first generation of Marquis Zhongxin.","Those who had offended Chu Yunfan were even more frightened. They wanted to escape overnight. If Chu Yunfan wanted to kill them, they wouldn’t have the ability to resist at all.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to have any intention of settling scores with them, which made them heave a sigh of relief. However, they quickly tucked their tails between their legs, afraid that Chu Yunfan would suddenly think of them.","Yesterday’s battle had undoubtedly shaken the entire residence. The entire structure of the residence had undergone earth-shattering changes. If no one believed Chu Yunfan when he said that he had no intention of fighting for the position of heir before, then everyone believed him now.","However, apart from a small number of people, most of them hoped that this statement was false. If Chu Yunfan intended to compete for the heir position, then he would definitely become the marquis in the future.","With Chu Yunfan leading the way, the residence would definitely become a first-class aristocratic family in the Great Wei Kingdom. It would be much more glorious than it was now.","Too many people had witnessed the battle yesterday, and it was impossible to hide it even if they wanted to. Not to mention, although not everyone from the various dignitaries in the city had been present, they had sent representatives with weight to attend the old madam’s birthday banquet. And these people had reported Chu Yunfan’s battle to all the major forces in Conglong when they returned.","There were many experts in Conglong, but only half-step Cores could be considered. Only the city lord of Conglong had stepped into this realm, and he was the number one expert in the city.","At the same time, he was a top expert who oversaw the entire Conglong area.","But now, Chu Yunfan had suddenly emerged as a new force, becoming the second half-step Core. Just this alone was enough to make Marquis Zhongxin’s residence and the city lord’s residence stand on equal grounds.","However, what really frightened them was not Chu Yunfan, who had entered the Half-Step Core Stage, but the Emissaries—two ferocious figures from the outer realm—who could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","From the battle process, the Emissaries was suppressed by Chu Yunfan from the beginning to the end. In the end, they were defeated by him without any difficulties.","This was the key to making these people gasp.","There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was not a newbie who had just stepped into the Half-Step Core Stage. On the contrary, he was the absolute king in this field.","Especially that night, the city lord’s words came from his residence. Even the number one expert from Conglong admitted that he was definitely not a match for Chu Yunfan, because at most, he was only on par with one of the Emissaries.","Even so, his cultivation was one of the best among the half-step Cores in the nearby area. However, when faced with Chu Yunfan, who could easily kill the Emissaries, even he had to admit that he was inferior.","The city lord’s words intensified the panic of these forces, especially those who were at odds with Marquis Zhongxin. Although Chu Yunfan wasn’t Marquis Zhongxin or Marquis Zhongxin’s son, he was still from the Marquis Zhongxin’s household.","Early in the morning, all the major forces sent their representatives to try to meet Chu Yunfan and gain his favor. His words could determine the situation in Conglong, and the Chu clan’s strong rise was unstoppable.","In this world, the strong were respected!","However, when they arrived at the residence, they discovered that outside the manor, it was already extremely lively. It was as though everyone had the same thought.","Everyone wanted to cool down the stove in advance, but it was clearly not the time to do so. Only Kong Buyi and the others who were present yesterday could be considered to have succeeded.","At most, they could only add icing on the cake, but even adding icing on the cake was better than being hit when Chu Yunfan was down.","That was how Old Wang saw the scene when he opened the door."]},{"number":1265,"title":"Chapter 1265 Everyone Was Shocked","paragraphs":["1265 Everyone Was Shocked","After all, it was a little too late to curry favor with Chu Yunfan. However, these people were all old foxes. In their opinion, those who had gone to give gifts and met Chu Yunfan might not be remembered, but those who did not go would definitely be remembered.","A half-step Core wasn’t scary, but a 20-year-old half-step Core truly frightened them.","Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties, but he had already stepped into the half-step Core Stage. It could be said that if there were no other accidents, he would definitely step into the Core Stage.","Once he reached the Core Stage, he would truly become the uncrowned king of the entire city. He would even become a super big shot who could rule the world in the entire Great Wei Kingdom.","Although it was a little too late for Chu Yunfan to show his strength now, if one looked at his future achievements, it would definitely be too late.","!!","Even though these people were usually arrogant and domineering, when they waited outside, they were quiet. There was no quarrel at all, and they did not dare to provoke anyone.","Seeing this scene, Old Wang could not help but click his tongue in wonder. He had been a gatekeeper for so many years, but he had never seen such a scene.","However, he understood that the one who could make these unruly people lower their heads was not his old master, but the god-like Young Master Fan.","However, just as everyone was quietly waiting, a commotion suddenly broke out in the crowd. They saw two figures appear in front of them in a distant light. Everyone focused their eyes and saw a tall middle-aged man walking over with a young man who looked similar to him.","The young man had some bruises on his face, which were obviously left behind from being beaten up.","“Isn’t that the manor lord of the Inherited Sword Manor, Lord Wan?”","Soon, the identity of the person who came was recognized. Immediately, many people were stunned. They did not know why Wan Huang was there. However, his presence soon caused a commotion among the crowd. Many people exclaimed in surprise. Why would Wan Huang come here personally?","However, some people who had been there yesterday seemed to have thought of something. They were not surprised. After all, Wan Huang bowed his head and apologized to Chu Yunfan in front of everyone yesterday. Now, it was nothing.","Old Wang also knew Wan Huang’s identity. After all, he was also present yesterday. He could ignore the others, but he could not ignore Wan Huang.","“Greetings, Lord Wan. May I know why you have come so early in the morning?” He hurriedly stepped forward and bowed.","“Please announce that I have brought my son, Wan Feihong, to apologize to Young Master Chu,” Wan Huang said respectfully.","Behind him, Wan Feihong was still a little unwilling, but he knew when to stab and when not to.","Wan Huang’s words immediately caused a huge uproar among the crowd, especially those who did not know that Wan Huang had been there yesterday. They looked at Wan Huang in disbelief.","What kind of person was Wan Huang? When he came to Conglong, even the city lord had to give him face and personally receive him. Now, he came in person to apologize to Chu Yunfan, and he even brought his son along to apologize.","This matter was not difficult to guess. Many people had also guessed the whole story. It was likely that Wan Feihong had offended Chu Yunfan in some way, which made Wan Huang have no choice but to personally bring him here to apologize.","But no matter what, Wan Huang’s personal apology proved one thing. Chu Yunfan was indeed something. Even a big shot like Wan Huang couldn’t afford to offend him.","Although many people knew about yesterday’s incident, or else they wouldn’t have been sent here, they still didn’t have a concrete idea. It was only now that they truly understood Chu Yunfan’s power. Forcing a half-step Core to lower their head was a very difficult thing to do. Unless he completely crushed them, it was impossible for a half-step Core to be so subservient.","Old Wang didn’t dare to be negligent. Chu Yunfan could ignore Wan Huang and order him around, but he didn’t dare to have such thoughts.","However, he was still secretly pleased. Although he knew that he was just a fox taking advantage of a tiger’s might, a dignified half-step Core was speaking to him in such a humble manner. No one else would have such an opportunity in their lifetime.","Old Wang immediately went to Chu Yunfan’s courtyard. Although Chu Yunfan’s status in the residence was different now, the place where he lived was still the same. It was just that from the original remote place, overnight, it became another core in the eyes of many people—even the absolute core.","When they turned their eyes over, they found that Chu Yunfan had transformed the nearby area into a paradise. The spirit energy was several times more than in other places.","Originally, there were almost only servant rooms in the vicinity. They were not valuable at all, but in an instant, the surroundings became valuable. The changes brought about by Chu Yunfan’s strength alone could be seen from this.","Old Wang came to the courtyard and reported respectfully, “Young Master Fan, the Inherited Sword Manor’s manor lord, Wan Huang, and his son, Wan Feihong, have come to pay their respects and apologize.”","Soon, a clear voice came from the small courtyard. It was none other than Chu Yunfan’s voice.","“Tell him to go back. I don’t have time for him now.”","Chu Yunfan did not hesitate at all.","“But Young Master Fan, other than Lord Wan of the Inherited Sword Manor, there are also other famous people in the city waiting to see you. Do you want to meet them?” Old Wang continued.","“Send them all away,” Chu Yunfan’s voice continued. “Help me inform them that I will be in seclusion for the next month. No matter what happens, they are not to disturb me. Do you understand?”","When Old Wang heard Chu Yunfan’s words, he immediately quivered and quickly said, “I understand. I will take my leave now.”","Old Wang didn’t dare to stay any longer. He quickly turned around and left. Although those nobles had secretly stuffed a lot of money into his pockets, hoping that he could put in a good word for him, he knew who was the one who could really decide his life and death.","After hearing the news from Old Wang, everyone was very disappointed, especially those who had hoped to curry favor with Chu Yunfan. Now that they had no chance, they could not help but be extremely disappointed.","However, they still left after presenting their gifts.","Wan Huang was no exception. Since Chu Yunfan was not going to meet him, he did not have the guts to barge in. He immediately left with Wan Feihong.","After these people left, Chu Yunfan finally got some peace and could start to make the Nine Yangs Spirit Restoring Pill with all his strength."]},{"number":1266,"title":"Chapter 1266 Entering the Eyes of the Higher-Ups","paragraphs":["1266 Entering the Eyes of the Higher-Ups","In a secret palace in the capital of the Great Wei Kingdom.","An old man was rapidly processing information from all over the country. This was a skinny old man who had worked in the dark for a long time, which had given him a sinister aura.","His years of experience in handling intelligence allowed him to handle everything quickly. In addition, his subordinates would also classify the information according to type and level of importance. This allowed him to process most of the information quickly.","The old man stretched his back. Although this information was shocking to many people, the secrets of various sects and the secrets of various dignitaries could cause quite a stir if they were exposed.","However, to this old man, these were nothing. After dealing with too many things, he had gotten used to it. He knew that although it was peaceful and boring for him, for the entire empire, being safe and sound was the best news.","Of course, it was not that there were no problems at all. It was just that they could not shake the overall situation of the entire empire.","Suddenly, a series of soft footsteps came from outside the hall.","Immediately after, there was a notification.","“Master, there’s news from Conglong!”","The old man immediately frowned. In the empire, Conglong was indeed an area that needed to be paid attention to. However, most of the news would be reported to the higher-ups in due process. It was rare to see someone cut in line at the last minute.","“Come in,” the old man said lazily.","A middle-sized young man slowly walked in. When he saw the old man, he could not help but feel nervous. Although his own reputation was quite resounding in the entire Imperial Capital and even in the Great Wei Kingdom—and in the eyes of some people, it had the effect of stopping a child from crying—compared to this old man in front of him, it was too far.","Although he was the old man’s confidant, he would still be nervous every time he faced him. This was the lord who had once caused mountains of corpses and seas of blood in the Great Wei Kingdom. Along the way, he had slaughtered countless dignitaries. Many of them even gritted their teeth and called him an executioner behind his back.","“What information could it possibly be that you need to deliver it personally?” The old man looked at the slightly nervous young man and nodded in satisfaction. Although he was old, his reputation was even greater. He was even more ruthless than when he was young.","He was satisfied to see his subordinates show some nervousness. After all, there was no harm in being humble.","“It’s a level eight intelligence report!” the young man quickly said.","His words made the old man’s expression turned serious. In the intelligence system of the Great Wei Kingdom, the lowest level was level 1 intelligence. It was all about trivial matters and basically had no value. It kept increasing to level 9. If such intelligence appeared, it meant that it was basically the destruction of the Great Wei Kingdom or the destruction of the Great Wei imperial family. Only then would it be classified as level 9.","This kind of information might not appear even once in decades. Therefore, level 8 intelligence reports below level 9 were basically the limit that could be seen normally.","But even so, this level 8 intelligence was rarely seen throughout the year. If it was level 8 intelligence, it was worth it for his trusted disciple to come personally.","“What information?” the old man asked with a solemn expression.","The young man placed the stack of information on the table and continued, “This information came from the spies we planted in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. Among the candidates for the position of heir, there is a person called Chu Yunfan. Recently, he suddenly showed his power and burst out with half-step Core Stage cultivation!”","The young man reported everything concisely. The old man stopped reading the information for a moment. No wonder half-step Cores were classified as level 8 intelligence.","Although level 8 intelligence was not enough to shake an entire country, it was often enough to affect an entire region.","The old man thought about it carefully. He had an excellent memory and soon remembered who Marquis Zhongxin was. After all, there were too many nobles in the Great Wei Kingdom. Unless it was a very famous one, he would have to think about it. He recalled that from the information that had been sent here back then. It did indeed mention that Marquis Zhongxin wanted to select an heir.","However, this may have been a big matter for Marquis Zhongxin’s residence, but to him, it was just a small matter that couldn’t be any smaller. It wasn’t worth paying much attention to. Therefore, he only asked others to continue paying attention to it, while he forgot all about it.","He had thought that the young man was referring to Marquis Zhongxin’s sudden burst of half-step Core Stage cultivation. Although he was a little surprised, it was not a big deal.","Marquis Zhongxin’s household was one of the founding marquis of the country and had existed since its beginning. Although the cultivation of the previous generations of marquis was average, they had such a foundation. It was normal for a half-step Core to suddenly appear.","However, he quickly reacted. It was not the marquis, but a candidate.","This was strange. It was already good enough for a mere heir candidate to have a Divine Abilities Stage cultivation base. How could a half-step Core Stage suddenly appear?","He checked through the information. The first half was about Chu Yunfan not being a suitable candidate. From this information, although Chu Yunfan’s talent was not bad in the branch family, it was just not bad. It was equivalent to the other candidates.","However, it was this Chu Yunfan who suddenly showed a completely different side more than a month ago. Not only did he defeat Chu Yanghui and the others, but he also managed to become a senior alchemist with full marks in front of everyone.","The information also stated that Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength and was highly suspected to have the strength of an alchemy expert. There was even news that he had originally applied to be an alchemy expert, but there were only senior alchemists in Conglong, so he could only take the examination available in that region. However, the intelligence officer was special. From the fact that Chu Yunfan had easily passed the examination for senior alchemists, the probability of him becoming an alchemy expert was very high.","Just the possibility of having the strength of an alchemy expert was enough for their intelligence organization to pay attention to, but it was not enough to be classified as a level 8 intelligence.","The real highlight was yet to come. After that, Chu Yunfan displayed his might and defeated Chang Shenghong, helping the Battle Wolf Gang, the largest gang in Conglong, gain a firm foothold and withstand the counterattack.","After that, he repelled Wan Huang, who had come to cause trouble.","At this point, the old man’s lips curled up slightly. He was already very interested, but when he read that Chu Yunfan had killed the Black and White Emissaries, his pupils contracted ever so slightly."]},{"number":1267,"title":"Chapter 1267 A True Dragon Appears in Shallow Water","paragraphs":["1267 A True Dragon Appears in Shallow Water","Ordinary people might not know much about the Emissaries, but as the Director of Intelligence of the empire, he had a deep understanding of these two people.","The two masters of the Netherworld Sect in the Jinzhanghan Kingdom had once caused endless killings at the border of the empire. They had always been wanted by the Great Wei Kingdom.","Even the Intelligence Department had sent experts to hunt down the Emissaries more than once, but in the end, the two of them escaped. He had even personally taken action once, sneaking into the outer realms and waiting for half a year before finally getting the chance to kill the two of them.","Who knew that the two of them would escape in the final battle and even kill many of the Great Wei Kingdom’s elite experts?","Under such circumstances, how could he not have a deep impression of the Emissaries?","!!","However, the Emissaries, who had given the entire Great Wei Kingdom a headache and could do nothing about him, had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","It was even an overwhelming suppression.","According to the battle report, the two of them had never had the upper hand against Chu Yunfan from the beginning to the end. Chu Yunfan had even stripped the Black Emissary of his spirit weapon treasure robe, the Black Dragon Night Robe.","The intelligence director still had a good impression of the Black Dragon Night Robe. This robe was the reason why the Emissaries were able to escape unscathed. Although the Emissaries had just obtained the Black Dragon Night Robe at that time, they were able to kill their way out of their encirclement with just this robe.","At that time, the Intelligence Department, which did not know that the Black Emissary had the Black Dragon Night Robe, suffered heavy losses. They could not hurt the Black Emissary at all and were all killed.","The White Emissary’s half-spirit saber was even more of a headache for them. They died if they brushed against it and get injured if they knocked against it.","The combination of one attack and one defense made it almost impossible for them to compete. However, the current combination of one attack and one defense was still the same combination of one attack and one defense, but the enemy they faced was much more terrifying than before.","It was because the intelligence director knew how terrifying the Emissaries were that the old man felt that it was completely unbelievable that Chu Yunfan had killed them. If it wasn’t for the fact that the reports from more than one spy had confirmed each other, he wouldn’t have believed it at all.","Was Chu Yunfan really that terrifying?","But now, it seemed that this Chu Yunfan was really such a terrifying existence.","The intelligence director couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. He looked at the battle report and saw how Chu Yunfan had crushed the Black Emissary and forcefully stripped off the Black Dragon Night Robe.","It made his pupils contract. When he read that Chu Yunfan had caught the half-spirit saber with his bare hands and crushed it, he looked as if he had seen a ghost. To be able to casually crush a half-spirit weapon... This kind of physique was strong to an unbelievable level.","It was even more terrifying than the Core Stage!","He wanted to know how Chu Yunfan cultivated. It was too terrifying. This was not someone that the Marquis Zhongxin’s residence could nurture.","In short, a true dragon could not be raised in shallow water. Even the Great Wei Kingdom’s imperial family could not raise such a top-notch expert, let alone Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","Chu Yunfan’s strength alone was not enough to shock the director. What really shocked him was Chu Yunfan’s age. He finally understood why Chu Yunfan’s matter was a level 8 intelligence report.","“Impressive. I didn’t expect such a character to appear in Marquis Zhongxin’s household.” The old man’s eyes narrowed slightly. No one knew what he was thinking.","“That’s true. Should we monitor him immediately?” the middle-sized young man quickly asked.","Then, the old man glanced at the middle-sized youth and said, “Are you kidding me? How could you possibly monitor a half-step Core? If he finds out, you won’t even know how you died!”","The middle-sized young man immediately broke out in cold sweat. He had only suggested this out of instinct because he had done the same to other experts in the past. However, he had forgotten that the target he proposed to monitor this time was a half-step Core.","That was an overlord. What kind of surveillance could be hidden from an expert of that level? Was he planning to find a Core Stage expert to monitor him?","Wasn’t that a joke?","“Master, I misspoke,” the youth hurriedly said.","“Although we can’t monitor him, we still have to investigate his background. Marquis Zhongxin’s household definitely can’t cultivate such a character. Chu Yunfan must have a sect behind him. The sect that can cultivate such a character must be extraordinary. We actually didn’t notice it before. We have to find out what sect it is and what its purpose is,” the director said.","He was not worried about Chu Yunfan. Even if a half-step Core could fly into the sky, he would not be able to overturn the sky. What really worried him was the huge sect that might exist behind Chu Yunfan.","In the Great Wei Kingdom, there were many such existences. Disciples and successors of various sects were spread all over the Great Wei Kingdom. Among them, there were many people with ulterior motives.","The director was afraid that Chu Yunfan was also such an existence. If that was the case, with the potential that he had shown, it was unknown how much danger he would cause.","“I understand,” the youth quickly said.","“Also, help me send a gift to the marquis’ residence. Just say that it’s a birthday gift for the old madam,” the director suddenly said.","Hearing this, the youth could not help but widen his eyes. He looked at the old man in disbelief. He knew the identity of this old man. He was in charge of the empire’s intelligence. Some people even called him the king of the shadows.","Usually, other people wanted to curry favor with him, but they had no way to do so. He had never taken the initiative to make friends with others.","Was this Chu Yunfan really so different?","Just thinking about it made him feel that it was completely unbelievable.","This kind of thing happening to the old man was simply a fantasy.","However, the youth did not dare to hesitate. He did not even dare to speculate because he knew very well that if he continued to guess blindly, what awaited him would only be a mass grave.","After the youth left, the old man finally sighed and said, “I didn’t expect there to be such a person. An alchemy expert? Princess Gushe has been looking high and low for an alchemy expert. This might be a suitable candidate...”","His voice became softer and softer until it was almost inaudible. No one knew what he said.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know that while he was making pills in seclusion, this trend had quietly swept out of Conglong and even began to affect the imperial capital."]},{"number":1268,"title":"Chapter 1268 Core Formation, Recovering Core Stage Combat Strength","paragraphs":["1268 Core Formation, Recovering Core Stage Combat Strength","In a secret alchemy lab in Marquis Zhongxin’s mansion, Chu Yunfan sat in front of a huge alchemic furnace.","This huge furnace was spewing out a faint white smoke. There was a mesmerizing medicinal fragrance in the smoke. Just inhaling it made people feel as if their pores had opened up.","Chu Yunfan stood in front of the furnace, changing his hand seals from time to time. His hands formed a seal in front of his chest, and his divine power gushed out along these seals.","As his divine power poured into the furnace, the alchemic fire kept changing colors and the temperature went up and down. This was something that only alchemy experts and above could do—making an alchemic fire that belonged to them.","To an alchemist, the alchemic fire was as important as their life. The strength of the fire was very important to an alchemist. This was because many natural treasures could not be easily melted. They could only be refined with the help of the special alchemic fire cultivated by alchemists.","!!","Therefore, when those alchemists cultivated to the level of alchemy expert, they would begin to refine their own special alchemic fire. In fact, in the alchemy expert assessment, a very important point was whether or not one had refined their own alchemic fire.","Some of these alchemic fires were refined by alchemists according to some ancient records, while some alchemists had traveled through various barren mountains and rivers to discover exotic fires of nature. Generally, they were divided into sky fire that descended from the sky and earth fire that spewed out from the ground.","No matter which type it was, it was extremely rare. Just finding it was very difficult, let alone refining it into one’s own alchemic fire.","Once one was able to tame one of the exotic fires, this alchemy expert would immediately become famous throughout the world. This was because exotic fires could greatly increase the success rate of alchemy, shorten the time required, and help to remove the weeds and retain the essence of medicinal pills. Many pills that were originally impossible to make could be made with the help of nature.","Of course, that kind of fire was rare. Chu Yunfan did not deliberately look for it, because he did not need to use these exotic fires when refining pills. Of course, it was inevitable that he would need to find those exotic fires in the future. High-level pills would be made with these exotic fires.","Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, was very clear about this. The alchemic fire he was using now was a type of fire recorded in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. It was called the Eight Desolations Fire. It was an extremely high-grade alchemic fire that was nurtured by using one’s own meridians as the alchemic fire.","Originally, this was just an ordinary fire. After many years of refinement by the Alchemy Emperor, the might of this Eight Desolations Fire was comparable to these exotic fires.","What was even more amazing was that this Eight Desolations Fire could continuously devour all kinds of exotic fires to strengthen itself. It was cultivated by the Alchemy Emperor in his memories and was already powerful enough to make all the medicinal pills in the world.","For example, if the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill was made using the Eight Desolations Fire cultivated by an Alchemy Emperor, it would only take a moment to finish. It was a pity that that kind of alchemic fire had long disappeared for many years.","If he wanted to reproduce the grand occasion of the Eight Desolations Fire cultivated by the Alchemy Emperors, Chu Yunfan would have to travel the world and constantly collect all kinds of exotic fires.","However, even if it was only the base version of the Eight Desolates Heavenly Furnace Fire, it was more than enough to refine the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill. Originally, it might have taken a month to finish making the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill, but now, in just ten days, it was already close to completion.","White smoke billowed out from the lid of the furnace. In a short while, the smoke filled the whole lab. Chu Yunfan, who was sitting cross-legged in it, looked like a god.","He could feel the injuries in his meridians stirring. It was as if he could already be treated by the medicinal qi of the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill.","He instantly revealed a look of joy. However, his hand movements did not change. He used hand seals to adjust the temperature of the Eight Desolates Heaven Furnace to match the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill that was about to be produced","This kind of pill recipe that had been lost to the outside world for a long time had reappeared in Chu Yunfan’s hands. He knew all the steps and details by heart as if he had made it countless times.","After another two hours, he suddenly opened his eyes and opened his mouth. All the medicinal qi in the alchemy room was sucked into his mouth. The furnace that had been indiscernible appeared in front of him again.","Chu Yunfan felt that his internal injuries had healed a little more. He quickly shouted, “Open!”","Immediately, the lid of the furnace was flipped open by Chu Yunfan’s shout. A golden pill flew out and stopped before Chu Yunfan.","It was the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill!","Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate. He opened his mouth and swallowed the pill. In just a moment, the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill had turned into a warm current that flowed through his limbs and bones.","He quickly sat down cross-legged and circulated the Emperor Method, guiding this warm current into his damaged meridians.","The Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill was indeed worthy of being the healing medicine that Chu Yunfan had been thinking about for so long. Wherever the warm current passed, the terrifying injuries that had troubled him almost fully healed. When the warm current flowed again, they were healed even further.","By the time the third warm current flowed through his body, he was completely healed.","Chu Yunfan’s injuries were recovering at an astonishing speed. The injuries that had troubled him for an entire year had completely healed in just two hours.","He let out a long roar that shook the entire lab. Fortunately, he immediately restrained himself. However, that feeling was too carefree. It had been a year, a whole year, and he had finally fully recovered.","It had been a long time since he had felt this way. Because of his injuries, he could not exert his full strength. Now, he had finally stepped into the ranks of the Core Stage.","If the Emissaries were to appear in front of him again, he would not even need to make any unnecessary movements. He would be able to kill them with a single slap.","Although those two had been strong and had escaped from the hands of Cores, Chu Yunfan was absolutely confident that these two people were no match for him.","They couldn’t even survive a single move from him.","However, after he recovered, the medicinal efficacy of the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill in his body had yet to completely dissipate. It was condensing into a torrent that directly charged toward the eighth level of the Divine Abilities Stage."]},{"number":1269,"title":"Chapter 1269 Breakthrough, Tier Eight Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["1269 Breakthrough, Tier Eight Divine Abilities Stage","After recovering, Chu Yunfan charged to the peak of the seventh level of the Divine Abilities Stage.","In the past year, although he had been in a half-crippled state, he had never relaxed his cultivation for a moment.","Coupled with the fact that the medicinal efficacy of the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill had been completely released at this moment, Chu Yunfan knew that this was a good opportunity to break through to the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","It took a full year for him to truly breakthrough. This period of time was not long, but he had experienced too much in this process. His comprehension of martial arts had reached a new stage.","And now, it was finally the harvest season.","The dense medicinal power transformed into Chu Yunfan’s powerful cultivation and began to gather crazily, forming a terrifying torrent that charged toward the barrier of the eighth-tier Divine Abilities Stage.","With a boom, he felt the barrier of the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage shattering at an astonishing speed. For others, this level was extremely difficult to break through, but for Chu Yunfan, it was easy.","He knew everything about the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. His entire battle prowess was undergoing a tremendous change.","One round after another, Chu Yunfan did not know how many times he had tried to break through to the eighth tier. With each round, his comprehension increased by a little.","It was unknown how much time had passed in the outside world. Finally, all of a sudden, the dharma power in Chu Yunfan’s body finally found an outlet. He rushed through the obstacles crazily and instantly broke through to tier-eight of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Boom!","The divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body swept out crazily. He had just broken through and could not fully control it","The divine power surged through the air and immediately alerted the barriers in the alchemy lab. It turned into a huge divine power storm around Chu Yunfan.","And Chu Yunfan was the core of this divine power storm.","After a while, he finally took back the scattered divine power. He slowly opened his eyes, and a burst of light shot out from his eyes.","“I’ve finally broken through to tier-eight!” Chu Yunfan exhaled deeply.","His breath turned into a white streak that exploded in the air.","Even with Chu Yunfan’s state of mind, he revealed a hint of joy on his face. He had finally stepped into the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Naturally, his combat strength had also increased tremendously.","He had stepped into a brand new realm.","Originally, he had just entered the Core Stage. In there, the first stage was called the Void Core stage. This stage formed an illusory golden core in the body, which was the first step to the Core Stage.","The Void Core Stage was divided into four tiers: fledgling, intermediate, late, and peak.","Compared to the half-step Core Stage when he was injured, there was an earth-shaking change. Not to mention the Emissaries, even a god was definitely not Chu Yunfan’s match at this time. They would die in Chu Yunfan’s hands in a few moves.","There were huge gaps between each tier of the Void Core Stage. It could be said that one step was equivalent to ascending to the heavens.","Fledgling Void Cores and intermediate Void Cores were two completely different things.","In the Core Stage, Chu Yunfan could be considered to have stepped into another stage.","No one had expected that while they were still discussing Chu Yunfan’s powerful strength that was absolutely above the ordinary half-step Core Stage, this was already yesterday’s news to him. It was all in the past. His strength had leaped up and he came to possess the strength of an intermediate Void Core.","He immediately went into seclusion to consolidate his cultivation. He had just broken through. If he did not consolidate, he might even regress. Of course, he would never make such a mistake.","Although Chu Yunfan wasn’t around, the discussions about him never stopped. As time passed, it became more and more intense.","More and more people started to realize what was going on. Gradually, the news about Chu Yunfan started to spread from the top to the middle and upper echelons.","Originally, there was only one half-step Core in Conglong, the city lord. But now, another one had appeared out of nowhere. Without a doubt, it was a huge challenge to the current situation.","Outside Marquis Zhongxin’s household, the various trusted aides and representatives of the city lord were present and become a wonder throughout Conglong. Such a grand scene had never appeared before, even in front of the city lord’s residence.","Everyone wanted to build a good relationship with Chu Yunfan before he entered the Core Stage. Although many people knew that he would not remember them at all, it was much better than being remembered by Chu Yunfan because they did not come.","For Chu Yaowei, this was both painful and happy. Because of Chu Yunfan, the entire residence received unprecedented attention. However, what made him feel pain was that Chu Yunfan had no intention of becoming the heir. Many people did not know this, which was why they were so enthusiastic.","They wanted to befriend the future Marquis Zhongxin. If Chu Yunfan did not become the marquis, they would not be so enthusiastic.","Moreover, with the arrival of the one-month agreement he had made with Chu Yunfan, he became more and more anxious. Although he had been planning this for many years, when there was a possibility of solving this matter, he became even more anxious.","Finally, after waiting for a full month, Chu Yunfan, who had announced that he was in seclusion, finally came out. After hearing the news, Chu Yaowei immediately ordered Chu Yunfan to come over.","“You’re quite impatient.”","As soon as Chu Yunfan came out of seclusion, Wang Zhenxi sought him immediately.","“Yes, Young Master Fan. You should understand how important this matter is to the marquis,” Wang Zhenxi said as he looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief.","He had personally experienced the battle a month ago and witnessed how Chu Yunfan had killed the Emissaries. It was because of this that he found it unbelievable. In the past, he was still proud of his cultivation and felt that his cultivation was not bad. However, who knew that compared to Chu Yunfan, he had lived like a dog.","He had thought that Chu Yunfan had given his all in that battle, but who knew that it was not Chu Yunfan’s full strength at all."]},{"number":1270,"title":"Chapter 1270 Combat Strength, Intermediate Void Core Stage","paragraphs":["1270 Combat Strength, Intermediate Void Core Stage","Chu Yunfan’s true strength was much more terrifying than what he had shown back then.","In Wang Zhenxi’s opinion, if Chu Yunfan had used his full strength, Chu Yunfan would have defeated him with just a finger.","This was what made Wang Zhenxi feel incredulous. He did not know how Chu Yunfan cultivated to such a level. It was simply unbelievable.","Stepping into the half-step Core Stage was the level he dreamed of. It could even be said that for those in the Divine Abilities Stage, stepping into the half-step Core Stage was their greatest goal. As for the Core Stage, that was almost impossible.","Even for these geniuses who could step into the Divine Abilities Stage, it was something that was one in a thousand.","Even the master of the Mount Taiyang Fist Sect, who had been famous for many years, was only a half-step Core Stage. One could imagine how difficult it was to enter the Core Stage.","Wang Zhenxi was especially clear that the method to reach the Void Core Stage was often only in the hands of some powerful sects. It was a secret technique and was not open to the public.","This greatly increased the difficulty of going from the half-step Core Stage to the Core Stage. Therefore, ordinary half-step Cores would not have such wishful thinking!","But Chu Yunfan was different. At his age, even if he didn’t have a powerful sect’s inheritance, he could slowly find a way. He had plenty of time to slowly find a solution. The probability of entering the Core Stage was much higher than his master’s.","Moreover, when he sent the news back to Mount Taiyang, his master’s response came back very quickly. According to his master’s analysis, it was impossible for Chu Yunfan to be an unorthodox person without an inheritance.","Judging from the strength and talent that Chu Yunfan had displayed, there must be an extremely powerful sect behind him. He just didn’t know who it was.","Like everyone else, Wang Zhenxi and his master also believed that Chu Yunfan was backed by a powerful sect. Otherwise, it would be difficult to explain how he could cultivate to such an amazing level in such a short period.","“All right, I understand. Let’s go over now.” Chu Yunfan looked at Wang Zhenxi.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He had not allowed the marquis to act in the short term because he had not broken through yet and needed time to break through and cultivate.","Now, after a month, not only had he recovered from his injuries, but his strength had also reached a whole new level.","In a short period of time, he stabilized his tier eight Divine Abilities Stage cultivation. He was only a step away from the peak. There was no doubt about the Nine Yangs Soul Restoring Pill’s effects. Chu Yunfan had not wasted his efforts in making it.","“Oh right, Young Master Fan. My master has come too.” Wang Zhenxi said as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","“Fu Wentai of the Mount Taiyang Fist Sect?” Chu Yunfan said after recovering from his shock.","At first, he didn’t know who this Fu Wentai of the Taiyang Moutain Sect was. However, because of his relationship with Wang Zhenxi, he learned more about it and finally found out who this Fu Wentai was.","Speaking of which, it was also related to Marquis Zhongxin. Fu Wentai was the general of the previous Marquis Zhongxin. Later on, due to an accident, he had a fortuitous encounter and achieved great success in martial arts. He left the army and went to Mount Taiyang to establish a sect.","After that, the relationship between Fu Wentai and the Marquis Zhongxin residence was still very good. Of course, no one in the residence dared to treat Fu Wentai as a servant anymore.","Wang Zhenxi was sent by Fu Wentai under such circumstances. In fact, it wasn’t just Wang Zhenxi. Before this, there were also a few disciples of Fu Wentai who had come to the residence.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t know who it was.","“That’s right, it’s my master!” Wang Zhenxi quickly said, “After my master heard about your matter, he hopes to have a battle with you.”","The corner of Chu Yunfan’s mouth twitched slightly. He felt that this was interesting. It was rumored that Fu Wentai was a super martial arts fanatic. He used to be a very famous martial arts fanatic among the generals of the marquis. Later on, he was promoted by the marquis. He went to war everywhere and finally comprehended the Great Dao. In a day, he transcended and became a half-step Core.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t believe that Fu Wentai was more powerful than the Emissaries. He knew that the Emissaries had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, but he still dared to fight with Chu Yunfan.","He really lived up to his name as a martial arts fanatic!","“Let’s see,” Chu Yunfan said noncommittally.","If it was Chu Yunfan in the past, this Fu Wentai would still be worth fighting. However, his cultivation had advanced by leaps and bounds. Let alone before, even compared to a month ago, there was a world-shaking change.","Fu Wentai’s challenge was meaningless to him.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan didn’t agree immediately, Wang Zhenxi was a little puzzled. However, he didn’t dare to question Chu Yunfan’s decision. Ever since Chu Yunfan revealed his half-step Core Stage combat strength, in Fu Wentai’s heart, Chu Yunfan had immediately risen to the same level as his master.","He didn’t want to see the consequences of angering Chu Yunfan.","“But why is your master here at this time? Don’t tell me he’s here just to see me.” Chu Yunfan smiled at Wang Zhenxi.","Wang Zhenxi hurriedly shook his head and said, “My master wishes to spar with you, Young Master Fan, but it is just a passing opportunity. The real reason is that the marquis’ plan is about to be implemented. Other than my master, there are also a few other experts who have arrived.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up when he heard this. The plan was finally about to begin. He didn’t know what Chu Yaowei was planning and how he was going to surround and kill this powerful enemy.","However, it didn’t matter to him now. According to Chu Yaowei, that powerful enemy should have entered the Core Stage not long ago. At most, he would be at the fledgling Void Core Stage. He was no match for Chu Yunfan at all.","Even if this person had also stepped into the half-step Core Stage, Chu Yunfan was still fearless. In this realm, he was fearless.","No matter what, victory was in his grasp, so it naturally did not matter.","“Interesting. Lead the way. I’ll go take a look.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","“Right this way!” Wang Zhenxi hurriedly said.","Under Wang Zhenxi’s lead, Chu Yunfan quickly entered a drill ground in the depths of the residence.","Chu Yunfan was sure that he had never been here before, but he noticed that the barriers and arrays around the drill grounds were so tight that not even a drop of water could leak out. Even if an expert used their spiritual will to scan it, they would not be able to detect the actual situation here.","However, Chu Yunfan immediately understood. Which family didn’t have a few secrets? His gaze quickly swept over the few people on the drill ground."]},{"number":1271,"title":"Chapter 1271 Half-Step Core Gathering","paragraphs":["1271 Half-Step Core Gathering","At this moment, two figures crossed each other in the school field and were rapidly exchanging blows.","One of them was a thin middle-aged man who looked to be in his forties. He held two enormous hammers in his hands. These two hammers seemed to be even bigger than him. They danced like tigers, and the symbols imprinted on them seemed to come alive, turning into ferocious tigers that roared.","The huge hammers smashed down, and the air collapsed at an astonishing speed. However, this wave of collapse was stopped at the edge of the drill ground.","At the edge of the venue, a light purple barrier blocked all of this. The attack that this skinny middle-aged man casually launched was extremely shocking. He was an expert who had already surpassed the ordinary Divine Abilities Stage and was at the half-step Core Stage. A casual attack from an expert of this level was a terrifying attack that could cover the entire drill ground.","Opposite him was a middle-aged man of medium build. He looked handsome and straightbacked. Although he was not tall , he looked like a huge mountain.","Compared to the terrifying existence that could collapse the world with a casual attack, the middle-aged man with a medium build seemed to be at a complete disadvantage.","He held a long spear in his hand, but the spear that was used to attack could only continuously block. However, the spear that he casually stabbed out directly transformed into a long dragon, directly fighting with the fierce tigers that the skinny middle-aged man opposite him used the hammers to form.","Looking from afar, the martial arts concepts of both sides were completely released. It was a good fight between a dragon and a tiger.","“These two are?” Chu Yunfan asked quietly.","Wang Zhenxi recovered from the shocking scene of the battle and said to Chu Yunfan, “Young Master Fan, the one holding the hammer is the Northwest Hammer Tyrant, Zhang Ling. Opposite him is the Divine Abyss Spear God, Yu Xuanfei.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. There was no doubt that the two people were experts who had stepped into the half-step Core Stage. Such a battle was not common in ordinary times. It was not something that could be seen under ordinary circumstances.","Even Wang Zhenxi was deeply immersed in it. At this moment, there were three figures who were watching intently as if they were unwilling to shift their gazes for even a moment.","The one closest to Chu Yunfan was an old man with white hair and beard. This old man was dressed in martial arts attire. He stood tall and straight, and there was an outstanding military aura mixed in.","Chu Yunfan noticed that there was a faint layer of divine power circulating on his hands. All his cultivation was on these hands.","His hands were like iron.","Chu Yunfan didn’t need an introduction. He could already guess his identity.","The man was Fu Wentai, the Fist Master of Mount Taiyang. Judging from his powerful cultivation, although he was not as strong as the Black and White Emissaries, he was still far above Wan Huang.","The key was that he had a strong sense of oppression that even Wan Huang did not have. Ordinary half-step Cores might not be his match.","Beside him was a woman in a long blue dress that accentuated her curvaceous figure. Her skin was as fair as snow. Although she was almost middle-aged, she still possessed a myriad of charms.","However, Chu Yunfan could feel powerful divine power lurking in her body. This beautiful woman was very powerful. She was actually a half-step Core.","But even so, such a cultivation was extremely rare.","Next to the woman was an arrogant figure. It was a middle-aged man with a pale face. Chu Yunfan noticed that while everyone else was paying attention to the woman, the middle-aged man with a pale face would occasionally glance at the woman. His eyes revealed a bit of greed and possessiveness.","“What about these few?” Chu Yunfan continued to ask.","“That’s my master, Fu Wentai of Mount Taiyang Fist Sect. Beside him is Lady Shui Ji of the Jellyfish Palace. And beside her is Lord Yuwen Chang, the Silver Ring Kickers!” Wang Zhenxi quickly revealed their identities.","Chu Yunfan nodded, and his arrival quickly attracted the attention of the three people outside the arena.","Fu Wentai’s eyes lit up when he saw Chu Yunfan. It was as if he had seen a rare treasure, and his eyes were burning with fighting spirit.","Beside him, Lady Shui Ji’s eyes lit up when she saw Chu Yunfan too, and a bright smile appeared on her face.","Yuwen Chang, who was standing next to Lady Shui Ji, saw this and looked at Chu Yunfan with jealousy.","“Are you Chu Yunfan?” Fu Wentai asked, “Zhenxi must have conveyed my words to you. I want to fight you!”","Chu Yunfan glanced at Fu Wentai and said, “You’re not my match. There’s no need.”","Fu Wentai was stunned, but he didn’t get angry. Instead, he laughed and said, “Even if you say so, I still want to fight with you. I’ve been challenging experts more powerful than me all my life. Only in this way can I find my martial arts. You are very strong. Even the Black and White Emissaries died at your hands. Therefore, I think I will definitely gain something from fighting with you.”","Chu Yunfan sighed and shook his head. Fu Wentai’s idea was right. Challenging stronger masters was indeed a way to grow faster, but there was a prerequisite.","If Chu Yunfan’s strength had not recovered, Fu Wentai might have gained some enlightenment and gains. However, the difference in strength between him and Fu Wentai was too great. Fu Wentai’s idea was destined to be impossible.","However, he did not refuse and said directly, “In that case, let’s have a go later.”","“All right, I’ll be waiting for you!” Fu Wentai nodded in satisfaction.","On the side, Lady Shui Ji said to Chu Yunfan, “Could you be the recently famous Chu Yunfan?”","“Yes.” Chu Yunfan nodded. Lady Shui Ji leaned over. Her body was soft, and a faint body fragrance surrounded the tip of his nose. He quietly took a step back.","However, as if she didn’t see Chu Yunfan’s indifference, she moved closer and said, “It’s a pleasure to meet you, Young Master Chu. You are truly a hero from a young age. After seeing you today, you truly live up to your reputation!”"]},{"number":1272,"title":"Chapter 1272 Kowtow and Apologize!","paragraphs":["1272 Kowtow and Apologize!","Chu Yunfan completely ignored Lady Shui Ji’s flattery.","“You flatter me,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Lady Shui Ji was still smiling and did not seem to care about Chu Yunfan’s indifference.","Seeing that Lady Shui Ji kept looking at Chu Yunfan, Yuwen Chang’s eyes flashed with disdain. He said, “Who knows if it’s just a false reputation!”","Yuwen Chang’s words successfully drew everyone’s attention to Chu Yunfan. Everyone could hear the provocation in his words.","“Do you want to try?” Chu Yunfan sneered at Yuwen Chang. “Undeserved reputation? You’re saying that?”","Yuwen Chang sneered and said, “Since you were all invited here by the marquis, you should know how dangerous this is. When ambushing a Core, if you’re not careful, you will die. If you are not strong enough, you will become a burden.","“When the time comes, we can’t even protect ourselves and we still have to save him?”","Yuwen Chang said that they couldn’t even protect themselves, but no one was angry because this wasn’t belittling them. It was the truth. Compared to Cores, even if they had the advantage in numbers, they couldn’t protect themselves.","“Brother Yuwen, I don’t think Young Master Chu will be a burden. After all, even the Emissaries died at his hands,” Lady Shui Ji said as she looked at Chu Yunfan with a flirtatious gaze.","Yuwen Chang noticed all this, which made him extremely jealous and resentful. He was proud and arrogant, and his cultivation was even at the half-step Core Stage. Those who could catch his eye were only a rare few.","In his opinion, there were very few people who could become his life partner. He had pursued Lady Shui Ji for many years. In his opinion, only Lady Shui Ji, who was also at the half-step Core Stage, was qualified to be his partner.","However, after this d*mned Chu Yunfan arrived, Lady Shui Ji, who was originally chatting and laughing with him, completely shifted her attention to Chu Yunfan.","This made him go crazy with jealousy.","However, he didn’t say this out loud because he was jealous. It was because he had always thought that way. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was nothing.","A twenty-something-year-old kid who didn’t even know if his hair had grown out wanted to be on equal footing with them?","One had to know that he was a half-step Core. If careless, one would be crushed to death by a finger.","In his opinion, Chu Yunfan’s reputation was spread by Marquis Zhongxin because Chu Yunfan’s surname was Chu. Therefore, Yuwen Chang did not have much regard for Chu Yunfan. His cultivation could advance by leaps and bounds, and his comprehension of the realm could also be reborn in a short period of time. Since ancient times, there had been legends of him ascending in broad daylight.","However, that was a level. Even if Chu Yunfan was a genius, he still needed time to accumulate his strength. This could not be made up for by talent.","“You? You’re the weakest here. Who are you trying to show off to?” Chu Yunfan sneered at Yuwen Chang.","“Who are you calling the weakest?!” Yuwen Chang was furious.","“I’m talking about you.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan, because they had never really compared themselves. Although they were all half-step Cores, except for the famous Emissaries who were obviously extremely strong, most of them had never really competed with each other.","“Vey well. After Zhang Ling defeats Yu Xuanfei, do you dare to fight me?” Yuwen Chang was so angry that his head was about to explode.","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly and said, “Idiot, you still dare to be arrogant? You can’t even tell who’s the winner and who’s the loser, yet you still dare to be arrogant.”","“Are you saying that what I said was wrong?” Yuwen Chang immediately understood what Chu Yunfan meant.","The others were also attracted by Chu Yunfan’s words. Zhang Ling had completely suppressed Yu Xuanfei. From the looks of it, Yu Xuanfei had no chance to counterattack.","“What a joke. Who doesn’t know that Zhang Ling’s moves are powerful and overbearing that it’s impossible to take them head on. If it was outside, Yu Xuanfei could still dodge, but in here, half the arena would be covered with a single swing of Zhang Ling’s hammer. Where can Yu Xuanfei hide?” Yuwen Chang said as he pointed at the stage.","The others nodded in agreement. If it were them, they would have the same opinion. Yu Xuanfei’s chances of winning were too slim. Even if he wanted to catch Zhang Ling off guard, it was impossible.","In their eyes, Zhang Ling’s fighting style was too overbearing, and Yu Xuanfei had no choice but to take it head-on in this narrow space. Just this alone was enough to determine that Yu Xuanfei would definitely lose this time.","“So, you didn’t see it. Can’t you see that Yu Xuanfei isn’t using his full strength?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Not using his full strength? How is that possible?” Fu Wentai said in disbelief, because Yu Xuanfei didn’t seem to be hiding his strength. “This is heresy to confuse the public and sensationalize!”","Yuwen Chang carefully observed the battle again and immediately came to the same conclusion as before. Chu Yunfan was clearly just trying to please the crowd. He had met too many people like this. They just wanted to amaze the world and attract others’ attention.","“How about it? Do you dare to bet with me and see who wins?” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","Yuwen Chang immediately sneered and said, “Bet with you? If you lose, I want you to kneel and kowtow in apology.”","“All right, if you lose, what will you do?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“How could I possibly be wrong?!” Yuwen Chang said.","“You’re already wrong. I don’t want you to do anything else. We’ll follow your suggestion. You will kneel and kowtow and say that you’re wrong.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“All right, that’s it then.” Yuwen Chang’s face revealed a carefree smile as if he could see Chu Yunfan kneeling and kowtowing.","Chu Yunfan immediately shouted at the scene, “You’ve already reached this stage, why aren’t you going all out?”","Both of them were attracted by the bet between Chu Yunfan and Yuwen Chang. Zhang Ling glared at Chu Yunfan. This d*mned kid actually dared to say that he was inferior to Yu Xuanfei.","On the other side, Yu Xuanfei shouted, “Since it has already come to this, there’s no point in me continuing to hide it. Seriously, if you saw through it, so be it. Why did you have to expose me?”"]},{"number":1273,"title":"Chapter 1273 Overconfident","paragraphs":["1273 Overconfident","As soon as Yu Xuanfei finished speaking, the power in his entire body suddenly surged. Just when everyone thought that he had reached his limit, he burst out with even more terrifying power. The mighty pressure instantly crushed the entire scene.","Everyone’s expression changed. Before, they had felt that their strengths were similar. However, after Yu Xuanfei’s attack, they immediately realized that his strength was far above theirs.","Zhang Ling, who was nearest to him, felt it the most strongly. He thought that he had already won and that Chu Yunfan dared to look down on him. He was going to teach Chu Yunfan a lesson later.","Unexpectedly, Yu Xuanfei’s strength suddenly burst out, as if he had planned this. The strength that he had displayed was completely beyond his previous strength, causing Zhang Ling to be stunned.","Then, before Zhang Ling could react, Yu Xuanfei made his move.","The long spear in Yu Xuanfei’s hand, which was engraved with dragon patterns, instantly pierced out. The spear’s light tore apart the sky and burst out with waves of intense light. The terrifying spear light transformed into a long dragon that tore apart Zhang Ling’s martial will that was smashing down.","The fierce tiger that was manifested from Zhang Ling’s martial will was instantly torn apart by the long dragon formed by the spear’s light.","The tip of the spear hit the giant hammer. At first, Yu Xuanfei had no way to resist such a giant hammers, but he also had no way to dodge, so he could only take it head-on.","However, things were different now. Yu Xuanfei exploded with his powerful strength and blocked the huge hammers. The sound of metal clashing rang out in the air.","Zhang Ling, who had been very confident in his strength, felt his arms go numb almost instantly. At this moment, he truly believed what Chu Yunfan had said. Yu Xuanfei was hiding his strength.","Before he could think further, the long dragon formed by the spear light had already torn through the sky and headed straight for his face. Zhang Ling quickly used his sledgehammer to resist, but he was still forced back.","Everyone was dumbfounded. The situation had completely changed. At first, Yu Xuanfei was the one being pushed back, but now, Zhang Ling was the one being pushed back.","After Yu Xuanfei’s display of strength, Zhang Ling’s innate strength was gone.","At this moment, everyone looked at Chu Yunfan again. They didn’t understand why they couldn’t see it, but Chu Yunfan had realized it after just a glance. Especially Yuwen Chang. His eyes flashed with a cold light as he hated Zhang Ling.","Zhang Ling was useless, which was why he was forced into a corner by Yu Xuanfei.","Originally, Zhang Ling’s loss meant nothing to him, but now that he was betting with Chu Yunfan, Zhang Ling’s loss meant that he had lost.","On the other side, Lady Shui Ji approached Chu Yunfan with a smile and said, “Young Master Chu, how could you tell that Yu Xuanfei was hiding his strength? In our opinion, he shouldn’t have the slightest chance to turn the tables.”","Facing Lady Shui Ji, Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “There are many reasons. Previously, Zhang Ling’s attacks were like a tidal wave, but in reality, every single one of his attacks failed to break Yu Xuanfei’s defense. He looked strong, but in reality, he was just an arrow at the end of its flight.”","Chu Yunfan had noticed from the start that Yu Xuanfei was hiding his strength. Of course, it wasn’t because of these so-called clues, but because he could tell that Yu Xuanfei wasn’t using his full strength.","Yu Xuanfei had hidden it very well, so no one else could see it. However, this did not mean that Chu Yunfan could not see it. In fact, he could see that there was more energy in Yu Xuanfei’s body that had not been mobilized. Therefore, Chu Yunfan could guess it after thinking for a while. Since he knew that Yu Xuanfei was hiding his strength, his actions naturally became suspicious.","However, he wouldn’t tell anyone about this. Therefore, in their eyes, Chu Yunfan was really amazing to be able to find out that Yu Xuanfei was hiding his strength through these clues.","Especially Yuwen Chang, he gritted his teeth and his heart was burning with anger. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan had clearly set a trap for him even though he knew the correct answer. He had forgotten that he had thought that victory was in his hands, and wanted to target Chu Yunfan.","While Chu Yunfan was talking, the outcome of the battle had already been decided. Just as he had said, Yu Xuanfei had easily forced Zhang Ling into a corner after unleashing his true strength. Then, he defeated Zhang Ling with a single spear strike.","Even in the end, Zhang Ling was still in a daze. He never expected he would fail just like that, especially when he thought that victory was in his grasp.","Yu Xuanfei slowly walked out of the arena and looked at Chu Yunfan, saying, “Brother, what you did wasn’t right.”","“Let’s be friends.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Yu Xuanfei burst into laughter. “Hahaha, seeing through but not revealing and wanting to be friends. Interesting!”","Chu Yunfan looked at Yuwen Chang and said, “How about it? Kneel down and kowtow.”","Everyone turned to look at Yuwen Chang. His face turned green and white. He was an extremely arrogant person, but now he was forced to kneel and kowtow to Chu Yunfan in front of everyone. How could he do that?","“You set a trap for me to jump into. This isn’t fair. I won’t kneel!” Yuwen Chang shouted.","Everyone frowned. Yuwen Chang was going back on his words, but they immediately understood. This was human nature. If it were them, they would probably not be willing either.","“So what if it was a trap I set?” Chu Yunfan sneered, “This can only mean that you’re stupid. How dare you be so arrogant without strength.”","“You’re courting death!”","Yuwen Chang was finally angered by Chu Yunfan. He instantly attacked Chu Yunfan. His leg swept out like a sharp sword, tearing the sky into two halves. In an instant, silver light filled the sky.","That terrifying aura enveloped the entire place. Everyone retreated one after another. This place had actually become a battlefield. There was no barrier protecting this place.","“You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan sneered."]},{"number":1274,"title":"Chapter 1274 All of You Should Attack Together!","paragraphs":["1274 All of You Should Attack Together!","Yuwen Chang’s strength had indeed stepped into the half-step Core Stage. When everyone saw him suddenly attack, their expressions became solemn.","Even though the rest of them, apart from Wang Zhenxi, were half-step Cores, none of them dared to let their guard down when facing Yuwen Chang.","To a certain extent, half-step Cores had already broken away from the Divine Abilities Stage.","Many people were secretly observing Chu Yunfan. They wanted to know if he was really as powerful as the rumors said.","Then, everyone clearly saw that the sky formed by the terrifying tide brought by the leg seemed to be torn apart by a big hand, instantly being torn into two halves.","Then, everyone saw Chu Yunfan appear in front of Yuwen Chang.","Yuwen Chang didn’t even have time to react before Chu Yunfan had already pounced on him. A slap came down like lightning.","Bam!","Everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s white palm slap Yuwen Chang’s face.","As for Yuwen Chang, it was as if he had bumped into Chu Yunfan’s hand with his face.","Yuwen Chang grunted and flew backward, crashing into the ground.","The scene was instantly dead silent. Everyone was dumbfounded. Everything happened too quickly. It was so fast that before everyone could react, it had already ended.","Everyone turned their gazes over. There was no life-and-death duel like they had guessed. Just a slap from Chu Yunfan and Yuwen Chang had been defeated.","Everything was so simple. They looked at Chu Yunfan with unconcealable shock in their eyes. No wonder Chu Yunfan didn’t put Yuwen Chang in his eyes at all. It turned out that he was confident.","Previously, Yuwen Chang wanted to test Chu Yunfan’s strength, but now it seemed that he was simply overestimating himself.","When she saw Chu Yunfan’s strength, the smile on Lady Shui Ji’s face widened.","Everyone was shocked. Even Yu Xuanfei, who had been full of confidence, had a serious expression on his face. They could see that Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary person.","“I’m going to kill you!” Yuwen Chang roared and jumped up from the ground. Half of his face was swollen like a pig’s head. That was from Chu Yunfan’s slap.","He wanted to teach Chu Yunfan a lesson because he knew how embarrassing it was to kneel to Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","A terrifying aura was released from Yuwen Chang’s body. It was as if a wild beast had descended from the mountain. It was extremely terrifying.","Compared to just now, Yuwen Chang, who was truly enraged, was even scarier. At this moment, he no longer had any other thoughts. He only had one thought, and that was to kill Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Yuwen Chang’s speed was fast, almost like a bolt of lightning. In an instant, he had already arrived before Chu Yunfan. His leg swept over like a mountain range.","In an instant, he kicked Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","Yuwen Chang’s kick finally hit Chu Yunfan. A carefree smile appeared on his face as if he could see Chu Yunfan’s body being kicked into two in the next moment.","However, the next moment, something even more terrifying happened. His kick landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but it was as if he had kicked an iron plate. A sound like metal clashing erupted.","Chu Yunfan did not budge. His terrifying attack, which could shatter a mountain, did not play any role in the face of Chu Yunfan.","However, before he could react, Chu Yunfan’s counterattack arrived and he was slapped again.","Yuwen Chang didn’t have time to react and was slapped. His entire body flew out like a meteor and crashed into the wall outside the drill ground. In an instant, he broke countless barriers.","His face was completely swollen like a pig’s head. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t use all his strength in this slap, for Yuwen Chang, these two slaps were enough to cause internal bleeding.","Yuwen Chang fainted!","‘How scary!’","At this moment, Yu Xuanfei and the others had no other thoughts other than this.","Before, they wanted to know Chu Yunfan’s strength, but now, just the tip of the iceberg that Chu Yunfan had displayed scared them.","If Chu Yunfan had used all his strength and exhausted all his efforts to defeat Yuwen Chang, it would have been fine. However, Chu Yunfan had only casually slapped Yuwen Chang twice and made him faint, making Yuwen Chang lose all his combat strength.","In other words, this was just the tip of the iceberg for Chu Yunfan, but it was already terrifying.","“How about it? Do you still want to fight me?” Chu Yunfan looked at Fu Wentai.","Fu Wentai’s eyes were burning with a raging fire. It was his fighting spirit. He said, “Even so, I still want to fight you. This is the only way to improve my martial arts!”","Chu Yunfan was slightly startled when he heard this. He said, “In that case, I wonder if everyone is interested. Why don’t you all attack together?”","He enunciated each word as if he was afraid that somebody would not hear him clearly.","When everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s words, even Lady Shui Ji, who had been smiling all this while, felt her face fall. They were all half-step Cores, but Chu Yunfan didn’t put them in his eyes at all. Even if his strength was amazing enough, this was too much of a bully.","Wang Zhenxi, who was watching from the side, was dumbfounded. Chu Yunfan actually challenged so many people at the same time and wanted them to fight together.","Chu Yunfan looked around at everyone. He could see the indignation on their faces, but it didn’t matter. No matter what they were thinking, rather than letting them guess, it was better to use absolute strength to let them understand that some people were not people they could provoke.","“All right then. In that case, we won’t hold back!” Fu Wentai shouted."]},{"number":1275,"title":"Chapter 1275 Defeating Four Experts Consecutively, Invincible!","paragraphs":["1275 Defeating Four Experts Consecutively, Invincible!","Chu Yunfan stepped into the drill ground. Other than Wang Zhenxi, the others followed him in. The four of them surrounded Chu Yunfan from four directions.","Their eyes were filled with fighting spirit. Chu Yunfan’s words had completely angered them.","“Get him!” Wang Zhenxi roared and pressed down like a mountain.","If Yuwen Chang’s martial arts were as fast as lightning, then Wang Zhenxi’s might was like Mount Tai. He used his fists to blast out destructive power.","The terrifying power was like two long dragons crossed the sky and attacked Chu Yunfan.","From the other three directions, Zhang Ling and Yu Xuanfei didn’t even wait for Wang Zhenxi’s attack to come to an end before launching their attacks.","Zhang Ling’s huge hammers swept across the sky and smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","Yu Xuanfei’s spear was like a black dragon and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","On the other side, Lady Shui Ji’s divine power was boiling, and endless water appeared in the sky. She was using her divine power to condense the water vapor in the air, turning it into a terrifying attack that bore down on Chu Yunfan.","Although the four of them had joined forces, the shock that Chu Yunfan had caused them was still vivid in their minds. He had casually sent Yuwen Chang flying and crippled him. Even if the four of them joined forces now, they did not dare to attack one by one. That would be courting death.","All four of them were half-step Cores. Any one of them was even stronger than Wan Huang. They were the best among half-step Cores.","As soon as the four of them attacked, the barrier of the entire drill ground was activated. The barrier rippled like the surface of water. Ripples of waves almost overturned the entire drill ground.","“Is this the might of half-step Cores?” Wang Zhenxi looked at the scene in front of him and was extremely shocked. However, boundless heroism rose in his heart.","He was Fu Wentai’s disciple. In essence, they were the same type of people and would not be easily defeated. However, he also knew how Chu Yunfan was going to fight against these four terrifying experts.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan suddenly moved. He took the lead and rushed toward Fu Wentai.","Fu Wentai punched at him with both fists, and Chu Yunfan also punched with both fists.","Chu Yunfan’s long hair and black robe fluttered in the wind. He was as fierce as hell, and he looked like an ancient god.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s punch smashed directly into Fu Wentai’s punch and shattered it on the spot. Chu Yunfan’s power was released, and his fist force tore everything apart.","Although Fu Wentai was very strong and his fist force was usually unparalleled, it depended on the opponent. Against Chu Yunfan, he could not resist at all. With just one punch from Chu Yunfan, all his attacks were destroyed.","Then, Chu Yunfan’s fist momentum did not decrease and suddenly hit Fu Wentai.","“What kind of fist technique is this?!”","Fu Wentai was shocked. He could also see that Chu Yunfan’s punch was far more powerful than his fist technique. It was unimaginably powerful.","He even saw the circulation of the Great Dao in Chu Yunfan’s fist technique, which contained traces of the Great Dao.","Originally, he had disregarded Chu Yunfan . Even though Chu Yunfan’s performance was extremely fierce and he knew that he might not be a match for Chu Yunfan, it didn’t shock him.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s power was not only far above his, but the martial arts he comprehended was also far more powerful than his.","Bam!","Fu Wentai grunted and was sent flying out of the drill ground, losing the ability to fight.","After sending Fu Wentai flying with a punch, Chu Yunfan immediately counterattacked Lady Shui Ji. Although Lady Shui Ji had been casting him flirtatious glances earlier, he did not have the slightest intention of showing mercy to the fairer sex.","He slapped her with his hand.","This slap seemed to contain the power of heaven and earth. In an instant, it had already shattered the raging tide that Lady Shui Ji had blasted out. It turned into nothingness and dissipated.","The slap landed on Lady Shui Ji’s voluptuous chest, creating a hand seal that sent her flying. She screamed and flew backward. Just like Fu Wentai, she lost her ability to fight.","On the other side, there was no time for Chu Yunfan to dodge Zhang Ling and Yu Xuanfei’s attacks. In an instant, both of them had arrived.","At this time, Chu Yunfan’s body was suffused with blood-red energy. An extremely evil energy surged out of his body and turned into a skeleton armor around him, instantly enveloping him.","This was Demon Descends Illustration.","Ever since Chu Yunfan recovered his strength, he could open the Mountain River Diagram that he couldn’t open before. And now, he could use the illustration again.","The quality of the illustration wasn’t very high. At most, it was a Divine Abilities magic weapon. However, that depended on who was controlling it. With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation, he was almost invincible.","The illustration that he casually used could also erupt with extremely terrifying power.","Neither Zhang Ling’s hammers nor Yu Xuanfei’s spear could break through the defense of the illustration.","“Sh*t!”","The two of them reacted instantly. Things were not looking good.","Sure enough, at this moment, Chu Yunfan had already rushed over.","He slapped Zhang Ling’s hammers.","Clang!","With a loud metallic clang, Zhang Ling’s hammers flew out and landed on the ground like meteors. Everyone could clearly see huge handprints on the hammers. It was terrifying.","These were magic weapons, not an ordinary metal weapons, but Chu Yunfan had managed to smash huge handprints on them.","The web between Zhang Ling’s thumb and forefinger had split open, and blood was flowing out. His face was filled with disbelief. He had actually lost to Chu Yunfan in a competition of strength.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan was already standing in front of him. He kicked Zhang Ling, and Zhang Ling destroyed the drill ground.","Yu Xuanfei felt his hair stand on end, because he was the only one left from so many people. He hurriedly stabbed out a sky full of spear lights in an attempt to stop Chu Yunfan.","Unexpectedly, Chu Yunfan only punched out a huge golden asura, tearing apart Yu Xuanfei’s spear lights.","Yu Xuanfei’s fate was the same as the others. Chu Yunfan sent him flying out of the drill ground."]},{"number":1276,"title":"Chapter 1276 Yuwen Chang Ran Away!","paragraphs":["1276 Yuwen Chang Ran Away!","The battle had come to an end at lightning speed. These people could be considered famous figures, but now, they had all been defeated by Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, besides Chu Yunfan, the only person who was still standing was Wang Zhenxi.","Wang Zhenxi’s pupils contracted slightly, and his heart was beating so fast that it was about to jump out of his throat.","Chu Yunfan had said before that his master, Fu Wentai, was no match for him, but he was skeptical about it. If it wasn’t for the fact that Chu Yunfan had left a deep impression on him when he killed the Emissaries, he wouldn’t have believed such ridiculous words.","However, after Chu Yunfan had just displayed his divine might and defeated several experts, he realized that Chu Yunfan had not exaggerated in the slightest. In fact, he had even said it modestly.","Moreover, he felt that Chu Yunfan had become much more terrifying than when he fought the Emissaries.","When Chu Yunfan killed the Emissaries, he suppressed them from the beginning to the end, making them unable to fight back. However, he had not defeated a half-step Core so easily.","This feeling could be described in terms of the realm of martial arts. It was like lifting heavy things as if they were light. Everything was within Chu Yunfan’s control.","He didn’t reveal his full strength, but this made Chu Yunfan even more powerful and terrifying!","The others got to their feet. After they were sent flying, they did not get up immediately because they were deeply shocked by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan did not kill them. Although there were some external injuries on their bodies, with their strength, they recovered in a moment.","“I lost. You are indeed powerful and live up to your reputation. No, you’re even more powerful than the rumors I’ve heard these past few days!”","Yu Xuanfei was the first to speak. He had nothing more to say to Chu Yunfan. Before this, he had blamed Chu Yunfan for exposing him, but now, he no longer had any such thoughts.","Chu Yunfan’s strength had been deeply imprinted in his heart.","“Hahahahaha! This is great! This feels so good!” Fu Wentai laughed out loud. Although he was defeated in one move, which was very embarrassing for some people, it was a rare experience for him. Chu Yunfan had showed him another terrifying level.","“Young Master Chu, thank you for showing mercy. After this matter is over, I wonder if you could make the time to come to Jellyfish Palace?” Lady Shui Ji didn’t mind her defeat and just smiled at Chu Yunfan.","Only Zhang Ling’s expression was a little unsightly. He had lost two matches in a row in a short period, but he had nothing to say about them. Especially in the second match, Chu Yunfan had completely crushed him with his absolute strength.","Chu Yunfan just smiled and didn’t say anything. He glanced at these people and shook his head. These people were the ones Chu Yaowei had gathered to kill the Core enemy.","Chu Yunfan was disappointed. These people were far worse than when he was seriously injured. How could they compete with a Core?","A few moments later, Chu Yaowei arrived at the drill ground. However, he had not expected that the battle there to have already ended.","When he received the news, he immediately rushed over. He knew that he hadn’t wasted any time, but he still didn’t make it in time. It was completely over.","Chu Yaowei looked at the scene in shock. It was not difficult for him to see that these people had all been defeated by Chu Yunfan.","He looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. Chu Yunfan’s words were still ringing in his ears. At that time, Chu Yunfan said that it was impossible to find another person like him in the whole country.","At that time, he thought that Chu Yunfan was just boasting. But now, it seemed that Chu Yunfan was not boasting, but rather, he had the strength.","Wang Zhenxi soon told Chu Yaowei everything that had happened. Chu Yaowei immediately revealed a bitter smile, especially when he saw that Chu Yunfan has knocked Yuwen Chang unconscious.","He quickly settled everyone down before looking for Chu Yunfan. The two of them went to a secret room and sat down.","“I wanted you to meet them and get to know them. I didn’t expect things to turn out like this!”","Chu Yunfan smiled and said, “These are all arrogant people. If we don’t beat down their arrogance, how could they possibly be honest?”","Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan and felt a little depressed. Speaking of arrogance, this young master in front of him was the real arrogant one. Although he wasn’t as arrogant and domineering as those half-step Cores, he had witnessed the arrogance in Chu Yunfan’s bones.","Seeing the depressed look on Chu Yaowei’s face, Chu Yunfan naturally knew what he was thinking. He smiled and said, “Don’t tell me you found these people to deal with the Core? I can tell you that it’s impossible.”","Chu Yaowei revealed a determined smile and said, “I know, but they’re not my real trump card. My real trump card is also a Core!”","Chu Yunfan suddenly realized that this was Chu Yaowei’s real hidden trump card. Although Chu Yaowei wanted to take revenge, he was not stupid. If one thought that they could deal with a Core with half-step Core Stage, that was just foolish.","So there was a Core!","“Since it has already come to this point, there’s no harm in telling you. The expert who attacked this time is an expert of the royal family. Our ancestors were involved in such a matter for the sake of the imperial court. Therefore, when I went to the imperial capital previously, I asked His Majesty for an expert to help us,” Chu Yaowei gritted his teeth and said.","“This time, I must catch that person in one fell swoop and take revenge for the lives of the many people in my family that were lost!”","“In that case, I won’t say anything more. Just inform me when you want to implement the plan!” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan was certain that he had recovered his strength. No matter who the other party was, he had nothing to fear.","After settling the matter, Chu Yunfan bid farewell to Chu Yaowei. However, the matter did not end there. Soon, a piece of news reached Chu Yunfan’s ears.","Yuwen Chang had ran away. He disappeared almost as soon as he woke up.","Everyone realized that this matter had blown up."]},{"number":1277,"title":"Chapter 1277 Ancient Tracking Technique","paragraphs":["1277 Ancient Tracking Technique","Yuwen Chang’s escape had alerted the higher-ups in the residence, especially Chu Yaowei.","When he heard the news, Chu Yaowei’s face turned green. He immediately thought of a terrifying consequence now that Yuwen Chang knew about their plan. He had invited Yuwen Chang to help him, but now his existence had become the biggest loophole in the entire plan.","Chu Yunfan had taught Yuwen Chang a harsh lesson. If he held a grudge and told this plan to Chu Yaowei’s enemy, the consequences would be unimaginable.","It was completely conceivable that this plan that had been planned for several years would result in failure. It might even alarm the other party and attract even more intense revenge.","Thinking of this, Chu Yaowei’s face turned green with regret. Before this, Chu Yunfan had already suggested that since he had already offended Yuwen Chang to death, it would be better to imprison him. At least, before this operation was over, Yuwen Chang could not be released.","However, he did not agree because he did not want to completely offend Yuwen Chang. He had wanted to apologize to Yuwen Chang after he woke up. After all, he was not Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan could completely disregard Yuwen Chang and slap him to death. However, he could only treat Yuwen Chang like a lord.","At first, he didn’t want to offend Chu Yunfan, but now it seemed that Chu Yunfan’s worries were right. Since he had already completely offended Yuwen Chang, he might as well kill him completely.","He wanted to kill Yuwen Chang while Chu Yunfan was around.","But now, Yuwen Chang had escaped without giving CHu Yaowei a chance to explain. He was clearly holding a grudge and was seeking revenge.","Almost immediately, Chu Yaowei gathered Chu Yunfan and the others.","“I didn’t expect him to run away and not give me a chance at all,” Chu Yaowei said through gritted teeth.","The expressions of the others changed. They had surrounded and killed a Core because they had the idea that they would die if they failed.","Adding on the fact that the residence paid a high price, they were finally able to set off.","In their minds, this matter had to be kept extremely confidential. Not many people in the residence knew that these experts had come to keep it a secret. If the news was leaked and the Core was still alive, then when the Core took revenge, it would be enough to uproot their entire business.","Thinking of this, these people’s expressions were extremely ugly. If that was really the case, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“What should we do?” Zhang Ling said in a low and muffled voice.","Everyone’s expression was very ugly, but no one proposed to withdraw because they knew very well that it was too late to withdraw now. If Yuwen Chang didn’t go to the secret, then there was no need for them to withdraw now. However, if Yuwen Chang withdrew, then there was even less need for them to withdraw now.","Because to that Core, all of them were capital criminals.","If it were them, if an ordinary Divine dared to scheme against them, with their tempers, it would be a piece of cake for the Divine’s family to be exterminated. In fact, such a thing had even happened before.","“It’s probably too late to kill him now,” Yu Xuanfei said with an extremely ugly expression. He had never thought that things would turn out like this. It was completely different from what he had expected.","Even with everyone’s state of mind, they felt like the sky was falling and the earth was shattering when they thought about offending a Core. Their hearts were like dead ashes.","Back then, all of them had thought so. Who knew that because of Yuwen Chang’s betrayal, all of this had become smoke?","Everyone wanted to chase after him at this moment, but no one knew where Yuwen Chang had gone. He had been running for a while. For a half-step Core, such a long time was enough for him to run far away.","Everyone turned to look at Chu Yunfan. Strictly speaking, this matter had started because of him. Of course, they did not have the courage to challenge him.","If Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary half-step Core, they would have cursed him long ago. However, the fact that he had defeated them with ease was too shocking.","“What’s the hurry? Take a look at this,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he formed a seal. Suddenly, a violent fluctuation in the air formed a picture. Everyone saw a figure appear in the picture.","It was none other than Yuwen Chang.","Yuwen Chang stepped on the light and fled into the distance at an astonishing speed. His swollen face revealed an extremely ferocious and vicious expression. He muttered something, but no one knew what he was saying.","However, according to his extremely ferocious expression, everyone could guess it without thinking. He must be cursing Chu Yunfan, and might even be bringing the Core to them.","However, what shocked them was that Chu Yunfan was able to track Yuwen Chang. This method had already surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage. Even Cores couldn’t do this.","This was because this was not a martial arts technique, but a spell.","However, ever since the world changed, this spell had been lost. They had only seen some records in some ancient books.","At this moment, they felt that Chu Yunfan was unfathomable, and the way they looked at him completely changed. The speculation that Chu Yunfan had a powerful inheritance was no longer a speculation in their hearts, but a fact.","If it was said that powerful strength could be cultivated by some fortuitous encounter, but this kind of tracking spell could not be cultivated by oneself. It could only be cultivated by powerful inheritance.","They had guessed correctly this time, but they were still too naive. What Chu Yunfan had obtained was not an ordinary inheritance. It was an inheritance from a top figure during the Ancient Zenith Civilization.","If word got out, it would immediately cause a huge sensation.","What Chu Yunfan used was an ancient tracking technique. Even in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, when they were at their peak, only a few sects with great inheritances had top-notch tracking techniques.","They had been worried about Yuwen Chang before. Although Chu Yaowei had rejected Chu Yunfan’s suggestion, Chu Yunfan still left his spiritual mark on Yuwen Chang’s body. Only then could he track him down.","Everyone’s faces revealed a hint of joy, and then their eyes erupted with waves of killing intent."]},{"number":1278,"title":"Chapter 1278 The Arrival of a Strong Enemy in the Core Stage","paragraphs":["1278 The Arrival of a Strong Enemy in the Core Stage","Of course, they didn’t have a good impression of Yuwen Chang. No matter what their previous relationship was, since Yuwen Chang dared to put them in danger and even endanger their lives, they wouldn’t be stingy to let Yuwen Chang die.","After all, everyone had the idea that it was better for him to die than for them to die.","“Since we can find him, tell us his location. He won’t escape!” Zhang Ling snorted.","He gripped the heavy hammer in his hand tightly. He might not be able to deal with a Core, but it was more than enough to deal with Yuwen Chang. Moreover, there were so many people present who wanted to kill him, so Yuwen Chang was as good as dead.","With so many experts gathered together, even the Great Wei Kingdom’s imperial court would have to look at them in a different light. In this process, Chu Yaowei had prepared for more than 20 years and dealt with experts from all over the world before finally completing this connection.","“That’s right. Since he wants to betray us, he has to be prepared to accept the consequences.” Lady Shui Ji sneered, no longer trying to seduce everyone.","“In that case, let’s do it!” Chu Yaowei gritted his teeth.","If Yuwen Chang succeeded, then all the years of preparation would go to waste overnight. The Chu clan might also be destroyed. That was the most terrifying thing.","“It’s fine. Don’t be anxious,” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “The original plan was to lure that person over, right? Isn’t this a good opportunity?”","Chu Yunfan’s words made everyone’s eyes light up. Everyone’s eyes swept over. They had never expected Chu Yunfan to have such a plan.","“It’s just a piece of cake for me to kill him,” Chu Yunfan continued.","If Chu Yunfan’s words were heard by others, they would only have one feeling, and that was that he was extremely arrogant. Yuwen Chang was, after all, an expert whose name shook the Great Wei Kingdom. However, in Chu Yunfan’s words, he was not much different from an ant.","However, no one felt that there was anything wrong with this statement because Chu Yunfan wasn’t boasting. He was telling the truth.","“It’s not difficult for me to kill him. If he finds that person, then it’s just right to lure him over,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Chu Yaowei thought for a while and said, “Very well. This is indeed an excellent opportunity. If that person arrives tonight, he will be dead for sure.”","“What if he doesn’t care and attacks our sect?” Yu Xuanfei suddenly asked.","Everyone’s expression changed because it was indeed possible. They could set up an inescapable net here, but if he didn’t fall for it, then all of this would be meaningless.","“He’ll come. This is what I want to happen by letting Yuwen Chang go.” Chu Yunfan paused and then continued, “Yuwen Chang will tell the Core about our plan. Then, he will know that we have invited the imperial family to deal with him. If you were him, would you kill us before the matter is settled or wait until the imperial family arrives to kill him?”","When everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they immediately understood what he meant. To be fair, if it were them, they would probably choose to kill them.","This was the best way to solve this problem.","“So that person is coming soon,” Chu Yunfan said, “At this point, I think I should know who it is that you plan to deal with, right?” Chu Yunfan looked at Chu Yaowei and said.","Chu Yaowei paused for a moment and said, “Since it has come to this, then I will tell you. That person is called the Ancestor Wusheng. He was originally the sect leader of the Inanimate Sword Sect in Great Wei. Later, the Inanimate Sword Sect colluded with the Jinzhanghan Kingdom and wanted to launch a rebellion. However, we found evidence first and wanted to destroy him, but he got away and became a Core.”","“The Inanimate Sword Sect. I remember that there was such a sect, but it was a long time ago,” Yu Xuanfei said, “I remember that it was during my father’s generation. The Inanimate Sword Sect was a powerful sect that was on par with us. Later on, they were wiped out overnight.”","“It’s normal that you don’t know. After he escaped, he mainly moved around in the outer realms and didn’t do much in Great Wei,” Chu Yaowei said.","Everyone was enlightened and nodded. However, there was a hint of envy in their expressions. After all, it was a great opportunity to enter the Core Stage.","As for the sect, when one reached the Core Stage, rebuilding a sect was nothing.","However, everyone could hear that there was no room for reconciliation between the two sides. The Chu clan had uprooted the Inanimate Sword Sect, while the Ancestor Wusheng had killed the members of the Chu clan until they were almost extinct.","Only when one of them could survive in the end.","“In that case, everyone should go back and prepare. I’m afraid the real attack will come soon,” Yu Xuanfei said.","After Chu Yunfan bade farewell, he returned to his small courtyard. However, he did not leave the residence because he knew the final battlefield would probably be here.","To others, this battle was like the pressure of Mount Tai, but to Chu Yunfan, it was nothing. This was because his strength had already entered the Core Stage. He had even killed an expert who was also in the Core Stage.","And now, his strength was more than ten times stronger than before. It was simply incomparable.","However, these preparations were all aimed at the top members of the Chu clan. Ordinary members of the Chu clan did not realize what had happened at all.","The night was silent. The next morning, Chu Hongcai came to Chu Yunfan’s small courtyard.","In the entire Chu clan, Chu Yunfan’s small courtyard had undergone special modifications. It had the most abundant spirit energy under Chu Yunfan’s guidance. After Chu Yunfan stored the energy, Chu Hongcai came here to train.","After Chu Hongcai had stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage, he faced even more problems. To Chu Yunfan, these problems could be easily solved. They were nothing.","In a short period, Chu Hongcai had already cultivated to the peak of the first level of the Divine Abilities Stage. For his age, he was indeed not weak.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was instructing him, there was a violent spatial fluctuation in the sky. Then, a group of more than ten figures appeared above the Chu clan.","Each of these figures had a terrifying power that could suppress heaven and earth. One person could suppress the whole of Conglong."]},{"number":1279,"title":"Chapter 1279 Not a Single Soul in Conglong Will Be Left Alive!","paragraphs":["1279 Not a Single Soul in Conglong Will Be Left Alive!","These terrifying auras pressed down like Mount Tai, immediately causing the many barriers in the residence to be activated.","However, these barriers that could usually defend against all kinds of attacks were unable to withstand the auras, and they collapsed at lightning speed.","One could imagine how shocking these dozen people were.","Chu Yunfan stopped teaching Chu Hongcai almost immediately and said to him, “Don’t go running around.”","After saying that, he stepped on a streak of light and disappeared from the spot.","In the sky, a group of more than ten figures surrounded the entire Chu clan. Each of them was a terrifying existence that completely surpassed the Divine Abilities Stage.","Half-step Cores!","At this moment, everyone thought of this. The Chu clan was no longer as ignorant as before. Especially when the Emissaries of the Netherworld Sect came, they had taught them how terrifying half-step Cores could be.","Just the Emissaries were already very terrifying. Now, more than a dozen people had suddenly appeared. It made many people despair.","Any one of these people could shake the whole of Conglong, let alone so many of them. The whole of Great Wei was shocked.","“Why are there so many experts?”","“They all came with ill intentions. When did our residence provoke so many experts?”","“It’s so scary, I can’t even move my fingers!”","The entire Chu clan felt as if they had encountered the end of the world. They could not move at all.","In the sky, among the dozen figures, there was an even more terrifying figure that suppressed the entire city. His terrifying pressure could even be sensed by the barriers of the city, and they were automatically activated.","What kind of figure was that? He looked to be about 50 or 60 years old. He was dressed in black clothes, had white hair, and a youthful face. His entire person looked like a treasure sword, and he had a terrifying pressure that ordinary people could not imagine.","Compared to the others, his strength was clearly much, much stronger. He was simply not on the same level.","Although the other dozen or so people were also very strong, they were nothing compared to him. He was the ruler in the entire sky.","“It’s a Core!”","At this moment, all the experts in the Conglong could feel the power of this expert. They had guessed it immediately. To be able to make the barriers of the entire city automatically activate, who else could it be but a Core?","Many people’s expressions changed. Just the half-step Cores alone, the invasion of Wan Huang and the Emissaries had already frightened everyone in Conglong, not to mention that a Core. It could be said that a Core had the ability to wipe out the entire city.","“Ancestor Wusheng, what are you trying to do?! Do you want to fight to the death with the Great Wei Kingdom?!”","At this time, the angry roar of the city lord came from the direction of the city lord’s mansion.","Ancestor Wusheng was truly audacious. He actually dared to attack Conglong. Once Conglong was destroyed, it would be of great significance to the Great Wei Kingdom. It was enough to make the entire Great Wei Kingdom furious.","“Hmph, I’ll kill you later,” Ancestor Wusheng said coldly. If it were anyone else, they would definitely be wary of Great Wei. After all, Great Wei was filled with experts. Only they knew how many experts there were. It was even said that there were also experts who could defeat others.","There was no sect that could truly withstand a full-powered attack from Great Wei. However, there was nothing to be afraid of. Ancestor Wusheng had been living in the outer realms for all these years, and his Inanimate Sword Sect had long been destroyed. He was no longer afraid.","“So what if it’s the Great Wei Kingdom? Can they do anything to me? Hahahahaha!” Ancestor Wusheng laughed. “After I slaughter the entire city, collect all the blood essence and souls, and refine them into spirit weapons, why would I need to live in Great Wei? When I go to the Jinzhanghan Kingdom and march Jinzhanghan’s cavalry to the south, Great Wei will be doomed.”","Hearing the words of Ancestor Wusheng, everyone felt a chill run down their spines, and even more people were so angry that their entire bodies were trembling. Ancestor Wusheng was too vicious. He wanted to slaughter the whole of Conglong and use over a million living beings to refine his spirit weapon.","Even the ruthless cultivators of the demonic paths would not dare to do such a heinous thing. If they did, they would undoubtedly be met with endless revenge from Great Wei.","Ordinary people would not dare to do so, but just as Ancestor Wusheng had said, if he went to Jinzhanghan, there was nothing they could do.","“Ancestor Wusheng, you were also in Great Wei. How can you do such a thing that infuriates both men and gods!” the city lord shouted from his mansion.","“Hahahaha, Great Wei massacred my entire sect, and now you still want to talk about kinship with me?” Ancestor Wusheng gritted his teeth and said with a ferocious expression. “That day, countless lives were lost in my family. Today, I will make sure that no one in Conglong gets out alive. Blood will flow like rivers!","“Don’t even think about leaving, and don’t even think about stalling for time. We’ve already set up a barrier around this area. You’re not allowed to enter or leave.”","Ancestor Wusheng’s words made many people despair. He simply did not give them the slightest chance of survival.","At this moment, Ancestor Wusheng turned his gaze to the Chu clan.","“Chu Yaowei, why aren’t you coming out yet? Aren’t you plotting against me? Now that I’m here, I want to see how you’re going to kill me. If you can’t kill me today, I’ll exterminate your entire clan as a sacrifice to the souls of my Inanimate Sword Sect in heaven!”","“Ancestor Wusheng, you colluded with Jinzhanghan and attempted to launch a rebellion, causing the whole of Great Wei to be plunged into misery.”","At this moment, a figure slowly flew up. Who else could it be but Chu Yaowei?","However, his expression was extremely ugly at this moment. He had not expected Ancestor Wusheng to really come. What he did not expect even more was that the imperial family’s guardian whom he had invited previously did not come last night.","“Cut the crap. What does the suffering of the people have to do with me? Back then, your Chu clan killed my entire family. Today, I will make you pay with blood!” Ancestor Wusheng shouted, and a terrifying pressure pressed down."]},{"number":1280,"title":"Chapter 1280 Noisy! Instantly Killing Yuwen Chang!","paragraphs":["1280 Noisy! Instantly Killing Yuwen Chang!","Almost immediately, Chu Yaowei felt a terrifying pressure grab him like a big hand, almost wanting to crush him in mid-air.","Cores were too terrifying!","Even though he had been fully prepared, he still felt that he had underestimated an expert of this level.","A half-step Core only possessed some techniques of a Core. However, their strength was not at the Core Stage. It was just that their efficiency in using their divine power was much higher than that of ordinary Divines.","However, the Core Stage was indeed the Core Stage. It was not something that ordinary people could compare to.","Just the pressure alone was enough to make Chu Yaowei, an upper-stage Divine, almost unable to survive. It was as if all the muscles in his body were about to collapse.","‘How could it be so terrifying!’ Chu Yaowei almost couldn’t breathe.","At this moment, powerful auras burst out from the residence. They were Zhang Ling, Yu Xuanfei, Fu Wentai, and Lady Shui Ji.","At this critical moment, the four of them made a move. They used their half-step Core Stage aura to save Chu Yaowei. Although they were still far from Cores, they were still better than Chu Yaowei who could not fight back.","After he was saved, Chu Yaowei heaved a sigh of relief. However, his expression was unusually ugly at this moment. Zhang Ling and the other three also flew into the sky and confronted the dozen people from afar.","Their faces were ashen. It was even worse than the worst scenarios they had planned for. Their original plan was to cooperate with the imperial family’s guardian to kill Ancestor Wusheng. Who knew that the imperial family’s guardian had not shown up, but Ancestor Wusheng had?","He had also brought more than ten half-step Cores, none of whom were weaker than their own group. Their numbers were several times more than the four of them, which meant that each of them had to face several experts of the same level.","They were not a match, to begin with. If Ancestor Wusheng was added, then they would have had no way to resist.","This was simply a situation of certain death.","They were not surprised to see Yuwen Chang in the crowd. Just as they had guessed, Yuwen Chang had indeed gone to join Ancestor Wusheng.","“Yuwen Chang, how dare you betray us! Betray Great Wei! Your whole family is dead!” Chu Yaowei shouted.","“Hahaha, as long as I kill everyone in the city, no one will know that I was involved.” Yuwen Chang sneered. “Besides, even if you know, what can you do? At most, we will enter Jinzhanghan. With the strength of the Yuwen family, we can still do well there.","“You let that guy bully me, now you all die!”","Yuwen Chang laughed manically. His expression turned ferocious when he thought of how he was easily defeated and humiliated by Chu Yunfan. He felt extremely happy now.","“Where’s Chu Yunfan? Why is he still unwilling to come out? Is he afraid?”","“You’re so noisy.”","All of a sudden, a clear sound was heard. A sword light swept across the sky and instantly hit Yuwen Chang in the face.","Bam!","Yuwen Chang’s head instantly exploded. From afar, it was like a watermelon exploding. His body did not react and fell from the sky.","This happened so quickly that it did not give anyone time to react.","Even though Zhang Ling and the others hated Yuwen Chang, they knew that it was impossible to kill Yuwen Chang in front of so many people. It was simply a fantasy.","But now, someone had done it right under their noses!","In just one move, a sword light had already killed Yuwen Chang, who was extremely powerful.","“Who did that?!” Ancestor Wusheng’s expression changed. Someone was actually killing people in front of him. This was equivalent to slapping his face.","He had been so proud of himself and said he wanted to slaughter everyone in Conglong. Now, someone had actually killed one of his subordinates in front of him.","Yuwen Chang was forced to submit to Ancestor Wusheng. A half-step Core subordinate was not easy to subdue. These people were all ambitious and unruly. It was not easy to make them submit.","“Chu Yunfan!” Zhang Ling exclaimed. He knew who the person who had attacked was.","At this time, who else could have the motive and the strength to make a move except for Chu Yunfan?","The others also thought of Chu Yunfan.","Previously, they were very afraid of his strength, but now it seemed that the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the safer they would be.","Immediately after, a figure slowly flew out of the residence. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","“Are you Chu Yunfan?” Ancestor Wusheng gritted his teeth and looked at Chu Yunfan. He admitted that he was too careless. Yuwen Chang had told him about Chu Yunfan before, but he did not take him seriously at all.","According to Yuwen Chang’s description, Chu Yunfan was very strong. Otherwise, he would not have been defeated.","However, he could see that Yuwen Chang had clearly hidden a lot of things, especially the fact that Yuwen Chang had almost been defeated by Chu Yunfan in two or three moves. Therefore, his words were full of mistakes in Ancestor Wusheng’s eyes.","Ancestor Wusheng thought that Yuwen Chang had exaggerated Chu Yunfan’s strength just to make his defeat reasonable, and he was not the only one who thought so. Even the other half-step Cores who had come with him thought so too.","However, he didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to take him down the notch the moment they met.","“That’s right, I’m Chu Yunfan!” Chu Yunfan glanced at Ancestor Wusheng with disgust in his eyes. He hated this kind of person the most.","He had killed most of these people in the Federation. Even in the Spirit Realm, his hatred for them did not diminish.","“You brat. How dare you block my way and kill someone? I will kill you. I will torture you for ten days and ten nights and make you beg for death!” Ancestor Wusheng roared angrily.","“You want to torture me to death, but I won’t do this to you. Killing you is enough,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, not taking the words of Ancestor Wusheng to heart at all.","“Kill me? You?” Ancestor Wusheng sneered. “You guys are probably still dreaming that the imperial guardian will come and save you. Don’t even think about it, because he won’t come.”"]},{"number":1281,"title":"Chapter 1281 He Is Trash, but So Are You!","paragraphs":["1281 He Is Trash, but So Are You!","Everyone’s expressions changed because what Ancestor Wusheng said was actually their greatest trump card.","Only the imperial family’s guardian could fight against Ancestor Wusheng.","It wasn’t strange for Ancestor Wusheng to know about the existence of the imperial guardian, because Yuwen Chang had betrayed them.","However, what really made their expressions change was that, just as Ancestor Wusheng had said, the imperial guardian who should have arrived had not arrived yet.","Instead, they got Ancestor Wusheng.","The reason behind this result was enough to make them feel scared.","The only result was that the imperial guardian had been intercepted. Regardless of whether he was alive or dead, he should not be able to make it in time.","If there were no Cores defending the city, the whole of Conglong would probably be slaughtered by Ancestor Wusheng and his subordinates.","This was the most terrifying part!","Before this, their biggest reliance was that Ancestor Wusheng dared not act recklessly here. Who knew that Ancestor Wusheng had already found a way out? Even if Great Wei was furious, could they charge into Jinzhanghan and kill Ancestor Wusheng?","“So this was part of your plan!” Chu Yaowei gritted his teeth.","“That’s right. You’re trying to scheme against me behind my back? Little did you know that in the face of true strength, your little schemes were simply mantis trying to stop a chariot!” Ancestor Wusheng laughed.","“Chu Yaowei, among these people, I’ll kill you first to end the grudge between our two families. As for the others, I’ll kill them all!” Ancestor Wusheng shouted.","He only had Chu Yaowei in his eyes, not because Chu Yaowei was strong, but because of the hatred between the two of them. As for the others, he did not care at all.","A true Core like him wouldn’t care about so-called geniuses, even though he had heard about Chu Yunfan from Yuwen Chang, so what? Geniuses and powerhouses were not necessarily equal.","He didn’t know how many so-called geniuses he had killed. If these so-called geniuses couldn’t take the next step, they would die young.","“Ancestor Wusheng, I don’t think you need to do this personally. Just leave it to us. Hasn’t Chu Yunfan been praised by others recently? I want to see how capable he is.”","At this moment, a tall and muscular man with a ferocious expression stood out. He was dressed in a nomadic style that was clearly different from the traditional outfit of Great Wei.","His eyes were cold. When he looked at Chu Yunfan, it was as if he was looking at his prey. His grin was especially scary.","“All right, since you want to make a move, I’ll leave it to you. I originally wanted to personally torture him for ten days and ten nights before killing him, but I’ll let you have it.” Ancestor Wusheng sneered.","“A Jinzhanghan warrior?” Chu Yunfan looked at the ferocious man. His body was a little rough. Chu Yunfan could even see that there was an extremely shocking evil aura in his body.","It was a sign of mass murder. In the outer realms, in Jinzhanghan, massacres were carried out at any time. Especially in Jinzhanghan, small tribes could be destroyed if they were not careful.","“That’s right. You’re a genius among the people of Great Wei, and what I like the most is to kill so-called young geniuses like you,” The Jinzhanghan warrior grinned.","“You overestimate yourself.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Yuwen Chang couldn’t even block one of my moves. Can you?”","The Jinzhanghan warrior sneered and said, “Don’t compare me to trash like Yuwen Chang. Even if there were two Yuwen Changs, they would be no match for me.”","“You said he’s trash?”","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, his figure suddenly disappeared from where he was.","The Jinzhanghan warrior’s vision blurred. He felt that Chu Yunfan had disappeared from where he was. When he reappeared, he was already in front of him.","The Jinzhanghan warrior roared and released all his divine power, turning into a terrifying battle energy.","However, the boiling battle energy could not stop Chu Yunfan’s footsteps. Chu Yunfan simply used his finger as a sword and flew across the sky.","The invincible battle energy was instantly cut apart, and the Jinzhanghan warrior was beheaded before he could react.","Everything happened too fast. In just a split second, before anyone could react, Chu Yunfan had already killed the Jinzhanghan warrior.","“You’re right. He is indeed trash, but so are you,” Chu Yunfan said casually as if the person he had just killed was not a half-step Core, but just an ant on the side of the road.","“Oh, my God!”","In the distance, in the city lord’s mansion, a gasp could be heard. The one who had said that was none other than the city lord of Conglong. It was a middle-aged man dressed in luxurious clothes. When he saw this scene, he could not help but gasp.","“The second one!”","This was the second half-step Core that Chu Yunfan had killed.","The city lord looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. When Chu Yunfan fought Wan Huang and killed the Emissaries, he had seen it from afar.","At that time, although Chu Yunfan’s strength was amazing, he was sure that it was far inferior to his current strength.","Back then, when Chu Yunfan faced the Emissaries, he could be said to have crushed them from the beginning to the end. However, it was not like now, when he casually killed a half-step Core.","Especially those experts who followed Ancestor Wusheng here. None of them were weaker than him. With so many experts gathered together, it was simply a huge disaster.","However, in front of Chu Yunfan, it was nothing.","Not only the city lord but even Zhang Ling and the others widened their eyes. Chu Yunfan was much more terrifying than yesterday. In other words, Chu Yunfan hadn’t used his full strength before. Now, he was showing his true strength.","“Chu Yunfan! You actually dared to kill Dagula?!”","At this moment, among the dozens of half-step Cores, five or six of them who were dressed similarly to the Jinzhanghan warrior stepped forward. Their ferocious auras blotted out the sky and covered the entire city.","It was as if they were on an ancient battlefield.","Although these people did not have a good relationship with each other, when they saw that Chu Yunfan dared to kill the Jinzhanghan warrior, they immediately roared in fury.","“That was boring. He was too weak. Are all the warriors of Jinzhanghan so weak? Why don’t you all attack together?” Chu Yunfan sneered."]},{"number":1282,"title":"Chapter 1282 Slaughtering Like One Was on a Leisurely Stroll!","paragraphs":["1282 Slaughtering Like One Was on a Leisurely Stroll!","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, the entire city fell silent. Everyone was dumbfounded as they looked at Chu Yunfan in the sky.","Many people only felt extremely domineering in their hearts as he had said what they wanted to say but did not dare to.","Although they didn’t know what Jinzhanghan was, they knew that these people were definitely from foreign tribes. When Ancestor Wusheng announced that he would slaughter the entire city, they were furious.","However, facing the god-like Ancestor Wusheng and the others, they were powerless to resist and could only be slaughtered. And now, Chu Yunfan didn’t waste any time and simply killed them.","It was too satisfying!","The Jinzhanghan warriors were completely enraged. Chu Yunfan was simply looking down on them. These people were not good-tempered people, and their killing intent was completely released.","Many people simply did not have the ability to resist. They only felt that a bloody battlefield had appeared in front of them. Many people were completely immersed in it and were unable to resist.","Ancestor Wusheng’s face turned even uglier. He had been speaking passionately for a long time, but in the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had killed two experts, especially Dagula, who was a Jinzhanghan warrior.","Yuwen Chang’s death was not a big deal, but a powerful tribe in Jinzhanghan was behind Dagula.","Thinking of this, Ancestor Wusheng’s expression became even uglier.","“It’s useless to have more people. They’re just uncivilized barbarians.” Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at the Jinzhanghan warriors.","“You’re courting death!”","The Jinzhanghan warriors instantly joined forces. They were experts who had been fighting in various places for many years. Their martial arts were full of the style of battle formations.","When they joined hands, they formed a joint attack reminiscent of the army. The strength they formed far exceeded that of ordinary half-step Cores. No one could compare to them.","“Be careful!”","Chu Yaowei instantly felt a terrifying power that was hard to resist rise up.","In the sky, a few Jinzhanghan warriors had joined forces to turn the entire sky into a battlefield. On the battlefield, a huge barbarian martial arts illusion was formed, and it seemed to be suppressing the entire barrier of Conglong.","Boom!","The giant barbarian swung his mace at Chu Yunfan.","The entire sky trembled under this mace.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, did not move in the slightest. It was as if he had been scared silly by this mace.","The mace smashed into Chu Yunfan’s body, and only a loud sound of metal clashing erupted. The loud sound turned into a huge sound wave that spread out.","Everyone was shocked to see that Chu Yunfan did not move at all, allowing the mace to land on his body. The moment it touched Chu Yunfan, it shattered inch by inch.","“It’s just a petty trick!”","Chu Yunfan pointed his finger in the air, and in an instant, a sharp sword light burst out from his fingertip. In an instant, the sword light pierced through the barbarian.","Boom!","The barbarian martial arts illusion exploded in mid-air.","Spurt!","Spurt!","Spurt!","The Jinzhanghan warriors retreated and spat out mouthfuls of blood. Their martial arts illusion had been broken by Chu Yunfan in one move.","Their eyes were filled with disbelief as if they had never expected Chu Yunfan to be able to do this.","This was terrifying!","There was only one thought flashing through their minds, and that was Chu Yunfan was terrifying!","They felt like he was invincible. This feeling would only appear on a Core. How could it appear on Chu Yunfan?","The few of them looked at each other. Suddenly, one of them shouted, “Fight him to the death! Use the blood curse and kill him!”","These people immediately understood what the other party was thinking. That was the most ferocious curse of their homeland. When it was used, it would definitely destroy both humans and gods. It was extremely terrifying.","However, once they used it, they had to pay a huge price. If they were not forced to this extent, they would not have wanted to use it.","Their bodies emitted a blood-red light. Their already extremely terrifying battle energy rose several levels in an instant. Almost every one of them was not inferior to the Emissaries. In fact, they were even stronger than the Emissaries.","A few of them joined forces, and all kinds of attacks directly turned into a blood-red energy tide that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","“You overestimate yourself,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. Then, he stretched out his hand and grabbed the energy tide, crushing it into pieces.","“Impossible!”","These people couldn’t believe that their attacks were so weak against Chu Yunfan.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had already appeared in front of one of them. Using his finger as a sword, he cut off a person’s head and sent it flying.","Everything was so simple. Chu Yunfan completed this step in a leisurely manner.","After killing one, he didn’t stop and went straight to the others. His movements were as if he was an immortal walking in the sky. That was the Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations.","Back then, Chu Yunfan was only able to display some of the superficial changes of the Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations. This was because this technique had extremely high requirements for the user.","However, it was different now. Chu Yunfan could casually use it to its full extent. It was completely different from when he was a beginner.","In a leisurely stroll, he had already arrived in front of another person.","Slash!","Another sword light flashed. Almost instantly, another half-step Core of Jinzhanghan was killed.","“D*mn it! Stop!”","At this moment, Ancestor Wusheng could no longer sit still. If he continued to let Chu Yunfan kill, there would be terrible consequences.","How was he going to establish himself in Jinzhanghan in the future?","Ancestor Wusheng instantly arrived in front of Chu Yunfan, but his attack went through Chu Yunfan’s body, leaving behind only an afterimage.","Chu Yunfan’s real body had already arrived in front of another Jinzhanghan warrior and easily cut off their head.","In just two short breaths, Chu Yunfan had killed two warriors in a row. The other Jinzhanghan warriors immediately retreated. Even if they were stupid, they would be able to see the situation clearly.","However, they underestimated Chu Yunfan.","“You want to leave? It’s too late!”"]},{"number":1283,"title":"Chapter 1283 The Whole City Is Shocked","paragraphs":["1283 The Whole City Is Shocked","Chu Yunfan spoke slowly, but his actions were fast.","In the eyes of ordinary people, his movements were not fast at all, and even a little lazy. However, it was this kind of movement that killed those half-step Cores of Jinzhanghan. In an instant, several of them were killed.","The remaining Jinzhanghan warriors wanted to turn around and flee, but they found Chu Yunfan was too fast.","In an instant, he seemed to have crossed the sky and arrived in front of him.","Slash!","The body of one Jinzhanghan warrior was cut in half. Then, Chu Yunfan charged at the next Jinzhanghan warrior.","After all this was over, Ancestor Wusheng finally arrived, but he could not catch up with Chu Yunfan’s speed at all. He could only watch Chu Yunfan kill the Jinzhanghan warriors one after another.","“D*mn it! Stop!”","Ancestor Wusheng roared again and again, but it was useless. He could not stop Chu Yunfan.","He could only watch Chu Yunfan kill.","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan had killed all the half-step Cores of Jinzhanghan.","The Jinzhanghan warriors widened their eyes before they died. They had thought that they could plunder wantonly and satisfy their desire to kill in the splendid lands of Great Wei. Who knew that they would die here?","Moreover, they were so vulnerable that they were instantly killed by Chu Yunfan in the sky.","The entire city was dead silent, especially the experts from the various forces. They looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. It was as if they had seen a monster!","Chu Yunfan’s strength was terrifying. It had already surpassed the level of suppression. He killed a half-step Core with simple but terrifying methods.","This was even more shocking than Chu Yunfan killing them after using all his methods and strength.","Normally, they would only feel fear and dread, but at this time, Chu Yunfan had become their only hope.","When Ancestor Wusheng had already announced that he would slaughter everyone in Conglong, the people came to see Chu Yunfan as their savior.","In the distant Marquis Anguo residence, Marquis Anguo, An Zhenguo, An Xiuxiu, and a few others looked up at Chu Yunfan, who had killed many powerful enemies in the sky.","An Zhenguo could not help but gulp and say, “Is this Chu Yunfan’s true strength?”","He had fought Chu Yunfan not too long ago, and he didn’t believe that Chu Yunfan had improved by leaps and bounds in such a short period of time. The only possibility was that Chu Yunfan already had such strength but had been hiding it.","Thinking about how he had wanted to challenge Chu Yunfan and compete with him, it was really ridiculous. Any one of those powerful Jinzhanghan warriors could have slaughtered the entire Marquis Anguo residence. However, they were so vulnerable when facing Chu Yunfan.","“This kid is simply hiding his strength. Who knew that he was so terrifying!","Marquis Anguo was in complete disbelief. At this moment, he felt some lingering fear. Fortunately, he had not offended Chu Yunfan previously and had even curried favor with him.","Now that he thought about it, he was really lucky.","“Especially you, Xiuxiue. It was a great opportunity for you to learn from him.”","He looked at his daughter, An Xiuxiu, with a hint of gratification and envy. After all, not everyone could receive guidance from a master of that level.","He didn’t dare to use Chu Yunfan’s age as a standard for judging a master of Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level. That level was not something ordinary people could reach.","“A real man should be like this,” An Xiuxiu finally said after a long time.","At this moment, she finally understood why Chu Yunfan was so disdainful of the Marquis Zhongxin’s heir position. Compared to Chu Yunfan’s god-like power, the position was nothing.","It was laughable that among the descendants of Great Wei, inheriting this title was the greatest glory. Little did they know that only they could bring true glory to themselves.","No marquis, duke, or even emperor would dare to put on airs in front of Chu Yunfan. They might even treat him as a distinguished guest.","Even at Chu Yunfan’s age, his future was limitless. This was true power. The so-called power of power was nothing in front of true power.","“Chu Yunfan hid such strength...”","At this moment, Fu Wentai was muttering to himself. Beside him, Yu Xuanfei and the others were shocked but also excited.","The stronger Chu Yunfan was, the greater their chances of being saved.","“No wonder he looked like he didn’t care about anything before. Even Ancestor Wusheng can’t make his expression change,” Yu Xuanfei said enviously.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength and confidence, even if he couldn’t defeat Ancestor Wusheng, he could still kill his way out. This was completely different from their strength.","However, they couldn’t understand how Chu Yunfan, who hadn’t entered the Core Stage, could have such amazing strength. They were confident about this assessment. No matter what, Chu Yunfan did not release the divine power fluctuations unique to the Core Stage.","But could he be so terrifying even without stepping into the Core Stage?","Yu Xuanfei felt as if Chu Yunfan had cleared the fog in front of his eyes and opened the door to a whole new world. It turned out that even if he did not enter the Core Stage, he could still be so powerful.","However, they immediately smiled bitterly. Even if they knew, so what? Without Chu Yunfan’s fortuitous encounters, it would be impossible to achieve this. Otherwise, wouldn’t everyone be able to do it?","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, who had killed all the half-step Cores of Jinzhanghan, stopped in his tracks. He looked at Ancestor Wusheng and said, “Is this the Jinzhanghan Kingdom you want to join? It’s nothing.”","“D*mn it, d*mn it, d*mn it!”","Ancestor Wusheng roared again and again. He felt his veins pop and the fire in his heart burned fiercely. He could only watch helplessly as Chu Yunfan killed his people under his eyes. It was as if he was grabbing his collar and slapping his face.","“How can a brat like you understand the power of Jinzhanghan?! I want you to die!”"]},{"number":1284,"title":"Chapter 1284 Killing More Than Half, Heavily Injuring Ancestor Wusheng","paragraphs":["1284 Killing More Than Half, Heavily Injuring Ancestor Wusheng","The Jinzhanghan warriors were completely frightened by Chu Yunfan’s vicious killing. Usually, they were the only ones who treated others like cabbages and killed them as they pleased.","But now, they had met Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s viciousness was far beyond their imagination. It even made them tremble in fear.","It was completely different from the smile that came from the bottom of their hearts when they killed people. As Chu Yunfan killed people, his face was indifferent and cold, but the more he did so, the more terrifying he was.","Then, they saw Chu Yunfan’s figure split into several figures in the air.","It was the Nine Cyclone Phantoms!","In an instant, he turned into a few figures and pounced toward the half-step Cores of Jinzhanghan.","Slash!","Slash!","Slash!","Chu Yunfan punched, kicked, or even pierced through these half-step Cores of Jinzhanghan with a single finger.","These terrifying killing gods who had dominated Jinzhangshan and made countless people tremble in fear could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","When Chu Yunfan’s massacre ended, the entire city was dead silent. All the experts who could see this scene were completely dumbfounded. Chu Yunfan’s massacre was too terrifying.","Compared to the time when the Emissaries invaded, it was a world of difference.","It was completely different!","Chu Yunfan slaughtered these half-step Cores with ease.","Zhang Ling and the others almost shouted when they saw this scene. In just a moment, more than half of the half-step Cores had been slaughtered by Chu Yunfan. Although the remaining half still outnumbered them, they did not have an overwhelming advantage like before.","And this happened in just a moment.","Many people suddenly had an unbelievable thought. No matter what, they would never believe that Chu Yunfan was just a mere half-step Core.","After all, they were also half-step Cores. They knew what the limit of the half-step Core Stage was.","The terrifying strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed just now had completely surpassed the half-step Core Stage and had truly stepped into the Core Stage.","Thinking of this, they looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief.","When Chu Yaowei saw this scene, his face instantly turned red. He was so excited that he couldn’t say anything. It was so satisfying. So satisfying!","Especially when he saw Chu Yunfan killing these terrifying existences as if he was cutting melons and vegetables, he wanted to shout out loud.","“D*mn you!” Ancestor Wusheng roared, and his eyes flickered with horror. “I was blind. I didn’t expect you to have such strength.”","Ancestor Wusheng looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief as if he could not believe that Chu Yunfan actually had such strength. Like everyone else, he had never thought that Chu Yunfan could be so strong. Only now did he finally realize that Chu Yunfan’s strength was far beyond everyone’s imagination.","“However, with your strength that I don’t know how you got, do you think you can compare to a real Core?!” Ancestor Wusheng roared.","He could see that Chu Yunfan didn’t have any fluctuations that belonged to a real Core. He must be someone whose combat strength had somehow broken through to the Core Stage. Such a person was indeed terrifying to a half-step Core.","However, it was still not enough against him!","“Then let’s give it a try.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Boom!","Ancestor Wusheng erupted. The mana in his body boiled and transformed into a monstrous aura flame. It was as if golden flames were burning, revealing unparalleled power and aura.","He was a true Core. An existence like that had already transcended the restraints of ordinary Divines. He truly controlled the universe and looked down on the common people. If he really moved, the sky would collapse and the earth would shatter.","“In that case, I’ll kill you first before killing Chu Yaowei!”","Ancestor Wusheng’s hand grabbed at the void, and a bronze sword suddenly appeared. Terrifying sword lights spread out in all directions.","Immediately after, the mana in his body boiled and transformed into an incomparably huge sword. Every pattern on this incomparably huge sword was condensed from countless sword lights.","Tens of thousands of terrifying sword lights condensed into one terrifying sword light that slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan immediately felt that he was locked onto by Ancestor Wusheng’s will. There was no way to escape or dodge.","However, he did not think of escaping. From afar, he saw the huge sword slashing down from the sky. There was a violent cutting sound everywhere as if the world was about to be destroyed.","Compared to Wan Huang of the Inherited Sword Manor, Ancestor Wusheng was much more terrifying. He was more than ten times stronger than Wan Huang.","They were both sword experts, but Ancestor Wusheng, who had taken that step, was much stronger than Wan Huang, who had not.","Chu Yunfan made his move at that moment. In an instant, his five fingers clenched into a fist and he withdrew it to his abdomen. He threw a punch.","Behind him, an incomparably huge asura instantly appeared. This golden asura had turned the entire world into its battlefield.","“What kind of technique is this?”","In an instant, before they even fought, Ancestor Wusheng could already feel the terror of Chu Yunfan’s punch. This Asura Punch was much stronger than the Inanimate Sword he cultivated.","The subtlety of it pointed directly to the Great Dao, but it was a domain that he could not touch at all.","The moment Chu Yunfan’s fist was thrown out, the sword light he slashed down was shattered by this punch. Immediately after, Chu Yunfan’s momentum did not decrease, and blasted toward him.","Ancestor Wusheng was shocked. He hastily retreated, and countless sword lights scattered through the air.","“Impossible! How are you so strong?!”","Ancestor Wusheng realized that there was a problem with his previous estimation. Chu Yunfan did not rely on some secret technique to forcefully increase his strength.","He clearly had such strength. In fact, he was even more terrifying than him.","“Frog at the bottom of a well.”","Chu Yunfan only sneered. The thunder wings on his back instantly spread out, and he arrived in front of Ancestor Wusheng like a bolt of lightning.","A punch was thrown out, and it immediately turned into a white-red streak that soared into the sky. It seemed to have pierced through the vast sky and instantly bombarded Ancestor Wusheng’s body.","Bam!","Ancestor Wusheng let out a muffled grunt and flew out instantly."]},{"number":1285,"title":"Chapter 1285 Lifeless Sword Physique? That’s Nothing!","paragraphs":["1285 Lifeless Sword Physique? That’s Nothing!","Chu Yunfan’s punch pierced through the sky and turned into a rainbow, directly slamming into Ancestor Wusheng’s body.","Ancestor Wusheng could not resist. After a muffled grunt, he spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire person instantly flew out and flew halfway across the city.","At this moment, everyone finally breathed a sigh of relief. The dazzling and terrifying attacks from both sides were simply like Mount Tai pressing down on them. Someone had grabbed their necks, making them unable to breathe.","“This is too scary!”","The first to speak was a half-step Core who had come with Ancestor Wusheng. A hint of horror flashed through his eyes. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed that a seasoned expert like Ancestor Wusheng would be beaten to such a state by a young boy like Chu Yunfan.","Only one word appeared in their minds—unrivalled!","Chu Yunfan was bathed in the golden fist force, like a war god cast from gold. Just him alone was enough to suppress everyone.","As for Zhang Ling and the others, they were trembling with excitement. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed it.","Chu Yunfan was so strong!","At this moment, they finally understood why Chu Yunfan would design such a scheme. Originally, they thought that he had placed his hopes on the imperial guardian because they thought so too. Therefore, when the imperial guardian did not appear, they panicked.","However, Chu Yunfan obviously didn’t count on the imperial family’s support. For him, the only person he could truly trust was himself.","Ancestor Wusheng spat out a mouthful of blood and immediately felt much better. The feeling of being attacked by a terrifying strange force in his chest had been greatly relieved.","Chu Yunfan’s punch was too terrifying. It almost pierced through his chest!","“So, you have such strength. No wonder you’re so arrogant!” Ancestor Wusheng shouted.","He was not a kind person. At this moment, his eyes suddenly opened wide. His aura soared. In an instant, the ancient greenish-bronze sword in his hand actually fused with him.","All of a sudden, the incomparably dense sword light on his body instantly soared into the sky. In an instant, his aura was even stronger than before.","“Inanimate Sword Physique!” Ancestor Wusheng shouted.","He could see that Chu Yunfan was not easy to deal with, especially his body, which was terrifyingly strong. That was why he had used his ultimate technique.","“Your body is strong? I’ll cut it into pieces!” Ancestor Wusheng said with a sinister smile.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a golden light. He instantly saw through all of Ancestor Wusheng’s methods.","“I see.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","He could already tell that Ancestor Wusheng had fused himself with the powerful sword. At the same time, his body would enter a magical state, forcefully increasing the toughness of his body by several levels.","It was indeed a wonderful idea.","However, Chu Yunfan was not concerned. There were many similar techniques recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. Compared to the techniques recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, Ancestor Wusheng’s technique was simply child’s play. It was even incomplete.","There was a time limit.","The true fusion cultivation method could be cultivated all year round, and at that time, the physical body would become stronger and stronger, and eventually become invincible.","Chu Yunfan shook his head after seeing through it. If Ancestor Wusheng thought that he could be compared to him with this Inanimate Sword Physique, then he was gravely mistaken.","“You should be proud to die under my Inanimate Sword Physique,” Ancestor Wusheng said coldly. After fusing with the Inanimate Sword Physique, his confidence had increased too much.","The mana around Ancestor Wusheng surged, forming an absolute sword dao domain around him.","“It has appeared! The Inanimate Sword Physique. In the outer realms, who knows how many people have suffered from this Inanimate Sword Physique!”","The experts who had come with Ancestor Wusheng all cried out in surprise because they all remembered the Inanimate Sword Physique. Yes, yes. Even they had suffered a loss from the Inanimate Sword Physique back then. It could even be said that they had suffered a huge loss.","If not for that, they would not have been subdued by Ancestor Wusheng and come to attack Conglong. One had to know that slaughtering Conglong from head to toe, leaving no one alive, would completely infuriate Great Wei.","Even if Ancestor Wusheng was not afraid, they did not have the terrifying cultivation of Ancestor Wusheng.","“No one in the Inanimate Sword Sect has succeeded in cultivating the legendary Inanimate Sword Physique for many years,” Chu Yaowei said, his eyes wide in disbelief.","Other than Ancestor Wusheng, he was the one who knew the most about the Inanimate Sword Sect.","When Great Wei’s Imperial Court had exterminated the Inanimate Sword Sect, many of the ancient books and records of the Inanimate Sword Sect had ended up in the hands of Great Wei’s Imperial Court and thus were familiar with many of the mysteries of the Inanimate Sword Sect.","He naturally knew that the Inanimate Sword Sect’s strongest technique was the Inanimate Sword Physique. However, no one had been able to master it since the first ancestor.","Although the Inanimate Sword Physique was known as the sect’s ultimate technique, it was actually in a state of being shelved because no one could learn it.","Everyone was shocked by Ancestor Wusheng’s appearance. The sword light on Ancestor Wusheng’s body became stronger and stronger, and it was extremely terrifying. His entire body turned into a terrifying sword dao domain.","Boom!","In an instant, Ancestor Wusheng had already moved. He only threw a punch. Although it was a punch technique, when he executed it, it turned into a sword light because he had already fused with his magic treasure sword. He had become one with the sword and transformed into a sword.","Every punch and kick was a sword light and nothing else!","His fist flew straight toward Chu Yunfan’s chest, wanting to blow him up in mid-air. Chu Yunfan had completely angered him.","“Inanimate Sword Physique?” Chu Yunfan merely glanced at the sudden punch. He just casually waved his hand and headed toward the punch.","“You think you can block my attack so casually? You’re too naive!”","Ancestor Wusheng roared and stepped on the ground. In an instant, he had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","“You’re the naive one,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. Then, he casually blocked Ancestor Wusheng’s punch. “The Inanimate Sword Physique is indeed a good cultivation technique, but it’s a pity that you haven’t cultivated it to the extreme.”"]},{"number":1286,"title":"Chapter 1286 Slapping Ancestor Wusheng to Death","paragraphs":["1286 Slapping Ancestor Wusheng to Death","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it and casually blocked Ancestor Wusheng’s sure-win punch.","“Impossible!” Ancestor Wusheng was shocked. “Even the most powerful magic weapon would be shattered by my punch. How could you possibly block it?!”","A look of disbelief flashed across his eyes. It should be known that in the outer realms, even many powerful half-step Cores had suffered losses at his hands.","Those experts who thought that their magic weapons were powerful were completely at a disadvantage when faced with his Inanimate Sword Physique. They were directly blown up in mid-air.","However, this move that he had always used was at a great disadvantage when he faced Chu Yunfan.","!!","“How can your body be so strong?!”","Ancestor Wusheng looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. Just the strength of Chu Yunfan’s body was not inferior to spirit weapons.","After he had displayed the ultimate technique of the Inanimate Sword Physique, he had only barely reached the level of top-notch magic weapons.","Just this alone was already shocking. It had allowed him to achieve everything he did in the past few years.","He had never met an opponent before. Even the strongest physique cultivator was only comparable to him in terms of physical strength.","However, Chu Yunfan’s appearance had broken his previous understanding. Chu Yunfan was simply a monster. He could actually cultivate his body to the level of a spirit weapon. No, he had even surpassed the level of an ordinary spirit weapon!","Ancestor Wusheng really wanted to ask, “Are you a monster?!”","Was this really a fight? This was crazy!","Chu Yunfan could easily take his full-powered attack. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan only needed to hit him once and he would lose half of his life. There was no way to fight back. The two sides were not on the same level at all.","“Petty tricks.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","After casually blocking Ancestor Wusheng’s attack, he took a step forward and his true strength instantly erupted. A terrifying aura instantly enveloped the entire city.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan’s strength had suddenly increased by another level, Ancestor Wusheng suddenly felt as if his entire body was about to be flattened by a divine mountain. He had never thought that someone could give him such terrifying pressure through just their aura.","“Your battle prowess is not at the fledgling Void Core Stage...” Ancestor Wusheng suddenly reacted. His back instantly turned cold as if he had seen a ghost.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was already shocking enough to be at the fledgling Void Core Stage, and this was the result of Chu Yunfan hiding his strength.","“That’s right, but it’s a little too late for you to realize now.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He had hidden his strength earlier, and Ancestor Wusheng thought that he could fight with him, but that was just an illusion.","Chu Yunfan’s aura was completely released. Ancestor Wusheng was almost forced to kneel on the spot. He felt like he was suffocating, and he couldn’t even breathe. Chu Yunfan had already locked all the spirit energy in the sky with his aura alone.","Only now did he truly realize that he had probably really kicked a terrifying hornet’s nest. A terrifying monster that had already reached the intermediate Void Core Stage was guarding Conglong!","However, he thought that Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary half-step Core and did not take Chu Yunfan seriously at all.","“How could it be so terrifying? I’ll fight to the bitter end!”","Forced into a desperate situation, Ancestor Wusheng went all out. With a furious roar, he threw a punch at Chu Yunfan, who was charging at him. The fist force turned into a terrifying sword light, wanting to pierce through Chu Yunfan’s body","“You’re so close. Even if you have the strength of a spirit weapon, you’ll still die.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the desperate Ancestor Wusheng and sneered. He descended from the sky and grabbed out with a big hand. In an instant, the sword light that Ancestor Wusheng sent out was crushed into pieces and exploded in mid-air. It could not cause any damage to Chu Yunfan.","Then, Chu Yunfan’s slap didn’t lose its momentum and flew toward Ancestor Wusheng.","Bam!","Ancestor Wusheng let out a miserable cry. His entire body flew out as if he had been hit by a mountain. He flew across more than half of the city and crashed into the barrier that he and his people had set up.","Originally, this barrier was to prevent people from escaping from Conglong, but now it had become his own death trap.","When everyone saw this scene, they felt the air in their lungs freeze because they saw that Ancestor Wusheng’s entire body was dripping with blood. The originally indestructible Inanimate Sword Physique had been slapped by Chu Yunfan until cracks appeared all over its body. It cracked inch by inch and blood spurted out.","And this was just a casual slap from Chu Yunfan.","“Is this Chu Yunfan’s true strength? What we knew before was just the tip of the iceberg!”","“Terrifying. He must be added to the list of the top experts in the world!”","“Too strong. Ancestor Wusheng can’t even fight back!”","Many experts looked at this scene as if they had seen a ghost.","Those half-step Cores who had come with Ancestor Wusheng were completely shocked as if they had seen a ghost. They were scared to death by Chu Yunfan.","The difference was too great!","They thought of the words of Ancestor Wusheng. Ancestor Wusheng had just stepped into the Core Stage not long ago, but Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying than him. Clearly, Chu Yunfan was just a fledgling Void Core, but an intermediate Void Core who had surpassed the fledgling Void Core Stage.","Wasn’t this like seeing a ghost in broad daylight?","Even if Chu Yunfan had started cultivating in his mother’s womb, it was impossible for him to be so terrifying.","Ancestor Wusheng was blown up by Chu Yunfan. Countless cells in his body exploded, and he felt like he was in a mess. He immediately made a decision to escape.","Ancestor Wusheng had really kicked a hornet’s nest this time. How could he dare to stay?","“You want to leave? It’s not that easy, so why don’t you just stay?”","Chu Yunfan reached out with his big hand. In an instant, it was about to turn into a cloud that covered the sky. Countless spirit energy condensed together.","This kind of method that even Innates could use looked ordinary, but in Chu Yunfan’s hands, it displayed a terrifying power comparable to an ultimate skill.","Ancestor Wusheng turned into a sword light and wanted to escape. How could he dare to stay? Who knew that Chu Yunfan’s big hand would slap down from the sky?","Bam!","Ancestor Wusheng was hit in mid-air again, but this time, he wasn’t so lucky. This time, Chu Yunfan used all his strength.","With just one slap, Ancestor Wusheng was smashed into pieces, turning into a cloud of blood rain and exploding."]},{"number":1287,"title":"Chapter 1287 The End, Another Development","paragraphs":["1287 The End, Another Development","In just a few short moves, Chu Yunfan turned Ancestor Wusheng into a rain of blood as he exploded in mid-air.","He died instantly.","Before Ancestor Wusheng’s corpse could spread out, it was grabbed by a giant hand. Then, it entered the Mountain River Diagram and watered the Brahma Tree.","This was the second Core to be watered on the Brahma Tree and used as fertilizer.","On the Brahma Tree, a fist-sized fruit was gradually taking shape. The body of a Core contained extremely terrifying energy. If such a body could be obtained in the Federation, it would probably startle countless great scientists in the Federation. All kinds of sophisticated instruments would be piled up on the Internet to analyze the mysteries of the Core Stage.","!!","Even if they could only analyze a portion of it, it would have an immeasurable effect on the development of the Federation’s martial arts. This was something that the various factions in the Spirit Realm could not compare to.","They were two completely different systems.","“Sh*t! Run!”","At this moment, the experts who had followed Ancestor Wusheng wanted to escape, but it was clearly too late.","This was because they did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so fast. No matter what, Ancestor Wusheng was a terrifying existence that had stepped into the Core Stage. However, when facing Chu Yunfan, he was so vulnerable.","In fact, they thought that even if Ancestor Wusheng could not hold on any longer, they could still escape in all directions. After all, it did not matter if Ancestor Wusheng was at the bottom.","Who would have thought that Ancestor Wusheng would be killed in just two or three moves?","He was no match for Chu Yunfan!","At this moment, they felt a chill run down their spines.","“It’s already too late to think of running now.”","Chu Yunfan sneered and casually slapped out with his palm, blowing up a half-step Core in mid-air. He grabbed all the flesh and blood and pushed it into the Mountain River Diagram, pouring all of it onto the Brahma Tree.","Seeing this, those half-step Cores didn’t dare to stay any longer. They quickly fled in all directions. However, how could their speed match Chu Yunfan’s killing speed?","Chu Yunfan was really fast when he killed. He could catch up with them with a casual punch or slap and kill them. These terrifying existences who usually shook the region in the outer realm could not resist at all.","In just a moment, these top-notch experts from the outer realms had been slaughtered by Chu Yunfan single-handedly.","In the Spirit Realm, one’s martial arts were the most important. A truly powerful expert could suppress all directions. Numbers were useless.","At this moment, the people in Conglong heaved a sigh of relief. Ancestor Wusheng had threatened to kill them all, and Chu Yunfan had saved them by killing them all.","However, to those powerhouses above the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan’s existence was like a huge mountain pressing down on their chests. Although Chu Yunfan wasn’t as cruel as Ancestor Wusheng, who could easily massacre a city, he gave them a more dangerous feeling.","“He’s so powerful!”","At this moment, Marquis Anguo’s family of three was all stunned. They looked at Chu Yunfan in the sky with complete shock. If they had not seen it with their own eyes, they would not have believed that Chu Yunfan could be so powerful.","“How did he train? No matter how I look at it, it doesn’t seem real!”","An Zhenguo still found it unbelievable. Just accepting Chu Yunfan’s combat strength that had already entered the half-step Core Stage had already consumed all his strength.","Not to mention now, Chu Yunfan had actually entered the Core Stage. Even Ancestor Wusheng, who had also entered the Core Stage, was not Chu Yunfan’s match.","“A heaven-sent genius. He really is a heaven-sent genius. I wonder what sect inheritance he has behind him. This is not good news...” An Zhenguo said with a worried expression.","He had seen too much of the world in his life. He knew that sometimes, mediocrity was not a bad thing. On the contrary, the birth of such a monster that broke the balance and surpassed the understanding of ordinary people would definitely be accompanied by a storm of blood.","For the current Great Wei, it was unknown whether this was a good thing or a bad thing.","“At that time, we won’t be the ones having a headache. I’m afraid Chu Yunfan will alarm the entire Imperial Court,” An Xiuxiu said with worry.","“No matter what, there’s no harm in befriending such a genius!” An Zhenguo said after a moment of thought. “The Chu clan is going to make a name for themselves this time. A true dragon has appeared from the depths of the water!”","When An Zhenguo said this, a hint of envy flashed across his eyes. Originally, his status was similar to that of Chu Yaowei, Marquis Zhongxin. However, the Chu clan had a figure like Chu Yunfan, an existence that even Great Wei would want to rope in.","As a figure in Great Wei, he knew the strategy of Great Wei all too well. As long as Chu Yunfan showed that he was willing to join Great Wei, he would at least be a duke. After that, as long as he made some contributions, he could easily become a county king or even a crown prince.","Since ancient times, this kind of situation was too common. Chu Yunfan was different from other Cores. He was so young.","With Chu Yunfan’s combat strength at the Core Stage, his age was really terrifying.","At this moment, in the garden of the residence, Chu Yaowei’s entire body was trembling. It was not because he was afraid, but because he was excited beyond compare.","Tears finally flowed uncontrollably from his tiger eyes. For so many years, he had been plotting to get rid of Ancestor Wusheng, and now, he had finally fulfilled this wish.","This was because Ancestor Wusheng and the others had paid too much. Now, although the process was a little complicated, the final result was still good.","The three generations had finally completed their revenge!","Soon, he wiped away his tears and looked up into the sky. He had never expected that Ancestor Wusheng would die at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","In his original plan, there was no place for Chu Yunfan. The enemy of the Chu clan was finally killed by someone of the Chu clan. Was this considered heaven’s will?","Suddenly, just as everyone was sighing or shocked, another violent fluctuation occurred in the sky, and the space boiled violently.","Everyone knew that this was bad.","“Someone is teleporting over!”","Everyone’s expression changed instantly. Previously, Ancestor Wusheng had used the teleportation array to teleport over. Now, someone was actually going to use the same trick again."]},{"number":1288,"title":"Chapter 1288 Defeating the Right King","paragraphs":["1288 Defeating the Right King","Originally, an important city like Conglong would have all kinds of arrays and barriers set up to directly lock down the nearby space. Even a radius of hundreds of miles was locked down, not allowing anyone to directly teleport over.","It was to prevent anyone from taking advantage of the situation.","However, Ancestor Wusheng had been at odds with Marquis Zhongxin’s residence for many years and had long left behind all kinds of backup plans in Conglong. That was why he could catch everyone off guard.","And now, before this loophole could be closed, someone had already taken advantage of this loophole to teleport over.","A figure gradually took shape in the sky. As the space fluctuated, more and more parts appeared in the sky.","!!","“Who dares to kill those of Jinzhanghan?!”","Accompanied by a furious roar, many people felt their expressions change. Everyone realized that the newcomer had ill intentions.","This man was obviously a Jinzhanghan warrior!","Immediately after, a boundless aura swept out and enveloped the entire city in an instant. Compared to Ancestor Wusheng, he was many times stronger.","In fact, the aura of Ancestor Wusheng, who had made them feel as if he was about to be exterminated, was nothing compared to this aura.","“A top-notch expert has arrived!”","The experts in the Conglong could tell the difference in energy almost immediately. This expert from Jinzhanghan was even more terrifying, and his energy was even more dangerous. He was much stronger than Ancestor Wusheng.","Everyone turned to look at Chu Yunfan. At this moment, their only hope was Chu Yunfan. However, Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely solemn at this moment!","The intermediate Void Core Stage?","No, it was at least a terrifying existence that surpassed the late Void Core Stage and might even be at the peak Void Core Stage!","If Chu Yunfan could successfully step into the Core Stage, he could still compete with him. But now, he was simply no match for such a terrifying expert.","Chu Yunfan immediately realized that a terrifying existence had appeared. This kind of person, whether in Great Wei or in the outer realms, was probably the best.","As this figure gradually appeared, the city lord suddenly exclaimed, “It’s the right king of the Jinzhanghan Kingdom!”","This exclamation shocked all the experts in Conglong. Although many of them had never been to Jinzhanghan, they were familiar with the various systems of Jinzhanghan.","In the entire Jinzhanghan, the great khan of Jinzhanghan had the highest status. Below the great khan was the left king. Generally speaking, the left king was the crown prince of Jinzhanghan and the future great khan. The right king was the successor of the left king and was also a strong contender for the throne.","In the entire Jinzhanghan, the right king was the third most important person. Different from Great Wei, almost all the higher-ups in Jinzhanghan were top martial arts masters. Otherwise, the extremely cruel power struggle in Jinzhanghan would be much bloodier than that in Great Wei.","Therefore, the right king of Jinzhanghan could be considered one of the top Jinzhanghan warriors. Ancestor Wusheng looked very strong, but in fact, compared to a figure like the right king, he was simply child’s play.","Let alone the right king appearing directly, even if there were only a few traces of him appearing at the border of Great Wei, it would make all the experts on the border feel as if they were facing a great enemy.","Now, he had actually broken into Conglong.","Everyone who knew the identity of the right king felt incomparably desperate.","Previously, Chu Yunfan could deal with Ancestor Wusheng. However, now that the right king of Jinzhanghan had come out personally, even Chu Yunfan was no match for him.","“We can’t let him teleport here completely!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes shone with a golden light.","The moment the right king was about to be completely teleported over, he moved.","“Asura Punch!”","Behind Chu Yunfan, a golden asura condensed and released all its strength.","Even when he was dealing with Ancestor Wusheng, he had not used his full strength like this. This was because even if he did not use his full strength, Ancestor Wusheng was not his match.","But against this opponent, Chu Yunfan had no confidence at all. If he met the right king in the outer realms, Chu Yunfan could only turn around and escape.","The right king was too terrifying!","Boom!","This punch landed on the right king.","The right king, who had yet to fully reveal himself, revealed an expression of shock and anger. If they were in a face-to-face situation, an attack of this level would not have moved him.","But now, when he was teleporting, this could become a fatal attack!","In the face of this situation, the right king immediately made a decision to retreat. A teleportation portal formed behind him, and he immediately retreated. If he took this attack head-on, he would definitely be severely injured.","Chu Yunfan had been waiting for this opportunity.","Another fist shadow flashed across the sky. Chu Yunfan turned into a golden roc and instantly tore through the sky.","Hurry up!","Hurry up!","Hurry up!","Chu Yunfan’s speed was extremely fast. In an instant, he arrived at the teleportation portal. After his punch pierced through the originally stable teleportation portal, the entire portal began to collapse.","The right king was instantly swept up by the collapsing teleportation portal. Even with his cultivation, he was almost torn into two by the power of space.","This was because the right king had retreated early. If he hadn’t reacted in time and directly received Chu Yunfan’s attack, he would have died in the collapsed portal.","In a place like a teleportation portal, unless one’s cultivation had reached the level of an emperor and could instantly reconstruct a portal, it was simply a dead end.","“I won’t let you get away with this!” the right king roared angrily. His angry roar made everyone shiver even though they were separated by the portal.","But soon, the sound disappeared without a trace, accompanied by the collapse of the portal. Seeing this, everyone finally heaved a sigh of relief. The feeling just now had simply made them despair.","The right king alone could slaughter the entire Conglong, leaving no one alive.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan made a decisive move at the last moment and forced the right king to retreat, shattering the teleportation portal.","Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable."]},{"number":1289,"title":"Chapter 1289 The Half-Step Cores Who Were Overjoyed by Getting Casually Guidance","paragraphs":["1289 The Half-Step Cores Who Were Overjoyed by Getting Casually Guidance","The right king was pushed back by Chu Yunfan’s punch, and the terrifying aura that enveloped the entire city finally dissipated.","The experts in the city heaved sighs of relief as if they had just escaped from hell.","Immediately after, many people became even more shocked and furious. As the important city of Great Wei, Conglong had never encountered such a great crisis. Many still had lingering fear in their hearts. They did not dare to imagine what kind of shocking scene it would be if such a terrifying existence had successfully teleported over.","‘Marquis Zhongxin’s residence will surely rise!’","This was the only thought in everyone’s mind. Chu Yunfan’s existence was undoubtedly an unprecedented expert in Marquis Zhongxin’s household.","In the Spirit Realm, a Core could definitely lead an overlord-level force. Sooner or later, Marquis Zhongxin could cause an earthquake in Great Wei with just a stomp of his foot.","The battle had finally come to an end, but the uproar it caused had only just begun.","Chu Yaowei, Zhang Ling, Yu Xuanfei, Fu Wentai, Lady Shui Ji, and Chu Yunfan sat opposite each other in the secret garden of the residence. Among these people, although Chu Yunfan was the youngest, he sat on the main seat.","With the strength that he had displayed, no one dared to treat him as an ordinary junior. Zhang Ling and the others even looked at Chu Yunfan with a fawning expression. At this moment, they did not dare to be unconvinced by Chu Yunfan at all.","“Yunfan, thank you so much. Our family’s years-long hatred has finally come to an end.” Chu Yaowei raised his glass in a toast and drank it without waiting for Chu Yunfan’s reply.","“It’s nothing. It was a piece of cake,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan with a grateful expression on his face. Of course, he understood that without Chu Yunfan, the probability of killing Ancestor Wusheng would be very low. It could even be said to be zero.","At this time, he finally understood why Chu Yunfan said to wait for another month. It was probably because his strength had changed drastically in this month.","Chu Yaowei was glad that he didn’t choose to fight back and chose to wait. Otherwise, things wouldn’t have been as perfect as they were now.","“I didn’t expect your strength to be so impressive, Young Master Chu. I wonder where your master is from. They muast be even more powerful to be able to teach a disciple like you.”","Lady Shui Ji smiled at Chu Yunfan. Her eyes were full of lust as if she was flirting with him, but he ignored her completely. Her words made everyone’s spirits rise. Everyone was very interested in Chu Yunfan’s master.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t have jumped out of a rock, right? There must be a reason for his earth-shattering cultivation. This was what they were most concerned about. Even Chu Yaowei, who didn’t care much about this, swept his gaze over to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t comment on this. He knew that if his strength was exposed, there would definitely be people who would take advantage of it. However, he really didn’t have a clear master. If there was, it would be the Alchemy Emperor from the Ancient Zenith Civilization.","But that was a time long gone now.","“I only had a fortuitous encounter and cultivated until now. I’ve never received guidance from anyone,” Chu Yunfan said.","These secret manual might be filled with all kinds of secret words, but if no one explained its meaning, you wouldn’t understand it even if you died.","How could someone who could cultivate to Chu Yunfan’s level not have a background?","However, they could see that he was unwilling to say more, so they did not dare to ask. Still, they could not help but start to have all kinds of guesses in their hearts.","Even many of the famous sects in the world and even the reclusive sects were under their suspicion. After all, they were the top figures of Great Wei and knew much more than the average person.","After the meal, everyone expressed their gratitude to Chu Yunfan. This time, Zhang Ling and the others no longer dared to treat him as an equal. They even lowered themselves the the level of juniors.","After all, on the path of cultivation, the one who reached the top was the top of the food chain.","It was not easy to meet a Core. After eating and drinking to her heart’s content, Lady Shui Ji raised some questions to Chu Yunfan. They were all about the problems she had encountered in her cultivation.","After seeing Lady Shui Ji do this, the other half-step Cores also spoke up and asked Chu Yunfan about the problems they had encountered in their cultivation.","For them, these questions had troubled them for too long, but for Chu Yunfan, they were nothing.","The problems they encountered were nothing more than a leaf covering their eyes for Chu Yunfan. His understanding of martial arts far exceeded the imagination of ordinary people. Even if he didn’t understand the parts, with the help of the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, it was only a piece of cake for him to solve the problems in their cultivation.","Lady Shui Ji and the other three lowered their heads to him, so Chu Yunfan didn’t mind giving them some pointers. Then, Lady Shui Ji and the others were pleasantly surprised that Chu Yunfan managed to solve the problems they raised.","It was as if the problem that troubled them was as simple as one plus one equals two!","Originally, they had not expected to get all the answers. After all, even Cores could not understand everything. Everyone’s cultivation path was different, and they were not sure if Chu Yunfan could answer them.","It was just that they were unwilling to give up such a good opportunity. Who would have thought that he would solve their problem so easily?","Many of the problems could be solved with just one step, but they just didn’t know the step. However, they didn’t underestimate Chu Yunfan because of this, because without his guidance, even if it was just a small step, it might have taken them years to understand.","Moreover, they were all top-notch experts. They understood that this kind of solution was more difficult than using all kinds of methods to solve it with great fanfare.","It was enough to highlight his shocking knowledge of martial arts.","Gradually, the appreciation meal arranged by Chu Yaowei became Chu Yunfan’s lecture. It was not until a person arrived that everyone’s questions were interrupted."]},{"number":1290,"title":"Chapter 1290 The Shock of the Imperial Guardian","paragraphs":["1290 The Shock of the Imperial Guardian","The meal-lecture came to a halt when a servant came in to announce that the imperial guardian had arrived.","Everyone’s heart trembled, especially Lady Shui Ji. She looked at Chu Yunfan reluctantly. Those who didn’t know better would think that she was looking at her lover.","However, the others could understand because they also felt the same way. They really felt that it was a pity. This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, after all.","Just the few words that Chu Yunfan had given them in this short period was equivalent to them having to fumble around and cultivate for a few years, or even more than ten years.","They were not immortal. What they lacked the most in cultivation was not resources or inheritance, but time.","However, they didn’t dare to reject. If it was anyone else, they would have immediately sent people to chase them out. However, the person who came was the imperial guardian.","The imperial guardian that Chu Yaowei had invited previously had appeared, and everyone looked at each other and looked at each other in dismay.","“Hurry up and invite him. If not, I’ll go invite him,” Chu Yaowei quickly said. He had no idea how long he had spent to hire this imperial guardian. He had paid a huge price to hire him. Although it wasn’t not effective in the end, he didn’t dare to neglect him.","After a while, under Chu Yaowei’s lead, an old man in black clothes strode in. Everyone stood up and greeted him.","“It’s you, Elder Ku.”","“Greetings, Elder Ku.”","“May you have a long life, Elder Ku.”","Zhang Ling, Lady Shui Ji, and the others immediately greeted him. A look of shock flashed across their eyes. They had not expected Chu Yaowei to invite this old man.","Elder Ku was not even from their generation. It should be said that he was a legendary figure in their previous generation. When they had just started their journey and made a name for themselves in Great Wei, Elder Ku was already one of the top experts in Great Wei.","His fame was not inferior to theirs. Later on, he even stepped into the Core Stage and became the overlord of a generation. Later on, it was said that he had joined Great Wei and became the imperial guardian.","After that, he rarely made a move. However, every time he made a move, something big must have happened.","Although they knew that the imperial guardian who could be invited must be a big shot and not a simple person, they did not expect Chu Yaowei to be able to invite Elder Ku.","However, Fu Wentai’s eyes flashed with understanding. Compared to the others, he had a deeper relationship with Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. He had vaguely heard that Elder Ku had once received help from a previous marquis.","Otherwise, it would be difficult to find someone to deal with a Core.","Even if they were both Cores, it was still unusual for them to deal with another Core. If they failed to kill the snake, there would be endless trouble. It was not a top-notch expert that could be hired with money.","If that was the case, then it made sense.","Elder Ku had just entered. He did not care about the others and looked directly at Chu Yunfan, who was sitting on the main seat. His eyes were bright as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","Otherwise, either side could easily crush them to death.","“Elder Ku, this is—” Chu Yaowei quickly went forward and said.","“Chu Yunfan. I heard about it on the way here.” Elder Ku looked at Chu Yunfan and sighed. “Heroes are born from young people. I didn’t expect that such a young hero would actually appear in Great Wei.”","“Elder Ku, you flatter me.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","Elder Ku waved his hand and said, “I’m not flattering you. You don’t have to be so modest. I was asked by Yaowei to ambush Ancestor Wusheng. I didn’t expect that he would be killed by you.”","“Speaking of which, I’m ashamed. On my way here, I was stopped by an array formation. Although I was only stopped for half a day, if you hadn’t turned the tide, I’m afraid that Ancestor Wusheng would have succeeded in his plan,” Elder Ku said bluntly.","Only then did everyone understand why Elder Ku had not arrived on time. It was probably because Ancestor Wusheng had set up an array formation on the path that he had to pass. Although it could not do anything to Elder Ku, it was enough to stop him for some time.","For a Core, even this short time was enough to wipe out an entire city.","Thinking of this, they all felt a chill down their spines. If Chu Yunfan had not suddenly appeared, stopped Ancestor Wusheng, and killed him, they would have died long ago by the time Elder Ku arrived.","However, when they saw that Elder Ku did not seem to have any intention of falling out with them, they heaved a sigh of relief. Otherwise, it would have been another terrifying battle between immortals.","“It’s nothing,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Elder Ku looked at Chu Yunfan in a daze and then laughed out loud.","“If Old Ancestor Wusheng knew about this, he would probably be angered to death. If anyone else said this, I would think that they were arrogant, but I think that what you said is the truth.”","Elder Ku clearly had already understood the whole story before he came. He already had a good understanding of Chu Yunfan. In fact, he was in a state of shock. When he arrived here, he found out that Chu Yunfan had killed Ancestor Wusheng, and he was even more shocked.","Although Ancestor Wusheng had only just entered the Void Core Stage—which was much later than him—in reality, after he had entered the Core Stage, his progress was not great. Compared to Ancestor Wusheng, he did not have much of an advantage.","It was precisely because of this that he did not want to take on this matter at the beginning. He was not completely confident that he could kill Ancestor Wusheng. If he could not kill that kind of Core in one fell swoop, there would be endless trouble.","If Chu Yaowei hadn’t sent him a letter and exchanged a Longevity Pill for his help, he might not have been willing to interfere in this mess.","For a young man, it might not be much, but for someone his age, a Longevity Pill to increase his lifespan by 20 years was undoubtedly crucial. It was worth it for him to fight with Ancestor Wusheng. However, after he broke through the array and rushed over, he found out that Ancestor Wusheng had been killed by Chu Yunfan.","This shocked him. Even if he attacked, he was not completely confident that he could stop Ancestor Wusheng. Heavily injuring and killing a Core were two completely different concepts.","Not only did Chu Yunfan manage to do it, but what was even more terrifying was that, according to the information he had obtained, Chu Yunfan had easily killed Ancestor Wusheng. It was not a bitter battle at all.","During the battle, Ancestor Wusheng revealed that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength might have already surpassed the fledgling Void Core Stage.","This made him even more shocked. From the beginning, he never underestimated Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1291,"title":"Chapter 1291 Peak Tier-Eight Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["1291 Peak Tier-Eight Divine Abilities Stage","Especially after seeing Chu Yunfan’s appearance, he was even more certain of one thing. Chu Yunfan was indeed very, very young. At such a young age, his cultivation was so shocking.","He thought about how he had barely managed to reach the Core Stage at such an old age and how he had lost the potential to advance further. Comparing the two of them really made him feel like he was about to die.","“But you met the right king in the end?” Elder Ku continued to ask, “I heard that you defeated him too.”","An inexplicable horror flashed through his eyes. If it was really the right king, then even if he came, he would still die.","In the information he received, it was said that Chu Yunfan had defeated the right king. If that was really the case, Chu Yunfan would not only have performed extremely well, but he would have become an unrivaled figure in the world.","“That’s just a rumor. I just interrupted the right king while he was teleporting over,” Chu Yunfan said truthfully.","Even so, Elder Ku didn’t underestimate Chu Yunfan. Even though Chu Yunfan had interrupted the teleportation, he knew how difficult it was. If it were him, he wouldn’t have been able to interrupt the teleportation.","No matter what, Chu Yunfan had left an unfathomable impression in his heart. Through his perception, he could only estimate Chu Yunfan’s unfathomable strength, which was like an abyss. He could not fully make out Chu Yunfan’s current strength.","“However, since the right king came here, we can’t treat this matter lightly. I’ll get someone to send a message back to the imperial capital later and ask the imperial court to send experts in the field of formation to re-consolidate the city barriers. This kind of thing must not happen again,” Elder Ku said.","When he thought about how the right king had almost killed his way into Great Wei, he suddenly felt a chill run down his spine.","Chu Yaowei and the others nodded their heads solemnly, indicating their agreement.","“Other than that, there’s also that Yuwen Chang. He’s really tired of living. How dare he collude with Jinzhanghan. I’ve already sent the news back to the capital. I think the army to attack the Yuwen clan is already on its way,” Elder Ku continued.","Everyone nodded. Thinking of Yuwen Chang’s betrayal, they gnashed their teeth in hatred. He almost got them killed. Yuwen Chang had brought this upon himself.","And without Yuwen Chang’s protection, how could the Yuwen clan stop Great Wei army? They would probably be completely annihilated. It would be lucky if a few of them could escape.","However, as half-step Cores, they still felt a little sad about the death of another half-step Core. Only Chu Yunfan really didn’t care.","Elder Ku only came here to meet Chu Yunfan before leaving. Although the battle had ended, the uproar caused by this matter had only just begun.","Chu Yunfan could ignore it, but Elder Ku, as the imperial guardian, had to clean up the mess.","After the banquet ended, Chu Yunfan returned to his small courtyard and counted his gains.","In this battle, Chu Yunfan had killed more than ten half-step Cores in one breath, as well as Ancestor Wusheng, a Core. Naturally, the harvest was not small. Their corpses were all taken away by Chu Yunfan and turned into fertilizer for the Brahma Tree.","At this moment, no one dared to argue with Chu Yunfan about the whereabouts of these corpses. After all, he was the one who killed them, so he naturally had the right to dispose of them.","These corpses were watered on the Brahma Tree, successfully allowing it to bear a fruit. It wouldn’t be long before the fruit on the Brahma Tree ripened. At that time, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation would naturally advance.","Other than that, the biggest harvest was the spirit stones stored in the fallen’s interspatial rings. This was especially so since these were all experts at the half-step Core Stage and above. Each of them had millions or even tens of millions of low-grade spirit stones on them.","Just these spirit stones alone had earned Chu Yunfan hundreds of millions of low-grade spirit stones. The gains from this battle had exceeded his entire net worth.","Other than that, there were also many heavenly and earthly treasures, precious medicinal herbs, and so on. Their value was shocking.","At this moment, in the space of the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan was sitting in front of the herb mountain. He stretched out his hand, and countless piles of low-grade spirit stones flew over. They exploded in mid-air, and the spirit energy contained in them flew straight over and poured into the herb mountain.","Immediately, the countless precious medicinal herbs that Chu Yunfan had planted on the mountain ripened. They had even been ripened to the point where they could be harvested.","This was the most precious function of the herb mountain. As long as there was enough spirit energy, it could even ripen the most medicinal herbs in the shortest time. And no matter what kind of living environment the medicinal herb needed, it could be simulated on the herb mountain.","The Brahma Fruit on the Brahma Tree also began to gradually emit waves of fruit fragrance. Under the ripening of countless spirit energy, the Brahma Fruit also began to gradually ripen. If this continued, it would not take long for it to ripen.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan was also constantly using the Celestial Devouring Art, crazily devouring the spirit energy in these low-grade spirit stones. Countless spirit energy floated in the space of the Mountain River Diagram like a field, and then directly poured into his body.","Every pore in Chu Yunfan’s body opened, and countless spirit energy surged into it.","If it were an ordinary person, they would have been stuffed to death by the spirit energy, but Chu Yunfan was different. His Imperial Physique was extremely powerful. No matter how much spirit energy he devoured, he could still endure it.","He circulated his energy and absorbed the surrounding spirit energy into his own.","Countless amounts of spirit energy were turning into his own power at a speed visible to the naked eye. At the same time, it was tempering his own body, allowing his Imperial Physique to advance further.","At his current level, it was extremely difficult for his Imperial Physique to advance further. However, with the crazy consumption of more than 100 million spirit stones, even if it was difficult for him to advance his Imperial Physique, he could still improve it at an astonishing speed.","However, if others saw this, they would definitely be scolded as being wasteful.","If he used another method, the utilization rate of these spirit stones would definitely be much higher. It would just take a long time.","However, for Chu Yunfan, time was far more precious than spirit stones.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan’s crazy devouring of spirit energy finally stopped.","He suddenly opened his eyes, and a terrifying divine power boiled out of his body.","He had finally reached the peak of the tier-eight Divine Abilities Stage!"]},{"number":1292,"title":"Chapter 1292 Soaring Strength","paragraphs":["1292 Soaring Strength","When Chu Yunfan had broken through previously, he had only just stepped into the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. With countless low-grade spirit stones, he had successfully pushed his cultivation to the peak of the eighth tier.","Chu Yunfan obtained more than 100 million low-grade spirit stones. In fact, the herb mountain had only consumed a total of more than 30 million low-grade spirit stones. The rest were all swallowed by him.","To others, it was simply unbelievable that a person had swallowed hundreds of millions of low-grade spirit stones. If they had so many low-grade spirit stones, it was impossible for them to devour and digest all of them in such a short period.","Even a Core would explode!","However, Chu Yunfan had done it. If others knew about it, it would probably cause a huge uproar. With his current strength, an intermediate Void Core was nothing in his eyes. He could easily suppress them because after he stepped into the peak of the eighth tier, the density of his mana had at least doubled.","And his transformation was far more than that. His Imperial Physique had also advanced a small realm after devouring countless spirit energy.","If the original Chu Yunfan could receive a low-grade spirit weapon with his bare hands, then the current Chu Yunfan could destroy a low-grade spirit weapon in mid-air.","He had no fear of ordinary attacks.","Although it was only a small step forward, it meant that his strength had undergone a huge change.","Of course, the reason why he stopped breaking through was that he had devoured all the low-grade spirit stones. The spirit-gathering formation alone could not provide enough spirit energy for him to cultivate.","Compared to the speed at which his cultivation increased when he swallowed low-grade spirit stones, the increase in his cultivation by absorbing the energy of nature through the spirit-gathering formation was almost negligible.","Of course, that was because Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was too strong. He was only in the Divine Abilities Stage, but his cultivation was several times stronger than that of an ordinary Core.","However, he was not in a hurry. When the Brahma Fruit on the Brahma Tree ripened, he would naturally break through to the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage after consuming it.","After that, it was the most troublesome time. He had to start working hard to condense the Void Core Stage and break through to the Core Stage. Judging from the resources consumed by his cultivation, there would definitely be need for countless resources at that time.","Because of this, Chu Yunfan stopped.","When he came out of seclusion, he found out that the battle had been over for three months.","During these three months, the impact of the battle in which he had killed Ancestor Wusheng finally subsided. However, that was only on the surface. In these three months, the position of the Marquis Zhongxin household had also undergone an earth-shattering change.","Chu Yunfan had killed Ancestor Wusheng in one battle and defeated the right king with one punch. This battle had made Chu Yunfan famous throughout the world and he was known as the number one expert in Conglong.","His reputation was spreading throughout the whole of Great Wei at an astonishing speed. Compared to the time when he had fought Wan Huang to a draw, his influence had increased by many times.","After all, although half-step Cores were known as the overlords of a region, their influence was often limited to one region. In the entire country, there were too many such experts.","The status of these five people in Great Wei was truly supreme. Each of them was a powerful existence that could affect the situation in the Imperial Court.","Chu Yunfan had become the sixth well-known Core in Great Wei.","They didn’t know that he had only broken through to the Core Stage in terms of combat strength, but to them, it was no different. Through word of mouth, Chu Yunfan gained the title of the sixth bigshot in the world.","Based on his astonishing performance in this battle, Marquis Zhongxin’s household became a hot commodity in the eyes of countless forces. They couldn’t find Chu Yunfan while he was cultivating in seclusion, and they didn’t dare to disturb him. However, it was different in the residence.","No matter what, Chu Yunfan was born in there. It was impossible for them to ignore the Marquis Zhongxin Manor.","Therefore, Chu Yaowei was both happy and terrified because he had to deal with the recruitment of these major powers. At the same time, he couldn’t offend any of them. Many powers were existences that even a power like the residence had only heard of. Now, they actually came to his door one by one.","Fortunately, these forces were restrained by Chu Yunfan’s strength and did not dare to act rashly. However, even so, he still trembled with fear.","However, this influence was just the beginning. A Core could be called a great grandmaster and could establish a sect in Great Wei.","How could such a person’s influence be limited to this.","Chu Yunfan didn’t really care about this. He was also a high and mighty figure back in the Federation, so he was already used to it. However, what surprised him was that after getting rid of Ancestor Wusheng, Chu Yaowei really made Chu Hongcai the heir.","Chu Yaowei also reported it to the Great Wei’s Board of Rites. The approval from the board had already been issued, and Chu Hongcai was required to go to the capital to take the assessment.","Great Wei was founded on martial arts. The first generation of Marquis Zhongxin had relied on outstanding military achievements to obtain the title of Marquis Zhongxin. Therefore, it was fine for ordinary descendants of noble families. However, Great Wei had a set of strict assessment standards for an heir to such a great title.","Those who could pass the assessment were definitely one in ten thousand.","Fortunately, Chu Hongcai was in good condition. In addition, he had been trained by Chu Yunfan for the past few months, and his strength had already reached the second tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. Although he couldn’t compare to Chu Yunfan’s monstrous talent, he could still be considered a dragon among men. It wouldn’t be difficult for him to pass the assessment.","After Chu Yunfan learned of all this, a servant came to report that a guest had been waiting for him in the residence for several days. He felt it a little strange. What kind of guest would wait for him for so long?","Even if ordinary people came to visit him and saw that he was in seclusion, they would put down their gifts and leave.","But soon, Chu Yunfan saw the guest. It was a young man of medium build.","This man looked ordinary, but Chu Yunfan could see explosive power in his body. He was actually a seventh-tier Divine who was hiding his strength."]},{"number":1293,"title":"Chapter 1293 Chu Yunfan’s Unexpected Might","paragraphs":["1293 Chu Yunfan’s Unexpected Might","Of course, this kind of strength was nothing in front of Chu Yunfan, and there was no way to hide it. However, for him to be able to cultivate to such a level at his age was indeed very rare.","No matter where he was placed, he could be called a young talent.","However, this kind of strength was hidden under his ordinary appearance. If Chu Yunfan’s cultivation did not far exceed his, people would only think that he was an ordinary person at first glance.","“May I know who you are?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I am Shi Yu, a subordinate of the Agency of Secrets. Greetings, Master Chu!”","The middle-sized young man hurriedly bowed and said.","He was filled with emotion. When he was ordered by the agency director to deliver the birthday gift to the Chu clan and pay his respects to Chu Yunfan, he never expected such a drastic change to happen.","According to the information that the Agency of Secrets had initially obtained, Chu Yunfan was only a half-step Core. Even so, the agency director had already said that a true dragon was raised in shallow water. Who would have thought that this was actually not the limit of Chu Yunfan’s strength?","When Shi Yu arrived at Conglong with the gift, he found out that Chu Yunfan had killed Ancestor Wusheng, a powerful enemy who had always been ranked very high on the Agency of Secrets’ wanted list.","He even defeated the right king with a single punch. Chu Yunfan was revered in Conglong!","In fact, such a result was indeed a miracle for Chu Yunfan.","Shi Yu had thought that as the head of the Agency of Secrets, even those half-step Cores had to give the agency director some face. It was a little inappropriate for him to lower his status to befriend a junior.","Only now did he understand what it meant to be a schemer and what it meant to have a vicious gaze.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had actually entered the Core Stage.","What kind of concept was that? The appearance of any Core would cause a shock in the entire Great Wei. As long as he did not die, he would definitely become an overlord in the future.","With Chu Yunfan’s age, it was not impossible for him to become the number one expert of Great Wei in the future.","No wonder even a high and mighty figure like the agency director had to lower his status. Of course, it couldn’t be said that he had lowered his status to make friends now. It should be said that he had come to curry favor with Chu Yunfan in advance.","The Agency of Secrets was so powerful that ordinary half-step Cores did not dare to be their enemy. However, it was completely different if they were in the Core Stage. They were an existence that transcended the Great Wei’s Imperial Court.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He knew of the Agency of Secrets. In fact, the Agency of Secrets could be called a behemoth in Great Wei. Its intelligence system was deep in all aspects, especially in the homes of various dignitaries. There were already countless spies lurking among them, and that was an open secret.","It could be said that this was the largest intelligence organization in the whole of Great Wei.","The director of the agency was the king of darkness. Ordinary half-step Cores were nothing in front of the director. He could kill them as he pleased.","Of course, in front of Chu Yunfan, the Agency of Secrets was nothing. He was an existence that transcended conventional power.","“So you’re from the Agency of Secrets. Have we met before?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I’m under the orders of our director to invite you to the capital, Master Chu,” Shi Yu hurriedly said.","In front of Chu Yunfan, he did not dare to hide anything. Otherwise, he did not doubt that Chu Yunfan could easily kill him with a look.","“The Imperial Capital?” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. Then, he thought of something. Now that his strength had completely recovered, he naturally had to start looking for Tang Siyu.","However, Great Wei was different from the Federation, which had an extremely developed network. As long as he was willing, he could easily find Tang Siyu’s whereabouts. In Great Wei, the manpower and material resources needed to spread the intelligence network to such a large extent were simply unimaginable.","Borrowing the intelligence network of the Agency of Secrets was the fastest way, and Chu Yunfan believed that they would not refuse to help him with such a small favor.","“I understand. Go back and report to your director. Firstly, I’ll thank him for the birthday gift. Secondly, I’ll also choose a day to go to the capital to meet him. I hope he can help me with a small favor.”Chu Yunfan nodded.","“May I ask what it is?” Shi Yu gritted his teeth and asked. His body was trembling slightly, afraid that Chu Yunfan would suddenly become angry.","Although he didn’t have much contact with such experts, he knew that such people were temperamental. It was like a person stepping on an ant. What reason did they need? Maybe it was just a spur of the moment. So what if they trampled someone to death? Did they need any explanation?","However, since this matter involved the agency, he had no choice but to ask.","“Don’t worry, I won’t make things difficult for you. I want you to help me find someone. Your agency’s intelligence network is spread all over Great Wei and abroad,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan did not suddenly flare up, Shi Yu was slightly relieved. However, if it was just to find someone, it was indeed a piece of cake for them. It was nothing more than giving orders to the spies everywhere to pay attention.","“In that case, I’ll take my leave first,” Shi Yu said.","“All right.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","After leaving the small courtyard where Chu Yunfan lived, Shi Yu finally heaved a sigh of relief. Although Chu Yunfan had never put on a stern face from the beginning to the end, to him, it was even more terrifying than when he faced the director.","The reason why the director was so terrifying was mainly because of the prestige he had accumulated over the years. However, when facing Chu Yunfan, it was as if he was facing a god.","That was a terrifying existence that completely surpassed his current strength. Although Shi Yu had a high position in the agency, he had never seen an existence of this level.","Now he finally understood why the agency listed Cores as living gods.","That was a living god. At this level, every move of an expert had great power. It was not something that they could guess.","Unlike Shi Yu’s fear, this was just a small matter for Chu Yunfan. He didn’t even care about the agency director, let alone a high-ranking officer in the agency. It was not enough for him to pay more attention to it.","However, the aftermath of the previous battle had just begun to ferment.","From the south of Conglong, in front of a huge and towering mountain, a group of people dressed in ragged clothes was rushing into the mountains in a panic."]},{"number":1294,"title":"Chapter 1294 The Remnants of the Yuwen Clan, Soul Hunter","paragraphs":["1294 The Remnants of the Yuwen Clan, Soul Hunter","There were elderly, children, and women in this group. All of them had cultivation. Although they looked ragged and extremely miserable, they were rushing like mad.","These people were all running as if they were flying. They ran all the way and finally stepped into the territory of this huge mountain range.","They felt that they had used up all their strength. The originally gorgeous robes on their bodies now looked extremely dirty. By the time they reached the foot of the mountain range, the true energy in their bodies was depleted. They could no longer run.","One of the women unknowingly started to cry. Since she was born, she had never suffered such a great loss or suffered such a great sin. But now, in a short period of time, their families had been destroyed. Only a few people were left in the entire clan. The rest had long been massacred.","And all of this originated from that person!","“Chu Yunfan, I will kill you!” the woman gritted her teeth and roared. Her originally beautiful face revealed a ferocious expression.","“Miss, don’t be angry. Let’s take a break and enter the mountains. When the time comes, we’ll ask the ancestor to come out. So what if it’s Chu Yunfan? We’ll make the Chu clan pay back a hundredfold for what the Yuwen clan suffered today!” an old man comforted her.","“That’s right, blood for blood!”","“The entire Chu clan will be wiped out!”","“I will tear Chu Yunfan into pieces!”","When these people scolded Chu Yunfan, they seemed to have found the motivation to live on, and their bodies were filled with strength again.","Suddenly, at this moment, the sound of hurried horse hooves came from afar. In just a few breaths, hundreds of riders appeared in front of everyone.","Everyone was dumbfounded as they looked at everything in front of them.","These riders were all dressed in black, and each of them was enveloped in a thick murderous aura.","“It’s over. It’s the Iron Calvary!” someone cried out in shock, feeling completely hopeless.","These men in black were all in black, and each of them was at the peak Innate Stage. The warhorses they rode were not ordinary warhorses either. They were all horses with the bloodline of monsters. Each of them was comparable to an Innate. Ordinary monsters could not defeat these horses.","These hundreds of riders charged out with the might of a thousand troops. It was extremely shocking!","These people were instantly in despair because they knew too well how terrifying these people were.","These people were all remnants of the Yuwen clan. A few months ago, they were still high and mighty figures. With a casual stomp of their feet, countless living beings around them would tremble. They were high and mighty figures.","Who knew that after that day, the Yuwen clan would be declared traitors? The Imperial Court’s anti-rebel army arrived, and the entire Yuwen clan was slaughtered until blood flowed like a river. Only a few people like them escaped. Because they were not important targets, there were no experts to keep an eye on them.","However, the Iron Calvary from the Agency of Secrets chased after them. Along the way, who knew how many people had died? It was not easy for them to arrive here, but they were actually caught up again.","When they closed their eyes, they thought back to the day when the Yuwen clan was slaughtered until blood flowed like a river.","Thinking of this, they immediately gritted their teeth in hatred. If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan, would they have ended up like this?","As for the rumor that Yuwen Chang colluded with Jinzhanghan and Ancestor Wusheng to massacre Conglong, it was nothing in their eyes. They were just some ant-like figures. How could they be compared to them? Moreover, they had not been slaughtered yet.","Just like that, their Yuwen clan was slaughtered.","“Miss, leave quickly. Go and find the ancestor. I’ll hold them off!”","The old man stepped forward. However, in just a moment, the riders had already arrived in front of them.","“The agency director has ordered that the Yuwen clan who colluded with the enemy and betrayed the country be executed,” a small number of experts from the agency shouted.","At this moment, a figure flew out from the depths of the mountain range.","It was a young man around the age of 20. He was dressed in white clothes that fluttered in the wind. He had bright eyes and white teeth, like a celestial being.","“Halt!” The young man directly blocked the Iron Cavalry.","The riders glanced at the young man and immediately recognized him, feeling a chill run down their spines.","“It’s the Soul Hunter!”","When the leader of the cavalry saw him, he jumped in fright.","The Agency of Secrets was known as the largest intelligence network in the world, so they were naturally familiar with all the experts. Although this young man was not as well-known as a Core, he was still very famous among the younger generation. He was known as one of the top ten experts of the younger generation.","Soul Hunter was invincible with his Soul Hunt striking techniques. He was known as someone who would likely enter the Core Stage in the future.","“Since you know it’s me, you still dare to approach?” The young man sneered as a murderous look flashed through his eyes.","“The agency is hunting down national traitors. I hope that you will give us a chance, Soul Hunter!” the leader of the cavalry spoke.","“I’ll give you a chance. Who do you think you are to talk to me?” Soul Hunter sneered. “I don’t care about the director of your agency. Sooner or later, I’ll go to the capital to challenge your director.”","“Soul Hunter, we are giving you face, but not because we’re afraid of you. Are you planning to go against Great Wei?” Hearing Soul Hunter’s words, the calvary leader had no choice but to speak up.","“You dare to threaten me?” Soul Hunter sneered. Then, he suddenly slapped out with his hand. In an instant, it turned into a ghostly strike that slammed down fiercely.","Boom!","The cavalry, which had been charging forward in an imposing manner, had been completely reduced to nothingness in this attack.","In front of Soul Hunter, they were nothing!","“Trash.”","Soul Hunter didn’t even look at them. The existence of the agency was undoubtedly a malicious ghost to the remaining members of the Yuwen clan, but to him, it was nothing.","“Thank you, Soul Hunter!”","“Thank you, Soul Hunter!”","The remaining members of the Yuwen clan didn’t dare to delay any longer and quickly thanked him."]},{"number":1295,"title":"Chapter 1295 I Will Make Chu Yunfan Pay the Price!","paragraphs":["1295 I Will Make Chu Yunfan Pay the Price!","Soul Hunter looked at them coldly and said, “My master already knows about your matter. He asked me to save you.”","The Yuwen clan members were overjoyed. They thought of their goal of coming here, which was to ask the ancestor to come out of the mountain and take revenge for their clan and wipe out the entire Chu clan.","They did not expect that the ancestor would already know of this injustice before they even met him. Thinking of this, they could not help but feel a little hope.","Soul Hunter waved his hand and swept the Yuwen clan members into his light. As for the Iron Cavalry, he didn’t even look at them. They were just ants.","In a moment, everyone had already stepped on the light and entered the depths of the mountain range. Unlike the majestic appearance, this mountain range was like a prosperous city.","It was an incomparably huge sect.","In the entire southern part of Great Wei, there was no one who did not know about this sacred land of martial arts!","It was the Great Formless Sect!","In the current Great Wei, there were five well-known Cores. They were known as one of the five great experts of the whole of Great Wei. One of them was the sect master of the Great Formless Sect located in the south of Great Wei.","He was known as the master of the southern sect!","It could be said that the Great Formless Sect had the power to cover the sky in the entire southern part of Great Wei. The disciples that came out of the Great Formless Sect were all over the southern regions. Countless forces were more or less related to the Great Formless Sect.","In the southern part of Great Wei, the Great Formless Sect’s authority even surpassed the authority of Great Wei’s officials. And all of this was due to the illustrious reputation that the sect master of the Great Formless Sect had built.","The Great Formless Sect had produced Cores for two consecutive generations. Their reputation in the south of Great Wei was unparalleled, especially the sect master of the Great Formless Sect, who was currently one of the five great experts of Great Wei.","Therefore, there were countless people who came to learn from him. The two generations of sect masters had nurtured countless experts over the past hundreds of years. In the entire Great Formless Sect, there were many experts as common as the clouds. Divines were like carps crossing the river here.","Looking down from above, one could see the auras of experts soaring into the sky. They could even condense into a ball and change the weather nearby.","One could imagine just how shocking this Great Formless Sect was!","When these Yuwen clansmen saw this scene, they felt incomparably excited. After all, the stronger the Great Formless Sect was, the higher the possibility of them taking revenge.","The legendary Chu Yunfan was not easy to deal with. The only person they could ask for help now was the sect master of the Great Formless Sect.","They looked at each other and saw the meaning in each other’s eyes. Their clan and the Great Formless Sect actually had some history. One of the matriarchs of the Yuwen clan’s ancestors was the mother of the current sect master.","Therefore, in reality, the Yuwen clan should be considered the sect master’s maternal family. It was also because of this not too distant relationship that they dared to come and ask for help.","Soon, under the guidance of Soul Hunter, they arrived at a valley. In the valley, a burly old man was sitting cross-legged in midair. When the Yuwen clan saw this old man, how could they not know that this was their clan’s greatest and last hope, the sect master of the Great Formless Sect, Mi Siyuan?","He was known as one of the five great experts in Great Wei.","The Yuwen clan knelt down and kowtowed in unison.","The burly old man, Mi Siyuan, slowly opened his eyes and looked at everyone. Then, he said, “I know everything.”","His words seemed to have completely ignited these people, and they began to cry.","“Ancestor, I beg you to seek justice for the Yuwen clan!”","“The Yuwen clan had tens of thousands of people, but they were all slaughtered!”","“Not only that but all the relations within the three clans that the Yuwens had relations to were completely wiped out as well!”","“They’re simply inhumane. They won’t even let go of a child!”","Mi Siyuan did not even look at these people’s complaints. How could he not know what the Yuwen clan had done? The matter of treason could not be justified anywhere.","Even if it was him, if he was involved in such a matter, he might die and his clan might be wiped out. The Great Formless Sect had a decisive influence in the south of Great Wei, but it was not to the point where it could cover the sky with one hand.","However, when he heard someone complain that the three clans related to the Yuwen clan were about to be wiped out, he could not help but snort coldly. Within the three clans, wasn’t he within the three clans?","Because his mother was a young lady of the Yuwen clan!","He was furious at Yuwen Chang’s stupidity. He dared to collude with Jinzhanghan. It would have been fine if he had done it cleanly, but now he had been caught and his mother’s family had been exterminated by Great Wei.","“I know. I won’t let this matter rest. I will make Chu Yunfan pay the price.”","Mi Siyuan was even more furious that Chu Yunfan did not give him any face at all. He was just a junior, but he actually shouted to kill his mother’s family. To him, it was simply a slap in the face.","However, he was completely wrong, because Chu Yunfan did not know what relationship Yuwen Chang had with the Great Formless Sect. Even if he knew, he would not hold back.","“That’s great. Thank you, ancestor. Thank you, ancestor!”","“Thank you for your help, ancestor!”","“We can finally avenge our clan!”","Then, Mi Siyuan said to Soul Hunter, “I’ll leave this matter to you. I want to let the Chu clan feel a pain that cuts to the bone. I want to cut off all the business tentacles of Marquis Zhongxin’s household in the south. Within ten days, I want to drive away all of Marquis Zhongxin’s power in the south.”","“Yes, but if that’s the case, Chu Yunfan won’t sit still,” Soul Hunter accepted the order and said.","“I just want to force him out so that he won’t be a coward!” Mi Siyuan said straightforwardly.","It was impossible for him to directly go against Great Wei’s Imperial Court. If he did, he would become a thorn in the side of Great Wei’s officials. However, it was not a problem for him to kill Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was nothing in his eyes.","“I haven’t made a move for too long. Some people have probably forgotten the fear of being dominated by me in the past.”","Mi Siyuan’s cold words made the Yuwen clan tremble. On the contrary, Soul Hunter’s face revealed a hint of excitement.","“Don’t worry, Master. Leave this matter to me. There’s no need for you to take action.”"]},{"number":1296,"title":"Chapter 1296 Clouds From All Sides","paragraphs":["1296 Clouds From All Sides","Following Mi Siyuan’s order, the entire Great Formless Sect began to move.","The influence of the Great Formless Sect on the southern part of the empire had already been thoroughly revealed.","In just three days, the tentacle that Marquis Zhongxin Manor had extended to the south of Great Wei was cut off. This action instantly caused a sensation throughout Great Wei.","“The Great Formless Sect has made a move against the Chu clan!”","“How is that possible? Why would the Great Formless Sect attack the Chu clan? This doesn’t make sense.”","“What’s so unreasonable about this? As everyone knows, the mother of the Great Formless Sect’s sect master, Mi Siyuan, was born in the Yuwen clan.”","“I’m afraid the entire world will be in a commotion. Behind the Great Formless Sect is Mi Siyuan, who is known as one of the five great experts. However, Chu Yunfan, who is behind the Chu clan, has also been in the limelight recently.”","“Are two great Cores going to face each other? There hasn’t been such a big scene in decades!”","For a time, all the major forces were guessing that a violent conflict was about to erupt between the Great Formless Sect and the Chu clan.","There was no comparison between the Chu clan and the Great Formless Sect. Even if ten Chu clans were combined, they would not be as powerful as the Great Formless Sect. However, everyone believed that the Chu clan and the Great Formless Sect were comparable because of Chu Yunfan, who stood behind the Chu clan.","In this world, the strength of a force was related to the strength of its members. The ones who really decided everything were the experts who were above ordinary people.","What would determine the outcome of the battle between the Chu clan and the Great Formless Sect was not the Chu clan and the Great Formless Sect themselves, but the outcome of the battle between Chu Yunfan and Mi Siyuan.","Although the Chu clan wasn’t comparable to the Great Formless Sect, Chu Yunfan was different. He had the record of killing a Core, so he couldn’t be underestimated.","However, after the initial shock, many people quickly made a judgment.","“Although Chu Yunfan is very strong, I’m afraid he doesn’t have any chance of winning against Mi Siyuan.”","“That’s right. Chu Yunfan is too young. If he was given a few more decades, it shouldn’t be a problem for him to defeat Mi Siyuan, but that’s in the future, not now!”","“That’s right. Although Chu Yunfan is very strong, Mi Siyuan is different from Ancestor Wusheng. Ancestor Wusheng has only just entered the Core Stage. In terms of strength, he can’t be compared to Mi Siyuan.”","After a simple analysis, many people believed that Chu Yunfan’s future was limitless, but it was impossible for him to compete with Mi Siyuan now.","After all, cultivation was dependent on the age of the cultivator. Chu Yunfan was only a young man in his twenties. Even if he had started cultivating in his mother’s womb, he was not a fraction of Mi Siyuan.","Decades ago, Mi Siyuan was already a legend in Great Wei. He was one of the five great experts, and no one could shake his position. If Chu fought Mi Siyuan head-on, it would not end well for him.","Some people could see Mi Siyuan’s intention, which was to force Chu Yunfan out. Everyone judged that Chu Yunfan was no match for Mi Siyuan. This had become a consensus.","In their opinion, if it was possible, Chu Yunfan would definitely not be willing to confront Mi Siyuan directly. If Chu Yunfan chose to hide, the others would definitely not be able to find him.","In another ten or twenty years, it would be hard to say who would win. Judging from Chu Yunfan’s performance as a genius, he might be able to beat up Mi Siyuan then.","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan would definitely not choose to fight Mi Siyuan head-on. Because of this, many people were waiting to see if Chu Yunfan would fight back after being bullied.","Or would it be like what many people had guessed, choosing to compromise?","At this moment, at the Agency of Secrets in the Imperial Capital, the agency director fiercely threw a stack of intelligence reports on the ground.","“What is Mi Siyuan trying to do?!”","And in front of him was that middle-sized youth, Shi Yu.","After visiting Chu Yunfan, he met Mi Siyuan who ordered Soul Hunter to cut off all the Chu clan’s businesses in the south of Great Wei. Under such circumstances, he did not dare to stay for even a moment. He hurriedly rushed back from Conglong and saw the director throwing a fit.","“According to the information we got from our spies, the experts we sent to kill the Yuwen clan should have all died at the hands of Soul Hunter. The other party didn’t even bother to hide this.”","When he thought of this, Shi Yu immediately felt extremely aggrieved. Although he could be considered an expert in the agency, he was nothing compared to Soul Hunter.","Although the two sides were about the same age, the agency mainly focused on gathering intelligence and did not judge victory by strength. However, encountering such an opponent who was completely unreasonable and crushed them with strength gave them a headache.","“Soul Hunter is getting bolder and bolder!” the director said coldly.","In the intelligence room of the agency, the information on Soul Hunter had already been stored in several large cabinets.","The director knew that Soul Hunter had declared that he wanted to challenge him in the capital. This made this king in the shadows, who had never been easily angered, extremely furious.","As the younger generation grew up, they became more and more presumptuous. Soul Hunter was one of them. He completely ignored the laws of Great Wei.","“That’s right. According to the information we received, Soul Hunter has probably entered the half-step Core Stage. Moreover, his cultivation is extremely strong,” Shi Yu hurriedly said.","Shi Yu’s tone also had a hint of helplessness. The Great Formless Sect could be said to be extremely powerful in the southern part of Great Wei. Experts were as common as clouds. Soul Hunter was the best among this generation of disciples. It was very likely that he would step into the Core Stage in the future.","Even the agency would find such an expert extremely troublesome. If it was just Soul Hunter, as long as the agency was determined, they could always find a few half-step Cores to surround him. However, there was a huge monster standing behind him.","“Hmph, the Great Formless Sect is really getting more and more arrogant. They even dared to kill people of our agency!” the director gritted his teeth and said.","“Should we report this to His Majesty and ask the imperial family to help?” Shi Yu said.","“No, that Mi Siyuan is too strong. How can an ordinary Imperial Guardian be a match for him? As one of the five great experts, do you think that he’s blind?” The director quickly rejected the idea."]},{"number":1297,"title":"Chapter 1297 The Gloomy Clouds Over the Chu Clan","paragraphs":["1297 The Gloomy Clouds Over the Chu Clan","The director immediately rejected Shi Yu’s suggestion. The empire had always had five experts on the surface, and any one of these five experts was an expert among experts—a well-known Core.","Ordinary people only knew that Great Wei had five Cores. However, those in their positions naturally knew that Great Wei did not only have these few experts. For example, Elder Ku, who was employed by the imperial family, was not among the five experts.","It was just that other experts, for one reason or another, did not appear in front of the world.","However, there was no doubt that these five people were the best among the small group of experts.","Among the five great experts, Mi Siyuan was the youngest and had the least qualifications. However, his strength was not bad. The ordinary imperial family servants were not his match.","Otherwise, Great Wei would not have tacitly agreed that he was practically dominating the South.","“According to the information sent back by one of our secret agents, I’m afraid his cultivation is about to enter the Late Void Core Stage.”","The director was extremely depressed. Speaking of which, Mi Siyuan and he could be considered to be people from the same era.","He had yet to take that step, and Mi Siyuan was about to step into the Late Void Core Stage. With this strength, he could roam freely in the south of Great Wei, and it was difficult for him to meet his match.","Although his time had been dragged down by heavy work, Mi Siyuan was indeed an extremely outstanding figure. In his hands, the Great Formless Sect was the true overlord of the South.","Now, even a disciple of Mi Siyuan wanted to challenge him. This was simply intolerable!","Shi Yu, who was standing at the side, could not help but be alert. He also knew what kind of concept the Late Void Core Stage was. In the entire Great Wei, it was a powerful existence.","“If that’s the case, I’m afraid that Chu Yunfan is no match for Mi Siyuan,” Shi Yu hurriedly said.","“It’s hard to say. Don’t underestimate Chu Yunfan. After all, even Ancestor Wusheng died in his hands. You’ve seen the previous information. Even Ancestor Wusheng was said to have surpassed the fledgling Void Core Stage and is an existence in the intermediate Void Core Stage.” The director sneered. “No one is optimistic about Chu Yunfan, but I beg to differ. Chu Yunfan can cultivate to such a level at such a young age. How can he be ordinary?","“Even if he can’t defeat Mi Siyuan, I’m afraid it will be very difficult for Mi Siyuan to defeat him. The agency shouldn’t interfere in this matter. Based on Chu Yunfan’s usual performance, Mi Siyuan has already rushed up to him and spat in his face. Chu Yunfan won’t just sit by and do nothing,” the director added.","“I understand. Then let’s just wait and see?” Shi Yu glanced at the director.","“That’s right, but you can get someone to add fuel to the fire. Between the two of them, no matter who wins or loses, it’s not a bad thing for us,” the director said indifferently, “All right, you can leave now. If there’s any news, inform me immediately.”","“Yes, sir.”","After Shi Yu acknowledged his orders, he left.","At the same time, in the Chu clan, there were many people who had gathered in the residence, hoping that Chu Yaowei would help them.","And now, in this vicious wave of revenge from the Great Formless Sect, almost all of them had been wiped out. Only a small portion of them had escaped because they were not in the stronghold.","However, it made every family in the Chu clan mourn.","At this moment, in a large hall in the residence, Chu Yaowei was looking at the reports from all over the place. His expression was extremely ugly. His subordinates were all the higher-ups and managers of the Chu clan, and everyone’s expression was extremely solemn.","“Right now, all of our cities in the south have been attacked by the Great Formless Sect. These attacks were prepared and premeditated. They took advantage of the chaos to sneak into our strongholds overnight and killed everyone in the strongholds. Hundreds of our clansmen have already been lost!” a Chu clan elder said through gritted teeth.","“Not only our clansmen but also the people in charge of commerce and intelligence in various places have all been killed. Not a single one escaped. It’s only been three days, and they’re all dead now. If they didn’t hide it and came for us, I’m afraid we wouldn’t even know who did it!” another elder wailed.","“This time, we’ve suffered a heavy loss. Even if we can survive this, it will take fifty years for us to rebuild in the cities in the south of Great Wei!” said another.","“Let’s report this to the authorities. If this continues, it’ll be too tragic. Now, there are still clansmen coming from all over the world to complain outside the door. I don’t even know how to comfort them.”","“What authority? Aren’t we the authority? Can the Imperial Court control someone like Mi Siyuan?”","Many people thought of Chu Yunfan, and their hearts were filled with mixed feelings. One had to know that they had received great benefits because of Chu Yunfan’s existence. No matter where the Chu clan went, they would be looked up to.","However, they now understood that opportunities and risks coexisted. In such a short period, everything had been reversed. All the benefits they had gained because of Chu Yunfan had been spat out, and the losses were incalculable.","The shops in various places were burned down, and that was not the worst of it. The key was that the clansmen in various places were slaughtered and lost.","However, they didn’t dare to mention anything about revenge. Facing such a colossus, they didn’t even have the thought of revenge. They didn’t even dare to have such thoughts. If they dared to have such thoughts, the Great Formless Sect might uproot the Chu clan tomorrow.","Chu Yaowei was gloomy. He didn’t expect the clan, which was still thriving a few days ago, to suffer such a huge change overnight.","Everyone looked at each other. They all understood what each other meant. Only Chu Yunfan could solve this problem.","To put it bluntly, this matter was also caused by Chu Yunfan. They were not stupid and could see Mi Siyuan’s intention. Killing these ordinary clan members was just to anger Chu Yunfan and force him out.","This was not brilliant in itself, and even Mi Siyuan did not want to hide it. He just wanted Chu Yunfan to become the target of everyone’s criticism."]},{"number":1298,"title":"Chapter 1298 They Were All Waiting for Chu Yunfan’s Stance","paragraphs":["1298 They Were All Waiting for Chu Yunfan’s Stance","This was clearly a plan to sow discord, but they still couldn’t help but complain. They were implicated by Chu Yunfan, but they couldn’t say anything.","After all, they had also benefited greatly from Chu Yunfan’s existence. They knew that they still had some conscience and would not do such a thing.","But even so, these things were too tragic. There were many deaths and injuries. This time, the Chu clan was going to suffer a great loss.","There were masters of the Chu clan guarding each stronghold, but this time, they too were uprooted. The losses were incalculable.","If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan, who was like a stabilizing needle, everyone would not be waiting for him to make a stand. They were afraid that after suffering such an attack and being forced by the Great Formless Sect, the Chu clan would have long since scattered.","They understood that the Great Formless Sect was taking revenge for the massacred Yuwen clan. What made them depressed was that the Yuwen clan had been massacred by the Imperial Court, so what did it have to do with them?","However, they knew that it was useless to reason with them at this time because they were picking on the weaker party. Compared to Great Wei’s Imperial Court, the Chu clan was naturally weaker.","No matter how one looked at it, it was definitely much easier to provoke them than Great Wei’s Imperial Court.","When they thought of this, they felt extremely bitter in their hearts.","Suddenly, hurried footsteps came from outside, followed by a notification.","“Something bad happened, sir!”","Chu Yaowei stood up and walked out. Behind him, the other members of the Chu clan also stood up and followed him.","After Chu Yaowei left the hall, he saw a bloody scene in the square in front of the hall. Chu Hongcai, who had just been conferred the title of Marquis Zhongxin’s heir, was covered in blood.","He was carried back on a stretcher.","“What happened?” Chu Yaowei quickly asked.","Beside Chu Hongcai was a guard who was also covered in blood. When this guard saw Chu Yaowei, this man who was made of steel cried.","“Sir, it’s too tragic. Too tragic! More than a hundred of us were slaughtered by the enemy. If it wasn’t for my brothers risking their lives to stop them and let me bring the heir back, we wouldn’t be seeing you now, sir!”","The guard wailed loudly. He could no longer hold it in after seeing his comrades, who were like brothers to him and had trained together, being slaughtered by the other party.","Chu Yaowei’s face was extremely pale. He had previously reported to the Board of Rites to make Chu Hongcai his heir, and the board had asked Chu Hongcai to go to the capital to participate in the assessment. He had not expected the Great Formless Sect to be so bold and send people to intercept them midway.","He had sent over a hundred Innates to protect Chu Hongcai, and there were even Divines among them. However, they had all been wiped out, and only one Innatye guard had returned with Chu Hongcai.","Everything was clear. The battle was extremely fierce, and no one else could escape.","Was the Great Formless Sect trying to cut off the descendants of the Chu clan?","“This is too much! The Great Formless Sect has gone too far!” Chu Yaowei roared angrily.","The other higher-ups of the Chu clan were in shock. The Great Formless Sect was actually so bold that they dared to attack Chu Hongcai, who had gone to participate in the Board of Rites examination.","This was clearly provoking the dignity of Great Wei. At the same time, this was also a sign of a complete fallout. Now that they were attacking the heir of Zhongxin Marquis, it was definitely not just a warning, but a complete fallout.","“This is simply too much. Does he want to exterminate our entire clan?”","“Fight it out with them!”","“Even if we die, we definitely won’t let their Great Formless Sect have it easy!”","After seeing Chu Hongcai’s miserable state, these higher-ups of the Chu clan were completely furious.","The Chu clan could only be considered a second-rate force in the entire Great Wei. It could not even be considered a first-rate force. But the Great Formless Sect was a super first-rate force, a terrifying existence that stood above the Imperial Court.","Therefore, even though the Great Formless Sect was taking revenge, no one dared to mention it. But now, Chu Hongcai’s miserable state had completely angered them. If the Great Formless Sect continued to take revenge like this, this kind of situation would happen to them sooner or later.","Everyone was completely enraged.","“Get Young Master Fan here,” Chu Yaowei thought of something and quickly said.","“No need. I’m already here.”","As soon as Chu Yaowei finished speaking, Chu Yunfan appeared in everyone’s field of vision. He walked over slowly, seemingly slow but actually fast. In a few steps, he had already arrived before Chu Hongcai.","When Chu Yunfan saw Chu Hongcai’s bloody state, he immediately raised his eyebrows and glared at Chu Yaowei.","“Who did this?!”","Chu Yunfan loved Chu Hongcai from the bottom of his heart. He also treated him as a younger brother. He was one of the few people in the Chu clan that he had feelings for.","Now, he saw Chu Hongcai beaten up like this. There was a penetrating wound on his chest, and half of his heart had been broken. Blood was flowing wildly, and he couldn’t stop it.","If it was an ordinary person, they would have died long ago. Only Chu Hongcai who had entered the Divine Abilities Stage and had a terrifyingly tenacious vitality could have survived until now. However, his life force was still flowing away at an astonishing speed. It would probably not take long for him to really die.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t care less about that. He quickly injected his divine power into Chu Hongcai’s body and started to heal him. Under his healing, Chu Hongcai’s blood finally stopped flowing.","“Brother Fan...” Chu Hongcai opened his eyes and called out weakly. “Am I going to die?”","“You are not!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“I know I’m not far from death. Half of my heart has been shattered.” Chu Hongcai smiled bitterly, but the pain from his wound caused him to frown.","“I said you aren’t going to die, so you won’t,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan began to treat Chu Hongcai. He controlled his divine power and continuously stimulated the vitality in Chu Hongcai’s body.","For a Divine like Chu Hongcai, his vitality was already incomparably exuberant. As long as his vitality was not cut off, he could slowly recover."]},{"number":1299,"title":"Chapter 1299 I Want to Kill Someone","paragraphs":["1299 I Want to Kill Someone","It was not until an hour later that Chu Hongcai’s wounds finally stopped bleeding. The vitality in his body finally surpassed his death aura and gradually suppressed his injuries.","Chu Yunfan finally heaved a sigh of relief. With his strength, he naturally far surpassed Chu Hongcai. However, Chu Hongcai’s life was hanging by a thread. If he had been sent back a little later, Chu Hongcai would have died. When that happened, Chu Yunfan would not have been able to make a move.","During the treatment process, Chu Yunfan didn’t dare to treat his wounds as roughly as he did when he was healing himself. This was because his Imperial Physique was strong enough to withstand the treatment. Chu Hongcai couldn’t accept such a treatment method.","He heaved a sigh of relief when he finally managed to keep Chu Hongcai alive. As for the rest, he just needed to wait for Chu Hongcai to recover with his powerful recovery ability.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had finally saved Chu Hongcai’s life, the upper echelons of the Chu clan finally heaved a sigh of relief. After all, it had been too inauspicious these years. It could be said that every heir had been killed. This position that everyone envied had actually become a death trap. Their clan would become a big joke in the eyes of others.","!!","Chu Yunfan withdrew his power and asked someone to carefully carry Chu Hongcai away to rest. Then, he asked, “Who attacked Hongcai?”","He had been consolidating his power these few days, so he didn’t know much about the outside world. He only knew that something big had happened to the Chu clan.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan didn’t know, Chu Yaowei smiled bitterly and told Chu Yunfan the whole story.","“So it’s the Great Formless Sect. D*mn them!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Since they no longer want to follow the rules, then they can’t blame me for not following the rules either.”","“Young Master Fan, are you planning to take revenge? But our clan is far inferior to the Great Formless Sect. It’d be impossible to kill their experts that come from all over the world,” an elder said with a bitter smile.","“Is there a need? Those were just the mud soldiers and clay generals of the Great Formless Sect. So what if they are all killed? Would it really make Mi Siyuan feel heartache?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Didn’t he want to force me to come out and fight? I’ll fight him. But before that, I’ll let him understand what it means to be heartbroken!”","“I want to kill someone!”","At the same time, in Tiannan City, an important town in the south of Great Wei, a banquet was being held. In the city, and even the entire southern Great Wei, many prominent figures had gathered here.","In the southern part of Great Wei, although Conglong was the place where the Great Ancestor had started his career and could be considered to have an important status, in fact, the true economic center was Tiannan.","Tiannan had a resident population of more than ten million, which was enough to compete with the imperial capital in the north. All the wealthy merchants and nobles in the south of Great Wei had gathered together today.","This was because the host of this banquet was so influential that no one dared to refuse.","It was the Great Formless Sect’s chief disciple who was currently in the limelight, one of the top ten experts of Great Wei’s younger generation, Soul Hunter!","No matter who it was, they did not dare to reject this banquet. Although they were all bigshots in the southern part of Great Wei, they were simply insignificant compared to a colossus like the Great Formless Sect.","In fact, in the entire Great Wei, those who could be compared to the Great Formless Sect were rare.","“President Li, you’re here too!”","“How can I not? Previously, our clan cooperated with the Chu clan. And now, we were badly beaten up by the Great Formless Sect. Over a hundred people died. Fortunately, our losses were not many.”","Lord Jue sounded extremely depressed. Many of his men had been killed, but now, they were here to apologize. He was extremely depressed.","“Sigh, who isn’t? The Great Formless Sect doesn’t move easily, but once it does, it’s like the sky collapsing and the earth splitting. How many years has it been since we’ve seen such a scene?”","“It’s a fight between immortals now. Us mortals are in trouble. We can’t afford to offend the Great Formless Sect, but can we afford to offend Chu Yunfan either?”","“You are right. The Great Formless Sect is peerless and invincible in the south of Great Wei. However, how old is Chu Yunfan? Only in his twenties. His future prospects were simply limitless. Wasn’t it said that he had the possibility of becoming the number one in the world? How can we afford to offend that kind of person?”","In the hall, many guests whispered to each other, but they did not dare to speak too loudly. On the contrary, they even used secret martial arts techniques like telepathy to converse. This was because they were all disciples of the Chu clan or people from factions related to the Chu clan.","According to the completely unreasonable style that the Great Formless Sect had displayed, if they caught something, it would be over.","Other than that, many people from the factions related to the Great Formless Sect were much more unrestrained. During this period of time, they were the most awe-inspiring.","The Great Formless Sect attacked everywhere, forcing the Chu clan and the forces related to the Chu clan to retreat step by step. They also received quite a lot of benefits.","As for the revenge of the Chu clan, they did not even need to think about it because the Great Formless Sect’s sect master, Mi Siyuan, was a truly legendary figure.","He was stationed in the south of Great Wei and had experienced countless storms. Step by step, he had developed the Great Formless Sect to its current level. He could be said to be a legend and one of the five great experts of the empire.","Although he was the most inexperienced among the five great experts, he was still considered a veteran compared to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was just a junior. Who knew how many years they would have to wait for him to rise up? At that time, the Great Formless Sect would have another Core guarding it. What was there to be afraid of?","And among the many Great Formless Sect disciples, the initiator of today’s banquet was one of the empire’s top ten young experts, Soul Hunter.","After a short while, the crowd heard footsteps. A young man in white robes walked into the hall, surrounded by a group of people with extraordinary auras.","Many people were secretly shocked. They knew those people who were surrounding that young man. They were all famous big shots in the south of Great Wei. But now, they were willingly surrounding that young man.","The young man’s identity was obvious. He was none other than the Great Formless Sect’s chief disciple, Soul Hunter."]},{"number":1300,"title":"Chapter 1300 To Kill","paragraphs":["1300 To Kill","“What an awe-inspiring presence. So many big shots have gathered here in fear.”","“Tsk tsk, so many big families. So many nobles. So many presidents of commerce chambers.”","“The Great Formless Sect is indeed the number one sect in the south. No one can match them.”","“Soul Hunter wouldn’t have such power just by relying on the prestige of the Great Formless Sect. He himself has an illustrious reputation in the South, and that’s because he killed his way out. Just for this reason, he slaughtered no less than ten sects and families.”","Many people were discussing in private. They felt that Soul Hunter was really impressive. He was so powerful that they didn’t dare to imagine it.","Even though they themselves had become Soul Hunter’s backdrop, they did not dare to show any dissatisfaction.","Soul Hunter was an existence that was said to have the highest possibility of stepping into the Core Stage in the Great Formless Sect. Even if they were to be his backdrop, that would be showing them respect.","Soul Hunter walked to the center of the banquet and said, “Everyone, I’ve invited you here today for two things.”","He glanced at everyone and said in high spirits, “The first thing is that all of you should know that the Great Formless Sect wishes to make a move against the Chu clan. I know that many of your forces have more or less cooperated with the Chu clan in the past, but from today onwards, all of you have to break ties with them.”","His gaze fell on someone, and that person immediately became extremely nervous. That person had heard of the shocking achievements of Soul Hunter in killing people. Those who followed him would prosper and those who opposed him would die.","When many people heard Soul Hunter’s words, they immediately heaved a sigh of relief. Soul Hunter did not have any intention of pursuing the matter, but this was also expected. The Chu clan was an old noble and had existed since the founding of the country. Although it could not be compared to the Great Formless Sect, its network of connections spread throughout the entire southern part of Great Wei.","They had more or less cooperated with the Chu clan, and this was very normal. If the Great Formless Sect insisted on pursuing this matter, the implications would be too great. Even the Great Formless Sect could not possibly offend everyone in one go.","“As for those who didn’t come, I already know who they chose. It doesn’t matter. Tonight, someone will teach them how to choose.”","Soul Hunter’s expression was extremely arrogant, and he had no scruples at all.","The laws of Great Wei had no way to control people like him. It could even be said that it was useless. That was why he was able to attack so unscrupulously and did not care at all.","His words made many people suck in a breath of cold air. They began to worry for those who had not arrived. They were afraid that these people would not be able to escape death.","They were shocked by Soul Hunter’s ruthlessness.","“The second matter is also closely related to all of you. I’m under the orders of my master to form an alliance in Tiannan and gather everyone’s strength. In the future, we will advance and retreat together, enjoy blessings together, and earn money together.” Soul Hunter said as he swept his gaze over the crowd.","Everyone was instantly in an uproar. They felt that this was the true goal of the Great Formless Sect. After so many years, the Great Formless Sect appeared in the martial world again. The moment they came, they wanted to form such an alliance. Without a doubt, there could only be one alliance leader, and that was the Great Formless Sect.","In the future, they could only follow the Great Formless Sect’s lead. In that case, the Great Formless Sect would become the local emperor of Great Wei’s southern region, becoming the true ruler.","The people present were already wealthy merchants who occupied more than half of the entire southern Great Wei. If all these people were to be gathered into an alliance, one could imagine the power of this alliance.","However, Soul Hunter knew that it would be a joke for him to lead the alliance with his status. Although half-step Cores were uncommon, they were definitely not rare. He did not have the qualifications to do so. Only the Great Formless Sect and his master would have the qualifications to form such an alliance.","However, they all belonged to different factions. At this moment, everyone was in a difficult position. If they did not agree, the surrounding Great Formless Sect disciples would all be eyeing them like tigers eyeing their prey. There was even a hint of threat in their eyes.","Only then did everyone understand that today’s banquet was basically a trap. They had gathered together in the name of dealing with Chu Yunfan, but the real purpose was actually this alliance.","It could be said to be a brilliant plan to kill two birds with one stone. Many people could not help but sigh in their hearts. It was really the new waves pushing forward the previous waves.","Just as many people were in a dilemma, a series of relaxed footsteps suddenly came from outside the banquet hall. A figure casually walked into the banquet hall and swept his gaze across everyone.","“Oh, this place is really lively!”","That person spoke directly, not shy at all.","Everyone looked over and saw that it was a young man dressed in a black robe. He looked to be around 20 years old, with a tall and straight figure and a delicate face.","“Who are you?” a disciple of the Great Formless Sect shouted.","It instantly attracted everyone’s attention, including Soul Hunter, who had been forcing everyone to take a stand.","However, when someone saw the black-robed young man, their bodies immediately trembled, and their eyes revealed a somewhat shocked expression.","“Why is he here?”","“Why is it him?”","“It’s actually him!”","Many people exclaimed because they all recognized the identity of the person in front of them. This person was none other than the other protagonist of the Great Formless Sect’s extermination of the Chu clan, which was currently causing an uproar.","Many people were waiting for him to express his stance. Some even thought that he did not dare to express his stance.","“I didn’t expect him to come. This is great. I’m afraid that Soul Hunter’s idea will fall through.”","“Yeah. This is great. If Soul Hunter wishes to establish this alliance, I’m afraid we still have to see if this person is willing to let it happen.”","“I didn’t expect him to actually appear here. I’m afraid he isn’t here with good intentions.”","Many people secretly sized up Chu Yunfan, constantly guessing what his plan was for coming here.","“Chu Yunfan, why are you here?!” Soul Hunter shouted.","“To kill!”"]}]);
